window.AKK_VILLAINESS_GENTLE_SECOND_CHAPTERS=(window.AKK_VILLAINESS_GENTLE_SECOND_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1,"title":"Chapter 1: Waking Up Two Years in the Future","paragraphs":["An Ling was jolted awake by a burst of raucous noise.","Frowning, she struggled to open her eyes. The overhead lights were glaring, and the flashing multicolored strobe lights made her eyes ache. Bottles of alcohol were scattered haphazardly, and the pungent stench of cheap liquor permeated the air.","Where was she? Wasn't she sleeping at home?","An Ling tried to stand up, but a wave of dizziness hit her.","She stumbled and fell back onto the sofa, rubbing her aching head.","A man's icy voice sounded from above her.","\"An Ling, I'm warning you for the last time. Stop playing these petty tricks. If there's a next time, I'll make you pay the price.\"","She looked up in bewilderment.","Who was this guy? Why was he acting so pretentious?","\"Hold on a second, give me a moment to process.\"","Pressing her throbbing temples, An Ling looked up again, only then noticing that the private room was full of people.","In front of her stood four or five burly men in black suits, standing bolt upright.","Was she kidnapped?","An Ling hesitantly looked at the man who seemed to be the leader, \"...Do you want money?\"","At these words, the man was momentarily taken aback.","His gaze grew increasingly disgusted, his tone freezing cold.","\"An Ling, don't be so cheap. A woman like you, I wouldn't sleep with you even if you threw yourself at me. You disgust me.\"","\"...\"","He didn't seem like a kidnapper, but rather a psychopath.","She sneered and staggered to her feet in her high heels, trying to look for her bag and phone.","\"Don't flatter yourself. You're not even fit to carry my shoes. What's your name? Which family are you from?\"","Under the dim lights, the woman bent over to rummage across the sofa. Her burgundy silk dress accentuated the slender curve of her waist, and her raven-black hair cascaded over her shoulders, her skin as pale and flawless as porcelain.","Her beautiful face was flushed from the alcohol, looking delicate and intensely alluring, bearing an anger and disdain that didn't seem faked.","Was she really that drunk? She didn't even recognize him?","Lu Jingshen frowned. Just as he was about to say something, hurried footsteps echoed from outside the door.","His assistant rushed over and whispered something to him.","Lu Jingshen's expression instantly darkened.","An Ling was still looking for her phone when her arm was suddenly yanked hard.","Hissing in pain, she turned her head. \"Let go! What are you doing!\"","The man's eyes were full of malice. \"An Ling, did you post those photos online? Do you think this will ruin my relationship with Wenwen?\"","To hell with your stupid romance!","An Ling's head was pounding.","Waking up in a bar and facing a bunch of lunatics—was she dreaming?","\"Who exactly are you...\"","Before she could finish her sentence, a voice suddenly rang out in her mind.","[Character deviation detected. The plot is at its final one percent. Forcing plot completion.]","An Ling froze. Before she could react, her mouth suddenly opened on its own.","She heard her own manic laughter: \"I was the one who had someone do it! Jingshen, I am the only one who loves you the most! Zhou Wen will divorce you when she sees those. She doesn't trust you. Jingshen, marry me, okay?\"","After saying this, An Ling looked utterly dumbfounded.","Ignoring the man's dark expression in front of her, she blankly touched her own mouth.","What was going on? Did those disgusting words really just come out of her mouth?","But before she could process it, her eyes widened in shock as she watched her own hand grab a wine bottle from the table.","Smash! Glass shards exploded everywhere.","Lu Jingshen's pupils constricted, and he subconsciously let go of her arm.","Crimson blood trickled down his forehead, gathering at his chin, adding a touch of ruthlessness to his handsome face.","Gasps echoed around them, accompanied by the assistant's horrified cry:","\"Mr. Lu!!\"","An Ling held the broken bottle in a daze, completely unable to control her own mouth. \"Jingshen, only in this way will you remember me. If you insist on being with Zhou Wen, then no one will have you.\"","Who was Zhou Wen?","What was wrong with her body? And what was that voice just now?","Could she really be dreaming?","Just as she was thinking this, the man's gnashing voice instantly rang in her ears.","\"An. Ling!\"","His gaze was fierce and terrifying, as if he wanted to skin her alive.","Thanks to all this bizarre madness, An Ling was now completely sober.","Just as she was about to speak, her expression changed drastically. A sharp pain pierced her head, feeling like a dense cluster of needles stabbing her.","She fell back onto the sofa in a sorry state, letting out a muffled groan as she painfully clutched her head. \"Ugh...\"","Unfamiliar scenes flashed before her eyes, and a massive amount of information flooded in, as if being forcibly stuffed into her brain.","Lu Jingshen, clutching the wound on his forehead, let out a cold laugh at the sight. \"Don't play the victim after smashing someone's head.\"","An Ling's face was deathly pale. She wanted to curse him out but couldn't utter a word.","Her vision kept going dark, and finally, completely drained of strength, she collapsed onto the sofa.","At that moment, hurried footsteps sounded outside the door, and a large group of people rushed into the private room.","\"Young Madam!!\"","\"Young Madam, are you alright?!\"","...What Young Madam?","Were they calling her?","But she wasn't even married.","An Ling gasped for breath. Her ears were filled with constant chattering, and her head felt like it was going to explode.","Weak and powerless, she closed her eyes.","It was so noisy. She just wanted to sleep.","But suddenly, the noisy crowd fell dead silent.","It was as if someone had pressed the pause button. In the quiet private room, the sound of leather shoes treading over the carpet produced a muffled yet distinct rhythm.","The footsteps drew closer, and a shadow fell over her.","An Ling opened her eyes in a daze.","Under the dim lights, a man stood quietly. His figure was partially hidden in the shadows. He wore a dark, impeccably tailored suit, and his metal cufflinks reflected a cold gleam.","His long, slender fingers tucked a strand of hair behind her ear, carrying the chill of the night. A crisp, woody scent of pine washed over her.","The man's voice was deep and slow.","\"Take Madam to the hospital.\"","An Ling's eyelids grew heavier. A second before her consciousness slipped away, only two hazy thoughts remained in her mind—","This man has really nice hands.","And a nice voice, too.","When she woke up again.","Staring at the snow-white ceiling of the hospital room, An Ling sluggishly patted her own cheeks.","\"I'm doomed...\"","It wasn't a dream.","Waking up, it was now two years later.","During these two years, her body had been controlled by a system.","Because she was the vicious female supporting character, the system needed her to play out the plot.","The tasks included, but were not limited to: seducing the male lead, humiliating the female lead, sowing discord, drugging people, and twisting the truth...","Now that the novel had reached its grand finale, her missions were complete, so the system returned her body to her.","An Ling took a deep breath and closed her eyes.","\"This shouldn't be right... How could I be the vicious female supporting character?\"","She just had a slightly bad temper and acted a bit impulsively, but she was an absolute, law-abiding good citizen!","Besides, she had face blindness and couldn't even recognize the male lead's face. How was she supposed to seduce him?","An Ling sat up. She was the only one in the massive VIP ward.","Throwing off the covers and getting out of bed, she walked to the door and was just about to open it.","Faint murmurs of a conversation drifted from outside.","\"The patient in this room is Madam Shen, right? I heard Madam Shen is very gentle. How did she get so drunk yesterday?\"","\"You've got it wrong. The one you're talking about is the Second Madam. This one is the Eldest Madam Shen, the notoriously unreasonable and vicious daughter of the An family.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","Huh? Me?"]},{"number":2,"title":"Chapter 2: What a Disastrous Start","paragraphs":["An Ling never imagined that one day she would be eavesdropping on gossip about herself.","Eavesdropping was one thing, but what did they mean by unreasonable and vicious?","Did that broken system really establish her character persona that successfully?","She stood still, continuing to listen to the nurses chatting outside.","\"You are new here, so you wouldn't know. The young madam used to come to the hospital all the time, always making a fuss out of nothing, claiming she was hurt. The main thing is, she wouldn't call her husband; she would call her husband's younger brother.\"","\"Huh? Isn't that just blatant cheating?\"","\"Don't even get me started. Everyone knows An Ling is obsessed with the Shen family's second young master, Lu Jingshen. If any other woman even gets close to him, she makes their life a living hell.\"","\"I heard the second young master came to the hospital yesterday too. His forehead was smashed open. The hospital director was so terrified he rushed over from home in the middle of the night. Who would be so reckless with their life as to hit the Shen family's second young master?\"","The reckless An Ling: \"...\"","That psycho from last night was the male lead?","What did he look like again?","She had completely forgotten.","An Ling took a deep breath, rubbing her throbbing temples.","This was bad. Although she had fragments of memories in her head, she was face-blind. She couldn't match anyone's face to their name at all.","Especially her newly acquired husband.","Who would have thought she would wake up to find herself suddenly married?","Click—","The crisp sound of a door opening echoed.","The two nurses gossiping at the door stiffened and looked up, their faces draining of color. With terrified and panicked eyes, they stammered, \"M-Mrs. Shen, w-why are you...\"","Why did this woman come out on her own??","She usually loved ordering the nurses around just to torture them, so they had assumed she wasn't awake yet.","They were doomed. She had definitely heard everything they just said.","But the very next second, the woman suddenly asked, \"Have you seen my phone?\"","The nurses froze, completely caught off guard by An Ling's reaction.","Could it be she hadn't heard them?","Before they could speak, a male voice suddenly interjected.","\"Young Madam, you are awake.\"","Turning their heads, they saw a man in a tailored suit walking over.","He stopped in front of An Ling with a polite, professional smile, handing over a shopping bag and her phone.","\"These are the clothes the maids prepared for you, along with your phone.\"","An Ling frowned, her eyes scanning the man's face.","Who was this guy now?","Before she could react, the man continued, \"Young Madam, Old Madam has already found out about you hitting the second young master last night. She wants you to go over. The hospital discharge procedures have already been handled...\"","At this point, Secretary Chen paused.","He quickly glanced up at her and added in a low voice:","\"Sir is already waiting for you in the car.\"","An Ling was taken aback. \"Sir?\"","\"Your husband, ma'am.\"","\"...\"","Talk about speaking of the devil. She had planned to look up a photo of him first.","Truth be told, An Ling didn't feel much of anything toward this sudden husband of hers.","She had known for a long time that she had a marriage arrangement with the Shen family.","The only thing that bothered her was her husband's identity—the gentle second male lead.","Although An Ling wasn't much of a novel reader, she had heard these tropes from her best friend before.","The gentle second male lead: always by the female lead's side, appearing whenever she was in trouble or needed help, and quietly watching over her from afar once she found her happily-ever-after.","What kind of combination was this now?","The gentle second male lead married the vicious female supporting character?","The one who loved the female lead and the one who hated her had been paired up together.","An Ling changed her clothes and went downstairs with Secretary Chen.","A black Bentley was parked at the hospital entrance. Secretary Chen stepped forward and opened the rear door.","\"After you, Young Madam.\"","The moment the door opened, An Ling saw the man resting in the backseat with his eyes closed.","He wore a sharply tailored suit, leaning against the seatback with his eyes shut. His fingertips rested lightly on his knees, his back perfectly straight. His features were handsome and refined, and every subtle posture exuded an air of noble elegance, like a young master raised with an impeccable upbringing.","And that was exactly what he was. Aside from being the second male lead, Shen Linyan was also the current head of the Shen Group.","An Ling was a little surprised.","...Why did it feel like the second male lead was even better looking than the male lead?","Even though An Ling was face-blind and struggled to remember faces, it didn't mean she lacked an aesthetic sense.","On the contrary, she could actually retain some impression of people who were exceptionally good-looking.","Hearing the car door open, the man slowly opened his eyes and turned to look.","Their gazes collided in the air.","With what seemed like a casual glance to confirm who had arrived, the man turned his head back.","Feigning nonchalance, she looked away as well and bent down to slide into the car.","Silence and a complete lack of communication were the norm in this marriage.","The interior of the car was so quiet you could hear a pin drop. Mixed with the scent of premium leather was a faint, clean aroma of pine, cool but not biting.","It was the exact same scent she had smelled right before passing out last night.","An Ling paused, stealing a glance out of the corner of her eye at the man's hands resting on his knees.","His skin was a cool white, his fingers long and well-proportioned. They were perfectly structured without looking harsh, and the faint blue veins protruding on the back of his hands conveyed a sense of steady strength.","Every single detail confirmed it: the man from last night was Shen Linyan.","An Ling silently turned her head toward the window, rubbing her temples in absolute despair.","She finally understood what had happened last night.","Even though the novel had reached its grand finale, there were still some plot points left unresolved.","When she regained control of her body last night, it was right in the middle of executing the final plot point.","The female supporting character had planned to seduce the male lead one last time, even if it meant completely tearing away all pretenses.","She used a trick to get the male lead to meet her at a bar. The moment he stepped inside, paparazzi lying in wait would snap photos and record videos of them entering the same private room.","Once edited and posted online, it would inevitably spark a massive scandal.","She had even thought of the headlines.","Headline: Is it a loss of morality or a distortion of ethics? Explosive wealthy family love triangle! The Shen family's eldest daughter-in-law and the second young master are actually secretly dating!","Headline: Both are already married! Is it true love or a thrill-seeking secret affair?!","Yes, the male lead was Shen Linyan's younger brother.","Lu Jingshen, the second young master of the Shen family. He took his mother's surname from a young age and was endlessly doted upon. He had a wild, uninhibited, and arrogant personality, but in reality, he was a wolf in sheep's clothing.","He accidentally crossed paths with a lowly secretary in the workplace, the female lead, Zhou Wen. Drawn to her resilient and kind nature, he fell in love at first sight, his feelings deepening over time, ultimately making the prodigal son change his ways.","After overcoming countless obstacles, the two eventually had a beautiful wedding.","This plot point was merely a catalyst to strengthen their relationship, but for the supporting characters, it was their final curtain call.","The second male lead, Shen Linyan, would be mocked by outsiders due to his wife's indiscretions, lose the support of the board of directors, and, after having too many shares snatched away by the male lead, gradually go bankrupt.","As for An Ling, she would be kicked out of the house because of this scandal. Her family's company would be acquired by the Shen Group, and she would ultimately freeze to death on the streets.","After sorting through the plot in her head, An Ling couldn't even force a smile anymore.","What kind of catastrophic opening was this?","So last night... she had been caught cheating in public by her own husband?","Just then, the man's calm voice suddenly broke the silence.","\"Lu Jingshen said I was the one who messaged him, which is why he went to the bar. You sneaked onto my phone yesterday, didn't you?\"","An Ling stiffened and turned her head.","\"That was... me too?\"","That stupid system actually used such an absurd method to invite the male lead out?"]},{"number":3,"title":"Chapter 3: Why Did the Madam Ask Me","paragraphs":["If there was one thing An Ling had to hand it to, it was that damn system.","Who in their right mind would use their husband's phone to orchestrate an affair?","And make such a public spectacle out of it, no less.","Now that things had escalated to this point, An Ling couldn't even deny it.","She couldn't exactly sob to Shen Linyan and say, \"I didn't do any of this! I've been framed! A system hijacked my body and forced me to play the villain for the past two years.\"","Resting her chin on her hand, An Ling racked her brain for a countermeasure before slowly speaking up.","\"Fine, I sent the messages. But isn't this better? I know it's all over the news now, but I can just step up and clear the air. I'll say I went to meet Lu Jingshen on your behalf, but accidentally got drugged, which made me delirious.\"","The moment the words left her mouth, the smoothly driving car suddenly jerked.","A dead silence filled the car.","Secretary Chen looked astonished, unable to stop himself from stealing a glance at the rearview mirror.","The Young Madam actually admitted to it?","And she even offered to clear the air?!","She had orchestrated this whole scandal on purpose just to get back at the Shen family, perfectly willing to burn herself as long as she took them down with her.","How did she suddenly change her tune overnight and decide to do damage control?","Then what about Mr. Shen's plan?","At that thought, Secretary Chen instinctively looked up at the rearview mirror.","In the backseat, the man's expression remained as composed as ever, the slight smile on his lips completely unchanged.","However, the rhythmic tapping of his fingertips against his knee had noticeably quickened.","Sensing the sudden shift in the car's atmosphere, An Ling felt utterly baffled.","What was their problem? Wasn't this a perfectly good solution?","When no one said a word, she hesitated before asking, \"Will that... not work?\"","A few seconds later, a low chuckle sounded beside her.","\"It will.\"","Shen Linyan lazily lifted his gaze, finally paying attention to his little wife's unusual behavior.","She had been acting strange even before getting into the car. Normally, she would be incredibly hostile every time they met, but today, she seemed remarkably calm around him.","Was she just keeping her head down because she had assaulted someone last night, or was she plotting something else?","Shen Linyan hadn't thought much of it earlier. After all, whatever she did was none of his concern, as long as everything proceeded according to plan.","But now, it seemed... there was a slight hiccup.","His gaze swept over her face, light and unreadable, before his eyes curved into a slow smile. His voice was gentle when he spoke.","\"We will do as you suggest, my dear. I'm ready to cooperate however you need.\"","Hearing this, An Ling put on a polite smile and flashed him an OK gesture.","No kidding. If you don't cooperate, you're going to go bankrupt.","Honestly, Shen Linyan really did have a great temper. Just like in her memories, he practically never got angry.","No wonder he was the gentle second male lead of the story. He was about to be cuckolded, yet he could still smile, not caring in the slightest about his ruined reputation.","Then again, he only cared about the female lead.","An Ling leaned back against her seat, toying with her phone as she drifted deep into thought.","Since she had assaulted Lu Jingshen last night, Mother Shen—who doted on her son to a fault—would definitely come after her to settle the score for dragging him into this mess.","This trip back to the Shen family estate today was undoubtedly going to be a witch hunt.","Thanks to that damn system's reckless antics over the past two years, her own family had taken a hit. Right now, they were barely staying afloat by relying on their business ties with the Shens and Shen Linyan's status as their son-in-law.","In a marriage of convenience like this, the weaker party never had a say.","An Ling stared at her bare ring finger. She glanced sideways, her brows furrowing when she noticed the man's hands were equally bare.","Not to mention...","If the married couple had zero feelings for each other, her situation was even more precarious.","If Mother Shen decided to target her, she would be completely on her own. There was no way Shen Linyan would speak up for her; the best she could hope for was that he wouldn't add fuel to the fire.","Thankfully, her husband was a total pushover...","Wait, no. He was the kind-hearted second male lead!","The corners of An Ling's lips gradually curled upward.","Shen Linyan had been up late last night dealing with paperwork and the fallout at the bar. First thing this morning, he had been bombarded with furious calls from his mother. Now, sitting in the car, he finally had a rare moment to close his eyes and rest.","But the moment he shut his eyes, the woman's voice drifted into his ears.","\"Shen Linyan... let me ask you something. Do you think Zhou Wen saw the news yesterday?\"","As if afraid of disturbing his rest, her voice was hushed and carried a hint of probing.","Shen Linyan paused. Leaning against the seat, he slowly opened his eyes.","He tilted his head slightly, his movements exuding a lazy grace, and a cryptic smile played on his lips.","\"Why are you asking me, my dear? Isn't she Lu Jingshen's wife?\"","Oh, please. Still playing dumb.","Didn't he have a massive crush on the female lead? How could he bear to see her heartbroken?","Theirs was just a marriage of convenience anyway. It was fine; she was a very understanding wife.","Gripping her seat, An Ling leaned in closer, her eyes curving into crescents as she coaxed him. \"I bet Zhou Wen definitely saw it. So she doesn't get upset, why don't we tell the family the same story? We'll say it was all a big misunderstanding. Wouldn't it be nice to keep the peace in the family? We can just sweep this whole thing under the rug.\"","In the driver's seat, Secretary Chen's mouth twitched.","What the hell? He couldn't believe the phrase \"keep the peace in the family\" had actually come out of the Young Madam's mouth.","It was painfully obvious that she was trying to drag his boss down with her. This whole mess was entirely her fault, but if they went with her story about the texts, Mr. Shen would have to shoulder the blame too.","Shen Linyan didn't say a word. His dark eyes settled heavily on the woman's face.","A pale, sickly complexion couldn't mask her stunningly beautiful features. When she smiled, her eyes sparkled brightly, making no effort to hide the scheming look in them. The outer corners of her eyes tilted upward, giving her an unintentionally alluring charm.","It was a rare smile for her.","In that moment, Shen Linyan was suddenly reminded of something a business partner had once told him.","\"The An family's daughter is one of the most stunning beauties in our circle. A single smile from her could hook a whole flock of wealthy heirs. It's just a shame the old man treats her like a precious treasure. You're a lucky man to have married her, Mr. Shen.\"","At the time, he had simply lowered his gaze and smiled without responding, thinking the man was exaggerating. Surely, she couldn't be that captivating.","It had never occurred to him that perhaps he felt that way because An Ling had never actually smiled at him.","Realizing where his thoughts were drifting, Shen Linyan stiffened slightly.","His brows furrowed slightly as a strange emotion flickered in his chest. He subtly pulled back, putting some distance between them, and turned his gaze out the window. The smile on his lips faded a fraction.","\"Do whatever you want.\"","An Ling keenly picked up on the shift in his tone. She blinked in surprise, quickly realizing that he must be angry.","Well, fine. He didn't care about getting cuckolded, but the moment she used the female lead for her own gain, he got mad.","Whatever. As long as he agreed, that was all that mattered. At least she wouldn't be the only one getting chewed out.","Deciding not to push her luck, An Ling happily settled back into her seat.","The car slowly pulled into the Shen family estate.","The car doors opened, and a servant stepped forward, bowing respectfully. \"Eldest Young Master, Young Madam. The others are waiting for you in the main hall.\"","Even though she had mentally prepared herself, the thought of facing a whole crowd of people made An Ling take a deep breath. She patted her cheeks and muttered under her breath, \"Just bear with it, bear with it...\"","She was at a severe disadvantage right now. If she just swallowed her pride, she could avoid a storm.","Besides, she still hadn't fully absorbed all the memories of this body, so she couldn't afford to act rashly.","Her soft muttering reached Shen Linyan's ears.","He paused in his steps, stealing a glance at her profile.","Was she nervous?","This was exactly what she had wanted, so why would she be nervous? Was it because she had accidentally laid a hand on Lu Jingshen?","Shen Linyan nonchalantly withdrew his gaze.","A few seconds later, An Ling—who was still busy giving herself a pep talk—suddenly heard the man's voice from above her head.","\"There's no need to be nervous.\"","\"...Huh?\"","Stunned, she looked up in confusion, only to catch sight of the man's retreating back.","Was that Shen Linyan speaking just now? What did he mean by nervous?","Seeing him step into the villa, she pushed her thoughts aside and hurried in after him.","The moment she stepped through the door, a woman's displeased voice rang out, her tone thick with suppressed anger.","\"Why aren't those two here yet? Just look at this. Ever since he got married, Linyan hasn't even been able to keep his own wife in line. Now they lack even basic manners. What will the people at the company think of our Shen family?\"","Hearing this, An Ling paused in the middle of changing her shoes.","There was no way Mother Shen didn't know her own son had just arrived.","Speaking like this right at this moment was clearly deliberate, meant for everyone to hear.","What kind of mother would openly criticize her own son in front of a crowd?","She subconsciously glanced up at the man beside her.","Shen Linyan lowered his gaze and gave his tie a slight tug, the look in his eyes completely indifferent.","He strode toward the living room. By the time he looked up again, his face had regained its usual gentle smile, and his voice was mild.","\"Apologies, Mother. Traffic was a bit heavy on the way, so it took a little extra time.\"","An Ling finished changing her shoes and followed him inside, silently clicking her tongue at his words.","It seemed Shen Linyan's relationship with his family wasn't all that great.","That put her mind at ease.","With a husband who didn't get along with his parents, she wouldn't have to worry about maintaining a good relationship with her mother-in-law."]},{"number":4,"title":"Chapter 4: Apology","paragraphs":["The interior of the villa was luxuriously and exquisitely decorated, with antique ornaments visible everywhere. In the huge living room, three women and two men sat on the sofas.","An Ling's gaze quickly swept over the people present.","Although she didn't recognize a single face, she could figure it out with a little deduction.","Father and Mother Shen were older, so they were easy to identify.","The one with a gauze pad on his head should be Lu Jingshen.","The woman beside him, whose eyes were full of heartache, was undoubtedly Zhou Wen.","The only one difficult to recognize was the woman sitting alone on a small sofa.","This should be the youngest daughter of the Shen family, Shen Fuyuan.","As soon as she walked in, the quiet atmosphere felt somewhat bizarre. The gazes of the five people instantly fell on her.","Mother Shen, in particular, stared fixedly at her, as if her gaze could pierce right through her.","An Ling's expression remained unchanged as she followed Shen Linyan and sat down.","Whatever. Since Shen Linyan didn't greet them, neither would she.","Her butt had barely touched the sofa when Mother Shen's cold sneer rang in her ears.","\"Some people are really thick-skinned. After such a thing happened, she can actually act like nothing is wrong. Not even an apology. Our Shen family is truly unlucky to have brought in such a shameless thing.\"","These words fell just short of directly calling out An Ling's name.","The living room was silent, not a single person speaking up. Everyone seemed to tacitly agree with Mother Shen's statement.","Even Shen Linyan merely picked up the teacup from the table methodically, looking as if he had no intention of speaking.","After all, those were the facts. The things An Ling had done had already caused the Shen family to lose all face.","The focus of the entire room gathered on the woman eating fruit on the sofa.","An Ling swallowed the apple in her mouth, put down her fork, swept her gaze across the crowd, and finally looked at the indignant Mother Shen.","Acting as if she had just realized everyone was talking about her, a perfectly measured smile of surprise appeared on her face.","\"Mom, are you talking about me? Isn't this all a misunderstanding? Last night I went to the bar on behalf of Linyan. Do you guys actually believe those rumors online?\"","As soon as these words came out, everyone else was stunned.","Ever since she married into this family, An Ling's face had only ever worn cold sneers and mockery, and she always spoke aggressively. When had she ever spoken in such a pleasant and mild-mannered tone?","Mother Shen was also taken aback. She narrowed her eyes at the woman in front of her and twitched her lips in a sarcastic sneer. \"A misunderstanding? You mean you smashing Jingshen up like this is all a misunderstanding?\"","\"Of course! Because I was accidentally drugged by someone, and my mind was a bit confused.\"","After saying this, An Ling turned her head with a beaming smile to look at the man beside her.","\"Don't you agree, Hubby?\"","Shen Linyan was drinking his tea, and upon hearing this, his eyelids twitched violently.","He suddenly felt a bit doubtful. Was this woman really nervous at the door just now?","A few seconds later, the man gave a soft \"Mm.\"","Receiving his reply, An Ling turned her head back in satisfaction, catching Zhou Wen's gaze right at that moment.","The young woman was dressed in a pure white long dress, her soft black hair cascading down. Her teary, misty eyes, with their reddened corners, stared at An Ling. She looked incredibly pitiful.","After last night's reports came out, it seemed the misunderstanding between the male and female leads was quite deep.","Look at her, her eyes were red from crying.","An Ling propped up her chin, glancing out of the corner of her eye at a certain second male lead beside her.","The man continued to sip his tea with lowered eyes. His facial expression was very faint, looking completely detached from the situation.","Ever since returning to the villa, Shen Linyan had been like this. He seemed to be in a rather bad mood.","But it made sense. Watching the woman he loved marry someone else with his own eyes would indeed easily break one's heart.","Just now at the door, he had told her not to be nervous, but in reality, he was the one who was truly nervous, right? After all, his first love was present.","Fortunately, she didn't like any of them. She definitely didn't want to get involved in this bizarre love triangle.","While thinking this, An Ling began to explain to Zhou Wen:","\"Sister-in-law, don't worry. Yesterday was truly a misunderstanding. I just got back from the hospital this morning, and my head still hurts.\"","To make this statement more convincing, she pretended to have a headache and rubbed her temples. She coughed lightly a few times and instinctively tried to lean on the person next to her to act weak.","She was an expert at this. During her university days, she would often coordinate with her best friend, using this trick to escape military posture training.","But when she remembered that the person beside her wasn't her best friend, but Shen Linyan, An Ling's coughing motion stiffened.","She smoothly shifted directions, leaning her body toward the other side. Propping herself halfway against the sofa's armrest, she lowered her head and rubbed her brow as if in discomfort.","The woman's movements were subtle, but Shen Linyan still noticed this action that resembled disgust.","His movements paused slightly as he turned his head to look at her.","When their eyes met, the woman was momentarily startled, then she secretly blinked at him, as if asking, \"I did pretty well, right?\"","\"...\"","Shen Linyan stared at her for a few seconds before silently retracting his gaze.","His eyes were quiet and unreadable, making it impossible to tell what he was thinking. His fingertips tapped against the teacup rhythmically.","But in reality, An Ling's explanation didn't hold much credibility.","After all, the fact that An Ling liked Lu Jingshen was already deeply ingrained in everyone's minds. Even Lu Jingshen himself believed so.","Hearing the woman's defense, he scoffed. \"Drugged? An Ling, stop spouting nonsense. I think you were quite sober last night. Do you need me to repeat what you said last night?\"","Hearing this, An Ling looked up, curled her lips, and said unhurriedly:","\"Sure, go ahead and repeat it. What did I say?\"","Lu Jingshen was just about to speak when Father Shen, who had remained silent all along, suddenly scolded, \"Enough! Since you all say it's a misunderstanding, then hurry up and clarify it! Do you know what a mess it is outside? Everyone is watching our Shen family make a fool of ourselves!\"","He stood up and looked at Shen Linyan, his tone stern and cold. \"Linyan, come up to the study.\"","Shen Linyan set down his teacup. \"Yes, Father.\"","Without Father Shen and Shen Linyan, the atmosphere in the living room became even more tense.","Shen Fuyuan stood up impatiently. \"You specifically called me back just for this? Just clarify it and be done with it. I'm leaving.\"","She picked up her bag and stood up, but right before leaving, she cast another glance at An Ling. The two briefly exchanged a look.","An Ling didn't have much memory of this sister-in-law. This character didn't appear much in the novel, but she was probably on the female lead's side as well.","Just as she was wondering if she should leave too, a familiar voice sounded in her ears.","\"An Ling, what kind of trick are you trying to play now? Do you think I don't know that you were the one who sent that message? You clearly admitted it yourself last night.\"","Her movements paused, and she looked at Lu Jingshen with a weird expression.","...He knew?","He knew, yet he still came last night?","Slowly shifting her gaze to Mother Shen, whose face was ashen, An Ling became thoughtful.","This didn't seem right...","She was so actively trying to clarify things to keep the Shen family out of the scandal, so why were these people still unhappy?","Could it be... they wanted her to admit to the act of seducing a man?","At this thought, An Ling rested her chin on her hand, her eyes filled with interest.","She had found it strange from the very beginning.","Since the Shen family valued their reputation so much, and knowing full well that \"she\" liked Lu Jingshen and hated Zhou Wen, they actually let Shen Linyan marry \"her.\"","Shen Linyan might not have refused out of the goodness of his heart, but how could Mother and Father Shen agree? They could have clearly ignored the marriage agreement with the An family.","Even after she did all those things, they still hadn't divorced.","If the divorce procedures were complicated and property issues were hard to divide, that could barely be used as an excuse.","But looking at it now, it seemed like Shen Linyan had been set up.","However, none of this had anything to do with her. She had a ton of trouble of her own.","An Ling ignored the dark-faced Lu Jingshen. Anyway, as a vicious female supporting character, ignoring people was standard procedure.","She stood up, patted some non-existent dust off her clothes, and smiled as she spoke to Mother Shen:","\"Mom, I'm going to prepare the clarification, so I'll head out first.\"","Mother Shen's expression was grim. Frowning, she scrutinized the woman's retreating back, her eyes filled with suspicion.","Why did this girl seem so different from before?","An Ling was just about to leave when a woman's voice, slightly hoarse from crying, suddenly spoke up behind her.","\"Even if the incident at the bar was a misunderstanding, Sister-in-law still hit and injured Jingshen. Shouldn't she apologize for that?\"","She paused in her tracks, looking at Zhou Wen with a half-smile.","\"Apologize?\"","She wasn't even the one who hit him, so why should she apologize?"]},{"number":5,"title":"Chapter 5: Is He Worthy","paragraphs":["An Ling had already made up her mind the moment she regained control of her body.","She would only deal with the mess left behind by that system.","The mistakes made over the past two years—especially the things done to hurt the male and female leads—had absolutely nothing to do with her.","If she apologized to the male and female leads, who was going to apologize to her?","Who would apologize for the two years she had inexplicably lost, or the massive mess she now had to clean up? Who would take responsibility for that?","The fact that she had not taken her anger out on the male and female leads was already her being incredibly generous.","An Ling had no intention of explaining herself. She would just leave the headache to Shen Linyan.","After all, the man had just sat on the sidelines watching the drama unfold from the very beginning.","Under the watchful eyes of the three people, she took her time changing her shoes, flashing a radiant smile.","\"You want me to apologize? Does he even deserve it?\"","The three people in the living room: ...","After telling the driver to head home, An Ling settled into the back seat, took out her phone, and skillfully dialed a number.","The call connected instantly.","\"Beep... Sorry, the number you have dialed is currently busy.\"","She glanced at her screen in confusion. What was going on? Had she been blocked?","Refusing to believe it, she dialed the number again.","The same cold, automated female voice replied.","\"Sorry, the number you have dialed is currently busy.\"","An Ling stared at her phone in sheer disbelief. \"Did Jiang Mai seriously block me?!\"","Jiang Mai had been her best friend since elementary school. They were so close they practically shared the same clothes, and their families were on great terms too.","Out of all her friends, Jiang Mai was the only one who knew about her face blindness.","An Ling knew that the system had severed all her genuine relationships, forcing her to hang out with a bunch of fair-weather friends to fit the plot's character settings.","But she had assumed the worst-case scenario would be them drifting apart into strangers. Had it really gotten to the point of being blocked?","Frowning, she looked up. Her gaze suddenly paused, then slowly shifted toward the driver in the front seat.","Xiao Li was focused on driving when a sudden chill ran down his spine.","The next second, a woman's gentle voice floated from the back seat.","\"Mr. Driver, what is your name?\"","He stiffened, answering nervously and dryly, \"Madam can just call me Xiao Li.\"","The woman leaned forward with a beaming smile. \"Alright then, Xiao Li, do you have your phone on you? Lend it to me for a quick call.\"","Meanwhile, inside a coffee shop.","The cashier looked at the vibrating phone on the counter, turning her head to shout toward the back kitchen.","\"Boss! Your phone is ringing!\"","\"Coming.\"","Jiang Mai set the freshly made coffee on the counter, wiped her hands dry, and picked up her phone.","Seeing an unknown number, she answered it without a second thought.","After all, working in the food and beverage industry meant constantly receiving calls from customers.","\"Hello, this is the Jiang Du Coffee Shop. How can I help you?\"","The person on the other end remained silent. Confused, Jiang Mai glanced at the screen and politely repeated her question.","\"Hello? Did you have the wrong number?\"","A few seconds later, the person on the other end cleared her throat. A slightly guilty female voice came through, \"Jiang Mai... it's me.\"","Hearing the familiar voice, Jiang Mai froze for a moment, her brain failing to process it right away.","But the second she realized who it was, she hung up instantly.","When the phone rang again, Jiang Mai fell silent. Taking a deep breath, she stepped outside to answer it.","She leaned against the wall with her arms crossed, opening with a cold sneer. \"What? Did you finally commit one too many sins and get kicked out by the Shen family? When is the divorce? I should send the Shen family a few flower baskets to celebrate.\"","An Ling, on the other end of the line: ...","What a vicious attack! She hadn't dialed the wrong number, had she?","An Ling genuinely could not fathom how the system had managed to turn Jiang Mai into her enemy.","Although she retained some memories, many of the details were fuzzy.","After all, it was two whole years' worth of memories! How could she possibly process all of it at once?","Just thinking about those fragmented memories gave An Ling a headache. \"Can we meet up? I have something to tell you, and it's too complicated to explain over the phone.\"","If she told Jiang Mai that her body had been hijacked by a system for the past two years, would she even believe it?","Jiang Mai read a lot of web novels, didn't she? Surely she would believe it... right?","Hearing the helpless tone in the woman's voice, Jiang Mai paused, narrowing her eyes suspiciously at her phone.","\"...Are you really An Ling?\"","\"Yes, yes, yes, it's me!\" An Ling said quickly. \"Take me off your block list first. I'm borrowing someone else's phone right now and need to give it back.\"","Jiang Mai: ...","Looking thoughtful, Jiang Mai gave a slow, drawn-out oh. Then she added, \"Didn't you want to talk? Come to my coffee shop then. I'm usually here.\"","\"Alright, I'll head over in a bit.\"","Hanging up, An Ling handed the phone back to the driver. \"Thanks, Xiao Li.\"","Xiao Li took his phone back, casting a surprised glance at her. \"You're welcome, Young Madam.\"","He had heard rumors that the Madam had a volatile temper and a vicious personality. But looking at her now, that didn't seem to be the case at all. Although she acted a bit casually, she was actually quite approachable.","He brought the car to a stop. \"Young Madam, we've arrived.\"","An Ling stepped out of the car and took the elevator up to the top floor.","With a beep from the electronic lock, the door swung open to reveal a luxurious, sprawling penthouse.","Taking it all in at a glance, only one word came to An Ling's mind: clean.","It was far too clean.","So clean that there was absolutely no trace of anyone actually living there.","It felt like a newly purchased, fully furnished model home, completely devoid of warmth or life.","It seemed this marriage truly was one in name only. The two of them probably didn't even cross paths when they were both at home.","Following her memories, An Ling made her way to the master bedroom. She took a quick look around before slowly walking into the walk-in closet.","With a soft click, the crystal chandelier overhead lit up.","Before her eyes was an entire room filled with luxury bags, designer clothes, and exquisite jewelry. Under the warm lighting, every single item was perfectly arranged, practically radiating the extravagant scent of squandered wealth.","If you asked her why she wasn't opposed to an arranged marriage with Shen Linyan?","The answer was right here.","Shen Linyan was the absolute perfect candidate for a marriage of convenience. He was gentle, incredibly wealthy, and possessed an impeccable sense of boundaries. He never crossed the line, truly embodying the ideal of a loveless, transactional marriage.","Even though she had caused so much trouble, Shen Linyan had never once mistreated her materially.","Whether it was the latest seasonal designer pieces or fine jewelry, someone would always deliver them to her right away.","To Shen Linyan, these things were probably just a string of numbers. It didn't matter who he was giving them to.","An Ling flopped lazily onto the soft leather sofa. \"Why obsess over some male lead? Isn't all this a hundred times better?\"","A system was just a system after all—completely incapable of appreciating the finer things in life.","She leaned back against the sofa, raising a fully diamond-encrusted bracelet to admire it. \"Still, I need to leave myself a way out,\" she muttered softly.","According to her memories and the plot she had received, Shen Linyan was the archetypal gentle second male lead who gave unconditionally.","Her interactions with him today certainly confirmed that.","Shen Linyan maintained a mild, accommodating attitude toward almost everything.","Even when dealing with her—the vicious female side character—he never rejected any of her suggestions. He only showed a flicker of anger when the female lead was brought up.","The plot also claimed that Shen Linyan eventually went bankrupt because of her. But that was clearly the man's own problem; everyone else had their eyes on him, ready to pounce.","If Shen Linyan really did go bankrupt, she needed to make sure she could protect herself.","Meanwhile, back at the Shen family estate, Shen Linyan only realized An Ling had left early after he emerged from the study.","He wasn't surprised. Politely declining the nanny's offer to stay for dinner, he curled his lips into a faint smile and nodded at Mother Shen. \"Mother, I'll be heading back to the company as well. There are still some documents I need to take care of.\"","Just as he was about to leave, Mother Shen's voice rang out from behind him:","\"Linyan, even though you and An Ling have no feelings for each other, you are married. She is your wife, after all. You still need to keep her in check, otherwise, how can she ever be presentable in public with a temper like that!?\"","He wasn't sure if it was just his imagination, but Mother Shen's tone seemed to carry a hint of gritted teeth.","Shen Linyan paused in his tracks. He turned his head nonchalantly, his gaze sweeping across Mother Shen's face before landing on Lu Jingshen beside her, whose expression was equally dark.","What had happened here?","Standing to the side, Zhou Wen suddenly raised her hand. \"Big Brother, it was me... I wanted Sister-in-law to apologize to Jingshen. After all, Sister-in-law hit Jingshen on the head. But Sister-in-law... she... she said...\"","Zhou Wen trailed off at the end. Having never uttered such provocative words in her life, her face flushed slightly with embarrassment and indignation.","Shen Linyan waited for a moment but still received no answer.","He glanced down at the time, his brows furrowing imperceptibly. \"What did she say?\"","Seeing this, the nanny nearby squeezed her eyes shut, steeled her resolve, and blurted out:","\"Madam said, 'Is he worthy?'\"","As soon as those words were spoken, the air froze for a split second.","Shen Linyan's movements faltered, a fleeting trace of surprise flashing through his eyes. He casually lifted his gaze, sweeping it over the increasingly unsightly expressions of the three people sitting on the sofa.","Could just a few words from An Ling really make these people reveal such amusing expressions?","He raised an eyebrow slightly, smiling as he lowered his head to adjust his wristwatch. The curve of his lips seemed to hold a hint of apology, and his tone was unhurried:","\"Is that so? That was indeed inappropriate of her.\"","But she wasn't wrong, either."]},{"number":6,"title":"Chapter 6: Do You Believe It","paragraphs":["Upon receiving the news, Secretary Chen had been waiting by the car early on.","Seeing the man approaching, he hurriedly opened the car door.","\"Young Master, are we now...\"","Before he could finish his sentence, his expression froze when he saw the slight upward curve at the corners of the man's mouth.","Huh? The young master was in a good mood?","Every time the young master returned from the Shen family, his mood would be terrible.","Could it be that something good had happened?","But wasn't their plan disrupted by the Young Madam?","Secretary Chen buckled his seatbelt and cast a sideways glance at the back seat out of the corner of his eye.","\"Young Master, you seem to be in a very good mood.\"","Shen Linyan paused, glanced at him, turned his head, and discreetly covered his mouth.","\"No, you're mistaken.\"","Secretary Chen: \"...\"","He didn't expose the lie, keeping his eyes fixed straight ahead on the road.","\"The newspaper agency just sent us a message asking if they need to take down the article, or keep it up and let the matter blow up.\"","Thinking of An Ling's unusual behavior today, he paused and continued, \"The surveillance footage and photos from the private room have been obtained. They're on the tablet next to you. Should we send them to the An family according to the original plan?\"","No one knew better than them what had happened in the private room last night.","As long as this video was sent to the An family, if they wanted to protect their daughter's reputation, they would have to offer something of equal value in exchange, such as... shares.","Shen Linyan casually propped up his head, his long fingers carelessly tapping to open the video.","The video on the tablet clearly showed the private room where An Ling and Lu Jingshen were last night.","The camera angle was unusual, but it clearly recorded the situation inside the room.","The first half of the video showed An Ling drinking alone in the private room.","She called the paparazzi to arrange for photos, got drunk and fell asleep on the sofa, and then Lu Jingshen came in.","Everything was going according to the expected direction.","But when the woman woke up again, things got weird.","—An Ling suddenly couldn't recognize Lu Jingshen.","In the footage, the bewilderment on the woman's face didn't look fake, and she had no reason to feign amnesia.","However, very soon, An Ling reverted to her former self.","The woman's unwilling and vicious words echoed in the car; this tone was the An Ling he knew.","Shen Linyan narrowed his eyes, his fingertips gently tapping the edge of the tablet.","Was it because she was drunk that she didn't recognize him at first?","But whatever the case, once these actions of An Ling were handed over, it would be enough to make the An family pay the price.","Looking at the woman passed out in the video, the nanny's words from earlier flashed through Shen Linyan's mind.","He turned off the tablet and said indifferently, \"Didn't An Ling say she would clarify things? Let's hold onto these for now.\"","Hearing this, Secretary Chen was stunned.","The young master wasn't going to make a move against the An family anymore?","Could it be that he planned to wait a bit longer for a perfect opportunity to deal a fatal blow?","He didn't dare to say more, just nodding in compliance: \"Yes.\"","After driving for a while, the man's thoughtful voice came from the back of the car again.","\"Chen Dao, why do you think someone could suddenly change overnight? Chasing after someone one day, and suddenly turning hostile the next.\"","Secretary Chen instantly guessed who the man was referring to.","The Young Madam's behavior today was indeed strange. In the past, she couldn't wait to help Young Master Lu in every possible way, but now... she couldn't wait to draw a clear line.","He remembered an internet buzzword and said hesitantly, \"Perhaps it's... love turning into hate? They say that love taken to the extreme becomes hate.\"","Shen Linyan's eyes flickered slightly.","Love... turning into hate? Love to the extreme?","Isn't that still love then?","Slowly tapping the tablet with his fingertips, he lowered his eyes to conceal his emotions, and an ambiguous chuckle escaped his thin lips.","\"That's ridiculous.\"","On the other side, after An Ling rushed to the coffee shop, she first sent a message to Jiang Mai.","[I'm at the door, where are you?]","This body hadn't seen Jiang Mai for a long time, and couldn't even quite remember her voice. She definitely wouldn't be able to recognize her just by feeling, so she could only let the other party find her first.","Jiang Mai quickly replied with a message.","[Wait a moment, I'll be done right away. Come in and order a cup of coffee first, then find a seat.]","[Okay.]","An Ling pushed the door open, walked in, and went to the front counter.","There were few people in the shop at the moment, and only one girl was inside making coffee.","An Ling walked over and, seeing that the other party was still washing cups, gently reminded her, \"Hello, I'd like to order.\"","The girl paused, looked up towards her, but didn't move, her face showing a complex expression.","An Ling was confused, thinking there was something on her face.","But soon the girl put down the cup in her hand, walked over, and smiled, gesturing to the menu: \"Hello, please take a look at what you'd like to drink.\"","An Ling nodded and looked down at the menu.","Just as she was hesitating whether to try a new item, the girl's voice sounded in her ear: \"You are Miss An, right?\"","She paused slightly and looked up in surprise. \"I am. Did your boss tell you?\"","The smile on the girl's face gradually disappeared. She stared at her without speaking, and only after a few seconds did she slowly say:","\"An Ling, I'm Jiang Mai.\"","\"...\"","Seeing the woman's face instantly turn expressionless, Jiang Mai hurriedly raised her hands to explain, \"Well, I wasn't trying to mess with you on purpose! I was just testing you!\"","She knew An Ling hated being played like this the most, but she really needed to test her out!","Jiang Mai walked out from behind the counter, her eyes filled with shock and doubt. \"No way... did you really not recognize me?\"","\"What do you think?\" An Ling leaned against the counter. Seeing Jiang Mai's reaction, she actually knew what the other party was thinking.","The system had used her body to chase Lu Jingshen for two years, going through countless plotlines, and could accurately recognize people every time. So in the eyes of others, her face blindness had indeed been cured.","An Ling pointed to her own face and said seriously, word by word:","\"Jiang Mai, my face blindness has never been cured.\"","Jiang Mai was stunned, her brows furrowed as her gaze swept over An Ling's face.","\"Let's sit down and talk.\"","The two chose a corner of the coffee shop to sit down.","An Ling held the cup in her hand, looked down, and spoke: \"I know this might sound ridiculous, but the truth is that for the past two years, my body was occupied by something. Haven't you read novels? Actually, I'm the vicious female supporting character in a novel, and Lu Jingshen is the male lead. That thing made me pursue Lu Jingshen just to follow the plot.\"","Saying these things out loud, An Ling felt a bit guilty herself. She coughed and looked up at Jiang Mai.","\"Do you believe me?\"","Jiang Mai's expression was sluggish for a few seconds, then she leaned back in her chair without speaking, seeming to find it a bit hard to accept.","An Ling could also guess that Jiang Mai would have this reaction; after all, this kind of thing was too surreal.","She lowered her head and sighed, just planning to give some more convincing evidence.","Suddenly, the girl's voice came from across the table.","\"I believe you.\"","An Ling was taken aback. She looked up and saw Jiang Mai take a deep breath, and then slam her hand hard on the table.","\"Damn it! I knew it! I was wondering why you acted like you were having a seizure two years ago! You woke up one day and suddenly started being vicious to everyone, except for that Lu Jingshen guy whom you loved to death! You guys hadn't even met before! And your face blindness was miraculously cured too, you could even remember what a random dog on the street looked like! I was seriously wondering if Lu Jingshen had put a hex on you!\"","The more Jiang Mai spoke, the angrier she got. She took a huge gulp of coffee and continued her tirade:","\"You made such a fool of yourself when you were chasing after Lu Jingshen. I even went to see you back then to ask why you were acting like that. And what the hell did you do? You had security drag me out right in front of everyone! Then you turned right back around to go after that Lu Jingshen! Just thinking about it pisses me off!\"","\"...\"","Even though she wasn't the one who had actually done those things, An Ling still let out a sheepish, awkward laugh and quietly changed the subject.","\"So, you really believe me?\"","Jiang Mai took a deep breath to calm herself. \"Yeah. Honestly, I was already a bit suspicious when I got your call. After all, you haven't reached out to me once in the past two years.\"","That was exactly why she had deliberately tested An Ling, and surprisingly, it had worked.","But then again...","\"To think your role is actually the villainess?\"","Jiang Mai stroked her chin, clicking her tongue and nodding in agreement. \"If it weren't for your face-blindness, your temper definitely makes you worthy of the title.\"","Having been friends for over a decade, no one knew An Ling's temper better than she did.","Because of her face-blindness, An Ling never bothered to mince words or save face for anyone when she spoke. Coupled with how much her parents and older brother doted on her, absolutely no one dared to cross her.","At the thought of this, Jiang Mai paused for a moment, looking at the woman drinking coffee across from her.","\"Speaking of which... have you told your parents about this yet?\""]},{"number":7,"title":"Chapter 7: Public Display of Affection (PDA)","paragraphs":["At those words, An Ling's grip on her cup tightened.","After a brief silence, she let out a helpless laugh.","\"No.\"","Jiang Mai was taken aback. \"Why not?\"","\"Because I don't dare to.\"","An Ling leaned back in her chair and rubbed her temples, nursing a headache. \"Judging from the memories I inherited, my parents and my brother have exhausted a lot of their connections over the past two years just cleaning up my messes. I heard they even lost several business deals. Besides, I don't know if they'd even believe that my body was taken over by someone else. It's not like they read web novels.\"","Jiang Mai rested her chin on her hand, staring at her for a long moment before suddenly speaking up.","\"But have you ever thought about it? If even I could notice how much you changed over those two years, how could your parents not feel it?\"","An Ling paused her movements. \"They talked to you about it?\"","\"Of course.\"","Jiang Mai wore a complicated expression that screamed, Don't even get me started.","\"They thought you were possessed by some evil spirit and even wanted to hire a Taoist priest to perform an exorcism. But it didn't work. Later, when they realized you weren't going to self-harm and were just chasing after a man every day, they finally relaxed a little.\"","\"...\"","The melancholy in An Ling's heart dissipated in an instant.","That did sound exactly like something her parents would do.","Having said that, Jiang Mai flashed an intriguing smile. \"Since you just came back yesterday, you must have seen your husband, right? How is it? How does the great Miss An feel? Are you satisfied? A lot of people have their eyes on the position of Mrs. Shen.\"","An Ling's hand twitched, her expression turning odd. \"Are you serious?\"","Jiang Mai shrugged and waved her hand. \"What else? If you ask me, Shen Linyan is way more handsome than Lu Jingshen. I have no idea why Lu Jingshen is the male lead.\"","So when the other An Ling married Shen Linyan, Jiang Mai had thought the girl's eyesight was finally cured.","Who would have thought that after getting married, this wicked female supporting character would continue her usual antics, stirring up a whole series of scandals.","An Ling silently averted her gaze. \"What if I told you... Shen Linyan is actually the gentle second male lead?\"","Jiang Mai was instantly dumbfounded. \"...Are you kidding?\"","\"I'm serious.\"","An Ling was about to say more when her phone suddenly rang.","She picked it up and saw the caller ID was saved as Secretary Chen.","She gestured to Jiang Mai and answered the call.","On the other end, Secretary Chen spoke in a respectful tone. \"Madam, the clarification documents you requested earlier are ready. The company will also release the relevant statements.\"","An Ling gave a hum of acknowledgment, turned on the speakerphone, and placed the phone on the table. She took a sip of her coffee, then, as if suddenly remembering something, asked, \"Is Shen Linyan at the company right now?\"","Secretary Chen paused, glancing toward the office.","\"Yes, he is.\"","\"Can I come see him now? It's about the news.\"","Huh?","Secretary Chen silently swallowed his shock. \"You are coming... right now?\"","\"Yes. Is it inconvenient?\"","\"...\"","Unable to figure out what this unpredictable lady was plotting, Secretary Chen could only placate her for now. \"I will relay your message to Chairman Shen first and get back to you shortly.\"","After she hung up, Jiang Mai looked down, scrolling through her phone. \"Are you clarifying the news from last night? It's already trending. Everyone is discussing the Shen family's love triangle. It's escalating so fast. Some people are even taking bets on when you and Shen Linyan are going to get a divorce.\"","How could it not be fast? After all, this was the plotline in the novel that caused Shen Linyan to go bankrupt.","An Ling had already read the news on her way here.","Things couldn't be allowed to develop like this. Until she could safely extricate herself, Shen Linyan could not go bankrupt.","Just then, Secretary Chen sent a reply indicating that Shen Linyan had agreed to see her.","She picked up her bag and stood up. \"I'm heading out.\"","Jiang Mai looked up in confusion. \"Aren't things already arranged? What are you going to see Shen Linyan for?\"","An Ling raised an eyebrow and slowly enunciated.","\"To flaunt our love.\"","-","Meanwhile, at the An Group.","An assistant placed a tablet playing a video on the desk, looking at the man opposite him. \"President An, the video from last night spread too quickly. The Chairman and his wife saw it this morning.\"","An Zhou's gaze swept over the familiar woman in the video, and he rubbed the bridge of his nose in irritation.","\"Where is An Ling? She did something like this, and there's no word from her at all? Not even a phone call?\"","Ever since his sister had suddenly turned into this version of herself, he had been doing his utmost to minimize the damage she caused.","Her usual embarrassing, petty antics were one thing, but was she trying to ruin herself this time?","The assistant shook his head. \"After Chairman Shen took Miss An away from the bar last night, he locked down the news. But I heard Lu Jingshen's forehead was busted open. Some say Miss An... smashed him in a fit of rage after her advances were rejected.\"","An Zhou fell silent. He couldn't even offer a single word of rebuttal.","Because his sister was indeed fully capable of doing something exactly like that.","After dismissing his assistant, he dialed a number with a dark expression.","An Ling, who had just arrived downstairs at the company, saw the incoming call and a flicker of surprise crossed her face.","She had figured it out by now: the more she dreaded dealing with someone, the more likely they were to show up.","She paused, stopped in her tracks, and answered the phone. \"Brother?\"","On the other end of the line, An Zhou's tone was icy. \"Don't call me brother. I don't dare claim a sister like you. An Ling, didn't I tell you? I don't care who you chase after, but don't take it too far.\"","\"...\"","\"Did you also smash Lu Jingshen in the head?\"","She silently rubbed her nose. \"Ah, I think I did.\"","She thinks so??","An Zhou's face instantly darkened. \"Are you really crazy, An Ling? Do you like Lu Jingshen that much? You smash someone just because they reject you?\"","\"What rejection? I hit him because he was asking for a beating!\"","\"I knew it was because of that. Even if he was asking for it, you shouldn't—\"","An Zhou's voice abruptly cut off.","\"Wait, what did you just say?\"","His hopelessly love-struck sister, who normally couldn't even utter a harsh word to Lu Jingshen, had just said what?","An Ling was just about to answer when Secretary Chen's voice suddenly rang out from behind her. \"Young Madam, the boss suddenly has a meeting. I will take you upstairs first.\"","She turned to look, covering the receiver as she spoke in a low voice. \"I'm hanging up now. We'll talk later. I'm going to clear up the news.\"","The call disconnected. An Zhou frowned at his screen.","Was it his imagination? Why did it feel like this girl was somewhat different from before?","That tone... felt inexplicably familiar.","On the other side, An Ling put away her phone and followed Secretary Chen into the building.","As soon as she walked in, probing gazes were cast her way from all directions.","Acting as if she couldn't perceive the stares, An Ling stood by the elevator doors without changing her expression.","\"Mrs. Shen is here again...\"","\"She must be here to see President Lu, right? Could the news be true?\"","\"What do you think? She can't possibly be here to see Chairman Shen. The last time she came and made a scene, she was almost thrown out by security.\"","\"I heard that after that incident, Chairman Shen got an earful from the board's shareholders. Do you guys think a leader who can't even handle his own family affairs can really manage a company well? If you ask me, President Lu is far more capable than Chairman Shen.\"","The chatter from the crowd drifted clearly into her ears.","Secretary Chen's face stiffened.","Seriously, didn't these people know how to whisper??","From behind him slowly came the woman's thoughtful voice.","\"Secretary Chen, is what they're saying true? Shen Linyan got reprimanded because of me?\"","Secretary Chen's mouth twitched. \"That... is completely false, of course.\"","He really wanted to ask what this unpredictable lady was doing here. Was she going to throw another tantrum?"]},{"number":8,"title":"Chapter 8: Because I'm Your Wife","paragraphs":["This was the first time An Ling had heard gossip about Shen Linyan.","Although the rumors those employees were spreading were false, at this rate, it wouldn't be long before they became reality.","Following the standard script of a vicious female antagonist, she ought to storm over right now, slap those employees across the face, and then flex her authority as Mrs. Shen. She should sneer and tell them they were fired, thereby further ruining Shen Linyan's reputation within the company.","An Ling tapped her finger against her arm, her gaze slowly sweeping over the employees who were whispering among themselves.","Catching her eye, the employees stiffened and lowered their heads like frightened quails.","Sensing the brewing storm, Secretary Chen quickly turned to her. Young Madam, please don't worry, I will handle—","But finding empty air behind him and seeing the woman already striding toward the front desk, he panicked. Young Madam!","Oh, for the love of God!","Ding! The elevator chime suddenly rang out.","The elevator doors slowly slid open.","Upon seeing the man inside, Secretary Chen's eyes widened in horror. He just wanted the ground to swallow him whole.","Sir... he stammered, just about to speak.","But the man merely raised a hand slightly, gesturing for silence.","Meanwhile, An Ling had already clicked her way over to the front desk in her high heels.","Under the pale, terrified gazes of the receptionists, she leaned lazily against the counter. Having a good chat, are we? How about letting me join in?","At her words, the group trembled even harder.","An Ling's gaze swept across their faces. Propping her chin on her hand, she asked with a beaming smile, Why did you stop? You specifically chose to discuss this right when I walked in. Didn't you want me to hear it?","One of the employees immediately apologized, his voice shaking. I'm so sorry, Madam... Please be the bigger person and forgive us this once. I really need this job.","The others quickly followed suit.","Madam, we are so sorry! Please forgive us just this once. We promise it will never happen again.","Yes, Madam, we wouldn't dare gossip like this ever again.","Madam, we were truly wrong. Please let us off the hook.","Seeing the receptionists being put on the spot, some onlookers who didn't know the full story began to whisper among themselves.","What's going on here...","Looks like they're being given a hard time.","That's Mrs. Shen, isn't it? Is she here to cause trouble again?","How awful. Those poor guys are doomed.","The whispers drifted into her ears. Everything was playing out exactly according to the predetermined plot.","No matter who was actually at fault, as long as she, the vicious antagonist, intervened, she would be the one to blame.","It was almost too classic.","An Ling blinked, then suddenly burst into laughter. What's with the long faces? You're making me look like the bad guy, as if I'm going to fire all of you.","Relief was just about to wash over their faces when the woman's tone abruptly shifted.","Although, I suppose I really am the bad guy.","...","An Ling offered a sweet, amicable smile. Tell you what. I'm not an unreasonable person. Who started the rumor about the board of directors? I don't know where you heard it, but this counts as slander, doesn't it? It might even damage the company's image.","The others shook their heads in sheer panic and immediately pointed at a man standing next to them. Madam, we didn't say it! He was the one who said it! We were just listening to him.","Yes, exactly! He said it! We don't know anything about it!","The accused man jumped, his face turning an ugly shade of pale.","An Ling took a brief look at the man.","Whatever, she couldn't remember his face anyway.","She'd just let Secretary Chen remember it.","With that thought, An Ling turned toward the elevators.","However, her gaze locked when she saw the man standing next to Secretary Chen.","The man was tall and straight. His dark black suit was perfectly tailored to highlight his broad shoulders and narrow waist. His features were mild and refined. With one hand casually slipped into his pocket, he exuded an innate, aristocratic elegance. It was unclear how long he had been standing there watching.","Honey, what are you doing down here? I was just on my way up to find you. Without letting her smile falter, An Ling clicked over to him in her heels.","From the very first second their eyes met, she knew exactly who he was.","She stopped in front of him, looking up with crinkled, smiling eyes. Someone was spreading rumors about you. I was just helping you catch the real culprit.","Upon hearing this, the other receptionists hastily spoke up to clear their names. Chairman Shen! We didn't say anything! He was the one spreading rumors; it has nothing to do with us!","Yes, yes! He was the one doing all the talking! He's the rumor-monger!","The tide had turned entirely too fast. Betrayed by his colleagues, the male employee's face grew even more livid. Don't try to shift all the blame onto me! You guys were gossiping too!","The others widened their eyes and waved their hands frantically. Don't talk nonsense! We're nothing like you! You were the only one talking!","Exactly! We didn't say a word!","The bickering escalated as the employees fought over who was at fault.","Meanwhile, the true instigator of this chaos stood right in front of him, smiling like a picture of innocence, reaching out to brush some imaginary dust off his shoulder.","Honey, I'll leave the rest to you, okay? I'll wait for you in the elevator.","Beside them, Secretary Chen's eye twitched. He lowered his head, trying his hardest to blend into the background.","Shen Linyan watched the woman's retreating figure. He lifted his gaze to the front desk and, with almost no hesitation, said,","Fire them all.","As his calm, emotionless voice fell, the color drained from the employees' faces.","Inside the elevator, An Ling raised an eyebrow when she heard this.","Once the man stepped inside, she leaned against the wall, gave a lazy yawn, and teased with a smile,","Firing all of them? What if people start gossiping about our Chairman Shen again?","Shen Linyan's lips curved upward out of habit. The smile in his eyes was exceptionally faint, overshadowed by a calm indifference, though his voice remained as mild as ever.","It sounds like my wife is looking out for me.","How could she not look out for him? After all, if he went bankrupt, the male lead would come after her.","An Ling looked down to play with her phone and tossed out a casual excuse. Because I'm your wife, of course. Who else would I help?","She failed to notice the man's frame stiffen slightly at her words.","The smile in Shen Linyan's eyes froze for a fleeting second.","His gaze gradually darkened into an abyssal stillness, and the fingers resting by his side curled slightly. He glanced at the woman beside him and suddenly gave a faint, mocking tug of his lips.","That won't be necessary. Miss An should know very well that ours is merely a marriage of convenience. You don't need to concern yourself with my affairs, and I won't interfere with whatever you wish to do. We are simply taking what we need from each other.","Just like it had always been. There was no need for this sudden change.","Whether her love for Lu Jingshen had turned to hate, or if she was planning some other sort of revenge, he had no interest in getting dragged into it.","Huh? An Ling looked up in surprise.","This was the first time since she woke up that Shen Linyan had spoken to her in such a tone.","He was so bluntly exposing the true nature of their arranged marriage, even going so far as to call her Miss An.","In the past, Shen Linyan had never cared about what the original An Ling did, much less felt the need to emphasize that their marriage was purely transactional.","Astutely sensing that the man's mood was off, An Ling put her phone away and asked directly,","Shen Linyan, I was just helping you protect your image. Why are you getting mad?","The man paused, turning his head to look at her.","Ding—","The chime rang out, and the elevator doors slid open.","Yet, the two people inside remained completely still in silence.","An Ling blinked, shifting her gaze elsewhere.","Never mind. If you don't like it, I just won't help you next time.","What a weirdo. She was doing him a favor and he was actually annoyed about it. It wasn't like this had anything to do with the female lead, anyway.","An Ling, his deep voice suddenly called out her name.","She threw him a nonchalant glance, silently asking what he wanted.","A thick, unspoken tension silently filled the air.","A second later, a faint sigh seemed to brush past her ear.","The coldness in the man's voice finally began to thaw. Pressing the button to unlock the door, he spoke softly,","\"I'm not angry. I just don't want you to waste your time on me. You married me to get close to Lu Jingshen, and I married you to fulfill an agreement. We both get what we want out of this.\"","Truth be told, Shen Linyan wasn't wrong.","That was exactly what their relationship was. The system had used her body to marry Shen Linyan for the sole purpose of getting close to Lu Jingshen.","It would be more surprising if her sudden change in behavior hadn't made him suspicious.","No wonder Shen Linyan had been acting so strangely, sometimes seemingly considerate, and other times completely distant. Clearly, he still had his guard up around her.","Staring at the man's back, she pondered for a moment before suddenly speaking up,","\"What if I told you I don't have feelings for Lu Jingshen anymore?\"","Shen Linyan stopped in his tracks and turned to look at her.","\"Shen Linyan, we did enter this to get what we both wanted, but my needs have changed. I want you to secure your position as the Chairman of the Shen Group, so we can solidify the partnership between our two families.\"","An Ling stepped up to him and raised her hands to straighten his tie. With a soft smile in her eyes, she murmured,","\"So, my dear husband, I won't allow anyone to jeopardize our mutually beneficial arrangement, not even myself.\"","Shen Linyan remained silent.","The man's calm, dark eyes rested quietly on her. The emotions in his gaze were like a faint mist hovering over a lake, so elusive that it was impossible to tell whether he believed her or not.","In truth, An Ling couldn't care less if he believed her.","Initially, she hadn't even wanted to bother explaining herself to him.","After all, infidelity between couples in arranged marriages was hardly uncommon.","Even Shen Linyan himself was still secretly in love with the female lead, Zhou Wen.","She was only saying this now to put his mind at ease. She wasn't going to stir up trouble like she used to, so there was no need for him to be so guarded. After all, they still had to work together moving forward.","Smiling, she let go of his tie. \"You should go. Don't you have a meeting to attend? I'll wait for you in the office.\"","Suddenly, the man's gentle voice sounded from behind her. \"Of course I believe my wife.\"","An Ling turned her head to meet his gaze.","Her eyes curved into a sweet smile. \"Thank you for believing me, hubby.\"","Watching the office door click shut, Shen Linyan withdrew his gaze. After a moment of silence, he turned and dialed a number.","\"Find out who An Ling met with today.\""]},{"number":9,"title":"Chapter 9: It seems Madam needs us to show off our affection.","paragraphs":["The board members attending today's meeting sensed that something was off.","Shen Linyan, a man usually known for his rigorous and composed demeanor, had repeatedly glanced at his phone during the meeting. He was clearly distracted.","Remembering the incident that had just unfolded downstairs, the room came to a sudden, collective realization.","Shen Linyan's wife from their arranged marriage never failed to stir up a hornet's nest of trouble every time she visited the company.","True to form, she had just gotten several receptionists fired today.","Shen Linyan was likely worried she would cause even more chaos.","The shareholders knew exactly what was going on, but none of them dared to bring it up to Shen Linyan's face.","Except, of course, for those who harbored a particular grudge against him.","Clack! A thermos was slammed onto the table, the sharp sound shattering the silence of the conference room.","Shen Yue furrowed his brows, his tone cold and unyielding. Shen Linyan, it is high time you reined in your wife. Do you have any idea how much the Shen Group's stock dropped after that fiasco yesterday? And this isn't the first time, either.","Shen Linyan lazily lifted his eyelids, finally tearing his gaze away from his phone. You don't need to worry. I will handle it.","Handle it?","Shen Jiandong let out a disdainful snort. How long has this been going on? That woman stirs up one mess after another. If you can't even keep an arranged wife in line, how do you expect us to trust you?","He leaned back in his chair, his tone growing harsher. I heard she fired several front desk employees today, and with your approval, no less? If things keep going this way, is she going to fire us next?","His reprimand echoed through the conference room. The rest of the board remained dead silent, neither agreeing nor disagreeing.","This was largely due to Shen Jiandong's unique status. Not only was he a major shareholder of the Shen Group, but he was also Shen Linyan's uncle.","When Shen Zhong stepped down, Shen Jiandong had fully expected to take over the reins of the company.","To everyone's shock, Shen Linyan suddenly returned from abroad and leapfrogged directly into the position of CEO.","The outside world had been rife with speculation at the time, but today, absolutely no one dared to question Shen Linyan's authority.","After all, within his first quarter in office, he had generated tens of billions in revenue for the Shen Group.","But so what?","Shen Jiandong sneered inwardly. In the end, didn't he still have to bow to the family elders, marry the woman they chose, have children, and let himself be manipulated like a puppet?","Shen Linyan, you might be a genius at investments, but when it comes to corporate management, you are still too green. If you ask me...","I was the one who fired them, the man's deep voice cut through the room.","Shen Jiandong's words caught in his throat. He stared wide-eyed at the man sitting at the head of the table.","Shen Linyan lowered his gaze and casually adjusted his cuffs. He spoke at a slow, measured pace, every syllable crystal clear and radiating an unflappable composure. I dislike chatty employees, so I let them go. Or are you suggesting that, as the Chairman, I lack the authority to terminate staff? Do we need to convene a board meeting to put it to a vote?","He paused, his sharp gaze sweeping across the pin-drop silent room, before continuing. I will also take full responsibility for last night's incident. It will not negatively impact the company. If anyone else has an objection, you may voice it now.","The conference room plunged into a deathly stillness. Even the sound of people breathing seemed magnified tenfold.","Shen Linyan slowly stood up. His movements were unhurried, every gesture exuding an innate, aristocratic elegance.","A faint, shallow smile graced his lips, and the trailing notes of his voice were gentle. The cold, piercing sharpness from just moments ago seemed like nothing but a passing illusion.","Since it seems no one has any further objections, meeting adjourned.","The moment he stepped out the door, the conference room erupted into a flurry of whispers.","Several shareholders leaned back in their chairs, sipping their tea as they looked at Shen Jiandong with undisguised schadenfreude.","Jiandong, why did you have to go and provoke the boy? Haven't you figured it out yet? He's not someone you want to mess with.","He's the heir personally groomed by that old fox, Shen Zhong. They kept him completely under the radar for years, supposedly training him abroad, only for him to parachute straight into the Chairman's seat the second he returned. Did you honestly think he was just some idle, spoiled rich kid?","You really need to temper that attitude of yours. If you ask me, Shen Linyan was actually in a pretty good mood today. He gave you plenty of face. Keep picking fights like this, and he might just find a way to strip you of your shares.","Shen Jiandong's face darkened. Are you all really letting a wet-behind-the-ears brat scare you? His past investments were nothing but dumb luck. You think he'd actually dare to make a move against us?","The other shareholders simply laughed aloud. Not wanting to argue further, they stood up and waved him off. Alright, alright. We just want to enjoy a peaceful retirement. If you want to butt heads with him, leave us out of it. You'd be better off seeking out his little arranged wife. Who knows, maybe she'd be thrilled to help you.","Hearing this, Shen Jiandong froze.","Shen Linyan's wife?","He stroked his chin, a calculating gleam flashing through his eyes.","Meanwhile, up in the CEO's office, An Ling, who was comfortably lounging in the executive chair, suddenly let out a sneeze.","She opened her eyes, her gaze landing squarely on Shen Linyan just as he walked through the door.","Finished with your meeting?","Shen Linyan gave a soft hum in response. His expression remained entirely unchanged, as if he wasn't the least bit surprised to find her sitting in his chair.","He slipped off his suit jacket, revealing a tailored vest underneath. The crisp white shirt accentuated his broad, perfectly contoured shoulders. With his long legs and narrow waist, he cut a striking figure. As he casually rolled up his sleeves, the faint outline of firm muscles shifted in his forearms.","He took a seat on the sofa and began pouring tea. His long, slender fingers lightly tapped against the white porcelain cup. Every movement was slow, graceful, and unhurried. The natural, gentle curve of his eyes softened his features, and his expression was completely serene when he finally spoke in a mild tone.","Secretary Chen mentioned that my wife wished to see me. What was it you wanted to discuss?","She had to admit, if it weren't for the fact that he was the story's second male lead, Shen Linyan's looks and aura would be exactly her type.","An Ling rested her chin in her hand and stared at him for a moment before letting out a soft sigh.","What a pity. He was doomed to fall for the female lead.","Losing interest, she looked away and began twirling a fountain pen on the desk. It's about the public clarification. If I'm going to clear things up, the best way to shut the media up is to prove that we have a loving relationship as husband and wife.","Shen Linyan took a slow sip of his tea and lazily raised his eyes. And so?","An Ling blinked at him with wide, innocent eyes. And so, I'll need my darling husband to cooperate with me.","Shen Linyan's hand paused. His gaze darkened slightly, the swirling steam from his teacup blurring the obscure emotions flickering in his eyes.","A moment later, he let out a low chuckle and set the cup down.","It seems my wife needs me to put on a public display of affection with her.","This man caught on fast!","An Ling blinked in surprise. She hopped out of the chair, walked over to the sofa, and plopped down right next to him. Tilting her head to study his face, she asked, So you agree?","Under the current circumstances, demonstrating that their marriage was perfectly harmonious would indeed shatter the rumors without them having to lift another finger.","Shen Linyan leaned back against the plush sofa and crossed his hands in his lap. He watched her with leisurely amusement, a gentle smile playing on his lips. I'm rather curious. Exactly how does Miss An plan to display this affection?","Calling her Miss An felt like a deliberate reminder of the purely transactional nature of their arranged marriage.","Going by the memories she had inherited, ever since their wedding, she and Shen Linyan had never even shared so much as a casual touch, let alone shared a bed.","But An Ling already had a game plan ready.","With a mysterious flair, she reached into her bag and pulled out a small, burgundy velvet box.","Click. The box popped open.","Nestled inside was a pair of dazzling, diamond-encrusted silver wedding bands.","An Ling's eyes curved into happy crescents as she held the box up between them. Tilting her head, she offered a bright, cheeky smile.","Time to put on your ring, Hubby."]},{"number":10,"title":"Chapter 10: Of course I will cooperate","paragraphs":["At the first sight of the ring, the composed smile on Shen Linyan's lips suddenly froze.","He shifted his gaze with an unreadable expression, moving it to the face of the girl standing in front of him.","Under the sunlight, her skin was translucent. Her brown eyes were clear and clean, rippling with a faint, gentle smile. The way they curved like crescent moons made her simply impossible to refuse.","He stared into those beautiful eyes for a moment before looking away. His Adam's apple bobbed slightly. It was hard to tell from his tone whether he was pleased or surprised. \"You went home to get these?\"","\"Yeah!\" What else would she go home for?","An Ling raised her eyebrows and hummed softly. She took out a men's wedding band, handed it to the man, and confirmed once more, \"Hubby, you'll cooperate with me, right?\"","Although their families' union was merely a marriage of convenience, it was still a marriage. Naturally, Shen Linyan wouldn't just go through the motions. He had arranged everything meticulously, ensuring An Ling received every bit of ceremony she deserved.","However, ever since buying the wedding rings, Shen Linyan hadn't seen them again. He had even long forgotten what they looked like.","He never expected to see them again in such a manner.","And brought to him by the wife who loved him the least, no less.","Under the girl's expectant gaze, Shen Linyan imperceptibly tilted his head, a very soft chuckle escaping his lips.","Interesting.","He could no longer guess what she was going to do next.","Before coming to the company, An Ling had already checked online: wedding rings are worn on the ring finger.","She excitedly waited for Shen Linyan to take his ring so she could put hers on.","But the next second, the box was taken from her hand.","An Ling froze. Before she could react, the pad of the man's thumb lightly brushed against her skin. His long fingers supported the palm of her hand, holding it up like a true gentleman.","The cold touch of the metal band spread from her fingertip, the diamond ring sparkling brilliantly under the lights.","The ring was slowly pushed onto her finger, its outer edge seemingly tainted with the lingering warmth of the man's fingertips.","From above came his gentle, low chuckle.","\"I said, if my wife needs me, of course I will cooperate.\"","A shallow smile rippled in the man's eyes. His facial features were as picturesque as a landscape painting, his expression gentle, and the woody scent of pine on him subtly drifted into her nose.","An Ling stared blankly at the diamond ring on her hand.","That was totally unfair...","Her face flushed slightly. She coughed and subtly pulled away, \"Thanks...\"","She held up the men's wedding band in her hand and asked tentatively, \"Should I put yours on for you, too?\"","The man's eyes curved as he took the ring. \"No need to trouble yourself, Miss An.\"","Fine then. Calling her 'wife' when putting the ring on her, and now switching back to 'Miss An'. He really had a strong sense of boundaries.","An Ling didn't mind. It was just putting on a ring, not a real wedding ceremony anyway.","After the ring was on, An Ling turned to take out her phone, completely unaware that the man behind her had his eyes fixed on her. His gaze was quietly evaluating, devoid of any trace of the previous tenderness.","Seeing the woman's perfectly normal expression, Shen Linyan casually withdrew his gaze and slowly slid on his own wedding band.","He thoughtfully picked up his porcelain cup and took a sip of tea, only realizing after swallowing that it had long gone cold.","He paused. Just as he was about to pour himself a fresh cup, the girl's earnest voice suddenly rang in his ears.","\"Shen Linyan, can you hold my hand?\"","\"...\"","His fingertips stiffened, then he curled his lips into a smile and set the teacup down.","\"I can. How do you want me to hold it?\"","An Ling obediently extended her hand. \"Just hold my wrist and make sure the rings are showing. I'm going to take a picture and post it.\"","Shen Linyan had never done anything like this before. His movements were uncharacteristically hesitant. His long fingers loosely hovered over her wrist, keeping a slight distance without actually touching her.","Little did he expect that this gentlemanly gesture would only earn his little wife's dissatisfaction.","\"Don't do it like that. Just grab it directly. People will be able to tell it's fake. It's fine, just bear with it for a second, it'll be over quickly.\"","\"...\"","He should bear with it?","Shen Linyan lifted his eyelids with an unreadable expression, his long fingers slowly wrapping around the woman's slender wrist.","As their warm skin touched, both of them paused.","The woman's skin was delicate and smooth, like a piece of fine, warm mutton-fat jade. It was soft to the touch, feeling as though even the slightest pressure would leave a mark.","He subconsciously loosened his grip, ignoring the strange feeling in his chest. He silently looked away and used his other hand to pick up the cold teacup, taking a few sips.","Meanwhile, An Ling, holding her phone, also felt a bit unnatural.","The man's palm was warm, the pads of his fingers bearing a very faint layer of calluses. His grip was light, and the touch of his palm was neither too hot nor too cold.","She silently raised her phone and took the picture.","\"Done.\"","As soon as she spoke, both withdrew their hands, each lost in their own thoughts. They exchanged a glance before tacitly looking away.","An Ling picked up her bag and stood up, the warmth of the man's palm seeming to linger on the back of her hand. \"You get back to work then, I'll head home first. I'll post the photo online along with the clarification in a bit.\"","Shen Linyan glanced at the empty square box on the desk, then casually looked away, giving a soft \"Mm.\"","After the woman left, he leaned back in his chair and remained silent for a long while. He raised his hand, staring at the wedding band on his finger, his pitch-black eyes hiding whatever he was thinking.","\"Knock, knock, knock—\"","Secretary Chen's voice sounded from outside the door. \"Chairman Shen.\"","\"Come in.\"","As soon as Secretary Chen pushed the door open, he saw the man leaning against the sofa, staring blankly at his hand.","Before he could figure out what was going on, Shen Linyan had already lowered his hand. \"Did you find anything?\"","Secretary Chen bowed and handed over the file in his hand, saying hesitantly, \"We found out that the young madam borrowed the driver's phone today to call a woman. The other party is an old friend of hers. Besides that, the only other call was from the young madam's brother.\"","Shen Linyan paused. He took the file and flipped through it. \"No Lu Jingshen?\"","\"No. Today the madam only saw that friend of hers. Chairman Shen, do you think the An family has noticed something...\" Secretary Chen's voice came to a sudden halt when he saw the ring on the man's finger.","His eyes widened as he stared at the wedding band in astonishment.","Huh?? Was that ring there before?","But before he could look closer, Shen Linyan set the file down. \"Stop the investigation for now. You may leave.\"","\"Yes, sir.\"","Secretary Chen closed the door on his way out. He returned to the office area, still not recovered from the shock, when a colleague nearby suddenly let out a gasp.","\"Holy crap!!\"","He jumped, nearly dropping the file. \"What are you doing? You scared me half to death yelling like that.\"","The colleague held up their phone in shock.","\"Secretary Chen, did you see the clarification the young madam just posted?\"","\"What clarification? She already posted it?\" Secretary Chen took the phone to look. When he saw the contents clearly, his face instantly froze.","He saw that five minutes ago, An Ling had made a post on social media.","[My husband and I are very much in love. Thank you all for your concern. Please don't believe or spread rumors.]","The accompanying picture showed two hands wearing wedding rings. The man was holding the woman's hand, the veins on the back of his large hand slightly bulging, giving off an invisible sense of security. The intimate posture allowed people to feel the romantic atmosphere even through the screen.","Looking at the comment section, the tide was already beginning to turn.","Everyone's attention was captivated by this photo; who still remembered last night's news?","[I knew it was fake. How could anyone throw away the status of Mrs. Shen just to seduce that second young master.]","[Holy crap! What a massive rock! So sparkly!]","[Is no one going to talk about how gorgeous Chairman Shen and Mrs. Shen's hands are? As someone obsessed with nice hands, I am extremely satisfied!! I am drooling over them!]","Secretary Chen was stunned speechless, looking at the colleague beside him.","\"Are these... Chairman Shen's hands? When was this taken?\"","A lightbulb suddenly went off in his head. He immediately thought of the wedding ring he had just seen in the office and muttered in disbelief, \"Unbelievable.\"","He had truly underestimated the Young Madam."]},{"number":11,"title":"Chapter 11: The pigeon egg in your hand looks even better.","paragraphs":["The post An Ling made quickly climbed to the top of the trending topics, and her follower count skyrocketed. At the same time, the Shen Group's PR department issued an official statement, causing last night's news to be instantly taken down.","However, right after her post went live, someone on the internet exposed the history of An Ling chasing after Lu Jingshen.","An Ling was completely unaware at first. After returning from the company, she took a shower and went straight to sleep.","She slept all the way until the evening, only finding out when Jiang Mai called her after she woke up.","\"The internet is saying I chased after Lu Jingshen?\"","With her phone on speaker and set aside, An Ling yawned, her voice still raspy from sleep. Wearing her pajamas, she sat on the sofa, scrolling through the comments on her tablet.","\"Yeah, it's incredibly detailed. They even compiled it into a document. It was completely scrubbed from the internet shortly after, but I managed to save a copy. I'll send it to you.\"","An Ling saw the file pop up and was just about to accept it.","From the other end of the line came Jiang Mai's teasing laughter. \"Hey, by the way, is that photo real or fake? Was that really Shen Linyan's hand?\"","\"What do you mean, real or fake? Do you think I'd just find some random guy to fake it? Imagine the disaster if I got caught,\" she replied with an amused scoff, her gaze subconsciously falling on her empty ring finger.","She wondered if Shen Linyan had taken off his ring yet.","Jiang Mai had actually guessed it was real. Shifting her position on the bed, she tapped open the photo and clicked her tongue in admiration. \"But seriously, Shen Linyan has gorgeous hands. He could totally be a hand model.\"","An Ling retorted, \"Hey, are my hands not pretty enough?\"","Jiang Mai replied, \"The giant diamond on your hand is even prettier.\"","\"...\"","An Ling let out a huff and downloaded the file.","Flipping through the comments below the post, Jiang Mai asked casually, \"Your parents must have seen the news by now, right? Have you talked to them?\"","An Ling's movements paused. She put down the tablet and suddenly said, \"My brother called me today.\"","Jiang Mai was startled and immediately sat up. \"Really? What did he say?\"","\"Nothing much. He just asked about the news reports and whether I actually hit Lu Jingshen. I was on my way to see Shen Linyan at the time, so we just had a brief chat. I told him I'd call him back once everything was sorted out.\"","At this, An Ling took a deep breath, her tone turning serious. \"So, I'm planning to make a trip back home tomorrow.\"","Although there was still a mountain of trouble waiting for her, at least the immediate crisis was resolved. She could finally feel a bit more at ease going back to see her parents and explaining everything clearly.","Jiang Mai was still hung up on the whole novel thing and asked curiously, \"So, our world is actually a novel? That's so surreal. I've read so many novels, and it turns out my bestie is the vicious female antagonist.\"","Adding to that, she asked with concern, \"Are you going to divorce Shen Linyan then? He is the second male lead, after all. What if he ends up betraying you for the female lead?\"","Jiang Mai had a valid point. An Ling had already considered this exact scenario.","Resting her chin on her hand, she let out a helpless sigh. \"I'm definitely getting a divorce, but not right now. I have to at least wait until the current mess is sorted out, right? I still have a pile of problems to deal with.\"","Unexpectedly, just as the words left her mouth, the electronic chime of the front door unlocking echoed through the room.","An Ling turned her head in shock.","Shen Linyan was back?!","This early? According to her memories, didn't Shen Linyan usually come home in the middle of the night?","She hastily grabbed the phone beside her. \"Shen Linyan is back. I'm hanging up.\"","Without giving Jiang Mai a chance to respond, she quickly hit the end call button.","With a soft beep, the door swung open.","Their eyes met in midair.","The woman sat on the sofa, her light gold silk pajamas making her skin look luminous. Her long, dark hair was slightly messy, and her delicate, makeup-free face bore a faint flush, making her look exactly like someone who had just woken up.","This unprecedented sight made Shen Linyan pause in his tracks.","His gaze lingered for a few seconds, and his grip on the doorframe tightened slightly. However, he quickly returned to his usual demeanor, lowering his eyes as he bent down to change his shoes.","For a moment, absolute silence filled the spacious living room.","The atmosphere was a bit awkward, so An Ling silently turned her head back around.","Whatever. If Shen Linyan greeted her, she would respond; if not, she'd just let it be.","An Ling smoothed out her bedhead, quietly pricking up her ears to listen to the rustling behind her.","Shen Linyan looked up as he loosened his tie, only to see the girl's figure sitting on the sofa with her back to him.","He paused for a moment before walking straight back to his own bedroom.","With a soft click, the door closed, but Shen Linyan remained standing frozen in place.","The man stood quietly by the door. The dim, warm light spilled over the broad, straight line of his shoulders, casting a deep shadow beneath his high nose bridge. His dark eyes were quiet yet slightly unfocused, masking whatever thoughts were running through his mind.","A moment later, he let out a low chuckle and rubbed the bridge of his nose in resignation.","\"I must be going crazy.\"","He walked over to the closet, took off his suit jacket, and unclasped his watch to place it on the table. When his gaze fell upon the wedding ring on his finger, his movements halted once again.","After a moment of silence, he finally took it off, placed it neatly beside his watch, and grabbed a change of clothes before heading into the bathroom.","Meanwhile, upon hearing the sound of his door closing, An Ling glanced back at his room and let out a sigh of relief.","\"Well, just as I expected.\"","They weren't exactly close enough to exchange casual greetings. They put on an act for the public when they were outside, but there was no need to keep up the charade at home.","Both she and Shen Linyan were well aware of this.","If it hadn't been for the need to clear up the rumors, they wouldn't have had a single word to say to each other.","Now that the crisis was averted, there was no need for any further interaction.","An Ling opened the document she had just downloaded.","The first thing that caught her eye was a neatly formatted spreadsheet.","Dense blocks of text filled the entire screen.","Just as Jiang Mai had said, whoever posted this had clearly put a ton of effort into it. Every single incident was described in excruciating detail.","There were even details that An Ling herself wasn't aware of, yet the author had managed to describe them with perfect clarity.","For instance, when she made love bento boxes for Lu Jingshen, the document listed the exact dishes inside. When she knitted a scarf for him, it detailed the specific pattern. It even accurately recounted how many bottles of alcohol she had intercepted for him during a particular dinner party.","At first glance, it almost looked entirely fabricated—after all, how could anyone know such intimate details?","But An Ling knew it was all true. In the memories she had inherited, every single one of these events had actually happened.","She read through a few lines, her mouth twitching more and more with every word.","What in the world was all this nonsense? How could it be this absurd?","Jiang Mai sent a message asking: [How's the reading going?]","An Ling: [It's pretty great.]","Jiang Mai: [...Great?]","An Ling let out a cold laugh.","[Yeah. I was having trouble sorting through all these memories myself, but now someone has kindly compiled them into a neat little document for me. It'll make getting my revenge on Lu Jingshen so much easier.]","Even though she wasn't the one who had actually done all those things, reading about them still pissed her off.","After finishing her chat with Jiang Mai, An Ling set her tablet back on the table and got up to head to the kitchen.","She had only eaten a quick bite for lunch, and now she was starting to feel a little hungry.","She opened the refrigerator to find it fully stocked with fresh ingredients—meat, eggs, and vegetables in abundance. It seemed the housekeeper came by frequently to restock.","She stared at the raw ingredients for a few seconds before slowly closing the fridge door. She then opened the pantry cabinet next to it and peeked inside.","\"How is there not even a single packet of instant noodles?\"","If she had known things would turn out like this, she would have bothered to learn how to cook.","An Ling ruffled her hair in frustration. Out of the corner of her eye, she noticed the freezer drawer below.","No instant noodles, but there had to be some frozen food, right?","She squatted down, pulled it open, and rummaged through it carefully. A few seconds later, she broke into a smile and triumphantly held up a package. \"Ha! I knew it!\"","Dumplings!","Beaming with delight, An Ling pulled the bag of frozen dumplings out.","Her smile barely lasted three seconds before she set the dumplings down, took out her phone, and opened a search engine.","Question: Do you put frozen dumplings in cold water or boiling water?","An Ling was so focused on reading the instructions that she completely missed the sound of footsteps approaching from behind.","The next second, a man's voice suddenly rang out right behind her.","\"...What are you doing?\""]},{"number":12,"title":"Chapter 12: What a Fine Husband","paragraphs":["Startled by the sudden sound of a man's voice, An Ling jumped and instinctively turned her head.","She saw Shen Linyan standing behind her; she had no idea when he had appeared.","The man was wearing pajamas, looking as though he had just stepped out of the shower. A towel was draped over his head, and his damp black hair clung to his temples, with a few stray strands falling to obscure his deep, expressive eyes.","His usual daytime elite persona was now softened by an air of casual, lazy elegance.","For some reason, An Ling felt a pang of guilt, like she had been caught sneaking a midnight snack.","She set her phone down and discreetly blocked the food packaging behind her back.","\"Nothing much, just... throwing together something to eat.\"","Shen Linyan took off the towel. \"You didn't eat dinner?\"","An Ling turned her head and gave a dry laugh. \"Haha... yeah, I didn't.\"","She had slept straight through to the evening; how could she have eaten?","As she was thinking, the sound of footsteps drew closer, and a shadow suddenly fell over her.","The man had just bathed, and the damp, warm air hit her face. A familiar woody pine scent, mixed with the crisp aroma of cedar, drifted to her nose.","Her face grew inexplicably hot. She instinctively shrank back, bumping her waist against the counter. Looking up at the man in front of her, she blinked. \"What's wrong?\"","Shen Linyan didn't say a word, his gaze falling on the packaging she was trying to hide.","Just as he was about to look away, he caught sight of the glowing screen of her phone out of the corner of his eye.","When he clearly saw what she had been searching for, he paused slightly, took a step back to give her some space, and lowered his eyes, asking gently, \"You're planning to eat this for dinner?\"","She had been caught after all.","An Ling sighed silently. \"Yeah. Do you want some too? I was just looking up how to...\"","\"I'll cook it for you.\"","The unexpected offer caught An Ling completely off guard.","She looked up in astonishment. \"You'll cook for me?\"","Shen Linyan gave a soft hum of agreement, turning around to place his towel and phone on the table. He rolled up his sleeves and opened the refrigerator.","\"I'll add some extra lettuce and fry an egg, is that okay? Or do you want something else?\"","He was actually going to do it?","An Ling was baffled, but when she turned her head, she saw the search screen she had left open on her phone.","She blinked, instantly understanding. Silently, she put her phone away and stepped aside to make room. Standing nearby and sipping water, her eyes unconsciously drifted to the man.","Shen Linyan had excellent proportions. It was obvious when he wore suits, with his broad shoulders, narrow waist, and long, slender legs. Even now, in pajamas, he was incredibly pleasing to the eye.","Just then, Jiang Mai sent another message.","\"Did you ask Shen Linyan about that news? Maybe he was the one who had it taken down.\"","An Ling replied, \"Didn't ask. He's cooking dumplings for me.\"","Jiang Mai: \"? Cooking dumplings? For you?\"","An Ling was about to explain when another message popped up a second later.","\"Wow, the Chairman of the Shen Group comes home from work and cooks for his wife. What a perfect husband. An Ling, you lucky girl, you're eating well.\"","Caught completely off guard, her eyes widened, and she choked on her water. She quickly turned her head away, covering her mouth as she coughed. Her face turned bright red, though it was hard to tell exactly why.","Seeing the man look over, she hurriedly locked her screen and, still blushing, changed the subject. \"You know how to cook?\"","Shen Linyan looked at her for a moment, sliding the fried egg onto a plate. \"I learned when I was studying abroad,\" he said gently.","An Ling took the plate he handed her. Noticing his bare fingers, she paused, her gaze lingering for a couple of seconds.","He had already taken off his ring?","She turned and set the plate on the table. \"Shen Linyan, where's your ring? Give it to me, I'll put it away.\"","The man's tall, straight back stiffened slightly. He stopped what he was doing and turned to look at her. His expression was faint, his thin lips pressed into a straight line, and his dark eyes stared at her calmly.","An Ling was confused. \"What's wrong? You didn't throw it away, did you? We still need to wear them next time.\"","\"...No.\"","He withdrew his gaze and lowered his eyes to stir the dumplings in the pot. His gentle voice gave nothing away. \"It's in my room. I'll get it for you later.\"","Since he was cooking for her, An Ling felt it would be rude to just sit on the sofa and wait.","She sat at the dining table and asked casually, \"Did you have that news taken down from the internet? The one saying I was chasing after Lu Jingshen.\"","\"Yes.\"","This answer was exactly what An Ling had expected.","Resting her chin on her hand, she swung her legs idly under the table, her clear eyes fixed on the man's broad back.","For some reason, Jiang Mai's words popped into her head again.","She touched her burning ears and guiltily looked away.","When Shen Linyan brought over the cooked dumplings, she reached out to take them. \"Do you want to eat together?\"","Buzz, buzz, buzz.","The muffled vibration of the phone on the table made them both pause and instinctively look over.","The caller ID read: Zhou Wen.","In the middle of the night, his younger brother's wife suddenly calling—no matter how you looked at it, it was a bit strange.","Shen Linyan's gaze faltered for a second, and his long fingers covered the screen.","\"Sorry, you go ahead and eat. I need to take this.\"","\"Okay.\"","An Ling looked away, lowering her head to pick up the soup spoon from her bowl.","The man went to his room to answer the call. The door wasn't completely shut, and through the intermittent conversation, she could faintly make out the words \"news\" and \"don't worry.\"","Couldn't he have closed the door tighter? It wasn't like she wanted to eavesdrop.","An Ling sighed silently. It seemed Shen Linyan wouldn't have time to share a midnight snack with her after all.","After finishing the last dumpling, she put her bowl in the dishwasher, grabbed her tablet and phone from the sofa, and headed back to her room.","By the time Shen Linyan finished his call and came out, the living room was empty, and the dining table was cleared.","He stood there in silence for a moment, the ring in his palm growing warm from his tight grip. Finally, he turned off the lights and went back to his room.","The click of the door lock echoed in the air.","The pitch-black, quiet house seemed to return to its usual cold and lonely state.","In the morning, An Ling woke up from her dreams.","She was dazed for a few seconds before remembering that she had time-traveled two years into the future. Glancing at the time, she yawned and got out of bed.","After a quick wash, she opened her door and stepped out.","But as soon as she reached the living room, she stopped dead in her tracks, staring blankly at the unfamiliar auntie busying herself in the kitchen.","Who was this auntie?","Hearing the noise, the auntie turned around, her tone respectful. \"Madam, you're awake.\"","\"...Mm.\"","An Ling replied without changing her expression, using the moment she took a sip of water to think.","What was this auntie's name again?","Why didn't she have any memory of her?","Before she could recall the name, the auntie's voice rang in her ears.","\"Sir has already left for the company. Would you like to have breakfast now, Madam? Sir also asked me to let you know that if you plan to eat at home, you can tell me in advance, and I will prepare it for you.\"","An Ling paused, instantly recalling what had happened last night. \"Did Shen Linyan ask you to come? Didn't you cook before?\"","The auntie looked at An Ling with some surprise.","\"Yes, because you never eat at home, Madam, and Sir rarely comes back either, so I usually only clean the house and restock the groceries.\"","An Ling genuinely hadn't known this. She had always assumed Shen Linyan didn't come home because he was too busy with work.","It turned out that she was the one who never came home, which explained why she had so few memories of this house.","An Ling let out a breath. \"Alright, I'll go change my clothes and then come have breakfast.\"","\"Will you need me to prepare lunch and dinner for you today?\"","\"Not today. I'll eat out.\"","\"Understood.\"","In his office, Shen Linyan received a message from the auntie at home.","\"Sir, Madam said she will not be coming home for meals today.\"","He stared at the screen for a long while. Just then, a phone call suddenly came through.","Once the call connected, a resigned male voice came through the line.","\"The guys set up another gathering and said they absolutely must have you there this time. Should I just turn them down for you?\"","\"No need. I'll go.\"","The voice on the other end sounded surprised. \"Didn't you say you were busy tonight?\"","The man lowered his gaze, his fingers gently tracing the intricate patterns of the ring. Slowly slipping it onto his finger, he spoke in a calm voice:","\"I have time now.\""]},{"number":13,"title":"Chapter 13: Does Shen Linyan Know","paragraphs":["An Ling was afraid her words wouldn't be credible, so she specifically brought Jiang Mai along with her.","When they returned to the An family home, the housemaid came to open the door. Upon seeing clearly who had arrived, her eyes widened, and she made no attempt to hide her surprise. \"Miss?\"","An Ling peeked inside. Before she could ask anything, Mother An's voice came from inside the house.","\"Auntie Wang, who is it?\"","Accompanied by the sound of footsteps, Mother An also walked over.","An Ling hadn't even formed a smile when she saw the other party's expression instantly turn grave and her tone heavy.","\"What are you doing here?\"","\"?\"","This tone was so unfamiliar that An Ling subconsciously turned to look at Jiang Mai, her astonished gaze repeatedly seeking confirmation.","— Did we go to the wrong house? This is my home, right? This is my mom, right?","Receiving the signal, Jiang Mai simply shrugged.","— It can't be helped. Someone's image as a vicious supporting female character was just too successful.","The commotion drew Father An from the living room.","When he saw An Ling, he didn't speak, but his face was equally grave, his brows furrowed.","Being stared at by several people, An Ling looked helpless.","\"Mom, Dad... how about you let me in first so we can talk?\"","Mother An and Father An exchanged a glance. Finally, Mother An hesitantly spoke up, \"Come in.\"","Returning to her familiar home, An Ling looked left and right, finally feeling a real sense of having transmigrated.","The furnishings in the house were indeed different from two years ago.","Mother An sat back on the sofa. Beneath her guarded expression, there were still traces of worry.","The previous few times An Ling came back, Mother An was still very happy that her daughter came to see her.","It wasn't until she realized that An Ling only came back when she had caused trouble that her happiness turned into sorrow.","Father An also guessed the situation. He sighed and said in a deep voice, \"Lingling, your mother and I saw the news that day. It's one thing when you make a small fuss normally, but this time you've stirred up such a huge mess.\"","Cheating during a marriage, and cheating with her own husband's younger brother at that—how could they possibly stop such a scandal from blowing up once it got out?","Mother An furrowed her brows tightly. \"If I had known this would happen, we shouldn't have let you marry Shen Linyan in the first place. Just what kind of charm does that Lu Jingshen have to make you do this? You foolish girl, you're going to ruin your own life!\"","Facing the daughter he used to dote on the most, Father An's expression was ugly, but he still left some leeway in his tone. \"We can't help you with this matter. You'll have to figure it out yourself. If Shen Linyan asks for a divorce, our An family will have nothing to say.\"","At a time like this, neither Father An nor Mother An even considered asking An Ling to step forward and clarify that she didn't like Lu Jingshen.","In their eyes, if she had to choose between not liking Lu Jingshen and severing her ties with her parents, An Ling would undoubtedly choose the latter without hesitation.","They no longer held any hope for this severely love-struck daughter of theirs.","The two of them went back and forth, one sentence after another. An Ling sat to the side, unable to get a single word in.","It wasn't until Father An and Mother An finished scolding her that she weakly raised her hand.","\"Um... Mom, Dad, I already clarified it online yesterday.\"","As soon as she said this, Father An and Mother An's sighing instantly stopped.","The two of them abruptly looked up at An Ling and asked in unison:","\"You clarified it?\"","\"Yeah.\"","Seeing that they didn't believe her, An Ling simply handed her phone over. \"Didn't my brother tell you?\"","The clarification had been out for so long, she thought her parents would already know.","Father An and Mother An took the phone. After reading it, although their expressions weren't as grave as before, their brows were still furrowed.","Mother An worriedly handed the phone back.","\"Lingling... Does Shen Linyan know that you just found a random man to take these kinds of photos?\"","???","An Ling looked dumbfounded. \"...Ah? No, this...\"","Father An sternly interrupted her. \"You didn't drug Lu Jingshen and then pose for these photos, did you? That won't do. If you get caught, the consequences will be even more severe than this.\"","\"...\"","\"Pfft—\" Next to her came the sound of Jiang Mai's laughter, unable to hold it in any longer.","An Ling suddenly felt she shouldn't have brought Jiang Mai over; instead, she should have brought Shen Linyan here.","She sighed, looked up, and spoke earnestly:","\"Dad, Mom, I don't like Lu Jingshen, and I've never liked him.\"","The couple froze for a second, then suddenly turned their heads and whispered to each other.","\"It's over, it's over. I feel like the situation is even worse.\"","\"Is this girl changing who she likes? Or should we invite Taoist Priest Huang over?\"","\"She must be lying to us. The clarification didn't say she disliked Lu Jingshen. She probably came to us for money for Lu Jingshen's sake.\"","\"No wonder An Zhou told us not to interfere yesterday. Lingling probably went to her brother for money yesterday.\"","An Ling: \"...\" She could hear everything!","\"I'm not here to ask you for money, nor am I lying to you. Everything I'm saying is true.\"","Seeing the worried expressions on her parents' faces, An Ling's expression shifted slightly.","The words reached her lips, but she silently swallowed them back. She helplessly curled her lips into a smile and said softly:","\"Mom, Dad, there was actually a reason why I liked Lu Jingshen these past two years.\"","Hearing this, Jiang Mai was startled and subconsciously opened her mouth.","But after seeing An Ling secretly shake her head, she silently closed her mouth and looked away.","Mother An didn't notice anything unusual and looked up in confusion. \"A reason?\"","An Ling placed her hand on the back of her mother's hand. \"Yes, because I found out that liking Lu Jingshen would cure my face blindness. I just didn't expect that this liking would also affect my brain. Now he's useless for my face blindness, so I don't like him anymore, and my brain is back to normal.\"","These words seemed nonsensical, but her parents already believed that their daughter had been possessed by something unclean, so how could such words be hard to accept?","Sure enough, there was already a waver in Mother An's eyes.","\"Really? So Lingling, you still have face blindness now?\"","\"Yeah,\" An Ling smiled and leaned on her shoulder. \"Sigh, I almost mistook Auntie Wang for you at the door just now. Didn't I tell you not to change your hairstyle? Once you change it, I can't recognize you.\"","Hearing this, Mother An finally revealed a smile.","Father An's expression also showed some emotion. \"You really don't like Lu Jingshen anymore?\"","An Ling sat up straight and said with a serious face:","\"Dad, I really don't like a psychopath like Lu Jingshen.\"","Father An nodded in gratification.","To actually curse out Lu Jingshen.","Then it seemed she really didn't like him anymore.","Seeing that the misunderstanding was cleared up, An Ling hadn't even relaxed for a few seconds before she heard Mother An ask, \"Then did you tell your brother?\"","She paused. \"Not yet. I'll go find him and tell him the same thing after I finish eating lunch with you.\"","Mother An's brows were filled with happiness as she patted the back of her hand. \"Good, good, good. Today is a good day. Auntie Wang, make a few more dishes that Lingling and Maimai like to eat!\"","Auntie Wang quickly smiled and nodded in agreement. \"Alright.\"","After eating at home, An Ling chatted with her father and mother for a long time. It wasn't until they were completely at ease and confirmed that she really didn't like Lu Jingshen anymore that she and Jiang Mai left the An family home.","Sitting in the car, without waiting for Jiang Mai to ask, An Ling rested on the steering wheel, took a deep breath, and let out a helpless laugh:","\"This excuse is better than the truth, right? I don't want them to be sad and worried because of me anymore.\"","If she told her parents that their daughter was a vicious supporting female character and had her body occupied by something else for the past two years, her parents would start worrying about her ending and her future.","Even if she didn't tell them that her ending was death, they would definitely worry about whether that whatever-system would come back again.","It would be better to just admit that she had done everything herself, letting them think their daughter had finally changed for the better, rather than telling them she had actually returned.","Jiang Mai patted her on the shoulder and let out a sigh. \"I know what you mean. But what about your brother?\"","\"My brother?\"","An Ling rested her chin on her hand. \"Let's tell him the truth.\"","He should believe it, right?","An hour later, inside the CEO's office at the An Corporation.","An Zhou looked at the woman in front of him with a complicated expression, his tone hesitant:","\"An Ling... have you lost your mind?\"","What novel?","Did this girl stay up late reading novels last night?","Seeing the man's face full of disbelief, An Ling and Jiang Mai exchanged a glance.","\"Didn't you say he would believe it?\" Jiang Mai asked.","\"I forgot he's a staunch materialist,\" An Ling replied."]},{"number":14,"title":"Chapter 14: Madam Made Me Wear It","paragraphs":["Knowing her brother was a staunch materialist, An Ling rubbed her temples, feeling a headache coming on.","\"Brother, I'm not lying to you. My body really was possessed by a system for the past two years.\"","An Zhou frowned, looking her up and down suspiciously before turning to Jiang Mai. \"Do you believe what she's saying?\"","Jiang Mai nodded. \"I do. Otherwise, it's really hard to explain.\"","An Zhou leaned back in his chair, deep in thought. \"...True.\"","But this whole \"vicious supporting female character\" thing was just too absurd.","He thought for a moment, then looked up and asked, \"That day I called you, had you already come back by then?\"","\"Yeah.\" An Ling nodded. \"I was in a rush to find Shen Linyan to clarify the situation. You should have seen the news about the clarification, right?\"","No wonder he had felt her tone was so familiar.","An Zhou stared at her for a moment, confirming that there was no sadness on An Ling's face.","At least she had just woken up to find herself two years in the future, rather than watching helplessly as her body was occupied for two years.","It was a good thing this girl had always been carefree and easygoing.","His tense body relaxed slightly, and he gave a small nod. \"Alright, I'll believe you for now. If that's the case, what about your marriage with Shen Linyan? Are you going to divorce him? It might be a bit troublesome.\"","An Ling leaned against the back of her chair, the scene in the kitchen last night and that phone call flashing through her mind.","She pursed her lips and nodded lightly. \"We will divorce, but not right now. Shen Linyan's status is quite special. Brother, if you can give him a heads-up in business in the future, please do so. It's best not to let Shen Linyan take a loss.\"","An Zhou's eyelid twitched, almost doubting his own ears.","Huh???","What the heck? Shen Linyan... taking a loss??","\"...Are you serious?\"","That man could ruthlessly devour other people's companies. How could he possibly be the one taking a loss?","An Ling thought An Zhou was worried about her siding with an outsider, so she explained, \"We're not divorced yet, so if something happens to him, it'll be very troublesome for our side too. Once the An family is doing well again, I'll discuss an amicable divorce with Shen Linyan.\"","Anyway, Shen Linyan had no feelings for her, so talking about divorce shouldn't be difficult.","Perhaps, for the sake of their business ties, he would even give her a few houses and cars, and conveniently let her keep that whole room full of luxury goods.","At this thought, An Ling raised a hand to cover her rising smile. \"Anyway, that's how it is. Just listen to me for now, there's no harm in it.\"","An Zhou took off his glasses and pinched the bridge of his nose. \"Alright, I get it. As long as you don't cause trouble, I'll thank my lucky stars. I have a meeting later. Are you coming home for dinner tonight?\"","\"Jiang Mai and I ate at home for lunch, so we won't go back for dinner. I also told Mom and Dad about this.\"","Speaking of this, she leaned in slightly and whispered, \"But I didn't tell them it was a novel. I used another excuse. Don't let it slip and make them worry.\"","An Zhou paused and raised an eyebrow, taking another look at her.","Now, he was starting to believe a little more that An Ling was really back.","When the two were about to leave, An Zhou suddenly asked as if remembering something, \"Since you were the vicious supporting female character, what was your ending like?\"","An Ling blinked thoughtfully, then smiled.","\"I don't know either.\"","Night fell, streetlights illuminated the streets, and neon lights spread across the city like a spiderweb.","Men and women gathered in front of the clubhouse. It was a magnificent and prosperous golden building. The scent of alcohol and perfume permeated the air, exuding an aura of luxurious wealth in the night.","Golden Palace Clubhouse was the largest clubhouse in Jing City. The first floor was used to entertain ordinary guests, while the second floor exclusively served wealthy young masters and ladies.","A black Rolls-Royce pulled up steadily at the entrance. The Spirit of Ecstasy ornament on the hood reflected a cold gleam, and a security guard hurried forward to open the car door.","The man wore a crisp, custom-made suit. His deep-set eyes and brows were cold and aloof, and his nose was tall and straight. A brown watch strap was faintly visible at his cuffs, and an innate aura of aristocratic privilege emanated from his very bones.","The manager bowed and smiled respectfully, \"Young Master Shen, Young Master Wang asked me to take you to the second floor.\"","Wang Yihong was the youngest son of the Wang family and also the largest shareholder of the Golden Palace.","He was the one who organized this gathering, and Gu Xiaochi and Liang Chen were also present.","An attendant pushed open the door to the private room. Inside, Gu Xiaochi saw the newcomer, let out a \"Ha,\" and leaned back smugly on the sofa.","\"I told you he agreed, didn't I? You guys didn't believe me, so you two are treating today!\"","Liang Chen shrugged. \"Well, Shen Linyan has already turned us down several times. It was hard to believe.\"","Shen Linyan ignored them. After he sat down, an attendant poured him a glass of wine.","Once the service was done, Wang Yihong waved his hand, signaling the attendant to leave.","As the door to the private room closed, he smiled and said, \"Eldest Young Master Shen took over the company right after returning to the country, so naturally, he's incredibly busy. How could we compare?\"","Shen Linyan took a light sip of his wine. \"It seems there's no need for me to come next time either.\"","The three of them immediately turned their heads and changed the subject.","\"Oh, this wine is pretty good.\"","\"Right? It's from my private collection. You couldn't buy it even if you had the money.\"","\"Then I'll have to drink a bit more.\"","Gu Xiaochi rested his arm on the back of the sofa, took a sip of wine, and looked at Shen Linyan. \"But seriously, your mom has been playing so many petty tricks. When are you going to do something about it?\"","Ever since he returned to the country to inherit the company, Mother Shen had been secretly tripping him up, desperate for her second son to take over.","With such blatant favoritism, Gu Xiaochi sometimes wondered if Shen Linyan was even her biological son.","Beside them, Liang Chen suddenly scoffed, raising an eyebrow and clicking his tongue. \"Come on, it's not like you don't know him. He's just playing around. He knows that woman values the Shen Corporation more than her own life, so he deliberately came back to inherit it.\"","The man sat on the leather sofa with his long legs crossed. Hearing this, he didn't deny it. A faint smile simply spilled from the corners of his lips as he lowered his head and took a slow, deliberate sip of his wine.","He looked like a calm and gentle person, but in reality, he just enjoyed watching people slowly be played to their ruin.","Because of this, bosses who wanted to secure investments from Shen Linyan in the past would initially treat him like an easy mark, trying to trick him out of some benefits, completely unaware that they had already fallen into his trap.","By the time they realized it, the largest shareholder on their project proposals had already become Shen Linyan.","Wang Yihong poured himself another glass of wine. Just as he picked it up, he noticed the ring on the man's finger from the corner of his eye.","The lighting in the private room was rather dim, so he hadn't seen it clearly at first. Only now did he notice that Shen Linyan was wearing a ring on his left hand.","The news over the past few days had been the talk of the town, so naturally, they had seen it too.","Wang Yihong stared for a few seconds, then lifted his chin, smiling meaningfully. \"Hey, Shen Linyan, that clarification wasn't fake after all? The hand in the picture is really yours?\"","His voice instantly attracted the attention of the other two.","Gu Xiaochi leaned on the table and leaned over in shock. \"Really? Is he wearing a wedding ring?\"","Liang Chen took out his phone to compare it with the photo. \"It really is exactly the same. You actually cooperated to take that picture? We all said it was definitely fake at the time.\"","The man didn't hide it either. He looked down at the ring on his hand and said in an unhurried tone:","\"My wife told me to wear it.\"","The three people beside him: ?"]},{"number":15,"title":"Chapter 15: Pretending to be deeply in love","paragraphs":["Shen Linyan and An Ling were in an arranged marriage. Add to that the fact that An Ling was in love with Lu Jingshen, and it was no secret to anyone in their social circle that the couple's relationship was incredibly cold.","Let alone to Wang Yihong and the rest of the guys who knew Shen Linyan personally.","They were well aware that there was definitely an ulterior motive behind his sudden agreement to this marriage.","They also knew just how difficult Shen Linyan's new wife could be. Not only was she hung up on Lu Jingshen, but her behavior was also, frankly, a mess. The only reason it wasn't widely known was that the Shen family had managed to suppress all the scandals.","Yet, in a single night, that woman had managed to cause a massive media uproar.","Logically speaking, this should have frozen the couple's relationship even further.","But looking at Shen Linyan's reaction right now... were they actually getting along quite well?","Could this be part of his grand scheme too?","Staring at the man's perpetually calm and unhurried expression, Wang Yihong suddenly realized something. A look of dawn breaking washed over his face.","\"A PR tactic to clear the air? Pretending to be deeply in love?\"","Shen Linyan paused, his wine glass hovering in the air.","He nonchalantly lifted his gaze for a brief glance, took a sip of his wine, and offered a soft murmur of agreement.","Well, that explained it. Since the public statement had already been released, wearing his wedding ring would stop any further gossip.","Wait, no, it was still incredibly weird!","\"From what you're saying, this An Ling came up with the idea? Did the sun rise in the west today? She actually volunteered to do PR damage control? Isn't she obsessed with Lu Jingshen? What if Lu Jingshen sees the news? Isn't she worried he might get the wrong idea?\"","Wang Yihong rubbed his chin in amazement, completely oblivious to the frantic looks the other two men were shooting him.","\"But she tells you to wear the ring and you actually do it? Damn! Shen Linyan, do you think that woman is just using you to test Lu Jingshen's reaction...\"","Clink—","The wine glass was suddenly set down on the table. The glass against the surface made a crisp sound, not loud, almost weightless, in fact.","Yet Wang Yihong snapped his mouth shut instantly.","The man pulled out a handkerchief, his expression completely unreadable. Without a single ripple of emotion on his face, he lowered his eyes and methodically wiped away a drop of red wine that had stained his fingers. The crimson liquid looked stark and vivid against his long, pale skin.","His voice was calm, his tone even and unhurried.","\"There is no downside to this approach, and it has nothing to do with Lu Jingshen, which is why I agreed to it. Don't speak like this again, or the PR statement will have been for nothing.\"","Wang Yihong let out a few dry laughs. \"Is that so? Got it...\"","He quickly shot a questioning glance at the other two men beside him.","—What is going on? Is Shen Linyan mad? What did I say wrong?","We have talked about this before and it was never a problem.","Gu Xiaochi and Liang Chen simply gave him looks of helpless sympathy.","Seeing Shen Linyan suddenly stand up, Gu Xiaochi quickly followed suit. \"Leaving already? Oh right, Shen Fuyuan mentioned she wants to go on a variety show. Her manager reached out to me, should I greenlight it or not?\"","Shihe Media was currently the largest entertainment company in the country. Gu Xiaochi had built it from the ground up, but what nobody knew was that Shen Linyan was also one of its major investors.","Shen Fuyuan had accidentally landed a role in a TV drama that ended up becoming a massive hit. Afterward, she was exposed as the daughter of the wealthy Shen family. Her rich heiress persona made her an overnight sensation, and upon her official debut, she signed with Gu Xiaochi's company.","With her two older brothers backing her, especially her eldest brother, who was at the helm of the Shen Group, absolutely no one dared to cross this young lady, and she naturally got the best resources in the industry.","However, variety shows were a different beast. The moment she slipped up or showed any flaws, she could easily become the target of internet-wide mockery and hate. Gu Xiaochi was just worried the pampered heiress wouldn't be able to handle the backlash.","Shen Linyan didn't even turn his head. \"You don't need to ask for my opinion on her matters,\" he said indifferently. \"If she causes trouble, just blacklist her.\"","Gu Xiaochi clicked his tongue. \"Classic you.\"","So ruthless, even to his own biological sister.","As the three of them walked out of the private room, Shen Linyan casually checked the time on his phone, a thoughtful expression crossing his face.","Suddenly, Liang Chen's excited voice rang out beside him.","\"Hey, hold on a sec. Looks like there is a fight breaking out downstairs. Oof, it is a middle-aged guy too.\"","Gu Xiaochi leaned against the railing, looking entirely too thrilled to watch the drama unfold. \"They are really going at it.\"","After listening to a nearby waiter explain the situation, Wang Yihong furrowed his brow and scoffed.","\"The guy came here to drink and hook up, but his wife caught him red-handed. She is currently dragging him by the ear and chewing him out. How annoying, it is always the same old garbage every day.\"","Shen Linyan had zero interest in the spectacle. He gave a cursory glance and was just about to look away.","But when he caught a glimpse of a familiar figure out of the corner of his eye, his nonchalant gaze suddenly froze.","Amidst the rowdy, crowding onlookers, a beautiful woman was sitting casually on a high stool by the bar not far away. She wore a simple white dress that fell to her ankles, her silver high heels resting on the floor. Her dark, slightly wavy hair cascaded loosely down her back like fine silk.","Holding a glass in her fair fingers, she rested her chin in her hand and lazily watched the commotion in the crowd, her posture the picture of languid grace.","The man slowly lowered his phone. His dark eyes locked silently onto her direction. His features were marked by a cold, detached indifference, and the previously relaxed curve of his lips was now pulled into a taut, straight line.","Downstairs, An Ling was watching the wife catches cheating husband at the club drama with fading interest. Yet, the longer she watched, the more familiar the scenario felt.","Wasn't this exactly what she had gone through just a few days ago? Only, the roles were reversed.","She silently looked away, stifling a yawn. Glancing down at the drink in her hand, she rubbed her temples.","Wasn't this supposed to be a fruit cider? The colors looked pretty enough, but why did it feel like the alcohol content was actually quite high?","Speaking of which, where did that girl Jiang Mai run off to?","I really just want to go home and sleep.","An Ling muttered to herself. She set her glass down and was just about to go look for her friend when she suddenly felt the faint prickle of someone watching her from the second floor.","The gaze wasn't exactly burning, but it carried a weight that made it impossible to ignore.","She slowly lifted her head. The overhead lights of the bar were blinding, prompting her to instinctively raise a hand to shield her eyes. Instead, her gaze collided unexpectedly with a pair of cold, fathomless dark eyes.","An Ling froze as a fleeting thought flashed through her mind.","Hmm?","Her alcohol-soaked brain was a bit sluggish. She shook her head, furrowing her brow and squinting as she struggled to make out the elegant, aloof figure standing on the second floor.","...Who is that?"]},{"number":16,"title":"Chapter 16: What Does That Have to Do with Me","paragraphs":["An Ling’s appearance at the bar was a complete coincidence.","After leaving An Zhou’s place, neither she nor Jiang Mai were particularly hungry, so they had originally planned to go shopping.","But as soon as she saw the club, Jiang Mai couldn't move. With an excited expression, she pointed inside and said, Let’s go check it out! I heard the male models in there are drop-dead gorgeous!","An Ling looked at her blankly. Am I crazy?","She had just been involved in an incident at a bar a few days ago. There was no way she was going back so soon.","Jiang Mai patted her shoulder with a serious expression. We’re not here to cheat on anyone, so what are you afraid of? Besides, you’re going to divorce Shen Linyan sooner or later. Then we’ll take the money and find some male models of our own. We’re just here to check out the market value.","The going rate? What on earth is that supposed to mean?","An Ling couldn't win the argument and sighed helplessly. Fine, but only on the first floor. We’re not going to the second floor.","Although she had been in the news, the photos had been blurred. Few people in the outside world knew what the wife of the Shen family looked like, and even if they saw her, they wouldn't necessarily recognize her.","As long as they didn't run into anyone from their social circle, it wouldn't be a big deal.","But even if she did run into them, it didn't matter. She was face-blind and couldn't recognize anyone anyway. She would just ignore them.","Take right now, for example.","An Ling stared at the man for a few more seconds. When she really couldn't recognize him, she gave up.","As long as the other party didn't actively look for trouble, she wouldn't bother them.","But why did he feel so familiar?","She withdrew her gaze thoughtfully as Jiang Mai's voice reached her ears. What are you looking at? I just took a peek, and those male models seem alright. This bar handles things pretty quickly too; that man who was causing trouble was already kicked out.","Nothing, An Ling replied with a yawn. Shall we go back? I want to sleep.","Okay, Jiang Mai nodded.","Just as they were about to leave, a hesitant male voice suddenly sounded from behind them.","An Ling?","An Ling closed her eyes in despair. She suddenly had a bad premonition.","To run into an acquaintance on the first floor... she felt like her villainous second female lead buff was starting to kick in.","Turning around, she saw a few young men standing behind her.","They were dressed in trendy, flashy clothes. The leader had platinum-blonde hair, a leather jacket, tight jeans, a clinking metal chain around his neck, and a lip piercing.","When he saw An Ling's face, a look of surprise appeared on his wild face, but a trace of calculation quickly flickered in his eyes.","He walked closer with a smile. It really is you! What a coincidence. My friends and I were just planning to grab a drink.","Without waiting for An Ling's reaction, he suddenly shouted to the group behind him as if it were the most natural thing in the world, Sister An is here today, so it's her treat! Everyone, drink as much as you want! We can even go to the second floor later!","His followers were startled at first, then immediately cheered. Whoo! Sister An is the best!","Brother Long really does have the best connections!","Following Brother Long was definitely the right choice! He knows so many rich people!","The young man known as Brother Long snorted disdainfully and raised an eyebrow. Of course! You’ll get plenty of perks following me! Do you think I’m just anybody?","Jiang Mai frowned and leaned closer to An Ling’s ear, whispering, Who is this guy?","Good question. Because she didn't know either.","Where did these flashy punks come from?","An Ling looked them up and down expressionlessly, then turned to Jiang Mai. Let’s go.","Seeing An Ling turn to leave, the boy was stunned and instinctively reached out to grab her. Hey, don't go!!","But before he could touch her, An Ling dodged his hand.","The boy froze for a moment, then turned to look at his excited followers. He frowned and lowered his voice.","An Ling, what are you doing? Are you giving me attitude? Didn't you want to find out about Brother Shen's likes? If you help me out this time, I'll tell you.","Brother Shen? His likes?","An Ling looked at the boy's face for a moment, then narrowed her eyes and suddenly burst out laughing.","Ha, I remember now.","Over the past two years, the System had used many methods to pursue Lu Jingshen, including trying to suck up to the group of fair-weather friends around him to find out what he liked.","This Huang Long in front of her was one of them.","However, compared to the other wealthy children, this Huang Long was just a street hoodlum. In the original story, Lu Jingshen had deliberately befriended such people while playing the part of a weakling to hide his true power.","In order to get information from him, the System had given this man many benefits, basically giving him money whenever he asked and providing unconditional support.","What a bunch of lunatics.","She sat back down with a smile, her face full of anticipation. Will you really tell me what Brother Shen likes this time? No lies?","Huang Long thought to himself, As if! He just wanted to use this excuse to milk her for more.","But his voice sounded sincere as he promised, Of course! I’ll tell you everything!","Hearing this, the woman's eyes instantly lit up.","But then, she showed a suspicious and worried expression.","I don't believe you. What if you lie to me again? I've helped you so many times before, and you never told me.","Tsk, how troublesome.","The veins on Huang Long’s forehead pulsed as he forced a smile. I won't lie to you. Don't worry, Sister An.","An Ling thought about it and suddenly smiled. How about this? I can treat everyone, but you have to have them put it on your tab first. Once you tell me what he likes, I'll settle the bill for you.","Damn, why is this woman so difficult today? Was it because he had lied to her too many times and she was on guard?","He remained cautious. What if you don't pay me after I tell you?","The woman blinked in shock, as if she couldn't understand why Huang Long would even suggest such a thing.","This small amount of money is just pocket change to me. Why would I hold out on you? Besides, I've helped you so many times before. When have I ever not paid?","Hearing this, Huang Long frowned. He looked at the eager followers behind him and thought back to all the times An Ling had picked up the tab in the past.","He bit his tongue and said, Fine! But wait a second, let me tell them.","These rich people were so stingy, haggling over such a small amount of money. Since it was being put on his tab anyway, he would just say he was the one treating them. Why even mention this woman?","An Ling’s eyes slowly curved into a smile. Of course. Go ahead and tell them.","As soon as Huang Long turned away, the smile on her face vanished instantly. She turned her head and gestured to the bartender.","The bartender bowed respectfully. Miss, is there anything I can help you with?","Please open a few bottles of your most expensive wine.","An Ling curled her lips and rested her chin on her hand, pointing at Huang Long’s back. She spoke slowly.","Put it on that man's tab. He said he’s buying a round for the whole house.","The bartender glanced over and nodded. Understood.","The bartender walked over to Huang Long.","After he whispered something, the crowd over there went silent for a moment, then erupted into cheers.","Holy shit! Brother Long is the man!","Oh my god!","Is this for real?! Brother Long, you’ve got some serious bank!","Brother Long, you’re so cool!","Amidst the chorus of praise, Huang Long’s smile was strained. As soon as he turned around, his expression darkened, and he gave An Ling a questioning look, asking what she meant.","The woman blinked innocently, smiling with pure kindness as if telling him not to worry.","Jiang Mai sat next to her, looking like she was enjoying the show. She raised an eyebrow and said, Playing this big? What if he can't afford it later?","Can't afford it?","An Ling tilted her head and smiled with curved eyes.","Then what does that have to do with me?","She took a sip of her wine, her gaze surreptitiously flickering toward the second-floor railing. It was empty now.","Had that man left?","An Ling looked away.","It didn't matter. As long as it wasn't Shen Linyan, she was fine. There was no way a man like him would ever set foot in a place like this.","Five minutes later, the announcer's voice boomed through the bar's speakers on the first floor.","\"Ladies and gentlemen, I have some great news! Tonight's tab is on Boss Huang. Everyone, have a blast!\"","Cheers erupted throughout the bar.","Only Huang Long looked grim as he walked over. \"Alright, I'll tell you Brother Shen's preferences now.\"","But the woman suddenly raised a hand to cut him off. \"Wait a second.\"","His eyelid twitched, and a sense of impending doom washed over him.","\"Wait for what? You’re not going to add more conditions, are you?\"","Fine, even if she did, he’d just have to suck it up. Damn it, he’d take the hit this time.","An Ling merely smiled without a word. She stood up languidly and smoothed out her dress with practiced ease.","Only when the security guards arrived did she blink, offering a smile that looked perfectly innocent.","\"You didn't really think I was going to be the one treating, did you?\""]},{"number":17,"title":"Chapter 17: I Love My Husband","paragraphs":["As soon as the words left her mouth, Huang Long’s face went blank for a split second.","Once he processed what she said, his eyes bulged, and he lunged forward.","\"What do you mean!?\"","But his body was instantly pinned down by security.","Huang Long struggled violently, his face flushing a deep red and the veins on his neck bulging as he glared at the woman before him, roaring, \"An Ling, what the hell do you mean!?\"","An Ling leisurely took the bill from the waiter's hand. After a quick glance, she gasped in mock surprise, covering her mouth. \"Oh my! This round costs 1.35 million.\"","Huang Long’s pupils constricted, his face turning deathly pale. \"What?\"","An Ling squatted down and thoughtfully held the bill in front of his face. \"See that?\"","She rested her chin on her hand, her eyes curving into crescents. \"I heard the rule at this bar is that once you offer to pay for the whole house, there’s no backing out. What are we going to do, Boss Huang?\"","The blood drained from Huang Long’s face, leaving his limbs cold. The astronomical figure on the bill made his head spin.","He was just a jobless vagrant; where was he supposed to get that kind of money?","Brother Shen had specifically warned him not to cause any trouble.","Huang Long swallowed hard, his lips trembling. He looked up at her with a pleading tone. \"An Ling... no, Sister An, look... I’ll tell you everything. I’m not lying this time. Just help me out just this once!\"","An Ling handed the bill back and let out a light laugh. \"Tell me? Who cares?\"","She looked down, her smile gentle and considerate.","\"But don't worry. I know you don't have the money. We just need to find someone rich to pay for you.\"","With that, she turned to the bartender. \"Is your owner or manager here?\"","Just as she finished, a male voice came from behind.","\"I'm the one.\"","She turned to see a clean-cut young man who had appeared behind her at some unknown point.","The man was staring at her with a complex gaze, filled with shock and curiosity.","Sensing his gaze, An Ling paused and frowned silently.","Does this guy know me too?","He probably wasn't the man from the second floor; the clothes didn't match.","Even if he knew her, she didn't feel like dealing with it today. She tilted her chin up. \"He probably can't afford this. Go straight to Lu Jingshen of the Shen Group. This guy is Lu Jingshen's friend.\"","Huang Long’s body shook, and he jerked his head up. \"No! Wait...\"","Wang Yihong didn't care about him at all.","He took a sharp breath, scanning the woman before him with a probing look. \"He’s Lu Jingshen’s friend, so you are... what to Lu Jingshen?\"","An Ling gave him a cold look. \"Why are you asking so many questions? Do you need a background check just to accept a payment?\"","Wang Yihong’s eyes widened, and he shook his head quickly. \"No, no, no!\"","Good lord, is this woman really the stupid and wicked An Ling from the rumors?","I don't see any stupidity here!","He subconsciously glanced at a certain spot on the second floor. Why hasn't Shen Linyan come down yet?","Seeing the matter settled, An Ling grabbed Jiang Mai’s hand. \"Then my friend and I will be leaving.\"","As they were about to go, Huang Long gritted his teeth and shouted at the top of his lungs.","\"An Ling, you’re shameless! You actually used this method to get Brother Shen's attention! I knew it—why else would you come to a bar? You set me up on purpose just so you could see Brother Shen! You used the same trick last time to get a date with him, didn't you? You shameless woman!\"","The room went silent for a moment before breaking into whispers.","\"Is that the Mrs. Shen from the news?\"","\"Gosh, she dares to come to a bar after what happened?\"","\"The clarification must be fake, right? Does she really like her husband's younger brother?\"","An Ling: \"...\"","Beside her, Jiang Mai sensed trouble. She frowned and whispered, \"An Ling, you were right. We shouldn't have come in. Should we just leave?\"","\"Leaving won't help.\"","An Ling had seen through it long ago. Even if she wasn't at the bar today, the internet would still be buzzing about her.","This issue wasn't going to be resolved overnight.","Since it was bound to happen sooner or later, better to get it over with now.","She signaled the guards to let go. Her high heels clicked as she stepped in front of the man. Looking down at him, she said coldly, \"I set you up? You were the one who offered to treat everyone. Your friends can testify to that. What does it have to do with me?\"","Huang Long rubbed his shoulder, his face full of malice. \"That’s because you said if I told you Brother Shen’s preferences, you’d pay the bill!\"","\"Why would I want to know Lu Jingshen’s preferences?\"","\"Because you like Brother Shen!\"","An Ling replied calmly, \"What are you talking about? I like my husband.\"","\"Pffft—\"","Wang Yihong, caught off guard, sprayed his drink and started coughing violently.","An Ling glanced at him and quietly moved away.","Wang Yihong waved his hand frantically. \"Sorry, sorry! Just pretend I’m not here.\"","Huang Long was left speechless. \"You... you clearly like Brother Shen. Otherwise, why would you come to a bar alone?\"","He seemed to find a plausible reason and shouted, \"Look! If you really liked your husband, why would you be at a bar by yourself? Do you dare to say Shen Linyan knows you're here?\"","Jiang Mai, standing next to her, raised her hand expressionlessly.","\"Hey buddy, I’m a person too.\"","Huang Long: \"...\"","The atmosphere was tense. An Ling checked the time, feeling she had stayed long enough. She was about to turn and leave.","But in the next second, a deep, clear voice resonated through the crowd.","\"Who told you I didn't know?\"","Her body jolted, and her eyes widened in shock.","...No way, right?","The sound of heavy leather shoes approached from behind. A tall, imposing figure loomed over her, as if pulling her into his orbit. The familiar scent of woody pine drifted into her nose.","The man leaned down, his warm breath brushing against her ear. His gentle, smiling voice sounded like a whisper right next to her.","\"Why didn't you tell him we came together, darling?\"","—Because I didn't know you were here either!","An Ling forced a smile and turned around. When the familiar suit came into view, her heart skipped a beat, and she nearly lost her composure.","Damn, I'm screwed!","Shen Linyan was the man on the second floor!","No wonder she felt something was off!","The man's perfect features seemed even more profound in the shadows. He looked down at her, his dark eyes seemingly able to pierce through her soul, quietly waiting for her reaction.","An Ling took a deep breath.","It wasn't her first time; what was there to fear?","Her eyes curved, shimmering with a hint of intoxication. She slowly raised her slender arms and wrapped them around his neck, burying her face in his shoulder like she’d been wronged. \"Because you were busy, Hubby. I didn't want to disturb you,\" she said coquettishly.","The moment her soft, fragrant body pressed against him, Shen Linyan’s pupils contracted, and his body stiffened imperceptibly.","His Adam's apple bobbed. He lowered his gaze to the woman's ears, which were turning beet red. A dark current swirled in his eyes. After a moment, a light chuckle escaped him. He cooperatively wrapped his arm around her waist, pulling his little wife—who was too embarrassed to face reality—into his embrace.","On his well-defined hand, a silver wedding ring shimmered under the lights, looking noble and elegant.","He looked up, his gentle gaze devoid of any actual warmth. He curled his lips into a polite but firm smile, his voice calm yet brook no argument.","\"Now, you owe my wife an apology.\""]},{"number":18,"title":"Chapter 18: Has Shen Linyan Fallen for That Woman","paragraphs":["The moment Shen Linyan appeared, the crowd erupted in a flurry of excitement.","It really is Chairman Shen!","No wonder An Ling came to the bar; her husband came along as well.","Look at the wedding ring on Chairman Shen's hand. It is exactly like the photos online. The clarification was true after all!","Do you even need to look at the ring? Just look at how Chairman Shen and Mrs. Shen are interacting; you can tell they have a great relationship at a glance! Would they be embracing like that if things were bad?","Standing in the crowd, Gu Xiaochi and Liang Chen exchanged a look, both seeing the shock in each other's eyes.","Maybe... they actually could.","Gu Xiaochi whispered, What is the deal? Since when were Shen Linyan and his little wife so affectionate?","He had already sensed something was wrong when they were upstairs.","At that time, that idiot Wang Yihong was rambling on, completely failing to notice that after he mentioned the words pretending to be affectionate, Shen Linyan's mood turned sour, and he could barely even maintain a smile.","When they were standing by the railing watching the commotion just now, he was right next to Shen Linyan.","Noticing the man's abnormality, he followed his gaze and saw An Ling. Naturally, he also saw the scene where An Ling met Shen Linyan's eyes and then nonchalantly looked away.","In that instant, Gu Xiaochi clearly felt Shen Linyan freeze for a moment. Although the man's expression remained indifferent, the aura around him turned freezing cold.","Recalling that scene, Gu Xiaochi rubbed his arms with lingering fear. Besides, his little wife has changed so much. Has Shen Linyan actually fallen for that woman?","Liang Chen stroked his chin. Fallen for her? Probably not.","He had never seen Shen Linyan truly like anyone; any kindness he showed was just an act.","Besides, theirs is an arranged marriage. Shen Linyan wouldn't fall in love with a wife from a political union. It is likely just that An Ling's sudden change has piqued his interest.","But regardless, these were just their own speculations.","Gu Xiaochi spoke up quietly, Why don't you go ask Shen Linyan what he is actually thinking?","Liang Chen replied, I am not tired of living yet. Why don't you go ask him yourself?","Gu Xiaochi said, Do you think I want to die?","The two looked at each other and came to an agreement.","How about we trick Wang Yihong into asking?","Agreed.","Meanwhile, at the center of the scene, the atmosphere was frozen solid.","The discussions from the surroundings reached Huang Long's ears. The indifferent and sharp gaze of the man above him was like an iceberg, weighing him down until he could hardly breathe, his limbs turning cold.","He knelt on the ground trembling, his face pale and covered in cold sweat as he stammered, I am sorry... Chairman Shen.","The man suddenly let out a soft chuckle, his expression appearing gentle.","Can't you understand me? Or did you hear me wrong? I said apologize to my wife.","Huang Long quickly corrected himself, I am sorry, Sister An...","I don't recall my wife having a brother.","In the bar, the man's unhurried tone was so terrifying that people hardly dared to breathe.","Huang Long's throat tightened, and he felt as though needles were pricking his back. A chill spread throughout his entire body.","He swallowed hard and stammered, I am sorry... Miss An, I said the wrong thing! It was all nonsense! Miss An doesn't like Lu Jingshen at all! Please just don't hold it against me, okay?","Shen Linyan looked down at him, the expression in his eyes devoid of any emotion.","An Ling lifted her head from the man's chest, glanced at Huang Long on the ground, and let out a silent sigh.","She had originally intended to just scare him a bit and make Lu Jingshen lose a little money, but now that Shen Linyan had arrived, everything was a mess. She wasn't sure if he had discovered her face blindness symptoms.","It was so dramatic. Just a moment ago, she was watching the spectacle of someone else's husband getting caught by his wife, and now she was the one being caught by her husband.","She wrapped her arms around the man's neck, suppressing her irritation, and leaned in to whisper, You handle it. I am tired and want to go home and sleep.","Her sweet breath brushed against his skin, carrying the lingering scent of peach, which felt even more intoxicating than the red wine he had just finished.","Shen Linyan's arm tightened, his Adam's apple bobbing with restraint as his dark eyes inadvertently landed on the girl's face.","Perhaps because it was her first time doing something like this, she turned her face away uncomfortably, her lips pursed in tension. Her neck and her beautiful face were flushed a deep red, and her curled eyelashes fluttered slightly.","It wasn't until the sound of Wang Yihong's deliberate coughing reached his ears that he slowly looked away and gave a soft hmph. He looked down at Huang Long.","Since you are a friend of Lu Jingshen, I will cover this bill on his behalf today. I don't want to hear such words again.","As he spoke, he paused, then turned to look at Jiang Mai nearby. He gave a faint smile, his tone as refined and elegant as ever.","My wife says she is tired and wants to go back. Does Miss Jiang need to come with us?","Jiang Mai instinctively stood up straight and nodded blankly. Okay, sure.","Receiving a silent plea for help from her best friend, her expression stiffened. She spoke up guiltily, Um... maybe I should help An Ling. She seems drunk and a bit delirious. She said earlier she was going to stay...","Shen Linyan cast a faint glance over.","It was a calm look, yet Jiang Mai felt a sudden chill down her spine. Her movements froze instantly, and she gave a couple of dry laughs before withdrawing her hand and turning toward the door without hesitation.","Chairman Shen, which car should I take back? Am I riding with you two?","An Ling's eyes were filled with shock and confusion.","But in the next second, she was suddenly swept up in a horizontal carry.","Startled, she instinctively grabbed the man's neck as a deep, magnetic voice sounded above her head.","Miss Jiang might have to wait a moment. The driver will be here shortly. My wife and I will be heading back first.","An Ling kept her eyes closed, pretending to sleep, until she was carried into the car.","Once she heard the door close, she quietly peeked with one eye, only to hear the man's leisurely and composed voice beside her.","Since you aren't actually asleep, let's talk. Is this what you meant by maintaining our mutual interests?","...","What was meant to come had finally arrived.","An Ling opened her eyes and rubbed her temples, feeling a headache coming on. It was a misunderstanding. I came with Jiang Mai, and we were just about to leave when that guy showed up.","As she spoke, she turned her head away, looking out the window and muttering under her breath, ...And even if you hadn't come down, I could have handled it myself.","The slight, dissatisfied complaint reached his ears.","The man raised his eyes with an unreadable expression.","You clearly saw me on the second floor just now, yet you pretended we weren't acquainted. Wasn't that your way of telling me not to interfere? I was worried about ruining your plans.","An Ling was speechless.","He really did remember that!","Shen Linyan turned to look at her, speaking with a light smile.","It couldn't be that you simply failed to recognize my face, could it?","...You guessed right.","An Ling pondered for a long while, then took a deep breath. And what if I did?","What?","Shen Linyan, I really didn't recognize your face at the time.","...","The smile at the corners of the man's mouth faltered, and the mirth in his eyes faded. He stared blankly at the woman in front of him. The inexplicable emotions that had been rising within him cooled instantly in that moment.","He inconspicuously clenched his fist, his knuckles turning white from the force. He calmly withdrew his gaze, and though his tone remained gentle, the curve of his lips was flat.","“Is that so? It’s only natural, really. After all, Miss An has rarely seen me, so it’s understandable she wouldn’t remember my face.”","She had given him a ring and declared her love in front of everyone.","Yet, in the end, she couldn’t even remember his face."]},{"number":19,"title":"Chapter 19: Shen Linyan, I'm a Little Angry","paragraphs":["From the very beginning, Shen Linyan knew exactly what kind of woman he was marrying.","An Ling, a woman obsessed with Lu Jingshen.","For the man she loved, she was even willing to marry his brother, disregarding all moral boundaries and ethics just to sabotage Lu Jingshen's relationships.","But none of that mattered to him.","On the contrary, her obsession was the reason he had agreed to the marriage in the first place.","He didn't need love, and he didn't care about the sanctity of marriage; what he wanted was the An family backing her.","If he could eventually swallow up the An family in the process, all the better.","The plan had been moving in its intended direction, so when did things change?","It started that day when An Ling suddenly claimed she no longer liked Lu Jingshen and even proposed maintaining their relationship for mutual benefit.","It was laughable.","Shen Linyan found it ridiculous and didn't even believe her.","Actually, it didn't matter to him either way; at most, he just wanted to see what she would do next.","The changed An Ling was indeed much more interesting than before.","He was merely curious...","And that curiosity had lasted until now.","Shen Linyan sat with his eyes closed, frowning as he massaged the space between his eyebrows, his lips pressed into a thin line.","Sensing the man's foul mood, An Ling sat beside him and quietly shut her mouth.","Was Shen Linyan angry? Surely not. Didn't he say himself that it was normal?","Should she explain things to him? Shen Linyan seemed to have a decent personality, so he probably wouldn't be as malicious as the people she’d dealt with in the past. Besides, if they were going to live together, it was only a matter of time before he discovered her face blindness.","If she told him now, maybe he could even help her cover for it in the future.","Just as she was about to speak, her phone vibrated. An Ling shifted her attention like it was a lifeline; it was a message from Jiang Mai.","Girl, you still alive?","An Ling: You jerk! I told you to save me! Shen Linyan realized I didn't recognize him.","Because of her, the atmosphere between her and Shen Linyan was now incredibly awkward!","Jiang Mai's reply sounded helpless: It’s not that I didn't want to save you, but your husband's gaze is terrifying! Do you know that refined predator vibe? I felt like if I even touched him, he’d smile while cutting my hand off.","Terrifying? Was she exaggerating that much?","An Ling felt like Jiang Mai was just making up half-hearted excuses. She actually thought Shen Linyan was too kind.","An Ling: Shen Linyan is just a gentle second lead; how scary can he be? And didn't you see him pay that 1.4 million for Huang Long? I was originally planning to scam Lu Jingshen!","As she typed those words, An Ling’s movements suddenly paused. Her fingertips curled slightly, and she bit her lip.","No, she still couldn't say anything.","An Ling had suffered for this in the past. When people found out she was face-blind, they would often toy with her on purpose, watching her talk to strangers like an idiot after mistaking their identity, then standing aside and laughing at her without any disguise.","Because of that, she hated showing her weaknesses and vulnerabilities to outsiders.","Especially someone like Shen Linyan who was supposed to be in love with the heroine. They were going to get a divorce eventually anyway. What if he stabbed her in the back? What if he helped the male lead harm her?","Even now, the fact that he helped Lu Jingshen pay the money was likely because he was considering the Shen family's reputation. He didn't want the matter to blow up, and perhaps he was afraid of how it would look to Zhou Wen.","That was it! Shen Linyan had actually paid the money for the male lead! Wasn't that the same as helping her enemy?","A friend of the enemy is an enemy.","Remembering this, An Ling put her phone away. After stewing in her seat for a while, she turned her head gloomily to look at her reflection in the window.","The interior of the car was so quiet that even the sound of breathing was audible.","The driver in the front felt a chill running down his spine, unable to understand why the young couple had suddenly entered a cold war. He could only drive on under the immense pressure.","A few minutes later, a dry, stiff female voice broke the silence.","Shen Linyan, I’m a little angry. I just realized that you’re the one who didn't follow our mutual interest agreement.","...","The man’s movements paused. He opened his eyes and turned his head toward her, looking confused.","Seeing his little wife pouting with her back to him, he remained silent for a moment before letting out a helpless chuckle. He exhaled and asked warmly, Why does my lady say that?","Then why did you pay the money for Lu Jingshen? An Ling turned around. Lu Jingshen’s friend provoked me first. I was the one scheming against him, but then you stepped in and solved the problem for Lu Jingshen.","Recalling that she was the one who told Shen Linyan to handle it, she paused and then turned back to the window. Forget it. Just pretend I didn't say anything.","She should have guessed. As a gentle second lead, Shen Linyan would naturally choose a more moderate, harmless way to resolve the issue.","She shouldn't involve him in the future.","Silence returned to the car, but it was immediately followed by the sound of a phone dialing.","The call was picked up, and a somewhat familiar male voice came through the speaker.","...Brother?","An Ling froze. Her ears perked up, and she peeked over quietly.","She saw Shen Linyan put the phone on speaker and place it on the center armrest. The contact name on the screen was Lu Jingshen.","The man leaned back against his seat and said calmly, Lu Jingshen, transfer 1.4 million to your sister-in-law’s account tomorrow.","Lu Jingshen, who had been woken up in the middle of the night, was bewildered. Huh??","He instinctively wanted to lose his temper, but then he realized who was on the other end. He took a deep breath and tried to stay calm. Brother, what do you mean? Transfer it to who?","Can't you understand?","Shen Linyan’s tone was indifferent. Your friend caused trouble for your sister-in-law. Do I need to repeat myself?","What the hell is this?","Lu Jingshen gritted his teeth, completely confused, but he still agreed. Fine. 1.4 million, right?","Just as Shen Linyan was about to confirm, his arm was lightly nudged. He saw the woman looking at him with sparkling eyes, blinking as she held up two fingers.","The man paused, a trace of a smile flitting through his eyes.","I remembered wrong. Two million.","Lu Jingshen: ??? No, brother... asking me for two million all of a sudden is a bit...","An Ling suddenly spoke up with a giggle, I want to see the money in my account tomorrow.","Lu Jingshen: ...","After the call ended, Shen Linyan looked at the happy woman beside him, his eyes filled with amusement.","Is my lady still angry?","Hearing this, An Ling shook her head and narrowed her eyes with satisfaction. Not angry anymore, not angry at all.","Seeing the male lead suffer like this felt amazing.","Shen Linyan laughed softly and lowered his head to put his phone away, his features looking refined and elegant under the car lights.","An Ling rested her chin on her hand, staring at the man’s profile for a few seconds. She blinked, suddenly realizing something.","If she could pull Shen Linyan over to her side and teach him not to be such a pushover, maybe she could change him too?","She pondered for a moment before suddenly speaking up.","Shen Linyan, let me tell you a secret. Weren't you angry because I didn't recognize you?"]},{"number":20,"title":"Chapter 20: Actually, I Have Face Blindness","paragraphs":["Upon hearing her words, Shen Linyan paused, his first instinct being to deny it.","Angry?","He never felt like he was angry. How could he possibly be angry over such trivial matters?","But catching the word \"secret\" in her sentence, he ultimately swallowed the denial that was at the tip of his tongue.","\"What secret?\"","An Ling didn't answer immediately. Instead, she spoke slowly. \"Before I tell you, I have a condition. You cannot tell this secret to anyone. If you let it out...\"","She paused, staring at the man as she enunciated every word. \"I will make sure you never get what you want for the rest of your life.\"","Whether it was the female lead or the family fortune, she would not let Shen Linyan succeed.","Her tone didn't sound like she was joking. Shen Linyan’s expression shifted slightly. \"I promise you.\"","An Ling stared at his face for a few seconds before sitting up straight and turning her face toward the window.","\"Then I'll tell you when we get home.\"","She needed some time to calm down and think about whether this plan would actually work.","As it turned out, she thought about it all the way until they had both finished their showers, and even then, she hadn't brought it up again.","She had tried to ask Jiang Mai for an opinion, but Jiang Mai hadn't replied.","Curled up on the sofa in her pajamas, she was feeling drowsy. Having had a few drinks that night, she was already sleepier than usual, and with so much on her mind, her head felt increasingly heavy.","When Shen Linyan came out of the shower, he saw the girl nodding off on the sofa.","He paused, then lightened his footsteps as he walked over. He picked up a blanket and gently draped it over her, then squatted down, his voice soft and tender. \"Why don't you go to the bedroom to sleep? Hmm?\"","An Ling opened her eyes, pulled the blanket tighter around herself, and simply leaned over to lie down on the sofa. Her dark hair spilled out messily behind her as she let out a long, lazy yawn, her eyes watering slightly from the fatigue. \"I haven't told you the secret yet.\"","\"It's the same if I hear it tomorrow.\"","\"What if I regret it tomorrow?\"","\"That's okay too.\"","\"But weren't you angry?\"","Shen Linyan paused for a moment, then stood up and sat down beside her. He gave a soft, warm chuckle. \"I'm not angry anymore.\"","After hearing that she had a reason for her behavior, he didn't actually care as much as he had before. Whether or not he knew the secret wouldn't change much for him, and seeing her hesitation, he felt there was no need to pressure her.","Shen Linyan didn't go back to his room. Instead, he stayed on the sofa to keep An Ling company. He took out his phone and saw that Gu Xiaochi and that group of friends had tagged him in their WeChat group.","He ignored them, simply clicking on the day's news to read as was his habit.","Hearing his response, An Ling blinked and looked up at the man's sharp jawline. Her gaze lingered on the ring between his long, pale fingers, and she realized that he had likely worn it all day.","She withdrew her gaze and lay on the sofa with her eyes closed, her voice slow and relaxed.","\"Are you really, truly not angry?\"","\"Truly.\"","\"Do I need to pay you back that two million?\"","\"No need. It's the same whether the money is with my wife or me.\"","The man looked away from his screen and said with a smile, \"Though if Madam insists on giving it back, I would find it hard to refuse such a generous offer.\"","An Ling let out a couple of hums and kept her eyes closed, remaining silent as if she were rejecting the proposal without a second thought.","The warm glow of the floor lamp made the living room feel cozy and serene. A silence fell between them, but it wasn't the oppressive silence from the car earlier; it was more like a comfortable peace.","Holding his phone, the man's gaze drifted uncontrollably toward the girl lying by his legs.","Under the play of light and shadow, her eyelashes cast shadows like butterfly wings beneath her eyes. Her profile was soft, her nose petite, and her lips looked full and inviting.","Sleeping peacefully like this, she didn't look at all like the person who had been bullying others in the bar.","A faint, barely perceptible smile touched the corners of his mouth.","As he was staring, the girl suddenly opened her eyes.","Caught off guard, their eyes met. Shen Linyan froze for a second, about to look away.","Suddenly, her voice sounded in his ear.","\"Shen Linyan, the truth is, I have face blindness.\"","His expression stiffened instantly, and he instinctively gripped his phone tighter. \"...What?\"","An Ling sat up with a yawn, tilting her head as she looked at him with a smile.","\"The secret. This is my secret, and it's why I didn't recognize you at the bar.\"","She paused and pointed to her own eyes.","\"Whenever I drink, I can't recognize anyone. No matter who it is, as long as they change their clothes and hairstyle, I can't tell who they are.\"","An Ling still didn't tell the complete truth.","It wasn't that she couldn't recognize people after drinking; she had been face-blind since birth.","She cleared her throat and blinked at the man.","\"You believe me, right? I'm not lying to you.\"","Shen Linyan didn't speak. He just quietly watched the girl's clear, soulful eyes.","Face blindness...","This distant, rarely-heard-of condition actually afflicted his wife.","But how was that possible? An Ling clearly recognized...","In an instant, the surveillance footage from the bar flashed through his mind.","Shen Linyan’s pupils contracted slightly. No wonder An Ling hadn't recognized Lu Jingshen back then—it was because her face blindness had kicked in after she drank.","The man's Adam's apple bobbed. He opened his mouth, his voice sounding strangely hoarse for some reason. \"Not a single person... you can't recognize anyone?\"","An Ling nodded. \"I can only tell that you look familiar, but I can't quite put a name to the face. I have to rely on your voice and the scent of your cologne to be sure.\"","Shen Linyan wanted to take back everything he had said before.","Knowing this secret changed everything for him.","His jaw tightened as he gripped his phone, only to slowly relax his hold.","An Ling blinked at him, repeating herself earnestly. \"You can't tell anyone, okay? Not even Zhou Wen. Aside from my family and Jiang Mai, you're the only one I've told.\"","Hearing this, the man's eyes crinkled slightly, a deep intensity swirling within them. His voice was soft yet solemn.","\"Alright. I won't tell a soul.\"","This was a secret known only to him.","Click.","The door closed. Shen Linyan stood there in silence, his tall silhouette like a statue in the darkness, his gaze deep and quiet.","After a long while, he slowly covered his mouth, hiding the irrepressible curve of his lips.","The phone in his hand was still vibrating. In a small group chat with Gu Xiaochi and the others, he was being tagged incessantly.","Gu Xiaochi: @Shen Linyan, I’m reporting Liang Chen. The brat took a photo of you carrying your wife princess-style.","Liang Chen: (Image) What’s wrong with it? Doesn't he look cool? Our CEO Shen looks absolutely stunning, doesn't he?","In the photo, the man held the woman steadily in his arms. She was petite, the hem of her white dress brushing against his black suit. Her beautiful face was buried against his shoulder, her cascading hair spilling over her back to reveal a glimpse of her snowy, graceful neck.","Shen Linyan looked at the photo and hit save.","The messages in the group continued to pour in.","Gu Xiaochi: But seriously, Shen Linyan’s wife has completely transformed. She’s nothing like the person I remember.","Wang Yihong: You guys have no idea. I was standing right next to her and I was floored.","Liang Chen: So the talk about An Ling being the one to initiate the clarification... it looks like it’s true.","Gu Xiaochi: So An Ling is on Shen Linyan’s team now? Does that mean we’ll be seeing her when we hang out?","Liang Chen: I don't know. If we do, what are we supposed to call her?","Wang Yihong: What are you two on about? Why would we meet her? There’s no way Shen Linyan would actually bring that woman out. It’s not like he actually likes her.","Liang Chen: Hehe ⌓‿⌓","Gu Xiaochi: Hehe ⌓‿⌓","Wang Yihong: ? You guys are being weird. You know that, right?","A second later, a new message appeared in the group.","Shen Linyan: Call her Sister-in-law."]},{"number":21,"title":"Chapter 21: Shen Linyan's Dark Turn: Imprisoning You","paragraphs":["Knowing that An Ling had told Shen Linyan about her face blindness, Jiang Mai called her early the next morning to blast her with questions.","\"You really told him??!\"","The exclamation shrieked through the phone. An Ling, sprawled across her bed, silently moved the device further away from her ear.","She closed her eyes and let out a dazed \"Mhm.\" \"I texted you yesterday to ask about it. Why are you only seeing it now?\"","\"I fell asleep the second I got home yesterday. I didn't see it. No, wait, that's not the point! Aren't you going to divorce him? What if he tells people after the divorce?\"","Jiang Mai sounded frantic on the other end. \"Have you forgotten how people treated you back then?\"","\"He won't. Shen Linyan promised me he wouldn't say anything, and I didn't tell him everything anyway.\"","An Ling stretched as she got out of bed, her lazy tone laced with the soft grogginess of someone just waking up. \"Besides, I came up with a plan yesterday.\"","\"What plan?\"","\"I've decided to change Shen Linyan. I'm going to make him stop being such a 'good guy'.\"","\"...\"","The other end went silent for a few seconds before Jiang Mai’s voice returned, sounding utterly numb.","\"An Ling, how do you always manage to say such shocking things? Are you saying you want to rewrite Shen Linyan's source code?\"","\"What source code? Shen Linyan isn't a robot.\"","An Ling chuckled. \"Anyway, I have to prevent him from going bankrupt now, so I might as well try this while I'm at it.\"","Jiang Mai mused, \"An Ling, do you know what you sound like right now?\"","\"What?\"","\"Based on my experience reading novels, this is how it goes: you'll slowly fall for Shen Linyan, he'll fall for you, and you'll end up together. Or, you fall for him, but he refuses to change, things get ugly, and you end up in a messy divorce.\"","\"...\"","An Ling paused in her tracks, looking bewildered. \"Why is it always me falling for him first?\"","\"Why else? Because he’s exactly your type.\"","Jiang Mai waved her hand dismissively, changing the script on the fly.","\"Fine, let's swap it. Shen Linyan falls for you first, but you're so dense that you never notice until after the divorce. Then, Shen Linyan turns dark and locks you up in a gilded cage.\"","\"...\"","Just how many novels has this girl read?","An Ling questioned her, \"Haven't you ever read a normal political marriage novel?\"","\"A normal high-society marriage novel? Are you sure you want to hear it?\"","Jiang Mai cleared her throat and said in a serious, formal tone:","\"Then get the condoms ready, because you two are about to have sex—\"","Click!","An Ling hung up without hesitation, her face flushing as her gaze darted around the room.","Was she joking? Having sex with Shen Linyan?","Since when did the 'villainess' and the 'gentle second male lead' sleep together?","She spent a few minutes in the bathroom washing her face to calm down before stepping out.","The housekeeper had already prepared breakfast. Seeing her come out, she greeted her with a smile. \"Good morning, Madam.\"","\"Good morning, Auntie Cheng.\" An Ling had finally asked for the housekeeper's name the day before.","As An Ling sat down, Auntie Cheng placed a bowl of congee in front of her. \"The Master told me before he left that you had some drinks last night. Having some congee will make you feel better.\"","An Ling nodded and picked up her spoon. Just then, her phone lit up. She glanced at it, and her movements froze instantly.","[Lu Jinggshen has transferred 2,000,000.00 RMB to your account ending in 9327.]","An Ling arched an eyebrow. That was fast.","She took a screenshot, intending to send it to Shen Linyan. It was only when she opened her messages that she remembered she hadn't added him on this account yet.","Suddenly, her brother, An Zhou, sent her a message.","[My dear princess, may I ask what this is...?]","Below the text was a link to a news report.","#Shocking! Mrs. Shen spotted at a bar again! Humiliating Young Master Lu’s friend, allegedly using underhanded tactics to lure Young Master Lu out! Was the previous clarification a lie?#","An Ling clicked the link and found that someone had filmed the incident at the bar last night.","In the footage, Huang Long was kneeling on the ground. From that angle, it truly looked like she was humiliating him.","Not only did the report take the events out of context, but it also conveniently omitted the latter half where Shen Linyan arrived.","An Ling didn't know who had intentionally leaked the story, but it was clearly aimed at Lu Jingshen.","It was a classic tactic: stir up public outrage first, then release the reversal when the heat is at its peak.","An Ling: [Don't worry, there's a plot twist.]","An Zhou: [What plot twist?]","An Ling: [I was carried out by Shen Linyan.]","The other side went silent for a full minute before a single question mark appeared.","An Zhou: [? Did you drink so much last night that you started hallucinating?]","An Ling: [Jiang Mai was with me. If you don't believe me, ask her.]","An Zhou didn't reply again, seemingly overwhelmed by the sheer amount of information shattering his worldview.","An Ling scrolled through the comments for a while. Some people who were at the scene last night had already started piping up.","[Is this news for real? If I hadn't been there, I might have believed it.]","[I'm speechless! It wasn't Mrs. Shen bullying anyone; that guy was the one who insisted on paying the bill.]","[Talk about taking things out of context. Chairman Shen was there last night too.]","[And I saw Chairman Shen carrying Mrs. Shen!]","Using her alt account, An Ling silently liked that comment.","Remembering something, she messaged the \"playing dead\" An Zhou.","[Brother, do you have Shen Linyan's contact info?]","He replied instantly.","An Zhou: [What? Someone got a princess carry from her husband but doesn't even have his WeChat? Why are you initiating? Wait for him to add you.]","An Ling: [Why?]","An Zhou: [Because you have to keep a man on the hook. In a political marriage, you need to hold the emotional upper hand. Don't let that 'smiling tiger' Shen Linyan fool you.]","\"...\"","Did her brother read those novels too?","An Ling ignored him and reached out directly to Secretary Chen.","[Can you give me Shen Linyan's WeChat? I want to add him.]","Upon receiving the message, Secretary Chen’s eyes widened.","He stole a glance at the man sitting in the head seat.","The atmosphere in the conference room was tense and solemn. The man at the head of the table leaned back against his chair, idly twirling an expensive custom fountain pen between his long fingers while staring impassively at a subordinate's report.","Once the presentation ended, the man flipped through the documents and suddenly let out a soft, light laugh.","\"I don't quite understand. Did you all produce this garbage because you're hoping for Shen Group to go bankrupt sooner?\"","His deep voice sounded casual, yet the employees nearby were so terrified they barely dared to breathe, lowering their heads to stay out of sight.","The employee who had given the report turned pale, apologizing profusely. \"I'm sorry, Ch-Chairman Shen.\"","The man looked up coldly and tossed the file onto the table.","\"Take it back and redo it.\"","Seeing the atmosphere in the room grow increasingly suffocating, Secretary Chen felt like he was holding a hot potato.","Was this message fuel for the fire or a much-needed distraction? Should he show it to the Chairman?","He nudged the female secretary next to him, who was recording the minutes, and gave her a pleading look.","—What do I do? Do I show him?","The female secretary pushed up her glasses sharply. Giving him a look of utter disdain, she snatched the phone and placed it directly in front of Shen Linyan.","Secretary Chen was shocked and moved to tears. (My goddess!)","Shen Linyan glanced down casually. When he saw the content on the screen, his gaze flickered for a moment.","He calmly looked away, stood up, and adjusted his suit. \"That's all for today's meeting. Good work, everyone.\"","Everyone rose immediately. \"Goodbye, Chairman Shen.\"","In the empty conference room, Secretary Chen looked at his phone, which had been left behind on the table. He turned around in confusion. \"So... is that a yes or a no?\"","The female secretary calmly continued organizing her notes.","“You’re a step too late.”","Staring at the sudden friend request on her phone, An Ling blinked and smiled, sending a screenshot to An Zhou.","An Ling: [A prophet?]","An Zhou: [...Impressive.]","An Zhou: [Wait a second... Why is the Shen Linyan you’re adding different from the one I have?? Mine was given to me by Shen Linyan himself. Is yours a scammer? Don’t get conned. (Image attached)]","An Ling took a look, and he was right.","The profile picture of the Shen Linyan that An Zhou had added was the Shen Corporation building. This current profile picture, however, was a minimalist letter ‘S’.","An Ling: [I’ll ask.]","She accepted the friend request first and sent a message.","An Ling: [My brother says something isn't right. Are you really Shen Linyan? (′ʘ⌄ʘ‵)]","A moment later, a voice message arrived from the other side.","She tapped it, and a familiar, low chuckle echoed from her phone.","“No. I’m just here to scam Mrs. Shen out of that two million.”","The man’s voice was clear and infused with a smile. The slight upward lilt at the end of his words, combined with the faint static of the recording, made it sound all the more magnetic.","An Ling’s face flushed a soft red, and she reflexively covered her ears.","She definitely couldn't listen to that a second time.","Shen Linyan followed up with a text explanation: [Don’t worry, my lady. This is my private account. ^^]","She screenshotted that sentence and sent it to An Zhou.","An Zhou: [.........??]","What was that supposed to mean? He used a work account just to add his brother-in-law??"]},{"number":22,"title":"Chapter 22: When did the gentleman and the lady become so close","paragraphs":["After adding Shen Linyan, An Ling put down her phone to change clothes. When she returned, she noticed another message had arrived from the other side.","Shen Linyan: [Are you free at noon today? I might need to go back to the Shen family home. Mother called me.]","An Ling instantly remembered that news report. There was no need to guess; it was definitely because of that.","She checked online and found the clarification still hadn't been posted, raising an eyebrow in surprise.","An Ling: [I'm free.]","Shen Linyan: [Good, I'll pick you up at noon.]","After replying, An Ling opened her contacts, intending to clean house.","Over the past two years, that lousy system had deleted many of her colleagues and friends, adding in some completely irrelevant riff-raff instead.","An Ling hadn't realized this issue at first, not until she ran into Huang Long last night, which reminded her of this troublesome problem.","While deleting friends, some people even sent her messages, probably having seen the news about Huang Long.","Stranger A: [Sis An! Is the report true? Did you really do that to Huang Long?! Are you crazy?!]","An Ling: [Let's delete each other, or you're next.]","Stranger B: [Damn! An Ling, how dare you mess with Huang Long? He's Lu Jingshen's good brother. Won't this ruin your chances of chasing Lu Jingshen?]","An Ling: [Let's delete each other, or you'll be ruined too.]","Stranger C: [Is this your new tactic to seduce Lu Jingshen? Aren't you afraid of taking it too far?]","An Ling: [Let's delete each other, or I'll set you on fire.]","Stranger D: [Sis An, did Huang Long upset you? I actually know Lu Jingshen's preferences too, you can ask me,]","An Ling: [Let's delete each other, or those preferences can be buried with you.]","...","By the time she finished deleting everyone, her hand was sore.","She searched and sent friend requests to re-add her former, closer colleagues.","However, the friend requests weren't accepted immediately, and An Ling wasn't sure if they would agree. After all, being inexplicably deleted by someone certainly didn't feel good.","An Ling sighed, massaging her temples with a headache.","She suspected it was a lingering side effect from that system; her head kept aching from time to time.","Fortunately, one colleague quickly accepted the friend request.","Their tone was full of surprise.","[Ah Leng?? Is that you, Ah Leng?]","Ah Leng, her former alias in the circle.","After absorbing the memories of the past two years, suddenly seeing her old alias gave An Ling a sense of being in a different lifetime.","She quickly replied: [It's me, it's me! Sorry, Sister Lin Ya, some things happened over the past two years that completely messed up my life.]","Lin Ya replied swiftly: [It really is you! It's fine, it's fine. You deleted all of us before, and we never saw you again, so we thought you'd suddenly left.]","\"...\"","Her wording was quite tactful.","An Ling smiled and breathed a sigh of relief: [Could you please let Teacher Chen and the others know?]","Lin Ya: [Of course! Teacher Chen Minhuai has been thinking about you these past two years, saying she finally had a talented apprentice who suddenly vanished. She'll be thrilled you're back. She's been quite frustrated with her project lately.]","After sending that, Lin Ya hesitantly added another line:","[You are coming back, right?]","An Ling's gaze paused for a moment before she smiled and replied.","[I'm coming back. I'll be counting on your guidance from now on, Sister Lin Ya. Don't scold me when I cause trouble later (o・`з・ ́o)]","Lin Ya: [Haha, you're joking. I'd be praising you non-stop. I'll go tell them now.]","An Ling: [Okay, you go ahead and get busy~]","Checking the time and feeling it was about right, Shen Linyan also sent a message. An Ling got up, gathered her things, and prepared to go out.","Taking the elevator down, the black Bentley parked at the entrance reminded her of the day she was discharged from the hospital.","Opening the car door, the man inside looked over at the sound. He was still the picture of refined elegance, a slight curve on his lips. \"Did you see the news, Madam?\"","\"I did.\" An Ling got in, closed the door, leaned back in the seat, and smiled wryly. \"My brother came to ask me about it first thing in the morning. I had to explain it to him.\"","Shen Linyan's smile was gentle. \"Calling us back today is probably to discuss this matter as well.\"","Secretary Chen in the front seat silently raised a question mark: ?","Since when did Sir and Madam get along so well?","Last time they were in the car together, it wasn't like this.","Mentioning the report, An Ling suddenly turned to ask: \"By the way, was that news released by you?\"","The smile on Shen Linyan's lips paused briefly. He smiled, his eyes gently lowering, his expression as mild as spring snow, his tone composed. \"No.\"","No?","Alright, as expected. A good older brother who even paid over a million for Lu Jingshen wouldn't deliberately release such news.","An Ling leaned back in her seat, closed her eyes to rest, and sighed with feeling. \"It seems a lot of people can't stand Lu Jingshen. Serves him right.\"","Truly the male lead, enemies everywhere.","The man lifted his gaze nonchalantly to look out the window, tapped his fingers lightly on his knee, the corners of his lips lifting as he let out a soft chuckle.","\"Indeed.\"","Arriving at the Shen residence, as soon as they pushed the door open, An Ling immediately saw Shen's mother sitting on the sofa.","Her face was grim, even darker than when An Ling first came here.","An Ling put down her bag and called out cheerfully, \"Mom~ Who upset you? Could it be me again?\"","The lively tone broke the serious atmosphere. Zhou Wen, hearing this, paused and looked up, seeming to want to say something but hesitating.","Shen's mother responded with a cold sneer. \"How could I dare? My eldest daughter-in-law is far too capable. I hardly deserve to be called 'Mom' anymore.\"","\"How could that be~\" An Ling exclaimed in feigned shock, covering her mouth and blinking playfully. \"You saw the news too, right? It's also a misunderstanding.\"","After saying that, she looked towards Lu Jingshen sitting on the other side of the sofa, her eyes curving into smiles. \"Shouldn't Lu Jingshen know about this? That was his friend. So you should ask him. It's not my fault.\"","When Lu Jingshen met her gaze, his eyes were so sinister it seemed he wanted to devour her, but he didn't say anything more.","Looking at the woman smiling before her like a cunning glutinous rice ball, Shen's mother gritted her teeth secretly.","This wretched girl doesn't have a single decent word in her mouth, impossible to gain any advantage from.","If she couldn't win an argument with An Ling, she could still pick on the easier target!","Shen's mother let out a cold laugh, slapped the sofa hard, and suddenly shouted sharply at the man sitting beside her, her words dripping with disgust and reproach.","\"Shen Linyan! How did you handle yesterday's incident?! Your brother's friend ends up in that situation, and you just stand by and do nothing? What kind of brother are you?!\"","Hearing this, the smile on An Ling's face faltered, her brows furrowing.","?","What did that mean?","She was just about to turn to look at Shen Linyan.","But the sharp sound of Shen's mother's accusatory voice reached her ears first.","\"Your brother made those friends. As the eldest brother, instead of thinking about covering for your brother, you help outsiders step on your own flesh and blood!!\"","\"You ungrateful wretch! I've wasted all these years raising you! That was your own brother's friend, what business was it of yours? Is your wife some delicate, untouchable princess? Now it's perfect, everyone in the circle knows your brother's friend has no manners, saying our Shen family has poor upbringing.\"","As she spoke, Shen's mother let out a cold snort.","\"Then again, you've been jealous of your brother being favored since you were little. Now you've finally found a chance to get back at him, haven't you?\""]},{"number":23,"title":"Chapter 23: Honey, I'm really pissed off right now.","paragraphs":["The words hung in the air, and it was as if someone had pressed the pause button in the living room. It grew so quiet that the sound of a pin dropping would have been deafening.","The smile had long since vanished from An Ling’s face. She frowned deeply, looking at Shen Linyan beside her.","The man sat quietly on the sofa, looking as if he were isolated from the surrounding commotion. His features still held their usual gentle and refined air. His lashes were slightly lowered, and those dark, ink-blue eyes were devoid of their usual warmth and peace; instead, they were like a pool of stagnant water, calm as if he had long since grown accustomed to this.","\"I apologize, Mother.\"","His voice was very soft, like a snowflake falling onto a lake—light, airy, and carrying a hint of hoarseness that was difficult to detect.","An Ling froze in place, staring blankly at the scene before her.","Wait a minute...","Before she could process it, Mother Shen’s cold, harsh voice rang in her ears.","\"Now you know you were wrong? What about your brother's reputation? So many people saw what happened last night. Find a way to suppress it.\"","An Ling paused, then turned her gaze back to the woman on the sofa. \"You know it was Lu Jingshen’s friend who was at fault first?\"","Sensing her gaze, Mother Shen’s movements faltered for a moment. She shot An Ling a sidelong glance. \"And you, as well. That friend of Lu Jingshen’s only greeted you yesterday because he recognized you. But you? You actually plotted against him. Is this how an elder sister-in-law should—\"","At this point, seeing An Ling's face growing darker and darker, Mother Shen abruptly stopped. She acted as if nothing had happened and took a sip of her tea.","\"Jingshen has already transferred those two million to you. Just act as if this never happened. I will have Shen Linyan handle the aftermath. You just behave yourself.\"","\"...Ha!\" An Ling couldn't help but laugh out loud. \"That is beyond ridiculous...\"","What was this? She had thought Mother Shen called them over because she had caused trouble again.","As it turned out, the woman knew the truth perfectly well. She was just blaming Shen Linyan, the elder brother, for not protecting his younger brother's reputation and for not handling the situation \"perfectly.\"","That coward Lu Jingshen didn't dare to face Shen Linyan alone, so he had to run to his mommy.","No wonder Shen Linyan ended up as the \"gentle second male lead\" in the story. This wasn't being gentle; he was being treated like a doormat and a tool.","She leaned against Shen Linyan’s shoulder and muttered under her breath, \"That old hag doesn't just have bad eyes; her heart is blinded by grease, too.\"","Her voice wasn't loud, but in the silence of the living room, it was exceptionally clear.","Clatter— The fruit platter the maid was preparing crashed to the floor.","In that instant, the living room fell into a deathly silence.","Everyone’s eyes were filled with shock, bewilderment, and disbelief.","Hearing her words, the man’s eyelids flickered slightly, and the corners of his mouth curled into an imperceptible arc.","Once she finally registered what had been said, Mother Shen’s voice erupted in a furious roar from the sofa: \"An Ling!! What did you just say!?\"","\"I wasn't talking about you, so why are you so angry?\"","An Ling slowly raised her head. \"The fact that Shen Linyan had to pay for your son last night already made me angry enough. This matter isn't going to be suppressed. I’ve already prepared a clarification and am ready to post it.\"","She didn't care if the clarification was actually ready or not.","She was in a foul mood right now, and she wasn't going to let anyone else have a good time.","Her perfect business partner was being bullied like this right in front of her.","Her gaze fell on the couple on the opposite sofa who were acting like bystanders. An Ling tutted.","Were the male and female leads just sitting there to reap the benefits? Letting the old lady charge into battle for them?","\"Also, as a daughter of the An family, I am high-born. Tell your younger son not to associate with just any kind of trash. It brings me bad luck, and it might even ruin the Shen family's financial fortune.\"","The An family might not be as powerful as the Shens, but they hadn't fallen so low that they could be harassed by just anyone.","\"You!!\"","It was unclear which sentence had struck a nerve, but Mother Shen’s face changed instantly, twisting with rage.","Without a second thought, she threw the cup in her hand. \"An Ling, how dare you!! Is it your place to speak here?\"","An Ling was stunned. She instinctively raised her hand to shield herself, but her waist was suddenly encircled by a powerful arm. A warm palm protected the back of her head as she was pulled into a hard, broad chest. A crisp, woody scent of pine filled her nose.","The porcelain cup rolled off the edge of the sofa with a thud, and lukewarm tea splashed onto her skirt.","She looked up blankly, only to collide with a pair of dark, deep eyes.","The man reached out to touch the area where the tea had spilled. After confirming it was only warm water, he took off his suit jacket and draped it over the woman’s slender shoulders. He gently tidied her hair and whispered softly, \"Go wait for me in the car, honey. I’ll finish up here quickly, and then we’ll go home.\"","That was perfect. If she stayed here any longer, she really wouldn't be able to show any respect for her elders.","An Ling stood up, but then she looked at Shen Linyan with hesitation, looking as if she wanted to say something.","The man’s eyes crinkled into a smile, and his fingertips lightly brushed against her palm.","Once she had left, Shen Linyan bent down to pick up the tea cup from the carpet. He placed it slowly on the table, his voice clear and calm. \"Mother, you shouldn't treat my wife like that.\"","Mother Shen’s chest was still heaving with rage. \"Did you hear what that woman said!?\"","The man looked up, appearing completely oblivious, and asked in a gentle tone, \"What did she say?\"","\"...\"","The words died in Mother Shen’s throat.","She realized that nothing good ever happened whenever she clashed with An Ling. She took a deep breath, chose to ignore the insult, and returned to the main topic.","“Let’s not talk about that for now. You must fix this situation with your brother. Go and have that report retracted before the clarification comes out.”","Shen Linyan replied in a calm, indifferent voice, “I’m afraid it’s already too late. The clarification has been released.”","Mother Shen’s voice suddenly spiked in volume. “What?!”","Beside her, Lu Jingshen asked in a low, heavy voice, “Brother, did you release that report?”","The man stood up with a faint curl of his lips, looking every bit the refined and elegant gentleman.","“I didn't release the report.”","“But I did release the clarification.”","Ignoring his mother’s scolding echoing behind him, he walked straight out of the villa.","As he crossed the courtyard, the sound of hurried footsteps came from behind, followed by a woman’s soft, breathless voice.","“Big Brother, wait a moment!”","He stopped and turned to see Zhou Wen standing behind him.","She caught her breath and lowered her head, letting out a gentle sigh. “I’m sorry, Big Brother. I’ve caused you trouble again. It was the same with the last incident. This was all done by Jingshen’s old group of friends to get back at him.”","Shen Linyan gave a soft hum of acknowledgment. “I know. There’s no need for you to apologize.”","Zhou Wen bit her lower lip, her fingers twisting together in a display of submissive grace, her eyes downcast. “I know these incidents have made things very difficult for you and Sister-in-law, so I understand why you released the clarification. Honestly, I didn't know what to do. Since I married into the family, Jingshen has been dealing with these headaches every day. The only thing I can do is stay by his side.”","The man’s gaze swept over her face, appearing lost in thought.","After a moment, he looked away, his eyes filled with a casual indifference. His voice remained gentle as he said, “I warned you before that Lu Jingshen is not a suitable marriage partner. He keeps company with a questionable crowd.”","Zhou Wen froze for a second before letting out a small laugh. “Big Brother, you sound like you’re trying to convince me to get a divorce.”","The man said nothing.","Zhou Wen hesitated for a moment before finally revealing her true purpose. “Big Brother, I know Jingshen is already dealing with those friends of his, but there might be more trouble in the future that requires your help. Could you look out for him a bit more?”","Shen Linyan looked down at his watch and gave a brief “Mhm.”","Seeing him agree, Zhou Wen’s eyes brightened. She turned and waved. “Thank you, Big Brother! Goodbye then.”","Shen Linyan turned to head back to his car, but his footsteps suddenly faltered.","Not far away by the door, a woman stood leaning lazily against the frame, a suit jacket draped over her shoulders. It was impossible to tell how long she had been watching.","Noticing his gaze, she tilted her head against the wall and slowly curved her eyes into a smile.","“Hubby, I’m absolutely fuming right now.”"]},{"number":24,"title":"Chapter 24: Minor Issue, I'll Teach Him to Be the Bad Guy","paragraphs":["In front of the villa, a woman stood with a slender, delicate frame. Her pitch-black hair cascaded over her shoulders, the ends curling slightly.","She stood with a lazy, nonchalant grace, her nude-colored high heels tapping the ground with a hint of impatience. Her ankles were slim, and her beautiful almond-shaped eyes curved upward, though they held not a trace of a smile.","A man paused for a second before continuing toward her.","Bending his tall, upright back, his fingertips brushed against her damp hem. His voice carried a mix of apology and coaxing.","\"I'm sorry. I didn't expect my mother to act like that. It was my lack of foresight. Please don't be angry, Lingling. We won't come back next time, okay?\"","An Ling stood still, but her gaze involuntarily drifted downward.","Looking from above, the man's brow bone was well-defined, and he was exceptionally handsome. He had a high bridge to his nose, cool pale skin, thin pale lips, and thick, long eyelashes. Even his fingers were elegantly jointed.","When your ideal type bows his head to apologize and uses such a magnetic, gentle voice to coax you, who could possibly resist?","An Ling silently averted her eyes.","Her anger dissipated in a rather spineless manner.","She gritted her teeth in regret, mentally cursing the distraction of a pretty face as she took a step back and turned her head away.","\"I'm not angry because of the dress. I'm just...\"","At this, An Ling paused again.","She thought about it irritably for a moment, feeling like she couldn't explain it clearly all at once. She turned toward the car.","\"Let's go home first. We'll talk at home. I don't want to stay here.\"","Behind her, the man's deep voice suddenly rang out.","\"If it's because of my mother's attitude toward me, there's no need for you to be angry about that.\"","An Ling froze and turned around.","The man gave a soft smile.","\"Because I'm already used to it.\"","Used to the differential treatment, used to the favoritism.","Ten years ago, when he was sent abroad to study alone without a penny and was deliberately targeted, he had already seen those people for who they were.","\"So there's no need for you to be angry on my behalf. I'm not hurt.\"","Hearing this, the woman said nothing. She slowly pulled the suit jacket draped over her shoulders tighter, her expression indifferent and her tone calm.","\"Shen Linyan, if you say something like that again, I'll go back inside and curse that old woman out a second time. I might even throw the teacup back at her while I'm at it.\"","Shen Linyan's expression froze.","Then, he couldn't help but press his hand to his lips and laugh out loud. His brow was full of mirth as he walked over to open the car door for An Ling.","\"You should get in the car, honey.\"","After returning home, An Ling changed out of her wet dress.","Leaning her hands on the bathroom sink, she stared at herself in the mirror and frowned.","What exactly had she been so angry about earlier?","This was someone else's family matter, and it was Shen Linyan's own business. She had clearly planned not to care about him and to find a way out so she could prepare for a divorce.","But this was just too pathetic! How could a mother be so biased? And that idiot Shen Linyan actually apologized!","Thinking about those two million, An Ling took a deep breath.","\"Fine, consider it the tuition fee for learning how to be bad.\"","\"It's a small problem. I'll teach him how to be a villain.\"","She didn't believe it—how could she, a professional villainess, fail to lead someone astray?","Everyone was going to learn to be bad!","Opening the bedroom door, she saw Shen Linyan sitting on the sofa. She walked over and silently sat down beside him.","\"Shen Linyan, I thought about it carefully, and I found the reason why I'm angry. Your mother's favoritism is one thing, and the water is another, but the main reason is that you undermined our partnership today—completely and utterly!\"","His little wife's complaints poured out like beans from a bag.","Shen Linyan paused, smiled helplessly, and put down his phone. He turned to look at her. \"How did I undermine it this time?\"","An Ling spoke without hesitation. \"You shouldn't have apologized to your mother. Apologizing is showing weakness, and it makes things difficult for me. You need to be firm. When I start the fight, you back me up.\"","As she spoke, she shifted her position to face Shen Linyan directly. She raised a finger, emphasizing her point with a serious and solemn expression. \"Moreover, you have one very, very fatal weakness.\"","The man suppressed a smile. \"What is it?\"","An Ling said, \"You're too kind.\"","\"...\"","The air fell silent for a moment.","The next second, the man suddenly covered his mouth and silently turned his head away, his shoulders shaking slightly.","?","An Ling was stunned at first, then her face flushed bright red.","Shen Linyan was actually laughing at her?!","Her eyes widened, and she was both angry and embarrassed. She slapped the sofa hard. \"What are you doing! I'm being serious! Shen Linyan, take this seriously!\"","\"Alright, alright.\" The man turned back, his eyes still brimming with laughter. \"Why do you say that?\"","\"Haven't you noticed? You never know how to say no. Whenever someone asks for help, you agree.\"","An Ling frowned. \"If this keeps up, aren't you afraid of going bankrupt? You need to learn how to reject people, especially your mother.\"","Shen Linyan smiled and played along. \"If I go bankrupt, I'll make sure to set aside two million for you first.\"","An Ling's face went numb. \"...That's too little. You have to leave two hundred million.\"","Seeing that the man completely failed to realize the gravity of the situation, An Ling guessed he probably hadn't noticed it himself. Growing up in such an extremely oppressive environment, Shen Linyan might have developed a bit of a people-pleasing personality.","She pondered for a moment before speaking slowly. \"Shen Linyan, do you trust me?\"","She looked up earnestly. \"I know it's hard for you to change all at once. If you trust me, I'll teach you how to be a 'bad person.'\"","Hearing this, Shen Linyan was momentarily stunned.","The smile remained in his eyes, but the curve of his lips deepened. His gaze grew darker as his fingertip tapped his phone. His tone was inexplicably meaningful. \"You're going to teach me... how to be a bad person?\"","\"Yes.\" An Ling raised her chin and nodded. \"I'm a professional.\"","Otherwise, why would the System have chosen her to be the villainess?","Looking at the confident expression on his little wife's face, the man pressed a finger to his lips and his eyes curved slowly.","\"Alright. I'm looking forward to it.\"","An Ling nodded in approval.","He was a quick study!","She immediately took out her phone, smiling as she opened her notes app and read out the terms she had just prepared in the room.","\"First, you have to listen to me. If I tell you to refuse, you refuse.\"","\"Okay.\"","\"Second, if I curse someone out, you have to curse too. If you don't know how, just listening is fine, but you can't play the peacemaker!\"","\"Okay.\"","\"Third, when I'm not around, if someone makes an unreasonable request—including but not limited to making you clean up their mess, making you compromise, or treating you like a sucker—you have to reject them all.\"","Shen Linyan laughed. \"Okay.\"","\"Fourth, you can't just believe what other people say, and you can't doubt me... or our partnership.\"","The man propped his head on his hand, his eyes warm and indulgent.","\"Why would you write something that could never happen?\"","He certainly knew how to talk.","As expected of her perfect contract husband.","Satisfied, An Ling nodded and continued looking at her phone.","\"Fifth...\" She paused, stealing a glance at the man.","\"Before our partnership ends, you are not allowed to develop feelings for anyone else. Once you do, the partnership will terminate immediately.\"","The smile on Shen Linyan's lips stiffened slightly.","He lowered his eyes and slowly shifted his seating position, the curve of his mouth becoming unreadable. \"And what if it's you?\"","An Ling said without hesitation, \"I can't either, of course.\"","Please! She wasn't the System!","Was Shen Linyan still suspecting that she liked Lu Jingshen?","The man's dark pupils stared at her. After a long while, he curled his lips into a low chuckle.","\"I see.\"","He saw?","Was that a yes or a no?","An Ling narrowed her eyes suspiciously.","Surely Shen Linyan wasn't the type to play these kinds of word games?","Forget it, she decided, it didn't matter for now.","She tucked her phone away.","\"Alright, time to move on to step one.\""]},{"number":25,"title":"Chapter 25: Ah, so it's a little game between the young couple.","paragraphs":["An Ling stood up and looked at the man on the sofa, the words catching in her throat.","Actually, she wanted to tell Shen Linyan to flat-out reject Zhou Wen’s help.","But would that be too harsh all at once? What if Shen Linyan’s conscience outweighed his sense of grievance?","Maybe she should take it step by step?","“You... first, refuse your mother. You cannot let this matter be suppressed.”","As soon as the words left her mouth, the man nodded. “Alright. Does Madam have anything else to add?”","“Not for now.”","“What about the water incident?”","“Huh?” An Ling didn’t react for a moment.","The man on the sofa sat with a dignified grace, his features as gentle as jade and his tone light. “Since Madam said we are going to be the villains, shouldn't we retaliate for the time she splashed water on you?”","“...Hahaha, of course we should.” An Ling’s smile was a bit forced.","As expected of the head of the Shen Corporation, he was a quick and precise learner, even capable of drawing inferences. She had almost forgotten about that herself.","“I’ll wait until the next time I go back to get my revenge. Let her enjoy her comfort for a little longer.”","An Ling silently picked up her bag and waved. “I’m heading out now. I have plans with Jiang Mai.”","Shen Linyan smiled and raised a hand. “Be careful on the road, Madam.”","The moment the door closed, the smile vanished from his face.","The man leaned back casually against the chair, his fingertips mindlessly tapping the phone screen, his eyes sinking into a cold, contemplative depth.","*Ding...*","a notification broke the silence.","[Chairman Shen, Huang Long has confessed everything. Young Master Lu’s people are looking for him. Should we release him?]","His expression remained indifferent as the corner of his mouth quirked up slightly.","[Release him. And make sure that old woman finds out what happened.]","It had been far too noisy lately; things needed to quiet down for a few days.","Just after sending the message, his private WeChat buzzed.","An Ling: [(Image) Just in case Hubby forgets! ^^]","He clicked on it. It was a photo of the \"rules\" she had just written down.","The man paused, his gaze lingering on the screen for a few seconds. His Adam’s apple bobbed as a slow, faint chuckle escaped his lips.","“Kindness...”","He slowly typed back a reply:","[Understood, Madam. ^^]","***","“An Ling, I really underestimated you.”","Inside the café, Jiang Mai flipped through the rules on the phone, unable to stop herself from clicking her tongue in wonder.","“I thought you were joking, but you’re actually doing it? You even wrote out a proposal. Your initiative is incredible—I guess that’s the producer in you talking.”","An Ling huffed twice. “What did you expect? And I’ve already talked to Shen Linyan about it.”","“Huh?? You told him?” Jiang Mai’s eyes widened in shock. “What did you say? You didn't just walk up to him and say, ‘I’m going to teach you how to be a villain,’ did you??”","An Ling paused, guiltily shifting her gaze.","“...Is there a problem with that?”","“...Don't tell me Shen Linyan agreed.”","“...So what if he did?”","“...”","Jiang Mai calmly handed the phone back.","She calmly took a sip of her coffee.","Finally, she gave a calm evaluation.","“Ah, I see. It’s just a bit of 'married couple roleplay' flirting.”","An Ling: “?”","Jiang Mai tapped the table, nodding for emphasis. “Think about it. If someone suddenly said to you, ‘I’m going to teach you how to be a bad person,’ what would you think?”","An Ling: “I’d think they were crazy.”","Jiang Mai: “Exactly!”","“...”","An Ling’s mouth twitched. She pushed her hands forward dismissively. “I don’t care. Anyway, I told him and he agreed. If he still ends up bankrupt, that’s his problem. I’ve done my part.”","Jiang Mai shrugged. “If you ask me, just let it be. Trying to change Shen Linyan is too much trouble. You should focus on handling your own affairs, stay away from the plot, and get that divorce.”","“But Shen Linyan is so pitiful!!”","An Ling slapped the table in frustration, her expression looking as though she were the one being treated unfairly.","“Do you have any idea how biased his mother is? Oh my god, it made my blood boil! In all my years, I’ve never seen such blatant favoritism. And that idiot Shen Linyan actually apologized! It made me even angrier!”","Jiang Mai said expressionlessly, “Why is a 'vicious female supporting character' like you worrying about the second male lead?”","Seeing her best friend freeze instantly, Jiang Mai sighed and set down her cup.","“An Ling, you haven't read enough novels. Let me explain this to you once, so listen closely.”","No wonder her soft-hearted friend had been possessed by a system; with this 'cold on the outside, soft on the inside' personality, she was never meant to be a villainess.","“You said our world is a novel. In that case, no matter how melodramatic the things happening to the characters are, they are 'real.' There is no such thing as 'too' melodramatic, only 'more' melodramatic.”","“Different life experiences shape different character traits. Why do you think Shen Linyan is so capable and sensible, yet still ignored by his mother? It’s because the author wanted to create the image of a gentle, mature ruler. Even if he grew up unloved and neglected, he remains kind and gentle to everyone. That *is* Shen Linyan.”","An Ling stared, her mouth hanging open as if she wanted to argue, but Jiang Mai cut her off.","“And don't bother trying to get revenge for him. That’s really not your job. My dear friend, have you ever wondered why Shen Linyan likes the female lead? It’s because she helped him a long time ago. We’re already at the end of the novel; Zhou Wen must have already 'saved' him by now.”","“...”","An Ling was stunned for a long while before finally muttering a single word.","“Crap.”","What a complicated setup.","She leaned back against her chair thoughtfully. “You’re amazing, Jiang Mai. I never even thought about all that.”","Jiang Mai rubbed her nose proudly.","“Of course! Do you think all those nights I spent reading novels were for nothing? If this were the beginning of the story, I’d encourage you to help him—maybe he’d even fall for you. But since it’s the finale, you’re better off just protecting yourself.”","“But I already promised Shen Linyan I’d teach him how to be a villain. What do I do now?” An Ling suddenly felt like deleting the photo she’d sent.","“Just wing it.”","Jiang Mai rubbed her chin. “Let me think... Basically, Zhou Wen is likely Shen Linyan’s 'White Moonlight' right now. Just don't be stupid enough to make him reject Zhou Wen directly. He probably won't refuse you on anything else.”","An Ling, who had almost done exactly that: “...”","She gave a guilty “Oh.” “These tropes are so complicated. I’m actually starting to admire my old screenwriting teachers.”","Speaking of work, Jiang Mai arched an eyebrow. “By the way, are you going back to being a producer?”","“Yeah! I got back in touch with my old mentor, and she agreed to let me work with her.” An Ling let out a sigh of relief. “Luckily Ms. Chen wasn't angry. I swear, I blame that stupid system for everything.”","“So, same as before? You’re staying away from the sets?”","Producers usually have to monitor progress on-site, but An Ling’s prosopagnosia—her face blindness—made recognizing people difficult. In the past, she had stuck to program production and post-production operations.","An Ling propped her chin on her hand. “Actually, no. This time I plan to follow Ms. Chen as an executive producer.”","She felt that because she had been such a shut-in before, no one had noticed the difference when she was possessed. If she participated in more offline activities, maybe the system wouldn't have chosen her to begin with.","Besides, she needed to break the persona that the damn system had forced on her.","Jiang Mai asked in surprise, “You’re not worried about your face blindness anymore?”","An Ling looked hesitant.","“I don’t think I know anyone in the entertainment industry... right?”"]},{"number":26,"title":"Chapter 26: Honey~","paragraphs":["In her two years working in the industry, An Ling had never run into anyone she knew.","As for her face blindness, having dealt with it for so long, she had naturally figured out the trick to interacting normally with others.","For people with a friendly tone who gave a good first impression.","—Smile, nod, and stay quiet.","For people with a rude tone who gave a bad first impression.","—\"None of your business.\"","As long as she didn't say any names, and waited for the other person to accidentally reveal their identity, everything would be sorted out.","Having confirmed her transfer to an executive producer role, An Ling's first step was to go see her former colleagues.","Two years ago, when she was working, she had only had one meal with Ms. Chen Minhuai and made an exception to take a commemorative photo together.","It couldn't be helped, she was a fan of Ms. Chen!","Ms. Chen Minhuai was a renowned producer in the industry, excelling in films, TV dramas, and variety shows alike, with every project she touched becoming a major hit.","Back then, An Ling had gone to great lengths to contact this teacher, sending her project proposals via email numerous times.","Until one time, she was finally noticed, and Ms. Chen proactively contacted her to ask if she was interested in joining the production.","From then on, An Ling collaborated with Ms. Chen on several projects. Although she never showed her face or revealed her real name, the name Ah Leng gradually spread within producer circles.","They even joked that Ah Leng must be Ms. Chen Minhuai's prized disciple, kept hidden away like a treasure.","It's just that no one expected, not even An Ling herself, that such an accident would happen over these past two years.","After finalizing the meeting place and time with Ms. Chen, An Ling finally breathed a sigh of relief.","Having disappeared so suddenly two years ago, just a meal wouldn't be enough; she also needed to prepare a gift as an apology.","Knowing Ms. Chen Minhuai liked fountain pens, An Ling made a special trip to the mall but couldn't find a suitable one.","She suddenly remembered the fountain pen on the man's desk in Shen Linyan's office from her previous visit; it had looked very nice.","She originally planned to ask Shen Linyan for the purchasing channel, but only found out the news when she got home.","\"Shen Linyan isn't coming back for dinner tonight?\"","Hearing the voice, Auntie Cheng poked her head out from the kitchen: \"That's right, the sir said he has a business dinner tonight. Didn't he tell you?\"","An Ling changed her shoes and glanced down at the empty message interface on her phone.","Her movements paused slightly. She lowered her eyes and then, as if nothing was wrong, turned off her phone.","\"No.\"","-","Inside a top-tier club, the atmosphere in the private room was harmonious. Most of those present were presidents of moderately well-known construction companies.","Everyone laughed and raised their glasses for toasts, but their peripheral glances were subtly fixed on the man in the central seat.","The man was dressed in a suit, handsome in appearance, with an indifferent expression. His long legs were casually crossed, and his slender fingers held a cigarette. He looked down at his phone casually, his demeanor noble and aloof.","The eldest son of the Shen family, the newly appointed head of the Shen Corporation this year, the youngest among the powerful elite.","Previously, at social gatherings, everyone had still looked down on this returnee young master, thinking Shen Zhong was crazy to hand over a large corporation directly to his eldest son.","But now, the Shen Corporation's land development project had everyone coveting a piece.","Hence, this dinner gathering was arranged. Having finally managed to invite this man, everyone was secretly looking for an opportunity to curry favor.","Someone took the lead, stood up, and walked over with a smiling toast, handing over a business card with a laugh.","\"Chairman Shen made tens of billions as soon as he took office. Young people indeed have far-sighted vision. I heard Chairman Shen is planning another development. Our company would also very much like to cooperate with Chairman Shen. Perhaps we could achieve even greater success. What does Chairman Shen think?\"","The implication, between the lines, was to get a slice of the pie.","The table instantly grew restless, with dozens of pairs of eyes closely watching the man's attitude.","Shen Linyan, however, put down his phone, glanced up nonchalantly, casually took the business card, his brows relaxing, his tone gentle and pleasant.","\"Cooperation? That sounds quite good.\"","The man's deep voice carried a hint of interest, as if he was somewhat intrigued.","The visitor was President Sun from a construction group. Seeing this, he was delighted and quickly added, \"Yes, Chairman Shen has just taken office, so you might not know our company well. This cooperation could also strengthen our ties, leading to more collaborations in the future.\"","His tone was respectful, his smile amiable, but inwardly he couldn't help but sigh that the young were indeed easier to talk to than those old foxes.","The man lowered his eyes and chuckled softly, casually extinguishing his cigarette in the ashtray, his movements carrying an unhurried, aristocratic air.","\"Cooperation is certainly possible, but there must be some benefits, right?\"","President Sun's eyebrows lifted with joy; of course, he had come prepared.","Just as he was about to speak, the man's careless voice sounded abruptly in his ear.","\"For a company at your level, I'm afraid offering ten percent of your shares would be needed to show sincerity.\"","The scene fell silent in an instant.","Everyone around was shocked, whispering and exchanging words in hushed tones.","\"Ten percent?\"","\"This young master Shen has quite an appetite.\"","\"Ten percent is a bit excessive...\"","Ten percent?? That's practically equivalent to being a minor shareholder!","This was hardly cooperation; it was clearly a disguised takeover of another company.","President Sun's expression also changed upon hearing this.","What a joke.","He forced a difficult smile, \"Chairman Shen is still too young... some words are perhaps a bit too...\"","\"Then five percent.\"","The man slowly lifted his eyelids, a faint curve remained at the corner of his mouth the whole time, yet there wasn't a trace of a smile in his eyes. His dark pupils sent a chill down one's spine.","\"Otherwise, did you think I came here to do charity?\"","At this, almost no one in the room dared to speak.","They suddenly realized just how this recently returned young master had so swiftly ascended to the position of head.","In the corner, An Zhou quietly drew in a sharp breath and took a sip from his glass.","Good grief, he hadn't wanted to come. A friend had insisted on dragging him here, saying there was a big deal.","Probably knowing about the marriage alliance between his An family and the Shen family, they wanted him to make the connection.","For goodness' sake, because of that girl An Ling, in the few months since their marriage, he didn't know how many losses he had suffered at Shen Linyan's hands.","Had he known it was Shen Linyan, he would have died before coming.","Remembering his sister's words, An Zhou felt like helplessly rolling his eyes.","Just who exactly was the one suffering losses here!","He still couldn't resist, silently pulling out his phone to message his unlucky sister.","[You really should come see how Shen Linyan acts at these business dinners.]","Then you'd know exactly who's suffering losses.","The other party replied quickly: [You're with Shen Linyan?]","[Yeah, happened to be at the same dinner.]","Before he could explain the situation, An Ling asked again:","[Is Shen Linyan busy right now?]","An Zhou thought he might have been busy earlier, but he certainly wasn't busy now.","Who would dare go up and talk to him?","[No, he's not busy. Why do you ask?]","As soon as he sent the message, the girl on the other end went silent.","An Zhou puzzledly tapped her avatar: [Where'd you go?]","Meanwhile, on the other side, Shen Linyan had just picked up his glass and taken a sip.","His phone on the table suddenly vibrated.","He paused, picked it up to look, his gaze halting momentarily, then the corner of his mouth involuntarily curved up.","An Ling: [Hubby~ ( ́⌣`ʃƪ)]"]},{"number":27,"title":"Chapter 27: Are you married","paragraphs":["Seeing the man's reply, An Ling was momentarily stunned.","She sat on the sofa, a slight smile playing at the corners of her mouth.","An Ling: [What brand is the fountain pen in your office? I want to buy a similar one as a gift.]","Shen Linyan: [If you like it, I'll have Secretary Chen deliver one home tomorrow.]","An Ling: [Okay~ Thank you, hubby.]","Having achieved her goal, An Ling hovered her fingertips over the screen, hesitating for a few taps.","Recalling what Jiang Mai had said earlier that day, she sighed silently.","\"How exactly am I supposed to 'teach' him casually?\"","As long as she didn't mention Zhou Wen, right?","She hesitated for a moment before typing:","[I heard you're at a business dinner, so go ahead and get back to work. Remember to say 'no' to the offers, okay? ^^]","Shen Linyan: [Thank you for the reminder, Madam. I almost said 'yes' just now. ^^]","Seeing that Shen Linyan's mood had suddenly improved, President Sun was about to speak when he saw the man suddenly stand up and unhurriedly button his suit jacket, looking as if he were about to leave.","He quickly forced a smile and said, \"Chairman Shen, we can still talk about the cooperation, and about those shares...\"","\"My apologies.\"","The man chuckled, his tone leisurely and calm.","\"I'm no longer interested.\"","The next day, An Ling received the fountain pen delivered by Secretary Chen.","\"I apologize, Young Madam. The one Chairman Shen uses is a Montblanc limited edition. I could only get my hands on this one for now, but it's also a limited edition from the same series.\"","She took the gift bag and looked inside. \"It's fine, this works.\"","No wonder she couldn't find it in the mall; it was a limited edition.","Secretary Chen was about to leave after delivering the item, but the woman's voice sounded from behind him.","\"Secretary Chen, wait a moment.\"","He turned around to see her eyes curving as she gave him a playful wink.","\"I want to ask you something, and you mustn't tell Shen Linyan.\"","\"...\" Why was there another hurdle?","Secretary Chen's expression instantly stiffened. \"...What... what do you want to ask?\"","Seeing his nervous expression, An Ling raised her hand to reassure him. \"Don't be nervous. I won't ask anything that puts you in a difficult position.\"","She stood by the door for a moment before asking, \"Do you know Zhou Wen? Lu Jingshen's wife. I remember she used to be a secretary.\"","Secretary Chen paused, a flicker of surprise crossing his mind.","Why was the Madam asking about her?","He thought for a moment and then slowly nodded. \"I know her. The Second Madam used to be... my colleague.\"","Before marrying Lu Jingshen, Zhou Wen had indeed worked at the Shen Corporation. Otherwise, how would the two of them have met?","An Ling nodded thoughtfully, leaning her head against the door, and suddenly asked:","\"So she was Lu Jingshen's secretary?\"","Secretary Chen nodded and then shook his head, answering casually, \"The Second Madam used to be President Lu's personal assistant. After Chairman Shen returned, she followed Chairman Shen for a period of time...\"","As he spoke, his voice suddenly caught in his throat, and he looked at An Ling with uncertainty.","The Madam wouldn't misunderstand something, would she?","Surely not? Didn't the Madam like Young Master Lu?","Secretary Chen swallowed hard. \"Um... Madam, why are you... asking this?\"","An Ling blinked, looking as if she didn't understand the fuss. \"Just asking out of curiosity. Why are you so nervous?\"","Seeing that she didn't look angry, Secretary Chen felt a little more at ease.","Just as he was about to say something, An Ling glanced at the wall clock. \"It's getting late, and I have an appointment later. You should get back to work.\"","\"Yes, Madam.\"","Once the door closed, the smile on the woman's face slowly faded. Her fingertips rested on the door lock, and her eyelashes cast a shadow over her eyes. She pursed her lips slightly, lost in thought.","After a moment, she ruffled her hair and laughed. \"Quite the melodrama.\"","That girl Jiang Mai actually had a point.","Looking at the gift bag in her hand, she took a photo with her phone.","An Ling: [Received it~ Thank you, Chairman Shen~]","The man replied quickly.","Shen Linyan: [You're welcome. As long as you like it.]","An Ling had intended to say she would be eating out tonight, but in the end, she silently deleted the message and didn't mention it.","There was no need for a couple in a marriage of convenience to report their whereabouts, right?","Shen Linyan hadn't told her yesterday either.","She put away her phone and went to change clothes to head out.","The appointment with Ms. Chen was for the evening. An Ling brought the gift and drove to the restaurant.","Standing before the private room, she took a deep breath and pushed the door open.","The woman inside was in her early forties, wearing a black tracksuit with sharp, shoulder-length short hair. A pair of rimless glasses sat on her nose, giving her a capable and highly intellectual aura.","Hearing the sound, she looked up, a joyful smile appearing on her face.","\"Ah Leng is here.\"","\"Ms. Chen.\"","An Ling walked over and placed the gift on the table, looking apologetic. \"I'm sorry. Some things happened over the past two years, and I disappeared without having a chance to tell you.\"","\"Lin Ya told me. It's alright, I know you're not that kind of child. You must have run into some trouble to act that way.\"","Ms. Chen's tone was gentle, without a hint of blame. She even smiled as she spoke, \"I'm truly happy to know you're coming back to work with me.\"","\"I'm also very happy to be working with you again.\"","An Ling pushed the gift bag forward. \"I know you like fountain pens. I asked my husband to get this for me. I don't know much about them, but I hope you like it.\"","Ms. Chen was about to decline the gift when she suddenly noticed the words the woman used. Her eyes widened in surprise, and her refusal took a sharp turn.","\"You're married??\"","Wasn't this girl still single two years ago? How did she end up married?","An Ling nodded somewhat shyly. \"Yes... I got married this year. It's a family alliance.\"","An alliance???","Ms. Chen's face froze for a second before she reached an instant realization.","So it was an arranged marriage.","Though rare nowadays, they still existed in some circles.","She hadn't realized Ah Leng's family was so traditional. No wonder the girl used a pseudonym and didn't show her face; she probably didn't want her family to find out.","After all, some traditional customs dictated that women shouldn't show their faces or be too high-profile after marriage.","This explained everything—her sudden disappearance two years ago might have been because her family was struggling and forced her into marriage.","Such a talented child, forced to marry someone she didn't love.","Thinking of this, her gaze filled with pity and heartache. She gently took the girl's hand.","\"I understand now. You should have told me sooner if that was the case. Now that you've come out and said you want to be an executive producer, didn't your family object?\"","Her gaze fell on the gift bag, and recalling what An Ling had said, her eyes showed a bit more relief. She patted the back of An Ling's hand and sighed deeply.","\"Fortunately, your husband seems decent and reasonable for supporting you in this. I support you too. Whatever difficulties you have, you can tell me. I'll help you.\"","A bewildered An Ling: \"??\"","What was wrong with Ms. Chen?","She paused. Although she was a bit confused, she picked the part she understood to answer: \"Um... Ms. Chen, actually, my husband doesn't know. I didn't tell him who the gift was for, nor did I tell him I was coming to see you. I just asked him to buy the gift.\"","Ms. Chen's expression changed drastically.","\"What!!?\"","So, this fountain pen was actually something Ah Leng had gone to such great lengths to obtain just to please him?!","Her expression turned solemn as she shoved the bag back. \"Then I definitely can't accept this! Ah Leng, if your husband finds out, will he... will he get violent with you??\"","Ah Leng’s expression went blank.","Shen Linyan... getting violent?"]},{"number":28,"title":"Chapter 28: Did Shen Linyan come back in the evening","paragraphs":["An Leng felt that Ms. Chen might have misunderstood something.","She chose her words carefully. \"My husband... is very gentle. He doesn't resort to violence. Besides, ours is just a marriage of convenience; there aren't really any feelings involved, which is why I didn't mention it before.\"","Ms. Chen frowned, still looking skeptical. \"Is that true?\"","An Leng nodded repeatedly. \"Really, really. My husband is a good person. Even if he knew, he wouldn't say much.\"","She pressed the gift into Ms. Chen's hands. \"Please, just take it and put your mind at ease.\"","Ms. Chen sighed.","\"I told you not to waste your money. You should have returned it and used the money to help out with your househo—\"","The second half of the sentence caught in her throat the moment she caught sight of the logo on the box.","Her eyes widened in shock.","...Montblanc??","That incredibly expensive brand??","Did Ah Leng's husband buy a knockoff?","She took it out and opened the box. When she saw the style of the fountain pen inside, Ms. Chen was dumbfounded.","It was a Montblanc limited edition, one of only one hundred in the world—a luxury item that was virtually priceless on the market.","She studied it for a few moments and couldn't see a single sign of it being a fake. She looked up in bewilderment. \"Your husband bought this?\"","\"Yes.\" An Leng blinked nervously. \"Do you not like it?\"","Was this a question of whether she liked it or not...","Ms. Chen’s heart was racing from the shock. Her stunned gaze slowly drifted over the woman in front of her.","She had been so happy to see her earlier that she hadn't noticed at all. The woman was dressed in designer labels from head to toe, wearing a Patek Philippe watch on her wrist, and the bag she had casually set on the table was Chanel.","Which family’s heiress had come out to play?","#The Poor Student Online is Actually a Wealthy Socialite Offline.#","It seemed the marriage of convenience was indeed a real one...","Ms. Chen swallowed the words she was about to say and silently tucked the pen back into the bag. \"I like it very much...\"","She then smoothly changed the subject. \"So, will you still be using a pseudonym when you transition to executive producer?\"","\"No need.\"","An Leng had considered this before, but since she had decided to show her face, there was no point in hiding her name.","Even if it were out there, people wouldn't necessarily recognize her immediately, right?","What normal person spends their days memorizing the names of every wealthy heiress?","She smiled and pointed to herself. \"Ms. Chen, my real name is An Leng. An as in 'peaceful,' and Leng is—\"","Ms. Chen’s eyes flew open, and the words escaped her lips. \"The heiress of the An family?\"","\"...\"","Realizing she had lost her composure, Ms. Chen quickly covered her mouth. \"Sorry, sorry. Because you mentioned a marriage of convenience and a high-status family background, it just clicked for me.\"","Despite her apology, her eyes were still filled with shock and amazement.","\"So... that Mrs. Shen who has been all over the news lately, that's you?\"","How could it be?! The Ah Leng she knew and the Mrs. Shen in the news didn't seem like the same person at all.","The woman laughed helplessly. \"It's me. Those news stories online are all fake.\"","\"You...\" Ms. Chen hesitated. \"Your identity is truly a surprise to me.\"","If she was An Leng, then her husband was Shen Linyan, the heir to the Shen family who was equally under the spotlight.","In that case, giving a pen like this wasn't strange at all.","Seeing Ms. Chen's complicated expression, An Leng quietly grabbed her arm and spoke in a soft, pleading voice. \"Ms. Chen, you won't regret it and then dump me, will you? Please don't, ahhh~~\"","The girl's beautiful face wore a pitiful expression, her clear eyes bright and clean, and soft strands of hair fell against her cheeks. Even her intentional playfulness was impossible to dislike.","Looking at that face, Ms. Chen's expression softened. \"How could I regret it? I'm mentoring you for your talent, not your status.\"","She suddenly remembered something and asked, \"But will you be okay?\"","An Leng looked up blankly. \"What do you mean?\"","\"I've been preparing a variety show recently, mainly filming the daily lives of celebrities.\"","This type of show focused on the off-camera lives of stars, and the results and reception were usually quite good.","An Leng was naturally aware of this and nodded. \"That's no problem. I've worked on those types of shows before.\"","\"No, that's not what I meant.\"","Ms. Chen took out her phone and opened a file. \"I remember there's someone among the celebrities participating in this show that you should know. Is it really okay for you to run into her?\"","Huh? Someone she knew?","With her face-blindness, how could she possibly know anyone in the entertainment industry?","Just as she was about to deny it, she heard Ms. Chen say, \"Ah!\"","\"Found it. Her name is Shen Fuyuan! You should know her, right?\"","\"...\"","An Leng's expression gradually froze.","\"Did you say... Shen Fuyuan?\"","Wait, what??","Shen Linyan's sister was a celebrity??","More importantly, why didn't she have any memory of this at all?!","After parting ways with Ms. Chen, An Leng still hadn't recovered from the shock.","She had just finished saying she didn't know anyone in the industry, and then this person pops up.","And it was her sister-in-law, someone she wasn't close to and didn't get along with.","An Leng sighed.","Whatever. As long as they didn't greet each other and acted like strangers, it would be fine.","She took out her phone to check the time and saw that Auntie Cheng had sent her a message.","[Madam, are you not coming back tonight?]","Her eyes went wide, and she slapped her forehead in regret.","\"Damn, I forgot to tell Auntie Cheng.\"","She had originally only intended to keep it from Shen Linyan, but in the end, she had forgotten to tell Auntie Cheng as well.","While she was having dinner with Ms. Chen, she had kept her phone tucked away in her bag. By now, two hours had already slipped by.","She quickly sent an apology to Auntie Cheng: [I'm so sorry, Auntie Cheng! I forgot to tell you that I wouldn't be back for dinner tonight. I feel terrible making you cook for nothing.]","Auntie Cheng replied with a soothing little emoji: [It’s no trouble at all. Mr. Shen came back this evening, so the food didn't go to waste.]","Shen Linyan was home tonight?","An Leng’s movements faltered for a moment.","Before she could reply, another message from Auntie Cheng popped up.","[Mr. Shen did ask me if you were coming back, though. I told him I wasn't sure since you hadn't mentioned anything. I even joked with him, saying that you had asked the exact same question yesterday.]","An Leng’s gaze lingered on the screen for a moment. She blinked, her fingertips slowly tapping out a reply.","[What did he say after that?]","Auntie Cheng’s status remained as \"typing\" for a long while, as if she were composing a lengthy response.","The night breeze carried a hint of a chill. An Leng pulled her coat tighter around her and hurried toward her car.","It wasn't until she was settled in the driver's seat with her seatbelt fastened that a message finally came through.","When she saw the content, her casual expression suddenly froze.","There was no long paragraph; Auntie Cheng had sent only six simple words.","[He said he would apologize.]","Inside the quiet car, the only sound was the low hum of the heater. The harsh white light of the screen illuminated the girl's face.","An Leng blinked slowly, her chin resting on the steering wheel. Her beautiful almond-shaped eyes stared quietly at the screen. She slowly pursed her lips and murmured softly to herself:","\"He really shouldn't apologize for this...\"","An apology would be playing dirty.","She wouldn't be able to handle it."]},{"number":29,"title":"Chapter 29: Madam, May I Come In","paragraphs":["Parking the car in the garage and taking the elevator up, An Ling’s gaze rested aimlessly on the floor indicator.","She had originally planned to come home much later tonight. At the very least, she wanted to wait until Shen Linyan had retired to his room before she stepped inside.","She didn't want to hear him apologize.","Apologizing just because he hadn't reported his whereabouts to her felt a bit too much like \"crossing the line.\" It didn't fit the nature of their political marriage.","That was the plan, which was why she had intentionally wandered around the mall and even picked something up on a whim. She felt like an eternity had passed, but when she checked the time, she realized she’d been gone for less than half an hour.","The elevator doors slid open. An Ling snapped back to reality, let out a soft sigh, and stepped out.","With a soft beep, the front door opened. In the vast living room, a floor lamp cast a warm, dim glow beside the sofa. The curtains were drawn back, allowing silvery moonlight to spill through the floor-to-ceiling windows, filling the space with an unexpectedly cozy atmosphere.","A man sat on the sofa, half of his silhouette draped in shadow. His long legs were crossed, and the top few buttons of his shirt were undone, revealing the faint, firm lines of his muscles. He looked relaxed, almost indolent.","He was leaning his head on one hand while scrolling through his phone. The lamplight defined his sharp, deep features, though there was a hint of cool detachment in his eyes.","Hearing the door, he looked up and set his phone aside. His eyes crinkled slightly as he reverted to his usual gentle demeanor.","\"You're back?\"","An Ling’s footsteps faltered. For a fleeting, inexplicable moment, she felt the blissful illusion of a wife coming home late from overtime to find her husband waiting up for her.","Clutching her shopping bag and purse, she gave a soft \"mm-hmm.\" Shifting her gaze away to avoid looking at the sofa, she headed straight for her room. \"Um... I'm going to take a shower. You should get some rest too.\"","Just as she turned away, the man's low, slow voice drifted from behind her.","\"Would you mind chatting with me after your shower, my lady? I was waiting for you.\"","\"...\"","An Ling gritted her teeth. Keeping her back to him, she waved her hand dismissively, trying to sound natural. \"Not tonight, I'm afraid. I'm pretty exhausted. I’m worried I’ll fall asleep mid-conversation. Next time, okay?\"","Shen Linyan’s gaze fell on her slightly stiff back. His eyes darkened. He set his phone down and slowly stood up.","In the silent living room, his steady footsteps were clear and deliberate.","An Ling froze when she heard the footsteps stop directly behind her.","A crisp scent of cedar wood drifted into her nose, elegantly and subtly enveloping her. He was so close she could almost feel him against her back. His deep voice was warm and clear.","\"Don't worry. If you fall asleep on the sofa, I'll carry you back to your room.\"","He paused, leaning down slowly until his breath brushed the top of her head. His tone was soft and persuasive.","\"So, will you talk with me? Please?\"","An Ling felt her head spinning from the sheer charm of it.","Before she knew what she was doing, she found herself nodding dizzily. \"Okay... sure.\"","Forgive her; she really couldn't resist a handsome face.","***","By the time she had showered and sat down on the sofa, An Ling’s brain was still in a bit of a fog from his coaxing.","That was until she heard his voice beside her.","\"I’m sorry. I forgot to tell you yesterday that I had a social engagement. I shouldn't have let you hear it from someone else.\"","As expected, it was about that.","She paused, uncomfortably shifting her gaze and pursing her lips. \"It's fine. I wasn't angry... there's no need for you to apologize for that.\"","Thinking of his kind nature, An Ling looked down and sighed. She decided to be direct; she didn't want him feeling unnecessary guilt.","\"Besides, you don't actually have to tell me, Shen Linyan. We’re in an arranged marriage. You have no obligation to report to me, just as I have no obligation to report to you.\"","As soon as the words left her mouth, the curve of the man’s lips faltered, though he quickly masked it.","His lashes drooped slightly, hiding the gloom in his eyes. He let out a low chuckle. \"What are you saying? Of course I have an obligation to report. After all, you’re supposed to be teaching me how to be a 'bad person.' Wouldn't I be failing your kind intentions if I didn't?\"","An Ling blinked, awkwardly touching her ear.","\"Well... I suppose that’s true.\"","After all, in those high-stakes social environments, someone as \"kind\" as Shen Linyan was an easy target for traps. She did need to know where he was going so she could give him pointers.","So, he was apologizing because of the \"lessons.\"","She had thought... it was because he felt guilty as a husband failing to check in with his wife.","An Ling stole a glance at him. \"Then... will you tell me every time you have an event from now on?\"","\"I will,\" he said gently. \"You'll be the first person I tell. And then I'll let you teach me what to do.\"","An Ling’s eyes brightened, and a smile spread across her face. \"Deal! I'll teach you everything!\"","The moonlight touched her face, making her skin look as translucent and delicate as jade. Her lips were a vivid crimson against her pale skin, like a drop of red in the snow. Her thick lashes curled over eyes that crinkled into crescents, brimming with genuine mirth.","This was the first time he had seen her smile like that.","A trace of a daze flickered in the man's eyes. He stared at her for a long moment, his thumb unconsciously rubbing his wedding ring until the friction made it warm. Only then did he snap back to his senses.","His Adam's apple bobbed. He looked down and said softly, \"Then, you should get some rest.\"","An Ling blinked, but she didn't move.","Her gaze lingered on his tall, upright frame. Inexplicably, her friend Jiang Mai’s words from earlier popped into her head, and she bit her lip.","Is this how those \"contract marriage\" novels usually start...?","Even though she knew a real romance between her and Shen Linyan was impossible, it was hard not to let her mind wander.","An Ling’s eyes darted around, her heart fluttering.","As long as things didn't go too far, there was no harm in a little fun, right?","She promised herself she wouldn't catch feelings. She was just enjoying the view. She wouldn't get this kind of treatment after the divorce, anyway.","Shen Linyan stood up, but realized she remained seated.","He looked down to find her staring up at him expectantly, her eyes sparkling.","He paused. \"Is something wrong?\"","An Ling tilted her body, slowly reclining against the sofa. Her face flushed as she closed her eyes, her voice hesitant and shy. \"...Do I have to be asleep for you to carry me?\"","Shen Linyan froze.","He stood there for several seconds, stunned. Then, his throat moved as he swallowed. A soft laugh escaped his lips, and he stepped toward her.","An Ling peeked with one eye and cooperatively reached out her arms.","Shen Linyan took her slender wrists, leaning down so she could wrap her arms around his neck.","His well-defined hands securely hooked under her knees while the other supported her lower back. His fingertips brushed against the soft skin of her waist through the thin fabric of her clothes, his warm palm pressing against her curves.","Her body was soft, carrying the faint, lingering scent of citrus and orchids from her shower. The man's breathing hitched for a second, his eyes darkening. In the next moment, he lifted her into a bridal carry, his grip tightening imperceptibly.","Skin pressed against skin; their body heat mingled.","The scent of citrus tangled with the cool, woody notes of his cologne.","The overwhelming masculine aura was almost dizzying. An Ling’s face was so red she didn't dare look up, burying her head against his firm chest instead.","Time seemed to stretch. The short walk to the bedroom felt incredibly long.","*Creak—*","The sound of the door opening felt startlingly loud in the quiet house.","The moonlight from the room spilled through the crack in the door.","Standing at the threshold, the man slowly lowered his head. When he spoke, his voice was hushed and laced with an unmistakable, lingering intimacy.","\"My lady... may I come in?\"","An Ling’s entire body went stiff.","Saying something like that at a time like this only made her mind flood with the scenes Jiang Mai had described before.","As the heat in her cheeks intensified, she buried her head and gave a tiny nod, her voice as faint as the hum of a mosquito. \"...Mm-hmm.\"","A soft, low chuckle seemed to ripple through the air.","The bedroom door slowly pulled shut, and the man’s broad shoulders gradually vanished behind it.","Darkness reclaimed the hallway, yet a faint, lingering trace of his scent remained, weaving through the air."]},{"number":30,"title":"Chapter 30: Is He Not Capable","paragraphs":["“You and Shen Linyuan actually slept together??!!!”","The exclamation erupted from the phone, and An Ling instinctively covered the receiver before realizing she was the only one home.","Still, she felt a strange twinge of guilt as she turned off the speakerphone. “Don’t get so excited, we didn’t! Didn’t I tell you? All he did last night was walk me back to my room...”","“You didn’t sleep together?”","Jiang Mai fell silent for a few seconds before slowly squeezing out a question:","“Is he... dysfunctional? Did you get a chance to feel...”","“Wait, wait a minute! What are you talking about?!” An Ling’s face turned bright red. “It was so dark, how could I have possibly... No, he just carried me back to rest! It wasn’t that kind of thing at all!”","She buried half her face in a throw pillow, her ears turning a shade of red that looked ready to bleed. She quickly tried to change the subject to hide her embarrassment. “Anyway, it’s not like that. Besides, do you really think that’s possible?”","Jiang Mai spoke in a low, suggestive tone. “Originally, it was impossible... but if you let it happen a few more times, humph... who knows~”","At that, she shifted her tone to a reminder. “But An Ling, you should remember what I told you.”","The conversation fell silent for a moment.","A moment later, the woman’s helpless chuckle came through the line.","“I haven’t forgotten.”","An Ling held the phone with one hand and pressed the back of her other hand against her cheek to cool down. She curled her lips into a slow smile. “I know Shen Linyuan only treats me this way because my current status is his wife.”","She hadn't gone out of her way to cause trouble for Shen Linyuan or sabotage their arranged marriage like the system might have wanted.","However, she wasn't much better. She was also taking advantage of Shen Linyuan’s nature—the fact that he was incapable of saying no.","On the first day she woke up here, in order to avoid getting into trouble herself, she had dragged the man down with her, letting them both take the heat from Mother Shen.","Later, because she liked Shen Linyuan’s face so much, she would intentionally find ways to get close to him.","For instance... that ring. The moment she gave it to him, An Ling knew exactly whether she was harboring selfish motives.","After all, there was more than one way to clear up a misunderstanding.","Perhaps it was because of these things that An Ling felt so angry when she saw Mother Shen’s blatant favoritism. It was more like a mask for her own guilty conscience.","She was already taking advantage of Shen Linyuan’s personality; why should anyone else be allowed to? If anyone was going to use him, it should be her—at least her life was currently tied to his, and she wouldn't actually hurt him.","Having these deliberately ignored thoughts brought back to the surface left An Ling’s mind in a bit of a mess. She lowered her eyes, set the pillow aside, and stood up.","“Don’t worry, I won’t fall for Shen Linyuan. It’s mostly just that I can’t seem to commit that face of his to memory, so every time I see him, I’m startled by how handsome he is.”","Shen Linyuan was indeed her ideal type, but she remained rational. She knew what she should and shouldn't do, and she had no desire to get tangled up in the protagonists' messy love affairs.","Hearing this, Jiang Mai was quiet for a moment before letting out a long, slow sigh, her voice tinged with a faint sadness:","“It’s over, An Ling. You’ve raised a flag. According to novel tropes, once you say something like that, you’re definitely going to fall in love later.”","Pausing for emphasis, she added:","“No matter what genre of novel it is, no one escapes this law.”","“...”","An Ling laughed as she opened her bedroom door. “Alright, alright, just pretend I didn’t say anything. Let’s leave it at that; I need to change. I’m meeting Ms. Chen this afternoon.”","“OK, get to work.”","After hanging up, An Ling placed her phone on the desk. Her gaze caught a shopping bag out of the corner of her eye, and she paused.","She opened the bag and took out the box inside.","Inside was a dark silk tie. The fabric had a brilliant, lustrous sheen, featuring a subtle, shimmering silver pattern that looked both regal and sophisticated.","When she had been browsing the mall last night, she had spotted this tie and immediately felt it would suit Shen Linyuan perfectly. By the time she realized what she was doing, she had already swiped her card.","She wasn't surprised that she had paid for it; she had even come up with an excuse to give it to him, telling herself it was a return gift for the fountain pen.","It was just that last night, she had been so lightheaded from the man’s gentle tone that she had completely forgotten about the gift.","An Ling smiled and closed the box, putting it back in the bag.","“I should find a time to give this to him soon.”","That afternoon, An Ling met Ms. Chen downstairs at the company, and the two of them took the elevator up together.","As the elevator doors closed, Ms. Chen turned to her. “Did you look over the files I sent you yesterday? Since things have already started, there might not be much time for you to adjust.”","“I looked through them. I have a general idea of the workflow now.” She had spent the morning reviewing the documents at home.","Ms. Chen gave a nod of approval. “We happen to be short-staffed on executive producers, so your arrival is a huge help. The investor this time is Shihe Media. Their goal is to boost the popularity of the artists under their banner. We’re meeting with their team today.”","As she spoke, she raised an eyebrow and glanced over.","“Among those celebrities is Shen Fuyuan. I heard she’s one of the ones they’re pushing the hardest.”","“...”","An Ling paused. “So, will Shen Fuyuan be there today?”","“Most likely. After all, the purpose of today’s meeting is to communicate before filming begins.”","Ms. Chen knew a little bit about the marriage alliance between An Ling and the Shen family, which was why she had asked An Ling yesterday if she was alright with the arrangement.","She patted An Ling on the shoulder. \"It’s fine. They haven’t arrived yet. Go ahead and meet your other colleagues first to get familiar with the environment.\"","An Ling nodded.","After exiting the elevator, Ms. Chen led her to a small conference room. When she opened the door, she found seven or eight people sitting inside, all wearing employee badges around their necks.","Seeing Ms. Chen enter, they stood up one after another. \"Ms. Chen, are the people from Shihe Media here?\"","Ms. Chen gestured for them to stay seated. \"No, not yet. Everyone, sit down. I’ve brought a new partner to join us. Didn't I mention it in the group chat yesterday?\"","At her words, it finally clicked for everyone. Late last night, Ms. Chen had suddenly announced in the group chat that an executive producer would be joining the team, but she hadn't given a name, saying she wanted to keep it a surprise.","The previously tense atmosphere instantly relaxed.","\"Oh, so it’s a newcomer! Ms. Chen, you were being so mysterious that you really piqued my curiosity.\"","\"Brother Chen and Brother Nan were placing bets this morning on whether it was a man or a woman.\"","\"Quick, introduce us! It’s been ages since we’ve had a new face around here.\"","Hearing the lively discussion, Ms. Chen smiled and stepped aside, signaling toward the hallway. \"An Ling, come say hello to everyone.\"","The woman walked in from outside, her eyes curving slightly as a perfect smile graced her beautiful face. \"Hello, everyone. I am An Ling.\"","In an instant, the once-chattering conference room fell dead silent.","Everyone froze, their gazes fixed in unison on the doorway.","An Ling struggled to maintain her smile. Was this... because they recognized her?","Just as she was about to turn to Ms. Chen for help, she heard someone let out a disappointed \"Huh?\"","\"Ms. Chen, this isn't fair. You should have told us you were filming a variety show! You even brought in a celebrity to prank us. Where did you hide the cameras? I don't see them anywhere.\"","\"Hidden cameras? Is this another prank show? Ms. Chen, you’ve become quite the trickster.\"","\"You can't fool us; we’re seasoned veterans at this, haha!\"","\"Though, I haven't seen this star before. Did she just debut? She’s incredibly gorgeous.\"","\"Wait, isn't Shihe Media sending people over soon? Is it okay for you to be filming like this? Should we just play along to give you some footage so we can wrap this up quickly?\"","An Ling and Ms. Chen: \"...\"","Just what on earth had these people been through in the past?"]},{"number":31,"title":"Chapter 31: That's Your Sister-in-Law","paragraphs":["Seeing the disbelief on everyone's faces, Ms. Chen said with an amused smile, \"What are you all talking about? An Ling really is going to be our colleague from now on. She’ll also be participating in the filming of 'Star Life'.\"","Seeing that they still looked skeptical, she arched an eyebrow, walked over to sit in a chair, and slowly let out a bombshell:","\"And besides, she is Ah Leng.\"","The room fell silent for a split second.","Then, someone let out a gasp of surprise, and An Ling was instantly surrounded by the crowd.","\"Holy crap, for real? Am I seeing the legend in person??\"","\"The real Ah Leng?! Ms. Chen, you aren't pulling our legs, are you?\"","\"You're Ah Leng? My god! You're actually this beautiful behind the screen.\"","\"I’ve always heard Ms. Chen had a favorite student who suddenly left two years ago. Man, I can't believe I'm meeting the real deal today.\"","\"Ah Leng... no, An Ling, hello, hello! I'm Chen Yikuan, in charge of post-production operations. Looking forward to working together.\"","\"An Ling, I'm Nan Zhechuan, also an executive producer. I hope we get along well.\"","\"Hello, hello,\" An Ling replied with a smile, shaking hands one by one. Her gaze swept over everyone's faces and hands, trying her best to remember each person's unique features.","Finally, the last woman walked over. She had straight hair, wore pearl earrings and gold-rimmed glasses, giving off the vibe of a gentle, easy-going older sister.","She smiled and extended her hand. \"What a surprise. Ah Leng... I mean, An Ling. I'm Lin Ya.\"","An Ling's eyes widened slightly, and then she spoke with a surprised smile, \"So it's Sister Lin Ya! Hello, hello. I also have to thank you for helping me get the word out.\"","Lin Ya waved her hand dismissively. \"Don't mention it. It was nothing.\"","Her gaze drifted naturally to the woman in front of her.","An Ling was wearing a simple white V-neck blouse paired with dark wide-leg trousers and a brown trench coat. Her jet-black curly hair was tied back in a casual low ponytail, framing an exquisite and beautiful face.","The outfit was simple and comfortable, yet it exuded an undeniable air of elegance. No wonder people had mistaken her for a celebrity.","Lin Ya arched an eyebrow, her voice tinged with admiration and a bit of teasing. \"I didn't expect that the Ah Leng who sounds so soft-spoken online would actually be such a stunning beauty in person.\"","An Ling smiled and returned the compliment, \"Sister Lin Ya is very beautiful as well.\"","The atmosphere in the meeting room was lively when someone knocked softly on the door, pushed it open, and said, \"Ms. Chen, the people from Shihe have arrived.\"","Just as Ms. Chen was about to stand up, she noticed the employee's expression was a bit complicated, as if hesitating to speak.","\"And... the CEO of Shihe Media is here too.\"","Ms. Chen was slightly stunned.","The CEO of Shihe Media?","\"Gu Xiaochi is here too?\"","-","Inside the reception room.","A girl with reddish-brown hair wore sunglasses, her expression cold as she sat with her arms crossed.","\"Hey, Gu Xiaochi.\"","Beside her, Gu Xiaochi was playing a mini-game on his phone. He looked up at her words.","\"What is it?\"","\"My team and I are here to coordinate for the variety show. What are you doing here as a big CEO?\"","\"Can't a CEO come to take a look?\" He put away his phone and looked at the angry young miss beside him. \"This is Miss Shen’s first time on a variety show. I have to keep an eye on things. Otherwise, before the show even starts filming, the headline about the Shen family daughter's terrible temper will be trending on the search rankings.\"","Shen Fuyuan impatiently took off her sunglasses and slammed them on the table, straightening her back. \"Don't exaggerate, okay? I only decided to take on this variety show because you guys kept saying I have a bad temper.\"","Gu Xiaochi glanced at the sunglasses that were nearly snapped. \"...You really don't think you have a big temper?\"","Shen Fuyuan frowned. \"No! Where is my temper big? No one ever said that when I was filming dramas, it's just you few people who always say it!\"","\"...\"","Would anyone on a film crew dare to tell you that?","Gu Xiaochi pinched the bridge of his nose and muttered, \"I don't know who's going to be in charge of your filming. Poor soul. It looks like I'll have to buy gifts for the staff in advance as mental compensation.\"","Shen Fuyuan snapped, \"Do you want to die?\"","She leaned back into her chair in annoyance, her brow still furrowed. \"Did Big Brother make you come? Does he also worry about me losing my temper? That seems unlikely, right?\"","Gu Xiaochi shrugged. \"You know it's unlikely. Shen Linyan said it straight out: if you cause any negative scandals, I'm to blackball you immediately. So, I'm here to supervise.\"","Shen Fuyuan: \"...\"","She stewed for a moment, not daring to say much more, so she changed the subject. \"He's so cold to his own sister, yet he plays the gentle act for that stupid woman. So hypocritical. Does he still not plan on getting a divorce?\"","Shen Fuyuan was the only one in the Shen family who knew Shen Linyan's true colors.","Regarding her brother marrying a \"stupid woman\" and even indulging her behavior—even though she knew there was a plan hidden behind it—even she couldn't stand it sometimes.","Hearing this, Gu Xiaochi recalled a certain person's comments in their group chat and arched an eyebrow. \"What 'stupid woman'? That's your sister-in-law.\"","Shen Fuyuan looked at him as if he were an idiot. \"Are you insane? Me, calling that woman sister-in-law? I'd rather die.\"","Rather die?","Well, you girl better wait for Shen Linyan to have a word with you.","Gu Xiaochi smiled meaningfully.","Shen Fuyuan felt creeped out by his smile and leaned away with a look of disgust. \"What are you smiling like a pervert for? It's creepy. Besides, I usually don't see her anyway. I haven't called her that since she married into the family.\"","As the two were chatting, there was a soft knock on the door.","When the door opened, Ms. Chen walked in with a smile.","\"President Gu, Miss Shen, sorry to keep you waiting.\"","Gu Xiaochi immediately dropped his casual demeanor and stood up with a polite smile. \"Not at all. Ms. Chen is so busy, we appreciate you taking the time to meet with us.\"","Shen Fuyuan also reached out to greet her. \"Hello, Ms. Chen.\"","\"Hello, hello.\"","Ms. Chen took a look at her face, her smile unchanging. \"Miss Shen is even more beautiful than she appears on television.\"","She withdrew her hand and turned to gesture behind her, stepping aside to make room.","\"These colleagues are the production team for this project. Some of you have met during the proposal phase, so we're here to discuss the preparations for the shoot.\"","Gu Xiaochi and Shen Fuyuan instinctively followed her movement. The next second, both of their gazes froze.","Among the crowd stood a striking figure.","The woman took a step forward, a faint smile appearing on that all-too-familiar beautiful face. She extended her hand, her fingers slender and her voice gentle and clear.","\"Hello to you both. I am the executive producer for this project, An Ling.\"","Shen Fuyuan: \"...\"","Gu Xiaochi: \"...\"","It's over.","Shen Fuyuan, I mean you're finished."]},{"number":32,"title":"Chapter 32: The woman's identity here is just a bug.","paragraphs":["After a brief silence, Gu Xiaochi was the first to take the initiative, smiling as he reached out to shake her hand.","\"Hello, Producer An. I am Gu Xiaochi from Shihe Media.\"","\"Hello, President Gu.\"","An Ling pretended not to notice the scrutiny and deeper meaning in the man's eyes.","She turned her gaze toward the dazed Shen Fuyuan and gave a polite, crinkled-eye smile. \"Miss Shen, I will be your executive producer from now on. I look forward to a pleasant collaboration.\"","Shen Fuyuan didn't say a word, her expression conflicted.","Once she regained her senses, she slowly knitted her brows and suddenly spoke up: \"I want a different executive producer.\"","\"...\"","Gu Xiaochi maintained his smile, playing deaf and mute. He absolutely would not interfere in this.","Hearing no response, Shen Fuyuan's frown deepened. She turned her head toward the man beside her who had suddenly lost his voice.","\"Gu Xiaochi, why are you suddenly not—\"","\"You can't change it.\"","The woman's gentle voice suddenly cut her off.","Shen Fuyuan paused midsentence, turning her head with a mix of shock and indignation. \"What did you say?\"","\"I said, you can't change it,\" An Ling said with a smiling curve to her eyes. \"Your executive producer is me.\"","\"No... based on what!?\" The girl's eyes widened, her voice rising in pitch. \"I want a change!\"","An Ling lowered her head, calmly flipping through the documents in her hand.","\"Including you, there are four guest stars for this shoot. We also have four executive producers following the shoot. The pairings have already been decided; they cannot be changed.\"","Shen Fuyuan didn't understand. \"What does that have to do with switching people? I'll just swap with someone else.\"","An Ling's tone remained steady and unhurried.","\"Because no one else wants to follow Miss Shen.\"","\"...\"","In that instant, it was as if the pause button had been pressed in the conference room. It was terrifyingly quiet.","Gu Xiaochi pursed his lips tightly, terrified that he might laugh out loud.","When she finally processed it, Shen Fuyuan's expression was one of pure disbelief. \"...What did you say?\"","The woman blinked and slowly let out a soft laugh. \"Do I need to be clearer? Miss Shen, because you have a bit of a temper, no one was willing to film you. I was the only one willing to take this on.\"","An Ling wasn't lying. On the way here, her other colleagues had already been venting to her about Shen Fuyuan.","They said this pampered young lady had a terrible temper, like a firecracker that exploded at the slightest touch.","Everyone was afraid to film her, fearing they would upset the heiress and lose their jobs.","Seeing the headache-inducing expressions on all her colleagues' faces, An Ling had taken the initiative to say she would handle Shen Fuyuan.","No joke—at that moment, everyone looked at her as if she were a savior.","Snapping back to the present, An Ling looked at the sister-in-law before her and smiled gently. Her smile was professional and her tone polite, yet she left no room for negotiation.","\"I heard Miss Shen is going on the show to improve her image. If things continue like this, I'm afraid the broadcast will only have the opposite effect. If Miss Shen is truly unwilling, you can choose to terminate the contract right now.\"","\"You!!\"","Shen Fuyuan gritted her teeth in fury, pointing a finger at the woman indignantly, yet she didn't know what to say.","In the past, anyone who dared to speak to her like this would have been packing their bags and leaving.","But the woman in front of her was her eldest brother's wife—her sister-in-law in name.","This woman's identity was a total bug in the system!!","She took a deep breath, slowly curling her extended finger back into a fist while grinding her teeth.","\"Fine! Then it's you. I won't change!\"","You want to follow me, right? Then let's see who breaks first!","After the general details were finalized, Ms. Chen walked over during a break, handed her a latte, and whispered, \"Is everything okay?\"","An Ling closed the organized file, took the latte, and gave her a reassuring look with a smile. \"No problem.\"","Shen Fuyuan had to care about her status as a daughter of the Shen family while also maintaining her public image as an idol; she wasn't that difficult to deal with.","It was just the man next to Shen Fuyuan—his gaze was very strange.","It didn't quite seem like scrutiny; it was more like the curiosity of someone watching a spectacle.","She didn't think she had met him before...","But Gu Xiaochi seemed to know her.","Furthermore, he seemed very close to Shen Fuyuan, even accompanying her here.","An Ling took a thoughtful sip of the latte, her thumb rubbing against the cup as she looked at Ms. Chen, who was busy sending messages nearby.","\"Ms. Chen, President Gu from Shihe Media seems to value Shen Fuyuan very much. Has it always been like this?\"","Ms. Chen looked up, thought for a moment, and replied, \"I suppose? I remember Shen Fuyuan signed with Shihe from the start, and Shihe has given her a lot of good resources.\"","An Ling nodded and continued drinking her latte.","In 그that case, either he wanted to maintain a good relationship with the Shen Corporation, or he was very close to the Shen family.","Was he close to Shen Linyan? Or Lu Jingshen?","Meanwhile, on the other side, Gu Xiaochi saw that he was no longer needed and made an excuse to return to his company.","Sitting in his car, he couldn't resist picking up his phone to send a message to Shen Linyan.","[I accompanied Shen Fuyuan to talk about the variety show today. That girl still couldn't keep her temper in check. The moment she saw the executive producer, she demanded a replacement.]","Five minutes after the message was sent, there was no sign of a reply from the other side.","Gu Xiaochi waited for a bit, wondering if Shen Linyan had seen it but didn't want to reply. After all, the man did that often.","He thought for a moment, then typed again:","“Actually, it was quite a coincidence. I ran into someone we both know while I was over there today.”","Ten minutes passed, and the other side remained silent.","Gu Xiaochi squinted, letting out a sharp breath. “Good grief. I can’t even bait him! He’s not biting at all!”","Left with no other choice, he shifted his posture and picked up his phone to type again.","[An Ling is actually Shen Fuyuan’s executive producer.]","The very next second, a message popped up on the screen.","Shen Linyan: [?]","Gu Xiaochi: “...”","The guy was online after all! He just didn't want to reply to the previous messages!","However, seeing that question mark made Gu Xiaochi grin again.","[You didn't know?]","To think there was actually something Shen Linyan didn’t know!","Gu Xiaochi’s interest was piqued once more, and he tapped away at the screen. [Shen Fuyuan and I were both stunned. Her face dropped instantly and she even demanded a replacement, but your wife just smiled and fired back. She shut her up so fast, it was hilarious.]","[But seriously, you really didn't know? My sister-in-law didn't tell you? She doesn't look like she just started the job.]","In the penthouse office of the Shen Corporation building.","A man sat in his executive chair, half of his face bathed in sunlight. His features were clean-cut and elegant; beneath his gentle, refined expression lay a layer of faint detachment.","His pale fingers lightly stroked a fountain pen. There was no emotion in the curve of his lips as his dark eyes stared calmly at the screen.","A moment later, Gu Xiaochi received a reply.","Shen Linyan: [In a marriage of convenience, there is no need to report every little thing. This is An Ling’s private matter. Tell Shen Fuyuan to behave herself.]","Gu Xiaochi’s eyebrows shot up. “Private matter?”","But it made sense. After all, Shen Linyan and that woman were only married for business.","He had thought their relationship had become something special, but it seemed their boundaries were still as rigid as ever.","***","In the breakroom.","An Ling glanced at the clock on the wall, sensing that her break was almost over.","She crushed her empty paper cup, tossed it into the trash, and picked up her documents to go find Shen Fuyuan. Before leaving, she grabbed her phone off the table.","The screen lit up automatically.","She gave it a casual glance, then her eyes paused.","A message from a few minutes ago caught her eye.","Shen Linyan: [My dear, I have a social engagement tonight. I won’t be home for dinner.]"]},{"number":33,"title":"Chapter 33: Guess Why She Calls Me Mrs. Shen","paragraphs":["Seeing the message, An Ling stopped what she was doing to reply.","[Alright. I have plans tonight too; I'll be eating out. I’ll let Auntie Cheng know in a bit.]","Today was her first day on the job, and her colleagues had suggested dinner together. She had originally intended to tell Shen Linyan about it, but seeing Shen Fuyuan had made her forget.","As soon as she sent the message, the status at the top of the chat window flickered for a moment.","But then, it returned to silence.","An Ling waited for a while. Seeing that the man hadn't sent anything new and unsure of what he wanted to say, she eventually sent another message herself.","An Ling: [Remember to say no (╹◡╹)]","Shen Linyan: [Okay.]","She turned off her screen and was about to shove her phone back into her pocket when another message suddenly popped up.","Shen Linyan: [Will you be drinking while dining with your friends? Do you need me to pick you up, Madam?]","Dining with friends? Drinking?","There were so many points in that one sentence that needed correcting that An Ling didn't quite know how to respond.","However, since she was eating with colleagues tonight, there would probably be some alcohol involved, right? Shen Linyan was likely worried about her face blindness.","An Ling couldn't help but chuckle. He truly lived up to his role as the \"gentle second male lead\"—his consideration for others was impeccable.","She typed back slowly.","[Yes. I'll send you the location later (⑉••⑉)]","Shen Linyan: [Understood, Madam (⑉••⑉)]","Pushing open the door to the reception room, An Ling looked at the young woman sitting on the sofa. \"Shen Fuyuan, let’s talk.\"","Shen Fuyuan gave a cold laugh, crossing her legs with casual arrogance. \"Finally stopped pretending, have you? I have nothing to talk about with you. If you’re trying to use me to get to Lu Jingshen, you’re dead wrong.\"","\"I'm referring to the program filming.\"","\"...\"","Shen Fuyuan's expression stiffened for a second. \"You’re calling me directly by my name when talking business? Where’s your professional etiquette?\"","An Ling smiled and uttered three words:","\"I feel like it.\"","\"...\"","\"Of course, you can call me 'Sister-in-law' instead. I don't mind.\"","\"...\"","Pretending not to notice the barely suppressed rage in the girl's eyes, An Ling pulled out a chair and sat down unhurriedly.","\"Since this is your first time participating in a variety show, let me be clear. Before filming begins, I need to understand your daily routine and your schedule for the days of the shoot to ensure no accidents occur during production.\"","Shen Fuyuan narrowed her eyes, then suddenly raised an eyebrow and smirked. \"You want to know my daily routine?\"","An Ling nodded. \"Yes.\"","\"Fine, but I don't like talking—it's too much trouble. Why don't you just follow me personally?\"","Shen Fuyuan slowly put on her sunglasses, a bright smile playing on her lips that carried a hint of mischief.","\"I feel like going shopping. Want to come along, Producer An? Just the two of us.\"","Still wanting her to call her sister-in-law?","Just wait until she was stuck carrying all the shopping bags.","This woman had tricked her big brother so many times; Shen Fuyuan decided she would be generous enough to help her brother get some revenge for once.","Hearing this, An Ling blinked, glanced down at the time, and smiled.","\"Certainly.\"","Once they arrived at the mall, Shen Fuyuan adjusted her hat, glanced at the woman behind her, and let out a laugh.","\"Make sure you keep up.\"","An Ling raised an eyebrow slightly, her hands casually tucked into her pockets. \"Sure.\"","They walked into a luxury boutique. As the sales associate approached, Shen Fuyuan raised a hand to stop her before she could speak.","\"All the new arrivals for this season that are in stock—wrap them all up for me.\"","As she spoke, she caught a glimpse of the woman behind her who was slowly admiring the displays. She curled her lips into a smile and pointed a finger.","\"Give them to her to carry.\"","The sales associate was taken aback. She turned to look at An Ling to confirm. \"Is that lady going to carry them all by herself?\"","Although there weren't many new items in stock, there were still over a dozen. Giving them all to one girl to carry?","The associate pulled her gaze back and said with a smile, \"If it's inconvenient for the two of you, our store actually offers a delivery service...\"","\"Ahem!!\"","Under Shen Fuyuan’s death glare, the smile on the associate's face froze. she quickly swallowed her words. \"Right away. Please wait a moment.\"","Hearing the commotion, An Ling looked up from the new seasonal ornaments in the display cabinet.","As she raised her head, she saw the mischievous glint in Shen Fuyuan's eyes beneath the brim of her hat. \"Producer An, usually my bodyguards carry these. Today, I’ve made an exception to come here just for you, so you won't mind helping me carry them, right?\"","An Ling’s tone was playful. \"Me? Carry them?\"","\"That’s right.\" The girl spoke with an air of complete entitlement, lounging back on the sofa and waving her hand as if helpless.","\"I have no choice. You know there isn't much stock. If I wait too long, they might be gone.\"","An Ling sat down opposite her, leaning casually against the arm of the sofa. She said unhurriedly, \"So you only came here to buy the latest arrivals? Nothing else?\"","\"Yep.\" Shen Fuyuan pulled down her mask slightly, grinning brilliantly. \"It's only a dozen or so items. That shouldn't be too much trouble for Producer An, right?\"","An Ling blinked and smiled slowly.","\"A dozen is too few. Why don't we just take the entire seasonal collection?\"","Shen Fuyuan was stunned. \"What?\"","The whole collection?","\"Are you crazy? That's impossible—\"","Before she could finish, a sales associate suddenly walked over.","The woman wore a manager's badge on her chest. She bowed with a smile and handed a small cake to An Ling.","\"Mrs. Shen, I am so sorry. Our staff are all new and didn't recognize you. What brings you here so suddenly?\"","An Ling waved it off, indicating it was fine. \"I recall that this season's new arrivals haven't been delivered to the house yet?\"","\"That's correct. The items are ready. If you need them, we can have them sent to your home right now.\"","An Ling nodded toward Shen Fuyuan, who sat opposite her, and said with a smile, \"Don't send them to my place. Send them to that lady's house instead.\"","\"Understood.\"","After the manager left, Shen Fuyuan was still in a daze. \"...What does this mean? You can just get the entire seasonal collection?\"","An Ling blinked and tilted her head with a smile.","\"Why do you think she called me Mrs. Shen?\"","At those words, Shen Fuyuan’s eyes widened. \"???\"","Damn it! Brother, you never treated me like this! I begged you for those items before and you wouldn't give them to me!","Has the acting reached this level of commitment already?!","Refusing to believe it, Shen Fuyuan stood up abruptly and gritted her teeth. \"I'm switching stores!\"","It had to be a coincidence. It couldn't possibly be like this in other shops!","A few minutes later...","\"Mrs. Shen, you've arrived...\"","\"Mrs. Shen, please have some water...\"","\"Mrs. Shen, we've specially reserved the limited-edition new arrivals for you...\"","\"Mrs. Shen...\"","The completely ignored Shen Fuyuan: \"...\"","Her face turned red with anger. She turned and stormed out of the store, gnashing her teeth in fury.","Insane! Big Brother has absolutely lost his mind!","Why give this woman so many perks? No wonder she isn't afraid of causing trouble every day!","The woman behind her followed with leisurely steps, her voice drawling, \"Does Miss Shen want to shop anywhere else?\"","\"...\"","Just as Shen Fuyuan was about to turn around and snap at her, a surprised female voice came from a nearby store.","\"...Shen Fuyuan?\"","An Ling instinctively glanced over, thinking it was a fan who had recognized her, and didn't pay it much mind.","But then, she heard Shen Fuyuan’s startled voice.","\"Zhou Wen?\"","An Ling paused mid-motion. She turned her head and squinted to get a better look.","It really did seem to be the female lead.","At that moment, her gaze met that of Zhou Wen, who was walking out of the store.","The moment she saw An Ling, the expression on Zhou Wen's face stiffened, and her footsteps faltered.","\"...Sister-in-law.\"","She seemed somewhat intimidated by An Ling, her voice weak as she called out. Her gaze shifted hesitantly between Shen Fuyuan and An Ling, a forced smile tugging at the corners of her mouth.","\"Are you two... out shopping together?\" she asked, her tone laced with uncertainty."]},{"number":34,"title":"Chapter 34: Giving a Tie to Shen Linyan","paragraphs":["Seeing Zhou Wen here, An Ling quickly recalled the plot.","She didn't say anything, just lazily glanced at Zhou Wen, her mind flashing with scenes of what might happen next.","Could it be that Lu Jingshen is also nearby? Waiting for her to humiliate Zhou Wen so he can jump out and play the hero saving the beauty.","After all, this kind of scene had happened before.","During the ambiguous phase between the male and female leads, when Zhou Wen was buying a birthday gift for Lu Jingshen, she, as the vicious supporting female character, happened to see it and ruthlessly humiliated her.","She even publicly stomped on the gift, sneering, \"How dare you give such a shabby thing to Brother Jingshen.\"","The next second, Lu Jingshen appeared, and what followed was the two of them jointly putting the vicious supporting character in her place.","The resurrected memory surfaced in An Ling's mind, giving her a chill.","She lazily shoved her hands into her pockets, looking completely detached.","Forget it, she wouldn't do that again now.","As long as she stays silent, how can the plot advance? How can the hero save the beauty?","Don't even think about using her as a plot device.","Seeing An Ling not responding, Zhou Wen felt somewhat awkward.","Fortunately, Shen Fuyuan scoffed coldly at that moment: \"Who would go shopping with her?\"","As she spoke, she casually glanced at the shop behind Zhou Wen.","It was a custom menswear shop for tailored suits, handmade and expensive.","She asked offhandedly, \"Are you here to buy clothes for Second Brother?\"","Hearing this, Zhou Wen turned to look, instinctively shaking her head, \"No, I'm here to buy...\"","But as if remembering something, her voice abruptly stopped.","She looked at An Ling beside her with a hint of panic in her eyes, nodded slightly, her voice tinged with guilt.","\"Yes... I'm here to buy something for Jingshen...\"","Shen Fuyuan's expression became subtle.","Oho, something's going on! And it involves An Ling!","Only a fool would pass up watching some drama.","Shen Fuyuan glanced at An Ling, who looked completely unbothered, walked over to Zhou Wen, and smilingly slung an arm over her shoulder.","\"Since you're also here shopping, let's go together. Why be so hesitant? Just say what you want to buy. I can even help you brainstorm.\"","Zhou Wen's expression was somewhat troubled.","After a moment's thought, she still whispered softly, \"Actually... I'm here to buy a gift for Eldest Brother.\"","Her voice was neither loud nor soft, but it just happened to reach An Ling's ears.","\"......\"","An Ling's expression paused slightly. Her originally casual gaze gradually focused as she turned to look over, her face expressionless.","For whom?","Did she just hallucinate?","As if sensing the shift in atmosphere, Zhou Wen quickly waved her hands to smooth things over: \"Sister-in-law, I don't mean anything else! It's just that I've troubled Eldest Brother so much lately; I just wanted to give him a gift to thank him!\"","Shen Fuyuan's eyes lit up beside her.","Ha! That woman's expression changed!","Watching the drama unfold with relish, she said with a grin, \"For Eldest Brother? What are you getting him? A suit?\"","An Ling's gaze remained calm, and she didn't speak.","Zhou Wen cautiously looked up at her, shook her head, and pursed her lips, saying, \"I... plan to give a tie...\"","An Ling: \".........\"","Remembering the tie at home that she hadn't yet given, she fell silent for a moment, ultimately unable to suppress a short, soft laugh, lowering her eyes to hide the coldness within.","Damn plot, it really knows how to push people's buttons.","It knows exactly what development is the most melodramatic.","She had underestimated it.","An Ling pulled her hands out of her pockets and said leisurely, \"Giving a tie to Shen Linyan?\"","Zhou Wen forced a smile to explain: \"Sister-in-law, please don't misunderstand, I really don't mean anything, I just want to express my gratitude...\"","Before she could finish, the woman interrupted her.","\"What kind are you planning to give?\"","An Ling slowly walked into the shop, her tone casual, \"Let me have a look too.\"","Let her see if it could get even more melodramatic.","As soon as she said this, both Zhou Wen and Shen Fuyuan turned their heads in unison.","They stared blankly as An Ling entered the shop, unable to tell what the woman was thinking at that moment.","When the tie Zhou Wen had picked out was placed in front of her, An Ling glanced at it.","Seems it hasn't reached that level of melodrama yet.","She had thought it might be the same one.","The tie Zhou Wen had chosen was silver with a subtle pattern, elegant and sophisticated.","Shen Fuyuan, standing to the side, saw the tie and gave a slight curl of his lip, but didn't say anything.","Zhou Wen spoke up with a smile: \"I think this tie suits Eldest Brother very well...\"","\"I don't think it looks good.\"","The woman's sudden interjection cut her off.","Zhou Wen's smile stiffened. \"Sister-in-law, you think... it doesn't look good?\"","She quickly lowered her head again. \"Then, Sister-in-law, what do you think looks good?\"","\"None of them look good.\"","An Ling dropped this sentence and turned to leave, casually waving a hand, \"Of course, this is just my opinion. You don't have to listen to me. You can still give it to Shen Linyan. He'll probably accept it.\"","What 'probably'—he definitely would accept it.","Just as she was about to step out the door, Zhou Wen's voice sounded from behind again.","\"Then... I also prepared another gift. Sister-in-law, what do you think about men's cologne?\"","An Ling's footsteps halted.","She turned her head, thought for a moment, then slowly tilted her head with a smile.","\"Whatever.\"","Anyway, whatever you give, Shen Linyan will take it.","-","After leaving the shop, An Ling took out her phone to check messages.","Colleagues in the group chat were discussing where to eat dinner and had tagged her, asking when she'd be back.","She replied: 【Already finished. Heading back now.】","Just after replying and planning to go get her car, she heard Shen Fuyuan's panting voice from behind.","\"Damn, woman, your legs are so long, you walk way too fast!\"","An Ling paused, turning around in surprise to look at Shen Fuyuan behind her.","\"Do you still need something?\"","Shen Fuyuan: \"...\"","She laughed in exasperation. \"What do you mean by that? Shouldn't it be you who needs something from me?\"","Had this person forgotten why they came here?","But An Ling just tapped her phone screen.","\"Miss Shen, I'm off work now, and you're off work too. Let's each go our separate ways.\"","\"...\"","Shen Fuyuan snorted, not pursuing that topic further. She straightened up and looked at An Ling sideways: \"Hey, just now when Zhou Wen was buying a gift for Eldest Brother, I got the feeling you were in a pretty bad mood? Don't you like Second Brother? You should take this chance to buy a gift for him too.\"","An Ling slowly walked towards her car. \"I wasn't in a bad mood. I just think life can be so dramatic sometimes.\"","Apart from that tiny bit of discomfort in her heart, she really didn't feel much. At most, she felt a little regretful.","That tie of hers probably wouldn't be given now.","But she also felt a bit relieved, relieved that she hadn't fallen for Shen Linyan after all.","Otherwise, encountering a situation like this, if Shen Linyan chose Zhou Wen's tie, wouldn't she be utterly miserable?","Shen Fuyuan followed behind, her gaze scrutinizing the woman's back, her thoughts unclear.","After a while, she suddenly let out a slow sigh, her tone relaxing.","\"Ah, but you weren't wrong either. That tie really wasn't nice. Tacky and cheap-looking, very tasteless.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","That line sounded familiar. How did the vicious supporting character's lines end up here?","She stopped walking and turned around with a strange look. \"You're telling me this?\"","Shen Fuyuan shrugged under her gaze. \"What? It's not like I'm wrong. I gave one before too. Later I found out Eldest Brother never wears that kind. He only wears custom-made ones. Anything Zhou Wen gives will just end up buried at the bottom of a drawer.\"","An Ling thought of her own tie, lowered her eyelids, turned around, and continued walking towards the car.","\"That's not necessarily true. Perhaps it's just that the person giving it wasn't the right one.\"","They simply couldn't compare to the female lead."]},{"number":35,"title":"Chapter 35: Now the Lady Finally Recognizes Me","paragraphs":["The dinner party was held at a famous local restaurant.","Throughout the meal, everyone was still buzzing about the events of the day.","\"You guys have no idea. When An Ling stood up to the Shen heiress, I was terrified and exhilarated at the same time!\"","\"Haha, me too! I was thinking, this new colleague just arrived today, is she going to be fired already?\"","\"As expected of Ms. Chen's student! Her ability to control the room was incredible. It was so satisfying to watch, haha!\"","\"She handled the most difficult person for us. We really owe An Ling a toast.\"","With that, someone raised their glass.","An Ling smiled and picked up her own glass. \"No, no, I was actually scared too. I just forced myself to go through with it.\"","With one person leading the way, several other colleagues stood up to offer toasts.","After a few glasses, Ms. Chen frowned and cut them off. \"Alright, that’s enough. Drink your own drinks and stop pestering An Ling. This is a dinner, not a drinking contest.\"","The colleagues quickly waved their hands in apology. \"Sorry, sorry! An Ling, we're just so happy to have a new colleague.\"","An Ling signaled that it was fine with a smile. \"It’s okay. It’s just that I’m not a very good drinker. Please, everyone, just enjoy yourselves.\"","As she sat down, Ms. Chen lowered her voice and asked, \"Did you drive? Don't drive later; call for a designated driver.\"","An Ling shook her head. \"I didn't drive. My husband is coming to pick me up.\"","Lin Ya, who was sitting nearby, overheard this and instinctively lowered her voice in surprise. \"You're already married?\"","They were speaking softly, and with the other colleagues being loud and boisterous from the alcohol, no one else heard them for the moment.","An Ling looked up and nodded at her with a smile. \"Yes.\"","Lin Ya arched an eyebrow. \"Well, it seems you and your husband have a great relationship if he’s making a special trip to pick you up after a work dinner.\"","\"...\"","Ms. Chen, who knew the truth, remained silent.","An Ling let out a soft laugh and gave a vague response. \"No, no, it's just average. He happened to be finishing up his own social engagement nearby, so he’s just picking me up on the way.\"","A great relationship?","It probably wouldn't stay \"great\" for much longer.","-","After the gathering ended, An Ling saw Ms. Chen into a car and then waited for Shen Linyan by the entrance.","She looked down at her phone. Shen Fuyuan, whom she had just added that afternoon, suddenly sent a message.","Shen Fuyuan: Oh ho~ I heard Zhou Wen actually delivered it.","An Ling’s gaze paused. While she was hesitating whether to reply, Shen Fuyuan sent another message.","Shen Fuyuan: Humph, you want to ask me how I know? Naturally, it's because I asked Zhou Wen. She said she gave it to Big Brother tonight. Guess if he accepted it or not? Beg me and I'll tell you the result. (≖‿≖)","Shen Fuyuan: But she did end up giving him that ugly tie. She gave him the perfume, too.","Below these words was a disgusted emoji.","Tonight?","Wasn't Shen Linyan at a business social tonight?","And what was there to guess? Would Shen Linyan ever refuse Zhou Wen?","After thinking for a moment, An Ling replied.","An Ling: Why are you telling me this? By the way, Ms. Shen, have you received the new arrivals you wanted to buy today? You should at least cooperate with me regarding your schedule tomorrow, right?","The other side went silent instantly.","It took several seconds before a slightly reluctant reply came through.","Shen Fuyuan: Received them, received them. For the sake of these things, I’ll cooperate with you a little bit.","An Ling chuckled and replied with an \"OK\" emoji.","After finishing the conversation, she stared at Shen Fuyuan's previous messages for a long while, murmuring softly, \"So he really took that tie...\"","If Shen Linyan wore that tie, even his face probably wouldn't be able to save his look.","Maybe then, she wouldn't like that face of his quite so much.","An Ling gave a helpless smile and put her phone away. When she looked up again, she noticed a man standing not far away.","The man was dressed in a suit, with long legs, broad shoulders, and a narrow waist—his proportions were exceptional.","In the dim light of dusk, he stood quietly in the distance, looking in her direction.","An Ling froze.","...Shen Linyan?","Was it him?","It was too dark to see clearly; she could only make out a blurry silhouette, but it felt like him.","the moment she looked over, the man started walking toward her.","As the distance closed and the face became clear, An Ling’s eyes flickered.","She remained standing where she was, her gaze instinctively sweeping over his tie.","As the man reached her, his tall shadow loomed over her. The familiar scent of woody pine filled her nose, and his voice was clear and gentle.","\"Has my wife been drinking?\"","Drinking?","Startled by the sudden question, An Ling blinked blankly before she couldn't help but burst into laughter. \"I have. Why didn't you come over just now?\"","The man lowered his head and smiled softly. His expression was tender, and his eyelashes cast faint shadows over his eyes, which were filled with a light shimmer of amusement.","\"Because I was waiting for my wife to slowly realize it was me. After all, if my wife didn't recognize my face and mistook me for a bad guy, what would I do?\"","He reached out his hand, his voice growing even more gentle in the night air.","\"Now that you've finally recognized me, shall we go home?\"","The night was as dark as ink, and the wind carried a hint of chill. The man's palm was broad, exuding an indescribable sense of security, making it easy to imagine the warmth of being enveloped by his hand.","An Ling didn't move. She looked down quietly, the night breeze blowing away the last of her intoxication.","In this moment, she suddenly felt a strong urge to refuse—to refuse this indiscriminate tenderness.","An inexplicable temper brewed within her, a frustration she felt too weak to even voice.","Could it be the alcohol making her overly sensitive?","An Ling’s fingertips, hanging at her side, curled slightly.","Finally, she lifted her head and offered her hand with a smile, her tone sounding no different than usual.","\"With a face like yours, Chairman Shen, you don't look like a bad man no matter how one looks at it.\"","Her cool fingertips brushed against his warm, dry palm, and in the next second, the man gripped her hand firmly.","Walking beside him, her hand held in his, she was enveloped in a seamless warmth that chased away the night chill.","Yet, at this moment, An Ling felt none of the heart-fluttering excitement she had experienced the night before.","She even felt a sudden urge to shake him off, a psychological aversion to the contact and the warmth he offered.","An Ling lowered her head, her expression a bit dazed.","She thought to herself that Jiang Mai’s previous worries had been making a mountain out of a molehill.","See? Love and hate can flip in a heartbeat.","She didn't like Shen Linyan right now.","She didn't even like his face anymore; in fact, she found him a bit annoying—annoyed that he had come to pick her up, and annoyed by his gentle, considerate nature.","They were only in a marriage of convenience; there was no need for him to go this far.","An Ling could vaguely sense why she felt this way.","The truth was, after experiencing Shen Linyan’s tenderness, she found herself caught between thinking it was wonderful and resenting him for treating everyone the same way.","Not being able to have it makes one frustrated.","Having it, only to realize everyone else gets it too, is even more frustrating.","It wasn't that she didn't like Shen Linyan; it was that she had developed a sense of possessiveness over that tenderness.","But Shen Linyan liked Zhou Wen.","Zhou Wen was his \"White Moonlight,\" his savior, so it was only logical for him to accept a gift from her.","As for her...","The tenderness Shen Linyan showed her was merely his standard setting; the only exception was reserved for Zhou Wen.","Had it been any other woman as his wife, he would have treated her exactly the same way.","Her thoughts were like a tangled mess of string, knotted together without rhyme or reason, dragging her emotions down with them.","Just then, the man’s voice sounded in her ear.","\"You seem to be in a bad mood tonight, Madam. Did something upsetting happen today?\"","An Ling snapped out of it and looked up, intending to deny it.","But the words died in her throat.","She pursed her lips and forced a smile. \"It's nothing. When did your social engagement end?\"","\"There wasn't much going on tonight, so it ended early. I was at home waiting for your message,\" Shen Linyan replied naturally, hiding nothing.","Reaching the car, he opened the passenger door for An Ling.","She got in and buckled her seatbelt.","As the man entered the car, she caught a glimpse of the wedding ring on his left hand as he fastened his own seatbelt. Her gaze faltered for a moment before she slowly looked away.","Throughout the drive, the cabin remained silent.","The atmosphere was even more hushed and strained than during their very first meeting.","While waiting at a red light, Shen Linyan turned to look at her.","She was leaning against the headrest, her head turned toward the window. Her eyelashes cast long shadows under her eyes, and she looked listless, appearing as though she had simply lost her energy from drinking too much.","The man’s eyes darkened, and he didn't pull his gaze away until the light was about to turn green.","His jaw tightened, his dark eyes devoid of emotion and clouded with a faint chill. His fingers tapped rhythmically against the steering wheel, his lips pressed into a flat line.","The car drove smoothly into the underground garage.","Just as he parked and unbuckled his seatbelt, about to speak, her voice suddenly rang out.","\"Shen Linyan, I ran into Zhou Wen at the mall today. She said she wanted to buy you a gift.\""]},{"number":36,"title":"Chapter 36: What Did Shen Linyan Call Her","paragraphs":["As soon as the words were spoken, the car cabin plunged into silence.","An Ling had finally been unable to hold back and said it.","Since she had this identity as his wife, why couldn't she use it?","Upon hearing this, the man's movements paused. He turned his head, his gentle eyes now quietly fixed on her.","An Ling looked up and met his gaze.","It was the first time she realized her own tone could be so calm.","\"She said she wanted to give you a tie and perfume, and even asked for my opinion, meaning it as a thank-you gift for you helping her.\"","Perhaps unable to bear the overly quiet atmosphere in the car, or perhaps not wanting to hear Shen Linyan's response.","She lowered her head and unbuckled her seatbelt, speaking softly as she did so, not giving the man a chance to speak at all.","\"But I thought the tie she picked wasn't very nice, so I didn't give any reference. So, I don't know what she ended up sending.\"","Once unbuckled, she hurriedly opened the car door.","Before her foot even stepped out, the man's voice suddenly came from behind.","\"I know. She sent them over tonight.\"","An Ling's body stiffened.","She didn't turn her head, just softly uttered an \"Mm.\"","The air fell silent again.","An Ling sat in her seat, her back to the man in silence.","Her smooth, long hair cascaded from her shoulders, barely revealing her profile. Her long, curled lashes trembled slightly, her soft, full lips pressed tightly together, and her slender fingers gripped the leather seat beneath her.","Shen Linyan's gaze fell on his young wife's fingers, clenched so tightly they were white. He lowered his head and gently unbuckled his own seatbelt.","A \"click\" sounded, startlingly abrupt in the silent cabin.","Like some sort of prompt sound.","An Ling's body on the seat visibly stiffened. Suddenly, she whispered, \"Shen Linyan, it seems... you've violated our agreement of mutual benefit again.\"","Her tone was very light, but her words came rapidly, carrying a barely perceptible hoarseness:","\"You accepted Zhou Wen's things, which means you're going to help her. Helping her is helping Lu Jingshen. I don't like Lu Jingshen. You helping Lu Jingshen means opposing me, and it also means you're helping your mother. Doesn't that play right into her hands? You said you didn't want to let me down, but you still helped them.\"","An Ling herself didn't even know what she was saying.","Her mind was a mess, she was just saying whatever came to mind. She didn't even hear the other car door open, nor notice the man getting out.","Only when the man's figure stood firmly before her did she abruptly stop speaking.","Remembering Jiang Mai's advice, An Ling regretfully closed her eyes.","Shouldn't have said so much.","Can't control her emotions once she drinks.","Something always happens every time she drinks.","She lowered her head, raised a hand to cover her forehead, shielding her eyes, her voice tinged with apology.","\"Sorry, I might be a little drunk. Let me collect myself.\"","A few glasses of wine weren't enough to make her drunk, but it was the best excuse right now.","An Ling took a deep breath. \"Just pretend I said nothing. Let's go up fir...\"","\"I refused her.\"","The man's gentle voice suddenly sounded above her head.","An Ling's gaze froze, her words instantly vanishing, her movements stopping along with them.","Before she could react, a strand of hair by her ear was gently hooked back.","A warm fingertip lightly brushed against her cheek, carrying a soothing sensation.","\"You told me to refuse, Madam. I listened to you.\"","The man slowly crouched down, looking up at her gently.","\"Were you in a bad mood tonight because of this? I didn't break our agreement. Don't be angry anymore, alright?\"","An Ling stared blankly without speaking, seemingly still processing.","The next second, the man's slender fingers gently hooked hers, her cool fingertips enveloped by his dry, warm palm.","\"It's alright if Madam is drunk. I will carry Madam home to rest.\"","In front of the car, the young, handsome man crouched before her, a faint smile playing at the corners of his eyes, his deep voice laced with amusement as he patiently coaxed her.","An Ling stared at him dumbfounded.","She truly didn't understand.","Didn't understand why Shen Linyan would go to such lengths.","This was crossing a line...","An Ling lowered her eyes, reached out, and gently touched the man's face.","As if bewitched, she slowly lowered her head and softly kissed the corner of his mouth.","Time seemed to stand still at that moment.","The instant the soft lips touched his, the smile in Shen Linyan's eyes abruptly froze.","His pupils constricted sharply as he stared blankly at the scene before him.","The sensation at his lips was real, fragrant, and soft. The unique, delicate fragrance of the woman wisped into his mind, like an addictive intoxicant, making his scalp tingle.","His fingertips twitched slightly, instinctively wanting to pursue it.","But the woman quickly straightened up, leaving his hand grasping empty air.","The moment she kissed him, An Ling immediately sobered up.","Realizing what she had done, her face flushed crimson. She immediately looked up, then slumped back into the seat as if drunk, closing her eyes and pretending to sleep.","Never mind, never mind, never mind, never mind, never mind!!","She was just drunk!","The man before her didn't speak, just remained quiet for several seconds before slowly standing up.","Then followed another long stretch of silence.","A shadow fell before her eyes. An Ling didn't dare open them, her lashes trembling slightly.","Shen Linyan wouldn't be so angry as to leave her here, would he?","They were both adults. What was wrong with one kiss? And that was her first kiss!","But the next second, her waist was gently encircled.","The man's scorching breath brushed against her face; his voice was somewhat hoarse.","\"Lingling, hold onto me.\"","An Ling's body instantly stiffened, almost opening her eyes.","What did Shen Linyan just call her??","The next second, she silently wrapped her arms around the man's neck and buried her face in his shoulder.","The sound of the car door closing reached her ears.","She was steadily carried towards the elevator.","At this moment, An Ling was still hesitating about whether to get down.","Between the temporary embarrassment of being seen by others and facing Shen Linyan, she leaned more towards the former.","After all, being seen was embarrassing for a moment; facing Shen Linyan was a lifetime of shame.","When she woke up tomorrow, she absolutely had to say she remembered nothing.","What gift? What kiss? All she remembered was Shen Linyan picking her up after the dinner, and then the two of them going home together.","Just as An Ling was thinking this, the sound of the elevator door opening suddenly rang out.","Her body instinctively stiffened.","But fortunately, there was no one in the elevator at that moment.","They entered the elevator.","One pretended to sleep, the other was silent. Only a hush remained in the elevator.","An Ling felt for the first time that the elevator ride up was so long.","Then, the man suddenly spoke:","\"I saw that tie. You were right, Madam. It really wasn't nice.\"","An Ling's movements paused, but she didn't stir, continuing to feign sleep.","The man continued speaking gently: \"I saw the perfume too, but even if I accepted it, I wouldn't use it. I'm afraid if I change my scent, Madam won't recognize me after drinking anymore.\"","An Ling was taken aback and opened her eyes.","Only then did she remember that she had apparently said something like that before.","—\"I can only feel you look familiar, but I can't match the face. I have to judge by your voice and your scent.\"","She hadn't expected Shen Linyan to still remember.","She pursed her lips, tilted her head slightly, and rubbed against the man's shoulder, but still held onto his neck without making a sound.","Noticing the movement, Shen Linyan glanced sideways at the young wife in his arms, the corner of his mouth lifting slightly.","He lowered his head slightly, his nose brushing against the woman's soft, fragrant hair, his voice very light.","\"I told her if she wanted to show gratitude, she could buy a gift for my wife instead.\""]},{"number":37,"title":"Chapter 37: Why Did the Lady in the Garage Just Kiss Me","paragraphs":["In the dimly light room, the door opened.","A man entered, gently laying the person in his arms onto the bed.","He carefully removed his jacket, tenderly smoothed the woman's trapped hair, and slowly pulled the quilt over her.","Having done all this, Shen Linyan was about to stand up and leave when his hand was suddenly grasped.","The woman had opened her eyes at some point. Under the soft glow of the nightlight, her features appeared even more beautiful and delicate, with strands of dark hair scattered across her cheeks. It was unclear if she was fully awake or still intoxicated as she stared directly at him.","He paused, sitting on the edge of the bed, and softened his voice. \"Did I wake you?\"","An Ling stared for a few seconds, then suddenly reached out and hooked his tie, immediately looking at him with pleading eyes.","Shen Linyan hesitated for a moment before a helpless smile curved his lips. Leaning over slightly, braced against the bedside, he made it easier for her.","In the dim light, the woman's slender, pale fingers slowly loosened the tie, then gradually undid the knot.","The soft rustling sound of fabric rubbing together was suggestive in the quiet night.","An Ling held the black tie, looked at it for a while, and slowly curved her eyes into a smile.","\"Give this to me.\"","Shen Linyan gazed into the woman's beautiful eyes, restraining an unnamed impulse, his Adam's apple bobbing slightly. \"Alright, it's yours.\"","An Ling clutched the tie in her palm. It was truly bespoke; both its texture and feel were top-notch.","Shen Fuyuan wasn't wrong. In comparison, the one Zhou Wen bought was indeed rather unsightly.","It also surpassed the one she had bought.","As their eyes met, she pursed her lips and whispered, \"Since I took yours, I'll compensate you with another one.\"","Shen Linyan chuckled softly in agreement. \"Okay.\"","An Ling silently turned her head away, covering her eyes with the back of her hand.","A moment later, she suddenly spoke. \"On the table.\"","Shen Linyan was slightly taken aback. \"What...\"","Suddenly realizing something, he abruptly stopped speaking and looked up towards the nearby vanity table.","Amidst various bottles and jars, an exquisite white gift bag stood quietly on the table.","And that bag had been there since last night.","He had thought it was cosmetics An Ling bought, but it was for him?","Shen Linyan stood frozen in place.","The mumbling sound of the woman talking to herself reached his ears.","\"It's fine if you don't wear it. I just wanted to give it to you, as a thank you for the fountain pen...\"","Shen Linyan slowly shifted his gaze from the bag.","He looked down at the girl who had turned her face away uncomfortably and said with a soft laugh,","\"I will wear it. Since it's a gift from my wife, I'll definitely wear it.\"","An Ling moved her hand away, revealing one eye.","\"You really will wear it? What if it doesn't look good? It's okay if you don't wear it, I won't be angry.\"","Under the dim lamplight, the man's eyes held a soft, amused glint as he nodded, his tone serious. \"If my wife chose it, it means she likes it, so I like it too. I will wear it.\"","An Ling stared at him for a moment, then slowly sat up.","She seemed hesitant, looking down and winding the tie around her finger.","Jiang Mai's words and Shen Linyan's words kept colliding in her mind.","After a pause, she bit her lip.","\"You... did you refuse Zhou Wen because of what I said?\"","Shen Linyan didn't respond immediately, just quietly watched her.","He suddenly spoke. \"I just realized... my wife seems quite concerned about me and Zhou Wen.\"","An Ling stiffened, instantly regretting asking that question.","Were they about to have a big argument over this?","She didn't speak, just silently lay back down, turned her back to him, buried half her face in the quilt, leaving the man with her back view.","Then she whispered, \"Is that not allowed? I am your wife, even if it's just a marriage of convenience.\"","She mumbled again, \"And we agreed beforehand that you can't develop feelings for anyone else. I'm afraid our beneficial arrangement would end because of that.\"","Shen Linyan's expression froze for a second before he understood.","She was concerned because of him...","He couldn't help but let out a low chuckle, his fingertips gently hooking a strand of hair behind the woman's back. \"What is my wife thinking? How could I possibly develop feelings for Zhou Wen?\"","\"...\" Hasn't she heard of old flames rekindling?","The woman on the bed remained silent, a form of wordless disagreement.","Shen Linyan finally figured out what his little wife was really thinking.","Bracing his hand on the bed, he leaned closer and said with a soft laugh, \"As for the gift, I did refuse it because you said to, but even if you hadn't said anything, I wouldn't have accepted it. That would have crossed a line.\"","He paused, then added with another low laugh, \"From now on, I'll only accept gifts from my wife, okay?\"","His crisp, woody scent of pine almost enveloped her, so close she could almost feel the warmth of his body.","An Ling's ears gradually flushed pink. She glanced at him slowly. \"Really? What if I ask you to refuse Zhou Wen in the future?\"","\"Why single out this particular person?\" Shen Linyan's eyes curved into a smile. \"I thought when my wife said 'refuse,' it meant refusing everyone except my wife.\"","An Ling's movements halted, and she silently turned back around.","What Jiang Mai said wasn't quite right.","Mentioning Zhou Wen didn't lead to anything terrible.","The 'white moonlight' didn't seem so powerful after all.","Nestled under the quilt, An Ling looked at the man and blinked.","Shen Linyan looked down at her, quiet for a moment before suddenly asking, \"Why did my wife kiss me in the garage earlier?\"","\"......\"","It was coming after all.","An Ling's eyes darted around. \"Because I was drunk at the time.\"","\"Is my wife sober now?\"","\"...Yes.\"","Feeling guilty, An Ling shrank back a little, her mind frantically searching for an excuse to brush it off.","The man's voice sounded unexpectedly in her ear:","\"Then, now that you're sober... will you still kiss me?\"","\"Huh... what?\"","She was stunned, looking up to see the man gazing at her gently, his tone as casual as asking if she wanted to eat.","\"Will you?\"","\"...?\"","Was she still drunk? Was this a dream?","An Ling was dazed for a second, but still instinctively refused. \"No.\"","Shen Linyan's eyes flickered.","The smile on his lips stiffened for an instant. The hand braced on the bed tightened its grip slightly, and he lowered his gaze, concealing the emotions in his eyes.","After a long silence, he finally smiled and slowly straightened up, his voice still gentle.","\"My apologies.\"","He said, \"Rest well, my wife.\"","An Ling sat up, watching the man walk to the door.","She hesitated for a moment, then suddenly spoke just before he opened the door.","\"Are you serious?\"","Shen Linyan stopped, his hand on the doorknob, and turned to look at her.","His gaze was deep, the emotions in his eyes hard to discern. After a moment, he spoke, his usually warm voice now slightly huskier.","\"Why would you think I'm joking? It was my wife who kissed me first.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","Even though she was the one who couldn't resist first, but...","What's with this accusatory tone?","Has Shen Linyan's sense of spousal duty reached this level?","After a brief silence, An Ling silently turned her flushed face away.","\"Then come here.\""]},{"number":38,"title":"Chapter 38: Madam, Close Your Eyes","paragraphs":["The words fell, and the room lapsed into silence.","A few seconds later, the man withdrew his hand and turned toward the bed.","An Ling didn't dare move. Her ears were burning, and she kept her eyes fixed firmly in the opposite direction.","She didn't move until the footsteps stopped and the mattress beside her dipped under his weight.","The man’s voice carried a hint of helplessness. \"If you can't accept this, I won't force you.\"","An Ling remained silent.","Was he using reverse psychology?","It was just a kiss, wasn't it? What was there to be \"unable to accept\"?","Besides, if Shen Linyan kissed her, it wasn't like she was the one losing out.","Unwilling to admit she was a little flustered, An Ling’s voice came out dry. \"Shen Linyan, this is the first time I’ve realized you talk so much.\"","The man let out a low chuckle. He reached out, his thumb and forefinger gently hooking under her chin.","\"I apologize. But if you keep your head turned like that, I can't reach you.\"","As soon as the words left his lips, his long fingers applied a sudden, firm pressure.","An Ling was caught off guard, instinctively turning her head to follow the force.","A shadow loomed over her, and a moment later, her lips were softly captured.","The man sat at the edge of the bed, one hand braced against the mattress while the other held her jaw. His tall frame leaned forward slightly as he lowered his head to tenderly take her lower lip into his mouth.","When their lips met, both of them froze for a heartbeat.","An Ling instinctively looked up.","Under the dim light, the man’s features were refined and handsome, his dark eyes focused intently on her.","Sensing her gaze, his eyes crinkled slightly into a smile, and he gave her lips a light suck.","\"Close your eyes.\"","An Ling’s lashes trembled. Blushing furiously, she squeezed her eyes shut.","The sound of breathing grew heavy—it was hard to tell whose—and the air between them turned scorching.","The man’s palm slid toward her cheek, his warm fingertips tangling into her hair as he cradled her face.","In the shadows of the bedside lamp, the silhouettes of the man and woman overlapped against the wall.","Their lips and teeth ground together in a gentle friction. Within that narrow space, a humid, sweltering heat began to brew.","The familiar, crisp scent of cedarwood enveloped her, wrapped in a potent masculine aura that carried a newfound hint of aggression.","An Ling was backed into a corner with nowhere to run.","With the back of her head protected by his hand, she could only passively endure the onslaught.","Shen Linyan’s kiss was like a pool of warm water—comfortable and soothing.","Yet it was bottomless and silent, making it dangerously easy to drown within it.","Her lips grew numb from the suction. The man pecked at her mouth repeatedly, his lips rolling against hers again and again. The intensity shifted from light to heavy, their breaths mingling before he slowly deepened the contact. A tingling sensation surged up her spine.","Throughout the entire encounter, however, his tongue only brushed against hers once.","It was as if he were deliberately maintaining a clear sense of boundaries, never venturing further.","An Ling was kissed into a daze, her eyes shimmering with a watery light.","After an unknown amount of time, the weakness in her lower back made it impossible to support herself, and she instinctively grabbed onto his clothes.","Finally, he released her lips. His thumb brushed against the corner of her mouth, his Adam’s apple bobbing. He leaned down and pressed a kiss to her beautiful eyes.","\"Would you like some water?\"","His voice was thick with desire, low and magnetic, sounding almost like a spell cast in her ear.","An Ling panted, feeling as though the entire room was filled with Shen Linyan’s scent.","Specifically, she felt it all over herself.","She pressed her numbed lips together, looked up at him, and gave a small nod.","\"I’ll go pour it.\" Shen Linyan helped smooth her hair before standing up.","After she finished the water, An Ling looked back at him.","The man was sitting on the edge of the bed. The white gift bag had been opened, and he was holding the black tie in his hands.","It was just an ordinary tie, yet Shen Linyan was turning it over, examining it closely for a long time.","His scrutiny made her feel a bit self-conscious.","An Ling clutched her glass and looked away. \"Um... it’s late. You should go get some rest too.\"","The man nodded and stood up. \"You should rest early as well.\"","Once the door closed, An Ling put the glass back on the nightstand. Her gaze fell on the spot where the tie had been resting on her pillow, and she paused again.","She picked it up, and after a moment of reflection, carefully placed it on the desk.","Then, she touched her lips.","The sensation of the kiss seemed to linger there.","\"He’s pretty good at that...\" she whispered.","There was no denying it—not just in terms of technique, but in the way he handled physical intimacy. The man was effortless and composed, without a trace of fluster.","It was as if he had long anticipated that all of this would happen.","An Ling had originally felt a bit embarrassed after the kiss, but seeing Shen Linyan’s calm reaction, the shyness in her heart suddenly dissipated.","No wonder some people could accept arranged marriages so easily; they must have planned for a day like this long ago.","Only she was acting like some naive teenager, getting all worked up over a single kiss.","Falling back onto the bed, she stared at the ceiling before turning to look at her phone, lost in thought.","Maybe... she should find some \"contract marriage\" novels to do some research?","She’d look for the dramatic, angst-filled ones to learn how those heroines managed their mindsets.","In the room just across the wall.","*Click—*","After turning on the light, the man stood in the middle of the empty room, looking down at the gift bag in his hand.","He slowly raised a hand to touch his own lips, his dark eyes shifting slowly as if lost in thought.","After a long silence, he placed the gift bag on the desk and unbuckled his metal watch, setting it down beside it.","He took off his suit jacket and instinctively reached up to loosen his tie, only to grasp at thin air.","Just moments ago, he had given the tie to his wife.","Shen Linyan’s movements froze. He stood still before the floor-to-ceiling window.","Half of his face was bathed in the lamplight, his lips pressed into a thin line. His elegant, refined features were now relaxed, his eyes half-lidded as his fingertips rubbed together.","It was as if that soft, delicate sensation was still there.","After a moment of silence, he suddenly pulled out his phone.","He opened the search bar.","*Wife initiated a kiss...*","He paused, then added a prefix.","*What does it mean when an arranged-marriage wife initiates a kiss...*","He stopped again, deleted it, and revised it once more.","*Does it mean she likes me if an arranged-marriage wife initiates a kiss?*","The answers on the internet were all over the place, but none of them were what he was looking for.","Then again, who would go online to ask about the nuances of an arranged marriage?","Shen Linyan rubbed the bridge of his nose and turned off the screen.","He reached for the cigarette case on the nightstand and pulled one out, casually slotting it between his middle and index fingers.","It was a slim, matte black cigarette with a faint gold pattern around the body, adding a touch of sensuality to his pale, well-defined fingers.","With a *clack*, the flame reflected in the window, and a spark flickered amidst the rising smoke.","Just as he was about to bring the cigarette to his lips, he seemed to remember something and stopped abruptly.","The cigarette burned between his fingers. In the darkness of the night, the wedding ring on his ring finger reflected a cold, sharp glint.","After staring at the ring for a while, he looked down and stubbed out the cigarette.","The smoke swirled—a blend of raw tobacco and cold sandalwood. It wasn't harsh or irritating, leaving only a faint, lingering fragrance in the air.","He picked up his phone again and dialed a number.","Gu Xiaochi, who was in the middle of a video game, heard his phone ring. He pulled off his headset and picked it up.","Seeing the caller ID, he raised an eyebrow in surprise and answered.","\"Shen Linyan? Why are you calling me out of the blue?\"","The man on the other end was silent for a moment before speaking slowly.","\"I think An Ling likes me.\"","Gu Xiaochi: \"?\"","Was he seriously calling in the middle of the night just to flex his relationship?"]},{"number":39,"title":"Chapter 39: Like An Ling","paragraphs":["Gu Xiaochi had a fleeting urge to hang up the phone.","But reason stopped him.","Because hearing that one sentence, he suddenly realized a situation.","Back then at the bar, those two really were just in an ordinary arranged marriage relationship.","And the act of pretending to be affectionate was also genuine.","Gu Xiaochi paused his game.","\"We've all wanted to ask you for a long time but didn't dare. Didn't An Ling used to like Lu Jingshen? Something even happened just a few days ago. How did the wind change direction so suddenly?\"","Shen Linyan sank into the soft leather sofa, lowering his gaze as he said calmly, \"She said she doesn't like him anymore.\"","\"...\"","Gu Xiaochi fell silent. \"You believed her?\"","No way? Does Shen Linyan trust others that easily?","Hearing this, the man didn't speak, his gaze slowly drifting downward.","He slowly raised his hand. The silver wedding ring refracted a dazzling light under the lamp, softening the man's cool, refined features.","\"I believe her.\"","\"...\"","Gu Xiaochi understood.","He propped up his leg. \"It's simple. So many people liked you before; it's not the first time something like this has happened.\"","Gu Xiaochi was all too familiar with this situation.","Shen Linyan, the future heir of the Shen Group, possessed an elegant, steady demeanor, kept himself clean and proper, treated others with gentle consideration, and crucially, had a top-tier appearance.","Back when studying abroad, even though Shen Linyan's identity wasn't revealed, many people still liked him. All sorts of young socialites would ask him out to dinner.","Shen Linyan would only smile and gently decline, then take out his card, his tone apologetic: \"I'm sorry, I have something on tonight. You and your friends go have fun, my treat, okay? If it gets too late, I'll have my driver pick you up.\"","The man's handsome looks, deep voice, gentlemanly manners, and the restrained nobility evident in his every movement.","No one could refuse.","But there was one strange thing.","Those women never confessed, as if they knew Shen Linyan wouldn't be with them.","As they put it: \"We just like his face, but if we were to be together, we would never choose someone like Shen Linyan.\"","Although Gu Xiaochi didn't quite understand this statement, he thought those women were really sharp, their insight even keener than people in business.","Because Shen Linyan truly didn't like them.","Gu Xiaochi felt the current situation was somewhat similar—An Ling, that troublesome woman, had actually been moved by Shen Linyan.","The phrasing might not be quite right, but he couldn't think of a better way to put it.","\"So now you like An Ling, and An Ling likes you. Isn't that a happy ending for everyone?\"","Unexpectedly, as soon as he said this, the other end suddenly fell silent.","A few seconds later, the man's slightly hesitant voice sounded.","\"I... like An Ling?\"","Gu Xiaochi: ?","\"????????\"","His expression froze, and he hurriedly sat up straight.","\"Wait, you don't like An Ling?? Then why did you tell us to call her 'sister-in-law,' and why did you hold her at the bar?\"","Most importantly, the way you looked at her didn't seem indifferent at all!","\"...\"","The other end didn't speak.","After a moment, the man finally explained: \"She is my wife in name. It's only right for you to call her sister-in-law. Our relationship is one of mutual benefit. These things are what I should do, and what she hopes I will do.\"","Gu Xiaochi: \"........\"","Damn! Those women were absolutely right!","You can't be with anyone, but you definitely can't be with Shen Linyan!!","A thought suddenly struck Gu Xiaochi: \"Wait, did you call because An Ling likes you, and you're troubled that you don't want her to like you?\"","\"...\"","The man's tone was indifferent, outright ignoring his question. \"Keep an eye on Shen Furui. I don't want An Ling to face any trouble at work.\"","With that, the call was disconnected.","Gu Xiaochi: \"...\"","Good heavens! What on earth is Shen Linyan thinking!","After hanging up,","the room returned to quiet.","Shen Linyan looked at his own reflection in the black screen of the phone, his expression dazed.","\"...Like?\"","Like An Ling?","But he was only doing what a husband should do.","An Ling fulfilled her duties as an arranged marriage wife, so naturally, he would also meet her requests.","This was their mutually beneficial relationship, helping each other.","An Ling wanted him to wear the wedding ring; he could wear it.","An Ling skipped dinner because of him, so he cooked dinner for her.","An Ling didn't want him to help Lu Jingshen resolve matters; he could refrain from helping.","An Ling told him her secret; he was the only one who knew it.","He was her trusted husband.","So he would also try to give An Ling more trust and care.","Because she is his wife, the wife standing by his side.","The only person whose name is closely linked with his on the Shen family household register, devoid of any familial affection.","An Ling wanted to teach him to be a bad person; he agreed.","An Ling wanted him to reject everyone; he also agreed.","These things were not difficult for him to do.","He didn't dislike doing these things either. In fact, doing them for the first time gave him a sense of enjoyment.","Since An Ling hoped for it, An Ling wanted it, then he could do it.","Except... kissing.","Shen Linyan had never considered that one day, An Ling would want to kiss.","But this is also something a husband should do.","Right?","Shen Linyan lowered his eyes, then slowly raised his head to look at the tie on the table.","But if An Ling wanted love.","He couldn't give it to her.","He didn't know how to love.","He never learned how to love someone.","Hypocrisy and pretense were like a hard shell, wrapping him up tightly.","Beneath the glamorous exterior, Shen Linyan could no longer distinguish which part was the real him. It seemed even every breath carried traces of performance.","But he would still give it to An Ling.","Because she is his wife.","The first person he has ever wanted to maintain a relationship with.","Early morning the next day.","\"Ring ring ring...\"","The phone rang. An Ling frowned, keeping her eyes closed as she fumbled for her phone.","After finding it, she squinted with difficulty to see the caller ID and answered.","\"Mom?\"","\"Lingling, it's already ten o'clock, are you still sleeping?\" An mother's voice sounded in her ear.","\"I stayed up late last night.\"","She had been reading a novel until three AM. In the latter half of the night, she was too tired and fell asleep as soon as she closed her eyes.","An Ling yawned. \"Why are you calling all of a sudden? Did something happen?\"","\"Nothing's wrong. Isn't it the weekend today? Want to come home? Your brother said we're having a barbecue in the yard.\"","An Zhou's voice faintly came through the phone.","\"An Ling, hurry up and come! Don't leave me to do all the grilling! We bought a lot of ingredients!\"","An Ling couldn't help but laugh twice. \"Okay, okay, I'll be over in a bit.\"","Just as she was about to hang up, An mother's voice sounded again: \"How about inviting Linyan along? Before, you caused that boy so much trouble, and we've barely met him a few times.\"","\"...Huh?\"","An Ling paused, memories from last night resurfacing in her mind.","Her face flushed, her tone vague. \"He's very busy with work. He's probably already at the office now, no time to come. Let's not talk about it now, I need to get dressed.\"","After hanging up, An Ling touched her warm cheek and got out of bed.","Just as she walked into the living room, upon seeing the man on the sofa, a flicker of surprise crossed her eyes, and her footsteps halted.","On the sofa, a man dressed in casual homewear sat with his long legs crossed. His noble bearing was softened by a touch of languid ease as he looked down at the book in his hands. Sunlight streamed in, painting a scene that was both warm and cozy.","Hearing footsteps, the man looked up.","The moment their eyes met, An Ling felt an inexplicable flutter of nervousness, mixed with surprise. \"You didn't go to work today?\"","Shen Linyan looked at her for a few seconds, then slowly, his eyes curved into a smile.","\"My dear wife, even a chairman deserves a weekend.\"","An Ling: \"...\""]},{"number":40,"title":"Chapter 40: He Is My Husband","paragraphs":["Accustomed to Shen Linyuan being away from home every morning, An Ling felt a bit out of place now that they were suddenly spending the day together.","She gave a shy response and walked toward the dining table. The man on the sofa also stood up.","\"Would you like some porridge? Auntie Cheng made some and left it in the rice cooker to keep warm. I'll dish some out for you.\"","An Ling nodded. \"I'll eat after I freshen up. I just came out to see if Auntie Cheng was here.\"","She had originally planned to tell Auntie Cheng not to cook lunch, but since Shen Linyuan was home...","Thinking of her mother’s words, An Ling paused.","She glanced at the man’s back as he stood in the kitchen. After a moment, she turned back toward her room.","Forget it.","Shen Linyuan finally had a day off; she should let him rest at home.","After changing her clothes, An Ling sat at the table to eat her porridge.","An Zhou was still pestering her on her phone.","An Ling replied speechlessly: [Big brother, don't rush me. I'm having a bowl of porridge and then I'll be there. Otherwise, I'll starve to death by the time you're done grilling.]","An Zhou: [I heard Mom tell you to bring Shen Linyuan along. Whatever you do, don't bring him! Do you hear me!]","Her gaze faltered.","[Why?]","An Zhou: [Why else? He's an outsider! Why would you bring an outsider to our weekend family dinner?]","An Ling: [...He's my husband.]","An Zhou: [A husband from an arranged marriage barely counts. Just don't bring him! And don't ask why. Though, I bet even if you asked, Shen Linyuan wouldn't agree anyway.]","An Ling wanted to argue but didn't know where to start, so she simply stopped replying.","In truth, even without An Zhou saying anything, she hadn't planned on asking Shen Linyuan.","After finishing her porridge, seeing the man sitting on the sofa with his head down reading a book, An Ling didn't want to disturb him. She intended to quietly return to her room to grab her bag.","But just as she turned around, a gentle voice came from behind her.","\"If you aren't busy today, would you like to go out with me?\"","An Ling’s back stiffened. \"...\"","She thought she was hallucinating.","She turned around hesitantly. \"...Go out?\"","Shen Linyuan placed a bookmark in his book, closed it gently, and looked up at her with a warm gaze. \"Yes. Since it's the weekend, we could see a movie and have dinner out.\"","Isn't that a date?","An Ling quickly shook the thought away, her expression turning a bit stiff. \"Um... I already have plans today. I have to head out in a bit.\"","Hearing this, Shen Linyuan’s eyes flickered with a momentary daze.","His fingers tightened unconsciously. Once he realized what he was doing, he abruptly relaxed his grip, the curve of his lips remaining unchanged. \"I see. It's my fault for forgetting to ask sooner. I hope you have a good time, then.\"","An Ling gave him a slight nod and turned back to her room.","When she came back out after gathering her things, the living room was empty. The book had been left on the table.","The man was standing on the balcony, holding his phone as if he were making a call.","An Ling thought for a moment and felt she should at least say goodbye to Shen Linyuan before leaving. After all, she had just turned him down.","Just as she reached the balcony, the man's gentle voice reached her ears.","\"...Go ahead and cancel the restaurant reservation... No need to hold it for me, just give it to another guest. My wife has other plans and won't be able to make it.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","Why did her conscience hurt a little?","After Shen Linyuan finished the call, he turned around and saw her standing in the living room.","He was startled for a second before he smiled. \"Are you leaving? Do you need me to drive you?\"","An Ling didn't answer. She simply stared at him, her expression thoughtful.","After a moment, she suddenly asked, \"Shen Linyuan, what do you plan to do this afternoon?\"","Shen Linyuan blinked, shaking his head. \"I haven't thought about it. I'll probably stay home. Why do you ask?\"","An Ling bit her lip and looked away for a moment before slowly shifting her gaze back to him.","\"Um... are you planning to rest at home today?\"","\"Most likely.\"","An Ling went silent for a few seconds, then spoke haltingly. \"Then, if you had the choice between going out or resting, which would you pick?\"","Shen Linyan looked momentarily stunned. A slight smile tugged at the corners of his mouth, and his voice carried a hint of amusement. \"If it's with my wife, I would choose the former.\"","An Ling paused.","Lifting her head to meet the man's gaze, she blinked.","\"What if we go to my house? Would you go then?\"","Shen Linyan’s movements faltered slightly, but he still nodded. \"I would.\"","Having received her answer, An Ling silently pulled out her phone.","She held the phone up, her face half-hidden behind it, revealing only a pair of beautiful, curving eyes.","\"It looks like I'll have to tell Auntie Cheng not to cook today. I'm taking you somewhere for good food.\"","When they arrived at the An residence, An Ling told Shen Linyan to just park the car at the entrance.","She stuffed her vibrating phone back into her bag and opened the car door to step out.","On the way there, she had decided to act first and report later, suddenly announcing in the family group chat that she was bringing Shen Linyan along for the gathering.","Mother An: [Great! Welcome, welcome.]","Father An: [Then we'll grill a bit more later.]","An Zhou: [?]","An Zhou: [??]","An Zhou: [??????]","The next second, her phone was bombarded with countless voice messages and texts.","An Ling chose to ignore them all.","After all, her mother had told her this morning to bring Shen Linyan along; she was simply following instructions.","Jiang Mai was away on a business trip today and couldn't make it, so the group was small to begin with. Bringing Shen Linyan along would just make it more lively.","Once Shen Linyan stepped out of the car, An Ling took his arm.","Different from his usual suit-and-tie appearance, the man was wearing a plain white inner shirt today paired with a dark gray cashmere cardigan. The watch on his wrist was sleek and simple, and though he wore plain black trousers, he still couldn't hide the innate air of nobility that surrounded him.","\"Let the housekeeper get the things from the car later. Let's go in first.\"","An Ling gave him a cautious heads-up.","\"My brother might say some unpleasant things later. You've met him before during business deals; he has a sharp tongue. Just ignore him.\"","The man looked down with a soft smile. \"It's fine. It is quite sudden of me to drop by.\"","\"It's not that sudden. Mom only called me this morning.\"","As they stepped into the courtyard, the smoky scent of charcoal grilling wafted toward them, accompanied by the sound of voices.","An Ling spotted them, and after identifying their outfits, she waved quickly. \"Dad, Mom! We're here!\"","Hearing her voice, Mother An and Father An looked over.","\"Lingling and Linyan are here.\"","As they approached, Shen Linyan’s eyes crinkled warmly, his tone gentle and respectful. \"Dad, Mom.\"","An Ling froze beside him.","Back at the Shen residence, Shen Linyan always addressed his parents formally as Mother and Father. Hearing him call her parents \"Dad and Mom\" alongside her felt a little strange.","Just then, a heavy cough sounded from the side.","An Zhou was standing in front of the grill, staring at her expressionlessly.","\"What about me? Aren't you going to greet me?\"","An Ling blinked and gave a cheeky grin. \"Brother, how's the grilling going? I'm starving!\"","As she spoke, she hurried over to grab a finished skewer from the plate.","Shen Linyan also looked over, his eyes curving politely. He was about to speak when An Zhou raised a hand to cut him off.","\"Hold it right there, Chairman Shen. You should just call me President An.\"","If he had to hear Shen Linyan call him \"brother,\" he felt like it would shave years off his life.","The man’s smile remained unchanged, his tone still polite and professional. \"Of course, President An.\"","President An’s mouth twitched.","Damn, this guy was a good actor.","He certainly hadn't acted this way back at the dinner party."]},{"number":41,"title":"Chapter 41: Shen Linyan Likes Her","paragraphs":["Shen Linyan went to the living room to chat with Father An and Mother An, leaving only An Ling and An Zhou in the courtyard.","Seeing his sister eating non-stop, An Zhou lifted his chin. Didn't you eat breakfast? Hurry up and help me grill.","I just had a little porridge. An Ling swallowed the food in her mouth and stood over to help him grill the other side.","An Zhou glanced at the villa behind him and lowered his voice.","I told you not to bring Shen Linyan, why did you still bring him?","An Ling did not hide anything. At first, Shen Linyan wanted to take me out to play, but we didn't go because of the barbecue, so I thought I might as well bring him here.","Take you out to play? An Zhou frowned. He wasn't planning to sell you off, was he?","An Ling gave him a weird look. What is wrong with you?","An Zhou looked guarded. Let me tell you, Shen Linyan is not a good person. Avoid contact with him as much as you can. It might be a bit troublesome to get a divorce right now, so just act as a loveless arranged marriage couple and live without interfering with each other.","...It was too late.","They had already kissed last night.","Using the white smoke from the barbecue to hide the guilty conscience in her eyes, An Ling just gave a vague response. I know, I know. You don't need to worry.","Why did her brother have such a big problem with Shen Linyan?","Calling him a bad person.","Wouldn't she know if he was bad or not?","An Zhou grilled for a while, then picked up the skewers that were already done. I'll take these inside for Mom and Dad. You keep an eye on the rest.","Okay.","After An Zhou left, An Ling picked up a lamb skewer, looked at it, felt it wasn't done yet, and put it back.","Hearing footsteps behind her, she thought it was An Zhou and turned her head. You're back so fast...","When she saw who it was, her voice stopped.","Shen Linyan? You're done chatting with Mom and Dad?","The man gave a soft Mm, walked over, and took the oil brush from her hand. Let me grill.","An Ling stood beside him, fanning the smoke, and asked curiously, What did Mom and Dad say to you?","Shen Linyan lowered his eyes, a faint smile on his lips. Does my wife want to know?","Of course. An Ling looked up at him. If it's hard to say, it's fine.","Shen Linyan handed her a finished skewer, his eyes smiling.","There's nothing hard to say. Mom and Dad just said that my wife has a bad temper and asked me to be more accommodating. They also said that if my wife loses her temper, I should tell them.","...","An Ling blushed and took a bite of the skewer, her tone slightly dissatisfied. They're talking nonsense! I don't lose my temper at all. No, wait! I have a very good temper!","A certain someone had completely forgotten how she had lost her temper several times over the past few days using the excuse of their business relationship.","Shen Linyan chuckled softly. Does my wife want to know how I answered?","So how did you answer?","The man suddenly stopped his movements and turned to look at her.","The charcoal fire crackled. Those pitch-black eyes quietly gazed at her, like a dark, deep pool hiding complex and obscure emotions.","But amidst the hazy smoke, An Ling could not decipher what those emotions meant.","She was just about to look closer when the man suddenly and slowly curved his eyes into a smile.","I said it doesn't matter, I will coax her.","Hearing this, An Ling froze.","For some reason, she suddenly felt as if Shen Linyan had had a romantic awakening.","Since waking up this morning, the man's words were even more misleading than before.","According to the novel she read last night, wasn't this usually the kind of change a male lead had when he realized he liked the female lead?","Did Shen Linyan like her?","Unlikely.","An Ling leaned more toward the idea that she was feeling it wrong.","Shen Linyan must have seen her parents' worries and deliberately created the illusion of a good relationship.","However, she hadn't told her parents yet that she planned to divorce Shen Linyan in the future. Once she explained it, they probably wouldn't say these things to Shen Linyan anymore.","She smiled, her eyes curving, and quietly sidled over. She held up the skewer to the man's lips. Thank you, hubby, for coaxing me. Here's a bite as a reward for my hubby!","Shen Linyan was slightly stunned, then smiled and lowered his head to take a bite.","Thank you, my wife.","Is it good? An Ling also took a bite. An Zhou said this is expensive lamb he spent a lot of money on, but I think it's just average.","A business partner invited me to dinner before, and there was a place that made really delicious lamb.","The man leaned close to her ear and whispered with a smile, And the boss raises sheep at home. You can pet the little lambs. Does my wife want to go?","Sure! An Ling's eyes lit up. Let's go together.","From a distance, the man and woman were talking and laughing, their posture intimate and close.","Not far away, An Zhou stood in place holding an empty plate, slowly furrowing his brows.","After lunch.","An Ling had planned to go back with Shen Linyan, but Mother An suddenly stood up enthusiastically.","Since there are a lot of people today and it's rare for us to get together, let's play mahjong. Linyan, do you know how to play?","...","Sure enough, here it comes again.","She quickly hooked her arm through the man's. Mom, Shen Linyan doesn't know how to play mahjong. Aren't you, Dad, and my brother just enough people?","Whenever there were people around, her mother wanted to play mahjong. Playing with those wealthy ladies usually wasn't enough; she had to drag them along during gatherings too.","Fortunately, she had asked Shen Linyan in the car.","Hearing this, Mother An nodded thoughtfully. Is that so? Then there's nothing we can do.","She looked at An Ling.","Then An Ling, you take your husband's place.","...Mom, I actually have a habit of taking a nap.","Mother An: Habit my foot. Sleep after we play.","...","Mother An smiled and looked at Shen Linyan beside her. Linyan, if you're tired, go rest in Ling Ling's room for a while. Although no one has lived there for a long time, it has been cleaned. Let Auntie Wang take you there.","Shen Linyan's gaze paused slightly. He silently swallowed the refusal on his lips and gave a slight nod.","An Ling was forced to join the table, turning her head to glance at the man's back as he went upstairs.","Only when the man's figure disappeared from sight did she quietly speak up. Mom, why did you tell Shen Linyan earlier that I lose my temper?","Mother An was sorting the mahjong tiles. Hearing this, she looked up. It's not like I was wrong. Doesn't a girl like you have a big temper? How did those things from before happen?","An Zhou nodded beside her. It's true.","...","There was still no need to say that. She lowered her voice. Besides, it's not like you don't know that Shen Linyan and I are just in an arranged marriage. Going through the motions is enough.","Arranged marriage? Mother An glanced at her. But Shen Linyan said he doesn't consider this an arranged marriage. He said he likes you a lot.","An Ling froze, stopping her movements.","He said... he likes me?","An Zhou discarded a mahjong tile, giving a dismissive chuckle. It's obviously a lie. Shen Linyan is just tricking you guys.","Father An slowly called a tile. I share the same thoughts as your brother. That boy Shen Linyan has a rather deep mind.","Mother An glanced at the father and son but didn't say much else.","Anyway, Ling Ling, as long as you and Linyan live a good life together, that's enough. Mom and Dad aren't asking you to do anything right now.","It was probably because the events from the past two years had left too deep a shadow on Father An and Mother An, so they didn't dare to say much now.","The words We're going to get a divorce later were stuck in An Ling's throat, unable to go up or down.","Wait...","How did things develop in this direction?","She absentmindedly played a few rounds.","Then she turned her head to speak to the auntie: \"Auntie Wang, could you take over for me? I'm suddenly feeling a bit tired and want to go upstairs to rest.\"","Mother An slowly raised her eyes, her tone teasing and ambiguous:","\"Are you going upstairs to rest, or going upstairs to look for your husband?\"","An Ling: \"...\""]},{"number":42,"title":"Chapter 42: Let me try again, okay, Madame","paragraphs":["In the end, An Ling went upstairs.","Opening the door, she paused when she saw the man sitting on the sofa in the room.","\"You didn't rest?\"","The man seemed to be looking at something on his phone. Hearing the door open, he calmly turned off the screen and offered a gentle smile.","\"Why did you come up, Madam?\"","An Ling closed the door. \"I'm tired. I don't want to play anymore.\"","She flopped onto the bed, turning her head to look at the man on the sofa. Her eyes were thoughtful before she slowly looked away.","\"Shen Linyan...\"","\"Hmm?\"","\"Actually, you didn't have to say those things in front of my parents.\"","The man on the sofa paused slightly and slowly looked up. \"What do you mean by that... Madam?\"","An Ling still minded it a bit.","Truthfully, she didn't quite like Shen Linyan's way of speaking today. It was too easy for people to misunderstand.","The novels she had stayed up late reading last night wrote all about it.","A marriage of convenience where the husband had a 'white moonlight' first love in his heart was a big no-no. It would easily lead to trouble later on—like the white moonlight getting sick, and the husband abandoning his pregnant wife to go see her.","She had been so angry reading those novels yesterday, feeling both furious and sad, and secretly swore she would never end up like that.","Lying on the bed, sleepiness gradually washed over her mind. An Ling yawned, her tone lazy.","\"I mean, my parents know ours is a marriage of convenience, so you don't need to put on an act that we're deeply in love. Just act normally...\"","Remembering that Shen Linyan had good intentions and didn't want her parents to worry, she paused and changed her tune. \"I just mean you don't need to say things against your own heart. I know you mean well, but my parents aren't outsiders.\"","Saying things like he liked her would make her parents misunderstand.","If he said it too much, she would misunderstand too.","An Ling had closed her eyes, so she completely missed how, in that split second, the smile on the man's lips abruptly froze.","Shen Linyan lowered his eyes, gripping his phone tightly. His dark eyes carried an unyielding heaviness, and his tone was very light. \"I don't quite understand what you mean, Madam. What do you mean by... against my heart?\"","\"Huh?\"","An Ling didn't hear him clearly at first. She slowly opened her eyes and looked toward him in confusion. \"What did you say?\"","Silence hung in the air for a moment before the man's voice sounded again.","\"Was Madam not satisfied with yesterday's kiss?\"","\"...\"","It was as if someone had pressed the pause button in the room.","An Ling stared blankly, her eyes wide open. She wasn't sleepy anymore.","Her mind went completely blank, and she didn't even know what to say.","The man, however, suddenly stood up, walked over to the bed, and rested one of his long, straight legs on the mattress, kneeling on one knee.","As his tall figure leaned over, bringing with it the crisp scent of cedarwood, the outline of his broad shoulders and narrow waist completely trapped her against the bed.","An Ling instinctively reached out to press against his chest.","But the next second, her wrist was grasped by a scalding hot palm.","Shen Linyan's eyes were half-lowered, his long eyelashes casting shadows. His pitch-black pupils quietly stared at the woman's shocked expression, his voice soft and slow.","\"Did I fail to meet your expectations? Did I disappoint you, Madam?\"","Because he didn't do a good job.","Therefore, that affection had faded.","Therefore, she was unwilling to accept his status as her husband.","He held the woman's hand, lowering his head to kiss her fingertips. He moved down little by little—the palm, the wrist—leaving every inch of her skin tainted with a damp, sultry heat.","His thin lips pressed tightly against her palm, branding a kiss there.","His eyes curved slightly. Those noble eyes now carried a bewitching darkness, and his voice was tender and enchanting.","\"Let me try one more time, alright? Madam.\"","Only by doing better could he maintain this relationship.","At this moment, An Ling was completely dumbfounded.","She felt like her husband was seducing her.","Although she didn't understand what Shen Linyan was talking about, whatever.","Anyone who could resist this wouldn't be human.","The novels from yesterday didn't say what to do when a husband was being this seductive.","She swallowed hard, remained silent for a moment, then slowly pulled her hand free and gently wrapped her arms around his neck.","\"Let's... try.\"","As her words fell, the man leaned down and pressed against her. He tilted his head slightly and kissed her earring.","A few strands of his dark hair fell, brushing against the side of her neck, his breath scorching.","His scattered kisses were restrained and gentle, landing lightly on the corner of her eye, the tip of her nose, the corner of her mouth, and her chin, as tender as if he were treating a precious treasure.","\"Does Madam like it like this?\"","The tip of his tall nose rubbed against her, making her heart itch. The warm breath from his words brushed against the corner of her lips, incredibly bewitching.","An Ling lay on the bed, her dark hair scattered. The corners of her eyes flushed with an alluring red, and her clear, bright eyes reflected the man's face.","She slowly lifted her head, taking the initiative to kiss the corner of the man's lips, chuckling softly as she panted lightly.","\"I like it.\"","Shen Linyan's eyes widened in surprise.","The hand propping him up on the bed suddenly clenched, the veins on the back of his hand bulging.","The freshly cleaned room had been crisp, but at this moment, it seemed to be filled with a rich, fragrant scent. The familiar aroma of citrus and orchid wafted from the blankets, stimulating every nerve in Shen Linyan's body.","He stared at her for a moment, his Adam's apple bobbing. He slowly lowered his head to capture her soft lips, sucking on them little by little, the tip of his tongue gently grinding against the parting of her lips, his movements both restrained and urgent.","His thin lips were scalding hot, their breaths intertwining. The crisp cedarwood scent from his nose mixed with his burning breath, wrapping around her and making her whole body tremble.","Her parents were just downstairs, yet here they were in a tightly closed room, intimately embracing and kissing on the bed An Ling had slept in countless times.","-","The events of that afternoon had been too sudden. It was only later that An Ling realized something wasn't quite right.","She stared at the document in her hand but didn't absorb a single word of it.","What did Shen Linyan mean by those words back then?","Why did they suddenly start kissing out of nowhere?","She stroked her chin, deep in thought.","Was this the adult world? How fascinating.","She could now somewhat understand why the male and female leads in those arranged marriage novels were able to fulfill their marital duties.","\"Hey... Hey!\"","A woman's dissatisfied voice rang in her ear.","She looked up and saw Shen Fuyuan crossing her arms and frowning at her. \"What are you thinking about? I'm talking to you.\"","\"Sorry, I zoned out for a bit.\" An Ling quickly snapped back to reality and turned the page of the document.","\"We have already understood Miss Shen's itinerary. If there are any special arrangements, please let us know in advance so we can send someone to set up the camera positions.\"","Shen Fuyuan looked her up and down a few times. \"By the way, about the gift from that day, did you know Zhou Wen didn't manage to give it out?\"","An Ling paused her movements, then looked down and continued organizing the files. \"I know. Shen Linyan already told me.\"","Shen Fuyuan leaned back in her chair and curled her lips. \"How boring.\"","She paused for a long while before speaking again slowly, \"But I heard you don't like Second Brother anymore. Is that true? Then who do you like now? Big Brother?\"","That morning, Gu Xiaochi had suddenly sent a message saying that Big Brother had issued a warning, telling her not to cause trouble for An Ling.","This reversal was too sudden. Did Big Brother actually believe it?","Wasn't he afraid it was a trick?","An Ling didn't know where Shen Fuyuan got her information. She raised an eyebrow. \"Miss Shen prying into my personal matters during work hours is probably against the rules.\"","\"...\"","Shen Fuyuan threw back the phrase from last time: \"I do what I please.\"","An Ling: \"Well, I don't.\"","Shen Fuyuan: \"...Tch...\"","Seeing the girl's deflated expression, An Ling laughed out loud.","\"It's true that I don't like Lu Jingshen.\"","As for Shen Linyan...","She smoothly skipped over that topic without batting an eye.","Picking up her bag and standing up, she asked politely, \"It's getting late, time to get off work. Miss Shen, would you like to grab dinner together tonight?\"","Shen Linyan had business to attend to tonight and said he wouldn't be coming home. She planned to take this opportunity to bond with her sister-in-law, hoping to avoid any more trouble during the upcoming shoot.","Shen Fuyuan answered without a second thought, \"Of course!\"","Never turn down a free meal! She was going to make An Ling bleed cash! High-end restaurants, here she comes!","Just as she was about to get up, Shen Fuyuan glanced down at her phone. Her gaze paused, and she clicked her tongue in annoyance. \"Almost forgot.\"","She looked up at An Ling, who was standing by the door.","\"Looks like I can't go after all. I have to make a trip back to the Shen family estate.\""]},{"number":43,"title":"Chapter 43: Why is that damn system's way of chasing people so corny","paragraphs":["Hearing this, An Ling didn't ask further and simply nodded slightly. \"Alright, then I'll head home for dinner.\"","Shen Fuyuan paused.","She was silent for a few seconds, her tone suddenly hesitant. \"You're not going?\"","?","\"Why would I go?\"","Seeing An Ling's bewildered expression, Shen Fuyuan's eyes widened slightly in disbelief.","\"Huh? Didn't you get the message?\"","An Ling felt baffled by her stare and subconsciously checked her phone.","\"What message?\"","Aside from Shen Linyan telling her this afternoon that he wouldn't be coming back tonight, there were no other messages.","Shen Fuyuan stared at her for a few seconds and muttered to herself, \"That shouldn't be. Could it be that Mom is scared?\"","She looked at An Ling again. \"Don't you remember what day it is today?\"","An Ling: ?","Shen Fuyuan looked serious. \"Today is Second Brother's birthday!\"","An Ling: ...","Scared her to death, she thought it was Shen Linyan's birthday.","\"Oh.\"","\"Oh??\"","Shen Fuyuan looked at her in shock for a few seconds, quickly walked over, her tone hiding considerable surprise. \"It seems you really don't like him anymore. My God, you used to look forward to this day so much. Every year you spent over a million to set off fireworks for Second Brother, gave him handmade scarves, bought 999 roses to send to the Shen family, and even baked a cake yourself and brought it over. You couldn't even be chased away.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","The dead memories came back.","Why was that damn system so tacky when wooing someone!","She said expressionlessly, \"I was possessed by a ghost before. How can I get Lu Jingshen to reimburse me for that million-dollar fireworks display?\"","Not wanting to hear any more about the past, An Ling was about to leave when she heard Shen Fuyuan's thoughtful voice.","\"How strange, Big Brother didn't tell you either?\"","She paused in pushing the door and turned her head. \"Shen Linyan is going too?\"","So Shen Linyan not coming back tonight was also to go to the Shen family to celebrate Lu Jingshen's birthday?","\"Yeah.\" Shen Fuyuan shrugged, returning to her seat to grab her bag. \"My mom takes Second Brother's birthday very seriously. She requires every family member to be present, and there will be other relatives coming too.\"","An Ling looked down at her phone again.","Shen Fuyuan put on her hat and mask and walked over. \"Let's go. I guess Big Brother didn't tell you because Mom has been traumatized by your last few visits to the house, so she didn't want you to come.\"","Saying this, her eyes lit up, and she patted An Ling's shoulder.","\"By the way, did you really curse at my mom? I heard from the auntie at home that my mom's face turned black with anger at the time.\"","When she found out about this, she thought the auntie was exaggerating.","But seeing An Ling like this now, she felt it wasn't impossible.","Ever since this woman stopped liking Second Brother, she had become much more interesting than before.","An Ling silently walked a few steps faster. \"...\"","Was Shen Fuyuan really Mother Shen's biological daughter? Why was she a bit excited that her own mother got cursed at?","Shen Fuyuan saw through her expression, her hands lazily stuffed into her jacket pockets. \"I know what you're thinking. I don't have much affection for my mom. She favors boys over girls, keeps a tight watch on my brother, and spoils him a lot. I've always been left to fend for myself.\"","An Ling paused, stood in front of the elevator, and pressed the button. \"Favors boys over girls?\"","\"Yeah.\" Shen Fuyuan tsked twice. \"Anyway, no matter what mess my Second Brother makes, she can smooth it over. But it makes no difference to me; I don't want her to control me anyway.\"","An Ling recalled her previous experiences at the Shen family, walked into the elevator, and pressed the button for the basement floor.","\"Isn't Shen Linyan also a man?\"","She didn't show the slightest bit of affection for Shen Linyan. Rather than saying she favored boys over girls, it was more like she was simply biased towards Lu Jingshen.","Shen Fuyuan was silent for a few seconds, then suddenly spoke slowly:","\"Big Brother is different from me. Mom doesn't care much about me, but as for Big Brother, she hates him.\"","As soon as these words came out, the elevator suddenly became quiet.","Shen Fuyuan quietly glanced at An Ling's expression.","Seeing that the woman's facial expression hadn't changed, she slowly shifted her gaze away.","\"Anyway, ever since I can remember, Mom seems to have hated Big Brother. No matter what Big Brother does, it's wrong. But sometimes she changes and suddenly treats Big Brother well.\"","\"Dad also has very high expectations for Big Brother, so Big Brother basically can't make mistakes. Once he makes a mistake, he will be punished. Mom hates hearing crying, so she also demands that Big Brother not cry.\"","The time Shen Fuyuan remembered most deeply was when Big Brother accidentally got second place in an exam, and Dad took out a ruler to beat Big Brother's left hand.","Again and again, the ruler swung, slicing through the air with a sharp, piercing sound. The palm of his left hand was beaten until it was covered in bloody welts, flesh split open, a shocking sight.","During this time, if Big Brother couldn't help but let out a muffled groan.","Mom would say from the side: \"What are you crying for?! Crying is annoying! What face do you have to cry when you didn't do well on the exam?! You call yourself the Big Brother like this, what abilities do you have! One extra strike for every time you cry!\"","The reason they hit his left hand was because after the beating, Big Brother still had to use his right hand to tutor Second Brother with his homework.","Afterwards, Mom would have the auntie send ointment to Big Brother.","The best, and also the most expensive ointment.","Shen Fuyuan slowly let out a breath of stale air. \"Anyway, I don't understand what Mom is thinking. If you say it's love, it's not love. If you say it's hate, sometimes she cares quite a bit about Big Brother.\"","The elevator remained unusually quiet.","\"...\"","Shen Fuyuan paused. Unable to hold back any longer, she looked grumpily at the silent woman beside her.","\"Hey, give some reaction!\"","Normally, hearing that Big Brother was so miserable, shouldn't a wife be in tears and deeply moved?!","Why did this woman have no reaction at all! This is too cold-blooded!! So an arranged marriage really has no feelings at all!","Hearing this, An Ling seemed to have just snapped back to reality, her eyelashes fluttering slightly.","She pursed her lips, turned her head to look at Shen Fuyuan, and asked hesitantly, \"Why do I... not have any memory of Shen Linyan celebrating his birthday?\"","She had thought she just missed it, but after searching her memories just now, she realized there truly was no scene of Shen Linyan celebrating his birthday.","Shen Fuyuan choked, her expression suddenly a bit complex. She silently turned her face away.","\"Mom doesn't allow Big Brother to celebrate his birthday, because... Mom said the day she gave birth to Big Brother was her day of suffering, so why celebrate a birthday.\"","\"...\"","An Ling's eyes widened slightly in a daze.","She didn't speak, just silently raised her head, staring thoughtfully at the elevator screen.","It wasn't until the elevator reached the basement floor, and Shen Fuyuan had just stepped out of the elevator, planning to look for her manager's nanny van.","Suddenly, the woman's voice rang out from behind her.","\"Take my car to the Shen family.\"","Turning her head to look, she saw An Ling slowly stuffing her phone back into her pocket, stepping out of the elevator in high heels, her tone calm.","\"I'm going to attend the birthday party too.\"","If they didn't want her to go, she was absolutely going to go."]},{"number":44,"title":"Chapter 44: After All, the Lady Likes Herself","paragraphs":["\"Shen Linyan, you're smoking upstairs at a time like this? With so many elders downstairs, do you not even know to go greet them?\"","By the railing on the second floor, a man in a deep black suit leaned against the terrace balcony. His long legs were slightly bent, his posture lazy and relaxed.","A cigarette was held between his well-defined fingers, the ember flickering. The wedding ring on his ring finger accentuated his elegant and ascetic aura.","Hearing the voice, the man unhurriedly stubbed out the cigarette on the railing. The expression in his eyes was mild, and his voice was gentle yet distant.","\"I thought that on an occasion like this, Mother would prefer Lu Jingshen to make more of an appearance. After all, today is his birthday party.\"","The smoke wrapped around the man's deep contours. Though his posture was casual, it carried a noble aloofness that warned strangers to keep their distance.","Mother Shen looked at this face, a flash of disgust passing through her eyes.","She crossed her arms, her tone cold. \"As the newly appointed head of the Shen family, you should let them see you too.\"","\"Yes.\"","As if remembering something else, Mother Shen spoke up, \"I told you not to tell that woman. You didn't say anything, did you?\"","The man paused. With his hands in his suit pockets, he slowly gave an \"Mm\" of agreement. \"I didn't tell her.\"","Besides, his wife didn't like coming here anyway.","Hearing this, Mother Shen frowned. Thinking of what happened a few days ago, she still couldn't swallow her anger.","Most importantly, An Ling had changed too much recently, always giving her an unsettling feeling.","\"That girl has been very abnormal lately. She speaks even more presumptuously than before. If she keeps this up, divorce her as soon as possible.\"","Shen Linyan didn't say anything, but the smile faded from his face.","His dark eyes swept over Mother Shen's face. With almost no emotion in his eyes, he indifferently withdrew his gaze.","\"Why?\"","The man's flat, unwavering voice made Mother Shen freeze.","She turned her head as if unable to believe it.","\"You're asking me... why?\"","It had been many years since she last heard Shen Linyan question her.","The bizarre feeling in Mother Shen's heart expanded.","\"I say no because I don't want it! I am your mother! Shen Linyan, I am the one who feeds and provides for you, and you ask me why?\"","She lowered her voice, but her tone was heavy. \"I arranged this marriage for you in the first place. I am not satisfied with this wife, change her! I won't hold your brother's matter from a while ago against you.\"","Shen Linyan patted away the lingering smell of smoke on his clothes. His eyelids drooped, casting a shadow under his eyes, revealing his lack of interest.","If he had known, he wouldn't have come.","It would have been better to accompany his wife for dinner at home; she would probably be very happy.","\"I will handle it. Mother doesn't need to worry.\"","Mother Shen furrowed her brows, not quite satisfied with this answer.","She felt that Shen Linyan had also changed a lot compared to before. When he first came back, he wouldn't dare disobey her words at all.","She seemed to want to say something more, but thinking of the relatives downstairs, she held her tongue and shot him an irritated glare.","\"As long as you know. Hurry up and come down.\"","After Mother Shen left, Shen Linyan took out his phone, a thoughtful look on his face.","At this time, his wife should be home.","Should he ask what she had for dinner? As a husband, it seemed he ought to ask.","If he asked, his wife would probably be happy too. After all, his wife liked him, so he needed to respond in kind.","Tapping his fingertips lightly on the screen, the corners of the man's lips curled up slightly.","A familiar voice sounded by his ear.","\"Big brother.\"","He stopped his movements and lifted his eyelids to take a glance.","Zhou Wen walked over with a smile on her face. \"Is sister-in-law not here today? I looked for a long time just now but didn't see her.\"","The young woman was wearing a long white dress today, with slender ribbons draping from her shoulders. Her hair was swept to one side, and her eyes held a soft smile.","Shen Linyan looked at her quietly for a moment, his gaze then falling on the corner not far away. He gave a casual response.","Was there a need to ask?","She had clearly been eavesdropping over there for so long just now.","Zhou Wen seemed to want to say something else, but saw the man suddenly raise his hand, tapping his knuckles lightly against his watch. His voice was clear and smooth.","\"Sorry, it's getting late and the party is about to start. I'll go down first to help prepare.\"","\"Ah? Ah... okay.\"","She subconsciously stepped aside to make room. Remembering her purpose for coming, she hurriedly spoke up, \"Big brother, can you wait a bit before leaving after the party ends? I have something I want to give you. It won't take long.\"","Shen Linyan was about to refuse when Zhou Wen suddenly added.","\"It's a gift for sister-in-law. Didn't you tell me to get a gift for her last time?\"","He paused, his gaze lingering on the young woman's face for a moment, before slowly withdrawing his hand.","\"Alright.\"","The guests were all relatives of the Shen family. When Shen Linyan went downstairs, Lu Jingshen was standing with Shen Jiandong.","Mother Shen stood nearby, and the three of them seemed to be talking and laughing.","Faint compliments like \"a man of striking appearance\" and \"highly capable\" could be heard.","Ever since Lu Jingshen returned to the Shen Group to take up the position of CEO, he had shed his former playboy image. Nowadays, his steady and reliable demeanor left an increasingly deep impression on people.","Out of the twenty-something people in the hall, no one struck up a conversation with Shen Linyan. As the true heir of the Shen family, he was instead given the cold shoulder.","But it was normal. Most of the people here were invited by Mother Shen, all for the sake of paving the way for Lu Jingshen.","Shen Linyan picked up a glass of wine and walked over to a table. Just as he was about to take out his phone, a voice sounded from behind him.","\"Linyan, An Ling didn't come today?\"","Being interrupted time and time again made Shen Linyan frown slightly.","Turning his head, he saw that Shen Jiandong, who had just been talking with Lu Jingshen and the others, had walked over at some point.","Without waiting for Shen Linyan to answer, he laughed a few times. \"Without An Ling, this party is going to be boring.\"","His words implicitly and explicitly mocked the things An Ling had done over the past two years.","Shen Linyan took a sip of wine, his tone indifferent. \"If Uncle Jiandong is bored, why not convene a shareholders' meeting right here? Let the other shareholders come over and liven up the atmosphere.\"","Shen Jiandong's expression soured. He twitched the corners of his mouth and spoke with an ambiguous meaning, \"Maybe An Ling will come later. Chairman Shen had better keep a closer eye on his own wife, lest she make a fool of herself again.\"","Shen Linyan shot him a sideways glance. He was just about to speak when a sudden commotion broke out in the crowd.","A servant hurriedly ran over, looking nervous.","\"...Eldest Young Master, the Young Madam is here!\"","Hearing this, Shen Linyan's expression slightly froze.","Shen Jiandong let out a sneer. \"Speak of the devil and she appears.\"","The man ignored him and walked straight toward the center of the crowd.","The moment An Ling pushed the door open and walked in, she drew countless stares.","Sizing, mocking, and expectant gazes fell upon her, as if looking at a piece of merchandise.","Shen Fuyuan stood beside her, hands on her hips, and sighed, \"Walking in with you really gives me face. It's just like attending a press conference, except without the cameras.\"","\"...\"","An Ling's gaze swept over the people in the hall. Under the crystal chandelier, unfamiliar faces stared at her without any attempt to hide it.","In such a setting, everyone was dressed differently than usual, making them even harder to recognize.","That was why An Ling used to hate attending these kinds of parties the most.","It took ages just to figure out who was who.","But this time shouldn't be too troublesome.","Amidst a flurry of hushed whispers, two people emerged from the crowd. The middle-aged woman frowned upon seeing her and issued a familiar questioning tone.","\"An Ling, why are you here?\"","The corners of An Ling's mouth curled up.","See, there was always some idiot who would jump out and reveal their identity first."]},{"number":45,"title":"Chapter 45: This Time, It Was Her Who Disrupted This Interest Relationship","paragraphs":["\"Is Mom saying I shouldn't have come?\"","The woman wore a coffee-colored coat over a light beige high-necked thin knit sweater, paired with dark coffee straight-leg pants. Her long hair was casually gathered in a low bun, and pearl earrings adorned her ears, looking simple yet elegant and aloof.","While everyone else was dressed up for a grand occasion, she looked like she had just rushed over after getting off work.","An Ling kept her hands in her pockets, her gaze slowly sweeping past the man next to Mother Shen.","\"I am Lu Jingshen's sister-in-law, after all. It's his birthday, so I had to come and take a look.\"","Lu Jingshen frowned in disgust, his tone hostile, \"An Ling, I'm warning you, you'd better not try any of your tricks. You are not welcome here!\"","\"So this is the Shen family's second young master's attitude toward his sister-in-law.\"","An Ling sized him up playfully, then suddenly turned her head and burst into laughter. \"Ha, you really have no manners at all. I wonder who taught you.\"","As soon as the words fell, the entire venue quieted down.","The An Ling who used to be dead set on Lu Jingshen was actually speaking like this now.","Mother Shen's face darkened, \"An Ling, what crazy nonsense are you talking about! Security, take her out!\"","\"Did I say something wrong?\" An Ling spread her hands, her eyes curving into a smile. \"I just got here and you're already telling me to get out. That's not respectful at all.\"","Lu Jingshen gritted his teeth, \"What right do you have to talk about me!\"","Seeing that the situation was going south, Zhou Wen quickly stepped in to smooth things over. \"Jingshen, Mom, let it be. Sister-in-law is already here.\"","After saying that, she looked at An Ling with a slightly apologetic expression. \"Sorry, Sister-in-law, we really appreciate you coming to the party, but you don't need to prepare a gift. It's the thought that counts.\"","\"What gift?\"","An Ling said lazily, \"Didn't you buy a gift for my husband a while ago? It just so happens you didn't give it to him. Why don't you take it out and give it to Lu Jingshen now, and just pretend it's from me.\"","The atmosphere in the room froze for a moment, as if everyone was processing the massive amount of information in that sentence.","Beside them, Shen Fuyuan let out a \"Wow.\"","Zhou Wen's eyes widened. Facing everyone's stares, her face flushed with embarrassment, and she quickly waved her hands. \"Sister-in-law! Don't say things that will cause misunderstandings! Big Brother didn't take it! Besides, I only bought it to thank Big Brother!\"","Lu Jingshen's face instantly darkened. \"You bought a gift for Shen Linyan?\"","\"I was just thanking Big Brother!\" Zhou Wen looked panicked and quickly explained in a low voice, \"Jingshen, don't misunderstand, listen to me, at the time I just...\"","But Lu Jingshen grabbed her wrist.","His eyes were dark and ruthless, ignoring the gazes of the people around them, his tone cold. \"Zhou Wen! Didn't I tell you to stay away from Shen Linyan! Don't tell me you still have feelings for him! Didn't you give him enough in the past, and now you're still giving him things?!\"","In an instant, the crowd of guests was dumbfounded.","The past?!","The second madam and the eldest young master actually had a history?","An Ling's expression remained unchanged, but the hands in her pockets slowly clenched.","Whispers began to rise and fall.","\"Is it true?\"","\"I only knew that An Ling used to chase after Lu Jingshen, but I didn't expect Zhou Wen and the eldest young master to have a history too.\"","\"Oh, this is getting exciting.\"","\"The way An Ling said it, it seems she knows about it too. Maybe this is revenge. The Shen family is really interesting.\"","Zhou Wen was both angry and anxious, her eyes welling up with tears. \"Lu Jingshen, what are you saying! There is absolutely nothing between Big Brother and me. That was all in the past, why are you bringing it up now.\"","Lu Jingshen's face grew darker. \"The past?! Then why did you still go give Shen...\"","Before he could finish, Mother Shen suddenly scolded him sharply. \"Lu Jingshen! Watch the occasion! Zhou Wen already said it was a misunderstanding!\"","After saying that, Mother Shen glared at An Ling with a cold and sinister look, as if she wanted to eat her alive.","An Ling, however, slowly curved her eyes into a smile at her.","You like celebrating birthdays? Go ahead.","If I let you have a peaceful birthday, I might as well stop being the vicious female supporting character.","From now on, whenever Lu Jingshen celebrates his birthday, people probably won't be thinking about An Ling anymore.","After all, what could be more exciting than this drama.","Watching this scene, Shen Fuyuan couldn't help but cover her mouth and exclaim, \"An Ling, you are... freaking awesome.\"","She hadn't seen such a melodramatic scene in years.","\"...\"","Shen Fuyuan quietly leaned over. \"By the way, how did you know that Big Brother and Zhou Wen had a history? Look at Second Brother's reaction, he really cares.\"","An Ling's expression was indifferent.","\"I guessed.\"","The gentle second male lead and the female lead interact, the male lead sees them and misunderstands, the male lead gets crazy jealous, isn't this plot everywhere?","It was just that even she hadn't expected that what she said casually actually existed in this novel.","Lu Jingshen really used to be jealous of Shen Linyan and Zhou Wen.","Catching a glimpse of the surroundings from the corner of her eye, An Ling didn't spot Shen Linyan, so she withdrew her gaze.","\"I'm leaving now.\"","Shen Fuyuan was startled. \"You're leaving just like that!?\"","Wasn't she here to find Big Brother?","\"Yeah.\"","An Ling guessed what Shen Fuyuan was thinking.","But actually, she didn't come here for Shen Linyan.","She just suddenly thought of her previous plan.","She needed to show her face more and shatter the image the system had built for her over the past two years.","So that was her goal.","And the result was quite satisfying.","Judging from this, the relationship between An Ling and Lu Jingshen would no longer be one of pursuer and pursued.","It would be more like enemies.","Just as An Ling was about to turn around, footsteps suddenly sounded behind her, and the familiar crisp scent of cedar mixed with tobacco drifted into her nose.","\"Wife.\"","A deep voice sounded above her head.","An Ling stopped in her tracks and looked up at the man in front of her, her gaze immediately landing on that familiar black tie.","Shen Linyan really did what he said; he wore the tie she gave him.","Her gaze paused slightly, and she pursed her lips, not knowing what she was thinking.","Seeing that the woman's mood was off, Shen Linyan paused slightly, lowered his eyes, and gently hooked his long fingers around her hand.","\"Wife, let's go home first, okay?\"","But from behind came Mother Shen's vicious voice.","\"Shen Linyan! Make that woman leave! Then hurry up and explain that there is nothing between you and Zhou Wen!\"","She pointed at An Ling's back through gritted teeth, her face looking terrible. \"This kind of woman doesn't deserve to stay in our Shen family! She doesn't deserve to be my daughter-in-law! Divorce her immediately! Right now! Immediately!\"","Sure enough, the moment things felt off at the beginning, she should have made Shen Linyan divorce this woman!","It was bad enough that this woman brought no benefits, but now she was actually biting the hand that fed her!","Shen Linyan ignored Mother Shen's roaring and held the woman's hand, wanting to leave.","But unexpectedly, An Ling stood rooted to the spot and didn't move.","After a moment of silence, she took a deep breath, let out a helpless, low chuckle, and slowly looked up at the man in front of her.","\"What should we do... Shen Linyan.\"","Although tonight's incident would bring trouble to Lu Jingshen and Zhou Wen, Shen Linyan was also a party involved.","As Shen Linyan's wife, she had actively exposed her husband's scandal with someone else, completely disregarding the impact it would have on Shen Linyan.","She knew what would happen once those words were spoken.","Zhou Wen and Shen Linyan, how could there have been nothing between them in the past? As long as she lit the fuse even slightly, Lu Jingshen would completely explode, and there would be conflict between the male and female leads.","Shen Fuyuan called her cold-blooded, saying she was completely indifferent whenever she heard anything concerning Shen Linyan.","Indifferent? An Ling just felt that it wasn't her place anymore.","Saving Shen Linyan—Zhou Wen had already done that.","Giving him gifts, celebrating his birthday... the female lead had already done all of that in the earlier parts of the story.","As someone so starved for affection, how could Shen Linyan not have been moved after meeting a female lead like her?","Just as Jiang Mai had said before, Shen Linyan's tragic past existed solely to give the female lead a chance to heal him.","Unlike her, who only ever used him.","Jiang Mai was right. She really did need to break free from the Shen family as soon as possible, break free from the male and female leads, and break free from this intoxicating tenderness she was so close to drowning in.","And now was the perfect time. The chance to distance herself from the plot was right in front of her.","All she had to do...","All she had to do was exploit Shen Linyan's kindness one last time.","Under the man's stunned gaze, An Ling concealed the emotions in her eyes, slowly curving them into a smile as she pulled her hand from his grasp.","\"What is there left to explain? Shen Linyan, did you really think I could just accept what happened between you and Zhou Wen back then?\"","I'm sorry, Shen Linyan.","This time, she was the one destroying their relationship built on mutual benefit."]},{"number":46,"title":"Chapter 46: Doesn't Madame Like Him Why Would She Want a Divorce","paragraphs":["The moment the words fell, the banquet hall became so quiet you could hear a pin drop.","Even Shen Linyan's wife had personally stepped forward to confirm it. Did this matter need any further explanation?","\"Looks like it's true...\"","\"The deeper you dig into the Shen family, the more you find. The Shen family heir and his own younger brother's wife... tsk, tsk, tsk.\"","\"Looks like the headlines are going to change again.\"","\"Before, they were saying the eldest young master couldn't keep an eye on his wife. Turns out it's actually the second young master. What a mess...\"","Whispers erupted all around, every single comment heading exactly in the direction she had hoped for.","But at this moment, An Ling only found it noisy.","She even wanted to tell them to shut up.","She didn't dare to look into the man's eyes.","She couldn't face those eyes that were always gentle and smiling, now filled with absentmindedness and bewilderment.","Lowering her gaze, she put her hands back into her pockets, forced a smile, and enunciated every word:","\"Shen Linyan, do you dare say you've never accepted anything from Zhou Wen before? Previously, Zhou Wen even served as your...\"","The following words were too sharp and ugly. An Ling's gaze paused. She silently went over them in her mind but still couldn't bring herself to say them.","This level was enough.","Hearing this, Mother Shen's face completely darkened. \"That is absolutely not true! An Ling, shut your mouth! In our Shen family, you are the only sl—\"","\"I have.\"","The man's soft, slow words instantly cut off all of Mother Shen's noise. She stared wide-eyed in sheer disbelief.","An Ling's eyelashes trembled, and she pressed her lips tightly together.","Shen Linyan slowly withdrew his outstretched hand, his fingertips curling tightly into a fist.","He slowly raised his head. The depths of his eyes were pitch-black, like a dead, silent pool. His voice was so light it was almost inaudible.","\"I have accepted gifts from Zhou Wen.\"","Is this what his wife wanted...?","Just admitting it would be fine.","If he admitted it, his wife would be happy, and she would go home with him.","An Ling's hands in her pockets had long since clenched into fists.","She turned to look at Mother Shen and let out a cold laugh.","\"Did you hear that? Still talking about birthdays, you should manage your own family affairs first. I, An Ling, no longer owe your Shen family anything. If we're going to divorce, then let's divorce. I haven't wronged anyone! At worst, we can just expose everything to the public together!\"","After speaking, she turned around to leave.","But looking at the man standing in front of her, her eyelids twitched. She pursed her lips and stepped sideways to walk past him.","Shen Linyan looked down in a daze.","The hem of the girl's clothes brushed past his fingertips, and that sweet fragrance dissipated along with it, leaving only the bone-chilling cold of the night.","From the hall came Mother Shen's shrill curses, the guests' discussions, and even Shen Fuyuan's cautious inquiries.","But at this moment, all the sounds seemed to fade away.","Shen Linyan sluggishly raised his head, his eyes fixed only on the woman's retreating back.","His ears were buzzing, and his chest felt like it had been struck by a blunt object, a dull, aching pain spreading through it.","What did she mean by... divorce?","Didn't his wife like him? Why would she want a divorce?","He had clearly done everything a husband should do.","Why would she still want a divorce?","\"Fuck, she just doesn't like you!!\"","In a private room at a club, Gu Xiaochi subconsciously cried out in shock.","Realizing he had misspoken, he quickly covered his mouth. \"No, Shen Linyan, why did you admit it! That woman was obviously using you on purpose!\"","Using Shen Linyan to divert attention.","This way, everyone's eyes would be on Shen Linyan and Zhou Wen, and then that woman could beautifully fade into the background.","Even if they divorced, no one would think it was her fault.","If he hadn't been considerate of Shen Linyan's presence, Gu Xiaochi would have shouted: Indeed, nothing is more poisonous than a woman's heart!","To actually use Shen Linyan's feelings to extricate herself!","Wang Yihong, drinking on the side, didn't even dare to speak. He was clumsy with words and afraid of saying the wrong thing, so he could only frantically signal Liang Chen.","Suddenly hearing this news late at night, all of them were dumbfounded.","Shen Linyan, who had always schemed against others, had actually been schemed against by his own wife.","Most importantly, Shen Linyan had willingly jumped into this trap.","Now it was great. That old woman was going crazy with anger, and that old fox Shen Zhong also threw a huge fit when he found out.","Receiving the signal, Liang Chen also indicated he was powerless, his gaze shifting to the other side of the sofa.","The man was hunched over, sunken into the sofa, his elbows resting on his knees, a few strands of hair falling over his forehead.","His usually handsome and sharp profile now looked somewhat absent-minded, his unfocused eyes staring blankly at the phone on the table.","Liang Chen poured a glass of liquor and silently pushed it toward Shen Linyan, perfectly blocking the phone.","\"An Ling has changed so much recently. Haven't you ever been suspicious?\"","An Ling really didn't like Lu Jingshen anymore, but no one expected she would scheme against Shen Linyan.","Liang Chen took a sip of his drink and carefully said, \"So are you really getting a divorce? To be honest, a divorce wouldn't be bad for you right now. You're considered one of the victims too.\"","A younger brother ruining his older brother's relationship—with this narrative, the public backlash against Shen Linyan would actually be much smaller.","An Ling bringing up this suggestion—who knew if she was really doing it for Shen Linyan's good, or if she just wanted a divorce herself.","Unknown which word triggered Shen Linyan, his eyelids twitched. He picked up the glass on the table and downed it in one gulp. A burning sensation slid down his throat and churned in his stomach.","\"Divorce...\"","He muttered with his head down, \"I just don't quite understand...\"","He had done everything, so why were they still getting a divorce?","Did she not like him? Or was it because that affection was gone?","Just like those people before, they only took an interest in him for a while, and as time passed, the interest gradually faded.","The other three exchanged glances, and finally, Liang Chen asked:","\"Shen Linyan, An Ling used you. Aren't you angry?\"","The man on the sofa kept his head down, his expression unreadable, his lips pressed into a tight, straight line.","After an unknown amount of time, he finally spoke in a hoarse voice:","\"...I'm not angry.\"","He was just wondering which step went wrong.","Clearly, the things he did were no different from before.","He even tried harder than before.","Performing well in front of An Ling's parents, giving An Ling the best, giving An Ling what she wanted.","He just wanted to try and keep An Ling's affection.","But he didn't know how to love someone, and he couldn't even fake it.","And now, even An Ling wanted to divorce him.","Liang Chen thought for a moment, and the words on his lips finally turned into a sigh.","Some things would only be useful if An Ling asked them herself.","But whether she would be able to ask them was uncertain.","\"An Ling should be at home now, right? You two should have a talk.\""]},{"number":47,"title":"Chapter 47: He Is Gone, His Wife","paragraphs":["Twelve midnight, the night was hazy.","\"Beep—\"","The electronic lock clicked open, and the front door swung wide.","The man stood outside, looking down at the light spilling from inside.","The light in the living room had never made Shen Linyan so afraid before.","It was as if a cliff was waiting for him right in front of his eyes.","He didn't know how high this cliff was—whether falling would leave him lightly injured, heavily injured, or if he would die without a sound.","After a moment of silence, he slowly pushed the door and walked in.","The woman was sitting on the sofa looking at her phone.","She was still wearing that light gold silk nightgown, her hair let down, nestled softly into the cushions.","It was exactly the same scene Shen Linyan had seen when he came home that night.","The moment he pushed the door open, the living room lights were warm. Seeing that scene, the first thought in his mind was:","It actually feels like a home.","This house, bought to be their marital home, was for the first time crowned with the special meaning of a home.","He thought he was crazy at the time.","Why would he have such a thought?","But now, he had long grown accustomed to calling this place \"home.\"","Hearing the sound of the door opening, the woman on the sofa paused her movements, but she did not turn her head.","Both of them maintained their silence.","After an unknown amount of time, An Ling slowly turned her head and looked at him gently.","\"Shen Linyan, can we talk after you take a shower? I've been waiting for you to come back.\"","Shen Linyan's pupils shrank slightly, and he subconsciously tightened his grip on the door handle.","This sentence was exactly what he had said before apologizing to An Ling back then.","\"...Okay.\"","After coming out of the shower, the man sat on the sofa.","He lowered his head, his eyelids drooping and casting a faint shadow under his eyes. His profile was elegant and clean. Drops of water rolled down from the tips of his hair and fell onto the back of his hand.","An Ling sat on the sofa, hugging her knees, her clear eyes looking at him quietly.","In the silent air, a very soft voice suddenly sounded.","\"I'm sorry.\"","Shen Linyan's body stiffened slightly, and he slowly raised his head.","Under the dim light, his eyes met the woman's. In their seemingly calm gaze, complex and obscure emotions were surging.","He opened his mouth slightly, his Adam's apple bobbing with difficulty and bitterness:","\"...Why? Madam.\"","His hoarse voice lost its usual gentleness, gaining an indescribable hidden pain.","She clearly knew that there was nothing between him and Zhou Wen, so why did she deliberately make him admit it in public?","They clearly could have gone on like this forever, so why ask for a divorce?","An Ling's heart trembled at his words. Her eyelashes fluttered rapidly as she looked away, pressing her lips tightly together, her voice thick with suppressed emotion.","\"I'm sorry, Shen Linyan. I was the one who broke the interest relationship this time. I will accept whatever compensation you want. I will make it up to you, anything except... divorce.\"","But all he wanted was not to divorce.","He didn't want An Ling's identity as his wife to disappear.","Once An Ling left, he would be all alone...","He would be all alone.","The light in Shen Linyan's dark eyes suddenly extinguished. His fingertips turned white from clenching, and he anxiously twisted the wedding ring on his ring finger back and forth.","The alcohol he drank earlier in the evening seemed to churn wildly in his stomach, sending waves of cramping pain. Even his heart felt heavy and sour, like a wad of cotton was blocking his throat.","After a long silence, he asked softly, \"Madam... can you promise me anything?\"","\"Anything,\" An Ling nodded hurriedly.","Shen Linyan looked at her gently and said softly:","\"Then will Madam spend today's birthday with me?\"","As soon as the words came out, An Ling's eyes suddenly froze.","She blankly lowered her legs and opened her mouth, but didn't know what to say. At a loss, she looked down at the time on her phone, turning her head back and forth, hesitating to speak.","After a good while, she asked hesitantly, \"Today... is your birthday?\"","Shen Linyan nodded: \"Yes.\"","An Ling was truly stunned now, her head spinning.","How could it be today?","According to the plot, Shen Linyan had only been back in the country for less than a year. He came back at the beginning of this year and married her a few months later.","Calculating like this, the female lead and Shen Linyan hadn't spent a birthday together yet.","Then what was the gift?","An Ling remained silent for a long time.","\"Shen Linyan, can I ask you a question?\"","\"You may.\"","\"What was the gift Zhou Wen gave you before?\"","Shen Linyan paused for a moment, then his eyes curved into a smile, his tone gentle.","\"She was having a conflict with Lu Jingshen at the time, so she gave me a jar of folded paper stars that Lu Jingshen had rejected.\"","\"...\"","Damn it! Damn it, damn it, damn it!","What kind of crappy gift was that!","An Ling closed her eyes and took a deep breath, running her fingers through her hair in frustration as her eyes constantly searched around the house.","How could it be today? The day after the male lead's birthday was Shen Linyan's birthday.","What a damned setting!","An Ling gritted her teeth, stood up, walked over, and cupped the man's face in her hands.","She looked down at him, her face serious, and spoke solemnly:","\"Okay, I'll celebrate it with you. What kind do you want? Lively? Or quiet? What flavor of cake do you want to eat? How about I have someone decorate the house? And then we set off fireworks? We can spend a few million, I'll pay for it. I promise it will be better than Lu Jingshen's. His party was too low-class and not fun at all. I'll give you an unforgettable one.\"","The girl's chattering voice broke the lifeless atmosphere in the living room.","Shen Linyan's eyes curved as he let out a low chuckle. He slowly grasped her wrists, turned his head, and gently kissed her palm.","\"I just want to spend it with my wife.\"","Instantly, An Ling's fingers froze in the air.","She forgot what else she was going to say, just staring blankly at the man on the sofa.","A voice in her heart seemed to be frantically warning her: That's enough, this is enough, don't continue anymore.","You can't like him, you can't like him.","Staying in the Shen family would do her no good. She had to run away as soon as possible, as far away from the male and female leads as possible.","Shen Linyan treats you like this only because you are his wife. If it were someone else, Shen Linyan would do the same.","He is simply a good husband by nature.","If you like Shen Linyan, you will be imprisoned in the Shen family for the rest of your life.","Are you gambling on Shen Linyan's unknown affection, or are you gambling with your own life?","Let Shen Linyan go. You've used him enough.","An Ling's eyes stung. She forced a smile, slowly pulled her hands back, and quietly withdrew from that touch of tenderness.","\"Then I'll cook you longevity noodles. You've been drinking all night and haven't eaten anything.\"","After cooking the noodles, An Ling had Shen Linyan sit at the table to eat while she went to the sofa to grab her phone and pick out a cake.","But the moment she picked it up, the screen of the man's phone next to it suddenly lit up, and a message caught her eye.","Zhou Wen: [I'm sorry, Big Brother, tonight's events were too sudden. I originally planned that after the party ended tonight, when I gave Sister-in-law her gift, I would also give you a birthday present. I'm afraid I won't be able to give it to you now. Wishing you a happy birthday.]","An Ling's movements froze in place as she quietly stared at this message.","It wasn't until the screen went dark again that she slowly picked up her own phone, the emotions in her eyes unreadable.","Sitting back at the dining table, she smiled at the man in front of her.","\"Is it good? The only thing I'm relatively skilled at cooking is noodles.\"","Shen Linyan nodded gently. \"It's delicious.\"","The light hit the man's face, highlighting his thick and long eyelashes, his high nose bridge, and his clean, sharp brow bone. It made his shallow eye sockets look clear and translucent, giving him an air of noble elegance and gentleness.","With such a kind and gentle husband from an arranged marriage, it was impossible for anyone not to fall in love with him.","Any other wife would do better than her.","An Ling slowly tightened her grip on the phone in her hand and spoke softly,","\"Shen Linyan, I don't want a divorce because you're not good enough.\"","The man sitting across from her stiffened.","Without giving him a chance to speak, her words came out slow and gentle, yet exceptionally clear across the table.","\"During the day, I will buy a cake and celebrate this birthday with you. The day after, we can go through with the divorce procedures. I don't need to take anything; you can choose whatever terms are most favorable to you.\"","\"Shen Linyan, you are a good husband, but I am not a good wife. You will meet a wife who is much better than me.\"","\"She will remember your birthday, she will spend many birthdays with you, she will give you gifts and even more love. You will be happier than you are now.\"","An Ling stood up.","The chair scraped against the floor with a harsh, jarring screech.","\"Happy birthday, Shen Linyan.\"","The man hadn't looked up once. In the shadows, his tense jaw trembled, and his lips quivered slightly along with it.","It wasn't until An Ling reached the hallway that his voice sounded from behind her.","\"Is a divorce... what my wife truly wants?\"","His hoarse voice carried a barely perceptible tremor.","She stopped in her tracks. Without turning around, she replied softly, \"Yes.\"","Shen Linyan's gaze instantly shattered. As if his soul had been drained away, his eyes fixed stiffly on the bowl of noodles in front of him, the corners of his once-clear eyes instantly turning red.","His Adam's apple bobbed with bitter emotion as he tightened his grip on his chopsticks.","\"I agree to it...\"","Whatever An Ling wanted, he would give her.","Even if it was a divorce.","This was... what a husband ought to do.","And it was the last thing he could do as her husband.","Shen Linyan didn't look up until he heard the sound of the door closing.","The corners of his eyes were painfully red. Large teardrops smashed against the back of his hand and fell into his bowl, but he remained completely oblivious, just staring blankly ahead.","It felt as though a piece of his heart had been hollowed out, a dense, overwhelming ache spreading across his chest.","He had lost her, his wife.","He would have a new wife.","A better, new wife.","He would have to continue fulfilling the duties of a husband for this new wife.","After an unknown amount of time, the man numbly raised his hand. Looking at the tears on his skin, he murmured in a low voice:","\"But I don't want to celebrate my birthday anymore...\"","He never wanted to celebrate his birthday again."]},{"number":48,"title":"Chapter 48: I Know the Ending of the Novel","paragraphs":["The next afternoon, An Ling deliberately got off work early.","Shen Fuyuan sent her a message.","[Are you really going to divorce my older brother??]","An Ling was at the bakery picking up a cake. Seeing the message, she replied:","[Didn't you dislike having me as your sister-in-law? Isn't this a good thing.]","The other side fell silent.","The clerk brought out the cake. \"Miss An, here is the cake you ordered. Actually, our store offers delivery, so you didn't have to go out of your way to come here.\"","\"It's fine, I just happened to be free today.\"","An Ling took it and took a look.","The clerk asked out of habit, \"Is it your birthday? Since you're here, we'll give you some freshly baked cookies as a gift.\"","She paused and looked up. \"No, it's for my... husband.\"","\"Your husband?\" The clerk smiled, packed the cookies, and handed them over. \"You two must have a great relationship, considering you made a special trip to the store to pick up his cake.\"","An Ling did not refute it.","Not knowing what to say, she just smiled and took the cookies.","Just as she walked out of the store, Shen Fuyuan's messages started popping up one after another.","[Oh... it's not that I dislike it. Since you've changed, it's not like I can't call you sister-in-law...]","[If you and my brother divorce, my mom will definitely be the happiest. No one will dare to blatantly talk back to her anymore. She'd love nothing more than for my brother to be alone, or to find him some random wife from who knows where.]","An Ling stood there, looking down at her phone. After a good while, she replied:","[That won't happen. Shen Linyan will refuse.]","She had told Shen Linyan to say no so many times, it should have had some effect, right?","Shen Fuyuan: [Are you so sure? What if he agrees? After all, he didn't refuse when he was told to marry a woman like you... Uh, I don't mean to insult you, I just mean my brother won't refuse my mom's demands, you know?]","Amused, An Ling replied: [If that day really comes, can I crash the wedding and steal the groom?]","Shen Fuyuan instantly got excited: [Really!?!]","An Ling: [Just kidding.]","Shen Fuyuan: [...]","Smiling, An Ling put her phone away and placed the cake on the floor of the passenger seat.","Just as she got into the car, her phone chimed again.","Secretary Chen sent a document.","[Young Madam, this is the drafted divorce agreement. Please take a look and see if there is anything you want to add.]","Just as she was about to open it, Secretary Chen sent another message.","[Chairman Shen said that regarding the assets, he will give you the maximum share, but he hopes to keep the house.]","An Ling paused and typed.","[Okay.]","Anyway, after the divorce, she would be living with the An family.","That place could be left for Shen Linyan, so he wouldn't have to move back to the Shen family home.","When An Ling opened the document and saw the amount Shen Linyan was giving her, her gaze froze.","The amount written there was exactly... two hundred million.","It was the exact number she had casually mentioned when joking with Shen Linyan.","She had said that if he ever went bankrupt one day, he should leave her two hundred million.","Seeing this number, her memory seemed to be pulled back to that night. An Ling let out a helpless laugh.","After arriving home, she parked the car and took the cake out.","Just as she pressed the elevator button, her phone rang again.","Looking at the caller ID, it was actually Jiang Mai, whom she hadn't seen in a long time.","Jiang Mai had been out of town on a business trip for training these past few days. She was so busy she didn't even have time to check her phone, so they had only chatted occasionally.","After answering, Jiang Mai's enthusiastic voice came through the line.","\"I'm coming back tomorrow! I even bought you some local specialties, Lingling. The dragon's beard candy here is incredibly delicious! I'll bring some for your mom and dad too!\"","An Ling smiled and agreed, \"Sure, my parents were just asking me last time when you'd be back.\"","\"The scenery here is pretty nice too, it's a good place for a vacation. It's just that the traffic is too congested, and it's not convenient to catch a cab.\"","Jiang Mai complained on the other end, \"Also, that training institute doesn't cover accommodation, and the hotel is far away. It forces me to leave super early every time and take the bus. You know, the morning buses are full of old grandpas and grandmas, there are absolutely no seats...\"","As she spoke, she seemed to remember something, and her tone shifted.","\"By the way, how are things between you and Shen Linyan now? Last time you said you were teaching him how to be a bad guy, are you still teaching him?\"","The smile on An Ling's lips paused slightly.","Seeing the elevator doors open, she walked in, pressed her floor button, and then said softly:","\"Jiang Mai, I'm going to divorce Shen Linyan.\"","On the other end, Jiang Mai was stunned for a moment, then subconsciously exclaimed, \"Divorce?!\"","What the? She had only been on a business trip for a few days, how were these two suddenly getting a divorce?!?","She was a bit incoherent, \"Wait, your relationship hasn't even started yet, how can you be getting a divorce? This doesn't follow the laws of romance novels! Where is the love, the hate, the passion, the melodramatic misunderstandings!\"","\"...\"","An Ling let out a long sigh and laughed, \"Isn't this a good thing? I'm getting away from the plot as early as possible. You were the one who advised me to do this in the first place.\"","As long as the divorce was successful, whatever male and female leads, whatever second male lead, would have absolutely nothing to do with her anymore.","Jiang Mai was still a bit surprised. \"Are you guys really getting a divorce? But An Ling, didn't you say you wanted to change Shen Linyan?\"","An Ling stared at the elevator doors and didn't speak.","After a moment, she lowered her eyes, pursed her lips, and said, \"Divorcing him is my way of changing him.\"","\"What do you mean?\" Jiang Mai didn't understand right away.","An Ling sighed, \"Jiang Mai, I didn't tell you guys, but I know the ending of the novel. My ending is death, and Shen Linyan's ending is bankruptcy. Right up until the very last moment, Shen Linyan and I are still married.\"","If she continued to be with Shen Linyan, what if Shen Linyan really headed towards bankruptcy, what if she really died.","What if they repeated the disastrous ending of the novel?","Divorcing now might just solve everything.","Jiang Mai on the other end fell silent. It took a good while before she spoke, \"Why didn't you say so earlier...\"","Looking at it this way, divorce was indeed the best choice.","The elevator reached her floor, and An Ling walked out. \"I'm going to handle the paperwork tomorrow. We can talk more when we meet tomorrow. I have to celebrate Shen Linyan's birthday in a bit.\"","\"Oh, oh, okay, then you go ahead and... huh??\" Jiang Mai thought she had misheard, her tone hesitant. \"...Celebrate whose birthday?\"","\"Shen Linyan's.\" An Ling patiently repeated. \"That's all, I'm hanging up.\"","In her hotel room, Jiang Mai stared blankly at her disconnected phone.","\"Is this... right?\"","What kind of normal person celebrates their soon-to-be ex-husband's birthday the day before their divorce??"]},{"number":49,"title":"Chapter 49: Did Madame... ever have feelings for me","paragraphs":["Opening the door, An Ling looked down and changed her shoes.","Hearing the noise, Auntie Cheng hurried out to take the cake. You are back, Ma'am.","An Ling responded, put down her bag, took off her coat, and walked toward the kitchen while rolling up her sleeves. Are you stewing soup?","Yes, it is almost done.","Auntie Cheng smiled and stepped aside to make room. You said you were going to cook today, so I helped you chop all the vegetables.","An Ling felt a little embarrassed. I am not very good at it, so I still need your help.","No problem, no problem. Auntie Cheng looked very happy. If Sir knows you are cooking yourself today, he will definitely be thrilled!","An Ling smiled and put on an apron. I am just afraid he will worry it tastes bad.","Nonsense, Sir likes you very much. He will surely love whatever you make.","Auntie Cheng turned to set out the chopped vegetables, her tone full of emotion. Ever since you started coming home for dinner, Sir has also started coming back often to eat. He even asks me if you will be home for dinner, and after noticing what you like to eat, he always tells me to make it often.","An Ling's hands paused while tying her apron. After a moment, she let out a slow, soft laugh.","Is that so...","She checked the time and set her phone aside. Then let us get started.","In her twenty-five years of life, even during the two years she was possessed by the system, An Ling had never cooked.","As for the boxed lunches the system had delivered to Lu Jingshen, in An Ling's memory, those were entirely made by someone else.","It seemed the system had some self-awareness, deeply afraid that its bad cooking would make Lu Jingshen hate it, but it forgot that Lu Jingshen would not eat them at all.","After two hours, An Ling only managed to make a few simple dishes, which were even simpler than their usual dinners.","She looked at the stir-fried greens and tomato with scrambled eggs on the table, as well as the only slightly complex-looking beef brisket stew, pondered for a moment, and turned her head to speak:","Auntie Cheng, how about you make a few more dishes?","She suddenly felt her cooking was a bit too embarrassing to present.","Auntie Cheng smiled and brought the soup out. Do not worry, Ma'am, Sir will like it.","She took off her apron and gathered her things. Sir will be off work soon, Ma'am, so I will take my leave now.","An Ling nodded. After the auntie left, she took out her phone, snapped a picture, and sent it to An Zhou.","What do you think? I made all of this.","An Zhou: Are you sure it is edible?","An Ling: ...","An Zhou: By the way, why did you cook? Do not tell me it is for Shen Linyan?","An Ling had not told them about the divorce yet, and An Zhou seemed completely unaware. It appeared that last night's incident had been suppressed by the Shen family.","An Ling did not reply to him and went to unbox the cake.","At that moment, the door lock beeped, followed by the sound of footsteps.","An Ling stood by the dining table, met the man's eyes, and then her eyes curved into a smile.","You are back.","Shen Linyan glanced at her face, then looked away and gave a soft Mm.","An Ling finished unboxing the cake. Then go wash your hands and let us eat. When I went to pick up the cake today, the clerk even gave me some free cookies.","When the two sat at the dining table to eat, An Ling picked at her food absentmindedly, her eyes quietly observing Shen Linyan's expression.","Noticing her gaze, the man paused, stopped his chopsticks, and said, You do not need to worry, my wife, it is very delicious.","An Ling looked slightly stunned. You know I made this?","Auntie Cheng already told me. Shen Linyan kept his head down, his tone remaining gentle. Thank you, my wife.","An Ling stared at him for a moment and slowly put down her chopsticks.","Shen Linyan, are you in a bad mood today?","From the time he came back until now, except for that brief moment when he walked in the door, Shen Linyan had not made eye contact with her.","Hearing this, the man opposite her froze.","In the quiet air, a very soft voice was heard a moment later.","I do not know...","In fact, Shen Linyan himself did not know why he was like this.","He did not understand what this feeling was, nor did he know when his tears had fallen last night. By the time he realized it, the tears had already landed on the back of his hand.","If An Ling wanted a divorce, he, as her husband, should just agree to it, as casually as he had agreed to marry her in the first place.","It was nothing more than his previous plan to swallow up the An family falling through.","But that tearing pain in his heart was something he could hardly forget.","He was even distracted when he went to the company in the morning. When Secretary Chen brought over the divorce agreement, he held his pen but hesitated for a long time, staring at the word divorce on the document.","Was this love?","Did he like An Ling?","Shen Linyan, do you like me?","The unexpected question rang in his ears.","Shen Linyan's eyes trembled slightly.","The sound of a chair being pulled back broke the air, followed by footsteps drawing near until they stopped beside him. The woman sat down next to him.","Shen Linyan, are you sad because of the divorce?","Her gaze landed on the wedding ring on the man's ring finger, and An Ling's eyes paused slightly.","How could she not sense that something was wrong with Shen Linyan?","As early as last night, she had already noticed the man's tense and suppressed emotions.","In the silence, An Ling gently took the man's left hand, her fingertips tenderly tracing over his knuckles one by one. She lowered her eyes and said softly:","Shen Linyan, it is normal for you to feel sad, because I am your first wife. You have done so much for me, and it is normal that you are reluctant to let go of this marriage.","She was Shen Linyan's first wife, the first person to accompany him for his birthday.","The first is always easily endowed with a special meaning.","Following the trend of redemption novels, she could even be considered Shen Linyan's salvation.","But ultimately, she was not his salvation, nor could she be.","If she stayed in the Shen family, she might die, and Shen Linyan might go bankrupt.","Besides, Shen Linyan did not really love her that much. He was just lacking companionship, which was why he had grown dependent on her.","Just like Zhou Wen before.","After spending time with Shen Linyan, An Ling could actually tell that Shen Linyan's feelings for Zhou Wen were not love.","He would reject Zhou Wen's gifts because of her, and he could clearly draw boundaries with Zhou Wen.","Perhaps at that time, Shen Linyan was merely craving that hint of care from Zhou Wen.","But this is not love, Shen Linyan.","Your feelings for me are just an illusion derived from a sense of responsibility.","Shen Linyan's breath hitched, and he subconsciously tightened his grip on her hand.","An Ling squeezed his hand back, smiled as she lowered her head, and brushed over the wedding ring on his finger, her voice remaining soft and slow.","Shen Linyan, I have told you before that you are inherently a good person. Right now, you just lack someone to keep you company. This person does not necessarily have to be me; it can be anyone.","You will be with your new wife in the future, and she will accompany you to do these things. You will also grow dependent on your new wife, and by then, you might not even remember me anymore.","Right now, Shen Linyan could reject Zhou Wen because of her.","In the future, he could also reject her, his ex-wife, because of his new wife.","At the end of the day, neither she nor Zhou Wen were Shen Linyan's ultimate salvation. They were merely manifestations of Shen Linyan's gentle persona.","The female lead, who was entangled in an emotional tug-of-war with the male lead, did not deserve Shen Linyan's true heart.","And the same went for her, the vicious female supporting character who was just using Shen Linyan.","Someone better would appear, someone more suited than either of them to love Shen Linyan.","An Ling raised her head slightly, her eyes curving as she said softly:","\"Shen Linyan, if you had married someone else, would you still have done all these things?\"","The man sat in his chair, his eyelashes trembling slightly.","After a long silence, he finally replied softly, his voice hoarse.","\"I would.\"","Even back when An Ling was still in love with Lu Jingshen, he had already been doing these things.","Cleaning up An Ling's messes, silently bearing the brunt of all the rumors and gossip—even when she treated him terribly, he had always responded to her with gentle patience.","Even if it had been someone else, he could have done the exact same.","Because acting this way did him no harm, nor did it cost him anything. If anything, it only helped him navigate the world and maintain his impeccable reputation.","So, was this not love?","Was everything just an illusion born from their time together?","If he had married a different woman, would he still feel this unusual emotional turmoil at the thought of divorce?","Shen Linyan slowly raised his head.","The overhead light traced the elegant, aristocratic contours of his face. Beneath his dark, unreadable gaze hid an imperceptible trace of bewilderment.","\"So, is it because you didn't feel my love that you want a divorce, my wife?\"","He asked softly, \"Have you... ever loved me?\""]},{"number":50,"title":"Chapter 50: He Has No Anling Anymore","paragraphs":["As soon as the words were spoken, the atmosphere at the table slightly froze.","It was as if time had stopped at this very moment.","An Ling sat in her seat, a fleeting blankness clearly flashing across her face.","The two questions suddenly thrown at her left her unsure of how to react.","To be exact, it was the latter question that she found impossible to answer.","...Like?","A moment later, the woman slowly raised her hand to prop up her chin.","She blinked, feigning a complaining tone: \"What are you doing? Who asks their ex-wife if she likes them or not? Of course I like someone as wonderful as Chairman Shen! Who wouldn't? Hmm?\"","Her joking words made it impossible to tell if she was just being polite or sincere.","Or perhaps, she was deliberately avoiding the topic.","Right, An Ling never needed to answer in the first place.","He didn't like An Ling, and the two of them were about to get divorced anyway. There was absolutely no need for An Ling to answer his question.","Did he really need her to admit whether she liked him or not?","Shen Linyan's mouth twitched bitterly. He knew he should smile at this moment.","Just like he always did, give a faint smile and naturally reply in a gentle voice, \"You are also very wonderful, Madam.\"","But right now, let alone smiling, he couldn't even form a complete sentence. The moment he opened his mouth, out came a trembling, broken tone.","He didn't know why he had asked this question.","But he wanted to know.","He just wanted to know the answer.","A sour ache gripped Shen Linyan's heart. He turned his head away in near panic and managed to force out a single word, \"Sorry...\"","Even if An Ling liked him, so what? He couldn't even give her the most basic response. He only kept An Ling around because he didn't want to be alone.","His seemingly affectionate actions were actually incredibly cheap; he wasn't worthy of An Ling at all.","Hearing the man's trembling apology, An Ling paused.","She took a deep breath, turned her head to blink away the sting in her eyes, and looked at the dishes on the table. Suddenly, she spoke softly:","\"Shen Linyan, this is the first time I've ever cooked for someone. Not even Lu Jingshen got this kind of treatment, but I did it for you today. Do you know why?\"","The man stiffened and slowly turned his head back.","He looked at her with reddened eyes. His clear, moist gaze seemed veiled by a layer of mist, looking fragile and bewildered.","An Ling's eyes curved as she gave him a gentle smile.","\"Because this is a perfect score reward.\"","\"Shen Linyan, you will always be a perfect ten to me.\"","She reached out to cup the man's face, her thumb quietly wiping the corner of his eye. \"I'm not divorcing you because I feel you don't love me. I just don't want our relationship to turn ugly, which is why I said I'd wait until after your birthday to get the divorce.\"","The corners of the man's eyes were red, and the depths of his eyes clearly reflected her face, as if trying to brand her into the very depths of his soul.","The atmosphere grew heavily quiet, the silence weaving into a suffocating net.","As their eyes met, An Ling lifted her head and slowly leaned in.","But just as she was about to kiss him, she suddenly raised her hand and gently covered the man's lips.","The tender kiss ultimately landed on the back of her own hand.","She lowered her eyes and murmured softly:","\"Shen Linyan, I hate the Shen family, so I don't want to stay here anymore.\"","\"But I don't hate you. You have to take care of yourself. I hope you make lots and lots of money, secure your position as the chairman of the Shen Corporation, and don't let them bully you.\"","\"This is an amicable divorce. Let's not be sad, okay?\"","Even if they were no longer husband and wife, when they met again in the future, they could still be friends who greeted each other.","An Ling didn't dare to look into his eyes anymore. She gently hugged him, resting her chin on his shoulder, and said softly with her eyes closed:","\"Also, when you get married in the future, remember to choose someone you like. If you don't know whether you like them or not, then just choose a good person. Anyway, don't agree to the blind dates your mother arranges for you, okay?\"","\"Shen Linyan, this is the last time I will teach you how to say no as your wife.\"","The man's eyes were bloodshot, his lips pressed tightly together. His tense arms slowly wrapped around the woman's waist.","Crystal tears rolled down the corners of his eyes. With red eyes, he tremblingly opened his mouth, his sore throat letting out a broken voice that was so soft it was almost inaudible.","\"I promise you... Madam.\"","An Ling didn't want to stay in the Shen family; this was what An Ling wanted.","He promised her.","It was just that after today, he wouldn't have An Ling anymore.","He wouldn't have An Ling.","\"Keep lying to yourself, An Ling.\"","In the cafe, Jiang Mai leaned on the table with a distressed look on her face.","She sighed, her eyes complex as she stared at the woman across from her who was applying an ice pack to her eyes.","\"How long did you cry last night? Your eyes are so swollen.\"","Telling Shen Linyan to go find someone he likes to marry—who knows who will be crying their eyes out on his wedding day.","An Ling kept her eyes closed, holding the ice pack as she tilted her head back against the chair. Her voice was hoarse: \"I forgot.\"","Anyway, she had held it in while she was in front of Shen Linyan, even eating the cake. But when she went back to her room and lay on the bed, her tears instantly broke loose. Afraid that Shen Linyan would hear her since their rooms were so close, she ran to the bathroom, turned on the faucet, and cried.","Jiang Mai took a breath, hesitating to speak. After a few seconds, she slowly sighed, \"You really are cruel. You deliberately picked his birthday to repeatedly emphasize that you were getting a divorce the next day. I guess you're perfectly fine with Shen Linyan being saved by someone else.\"","An Ling kept her eyes closed and didn't make a sound.","After a long while, she finally spoke softly: \"Then what should I have done? Save him first and then cruelly divorce him? Then Shen Linyan would never forget me and would refuse to try loving anyone else, just constantly pining over me. I shouldn't be that terrible.\"","That night, when she caught a glimpse of Shen Linyan crying while eating the noodles, for a split second she wanted to say she wouldn't divorce him. But in the end, rationality triumphed over her foolishly romantic heart.","When going back to her room, she hadn't even dared to turn her head to look at him.","Sitting across from her, Jiang Mai also felt a headache coming on.","Knowing the ending of the novel, she naturally knew that An Ling's decision was the right one.","Before any deeper feelings could develop, getting a divorce was best for both of them.","Short-term pain was better than long-term suffering.","She propped her chin up and muttered, \"It's quite amazing though. This is already the ending of the novel, yet Shen Linyan wasn't saved by Zhou Wen. Instead, you, the vicious supporting female character, almost found a loophole.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","She laughed out of sheer annoyance, opening her eyes with a look of indignation. \"No, what do you mean I found a loophole? Didn't I just avoid it? Besides, I did such a great job as a wife. What's wrong with him being saved by me?!\"","As a wife, she was full of care in every aspect, and even taught Shen Linyan how to say no. The fact that she was using him during the divorce was a completely separate matter!","\"Alright, alright, alright.\" Jiang Mai quickly waved her hand to signal her to calm down. \"My dear Miss An, you should just keep icing your eyes. Both of them are swollen like walnuts.\"","An Ling scoffed and picked the ice pack back up.","Jiang Mai: \"So you really went to the Civil Affairs Bureau to get divorced this morning? How did you go with your eyes swollen like that? Didn't Shen Linyan see?\"","An Ling silently pulled the divorce certificate out of her bag and placed it on the table. \"I wore sunglasses and a hat. He couldn't see.\"","Jiang Mai took it, glanced at it, and then handed it back.","\"Didn't they say there was a thirty-day divorce cooling-off period?\"","An Ling shook her head. \"Handing in the materials waived it. That old hag couldn't wait for Shen Linyan and me to get divorced.\"","Hearing this, Jiang Mai was curious. \"Who is the old hag?\"","\"Shen Linyan's biased and brainless mother.\"","An Ling kept her eyes closed and said hoarsely, \"So even if there wasn't a plot, that old hag would never agree to Shen Linyan and me being together.\"","Rather than putting Shen Linyan in a difficult position, it was better for her to take the initiative and ask for a divorce."]},{"number":51,"title":"Chapter 51: I Divorced Shen Linyan","paragraphs":["After finalizing the divorce procedures, An Ling needed to move out of the house as soon as possible.","She didn't dare delay until Shen Linyan got off work. Right after leaving the cafe, she went straight home to pack her bags.","Click.","She turned on the light in the walk-in closet. Under the dazzling crystal chandelier, the room full of luxury goods exuded the scent of money. The air still carried a faint fragrance, just as exquisite and noble as when she first saw it.","Looking at the room full of designer items, she remained silent for a long time before letting out an ambiguous, sighing laugh.","\"Wow... it's a pity I can't take them with me.\"","Back then, she thought that if she ever divorced Shen Linyan, she would definitely take all of these away.","But looking at them now, her heart didn't stir in the slightest.","She took a square velvet box from the drawer.","After opening it to confirm the diamond ring was still inside, An Ling stuffed the box into her bag.","She was only taking this. It was enough.","Opening her suitcase, she simply packed a few sets of everyday clothes. As for the untouched garments, An Ling didn't take a single piece.","She hadn't actually lived in this house for very long, but she had quite a lot of memories.","Thinking about it carefully, whether it was the kitchen, the sofa, or this bed, every scene in her mind featured Shen Linyan.","She used to say that they might not even see each other once while living in this house, but to her surprise, seeing each other every day had become a habit.","Closing the suitcase and lifting it, An Ling subconsciously scanned the room to see if she had missed anything.","When her gaze fell on the nightstand, she paused again.","The tie that was left behind that night was currently lying there all by itself.","An Ling looked at it for a good while, walked over and picked it up, but ultimately sighed and put it back down.","Forget it. Keeping it was useless to her now.","Carrying her suitcase out of the room, An Ling paused slightly at the bedroom door, her back lingering at the threshold.","A few seconds later, she silently turned around, walked back to the bedside, folded the tie neatly, and placed it in her bag.","As she folded it, she muttered softly, \"It's expensive, this is very expensive. When I run out of money, I'll list it on a secondhand platform.\"","Walking into the living room, An Ling took one last look around, then turned and dragged her suitcase out the door.","Beep.","With the notification sound of the automatic lock, the house returned to silence. The twilight rays of the evening glow outside the window slowly crept up the edge of the sofa through the floor-to-ceiling windows, finally landing on a neatly folded blanket.","In the empty living room, only the ticking of the clock remained.","It was as if nothing had ever happened.","The An family residence.","The TV was playing in the living room. Mother An sat on the sofa peeling an orange, while Father An read the newspaper beside her.","Hearing the door open, they looked up.","Upon seeing who had arrived, Mother An smiled and said, \"You're back? Perfect timing for dinner. Your dad was just saying he was hungry.\"","An Zhou changed his shoes at the door and took off his suit jacket. \"You guys could have started eating, no need to wait for me.\"","\"It's fine, a little extra time doesn't matter anyway.\" Mother An placed the orange on the table and walked to the dining area with Father An.","Auntie Wang brought out the final soup.","They had just taken their seats and hadn't yet picked up their chopsticks.","Suddenly, the familiar sound of the doorbell rang through the air.","Ding-dong.","All three of them paused, looking stunned as they exchanged glances.","Who would come at dinnertime?","Auntie Wang went to open the door, followed by an exclamation of surprise: \"Miss? What is this...?\"","Mother An was just about to get up to look.","But accompanied by the sound of rolling luggage, the woman's familiar face suddenly appeared before them.","An Ling stood in the living room, dragging her suitcase.","She happily raised her hand, smiling brightly: \"Hi! Mom, Dad, oh right, and my brother! I'm back!\"","\"...\"","The three of them stared at her with dumbfounded expressions.","Mother An was the first to react, her gaze landing on the suitcase: \"Lingling, why are you...\"","Why did you come back with a suitcase?","Father An put down his chopsticks and frowned, his tone somewhat heavy: \"Did Shen Linyan kick you out?\"","An Zhou crossed his legs and ate some food. \"I said long ago that Shen Linyan wasn't a good guy. Now look, he's not even pretending anymore.\"","An Ling put down her suitcase and took off her coat, finding their reactions amusing:","\"What are you guys talking about? I wasn't kicked out.\"","Mother An hesitated: \"Then why do you have a suitcase?\"","An Ling washed her hands, sat at the dining table, picked up her chopsticks, and said casually:","\"Oh, that. It's nothing, Shen Linyan and I just got a divorce.\"","Mother An: ?","Father An: ?","An Zhou: ?!???","That airy sentence instantly silenced the room.","The three people at the table froze in place, leaving only An Ling to drink her soup at her own pace.","The scene was eerily quiet.","Mother An slowly sat down, her expression solemn: \"Lingling, you can't joke about this kind of thing.\"","An Ling guessed they wouldn't believe her, so she pulled the divorce certificate from her pocket and placed it on the dining table.","\"I'm not joking, we divorced just this morning.\"","She drank her soup, her tone calm. \"Don't worry, it was an amicable divorce. The Shen family brought it up first, so it has nothing to do with our An family. Besides, Shen Linyan gave me compensation.\"","Mother An picked up the certificate and looked at it with Father An, their expressions gradually becoming complex.","An Zhou also leaned over for a glance, then grimaced and sat back in his chair. \"Oh my god...\"","An Ling had mentioned wanting a divorce before, but they didn't expect it to happen so fast.","His sister was actually the speedy type.","He had even been worried the other day that this girl's love-struck brain would act up again.","An Zhou leaned in and asked quietly: \"How much of the assets did you get?\"","An Ling held up two fingers.","An Zhou looked disdainful. \"Two million? That's way too little, isn't it?\"","An Ling shook her head.","An Zhou: \"Twenty million?\"","An Ling shook her head again.","An Zhou paused, his expression complicated.","\"Don't tell me it's twenty thousand. That guy Shen Linyan really wouldn't give away a single extra benefit.\"","\"...\"","An Ling looked up, her eyes curving into a smile: \"Two hundred million.\"","An Zhou: \"...?\"","How much?","That Shen Linyan, who was shrewd down to the last penny in business deals, actually gave his trouble-making sister two hundred million?","An Zhou's expression froze as he slumped back into his chair.","\"Incredible.\"","It was equivalent to taking back all the company projects Shen Linyan had snatched away before, now returned with interest.","Mother An handed the divorce certificate back to her. \"This is too sudden. Why wasn't there any news at all?\"","\"The news will gradually be released in a few days.\"","An Ling put down her bowl, catching a glimpse of a message popping up on her phone out of the corner of her eye.","Auntie Cheng: Madam, are you not coming back for dinner tonight?","Only then did she remember that she hadn't told Auntie Cheng she had already moved out.","Auntie Cheng, I have already moved out.","Auntie Cheng: Madam, did you and Sir have a fight?","An Ling paused.","Didn't Shen Linyan tell you that we are already divorced?","The other side seemed stunned. It took a good while before a reply came, surprise leaking through the lines.","...Divorced?","Just as she was about to reply, Auntie Cheng sent another message.","But, it was Sir who asked me to ask you.","An Ling's gaze froze.","Meanwhile, on the other side.","Auntie Cheng hesitantly put down her phone and turned to look at the man in the chair.","\"Sir, Madam says... she has already moved out.\"","The man looking down and twisting the wedding ring on his ring finger paused at her words. His fragmented hair fell across his forehead, casting a shadow under his eyes, his lowered eyelashes trembling slightly.","After a moment of silence, he slowly lifted his head. His expression was gentle, and with a soft curve of his lips, he said warmly, \"I understand. You may head back now.\"","Aunt Cheng hesitated, as if she wanted to say something, but ultimately turned around.","Just as she was stepping out the door, the man's faint voice suddenly sounded from behind her.","\"Aunt Cheng, there is no need to prepare meals anymore. Let's just go back to the way things were before.\"","Aunt Cheng paused in her tracks. Turning her head, she saw the man getting up and returning to his room.","She was about to look away and leave when her gaze suddenly caught on something.","After a brief silence, Aunt Cheng lowered her head, let out a soft sigh, and pulled the door shut.","Beep— The front door locked.","The living room was dead silent, moonlight cascading in through the window.","The surroundings were dim. The only illumination came from a single white bulb shining in the empty kitchen. A lavish spread of food sat on the dining table, still emitting faint wisps of steam.","Under the light, a silver wedding ring lay quietly on the table."]},{"number":52,"title":"Chapter 52: Her Poor Ex-Husband Is Really Targeted Everywhere","paragraphs":["After returning home, An Ling deeply experienced what it meant to regret.","Why on earth had she kissed Shen Linyan on this bed?","Every time she lay down, An Ling couldn't help but recall the events of that day.","She hadn't gotten used to it even after sleeping for several nights, and would even dream of the divorce scene.","Sitting at her workstation, she propped up her chin and revised the script on her computer, still letting out a yawn.","Ms. Chen walked over and handed her a cup of coffee: \"Didn't sleep well again? You've been yawning a lot lately.\"","\"A little.\" An Ling took the coffee.","\"Filming is about to start next week. Shen Fuyuan's schedule is confirmed, right? It's time to have someone set up the camera positions.\"","Ms. Chen sat next to her, \"Call Nan Zhechuan when you go, he'll go with you. He's also an executive producer and has a lot of experience. You can ask him if there's anything you don't understand.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","What did this senior look like again?","But she still nodded in agreement first, \"Okay.\"","After Ms. Chen left, An Ling planned to send a message to that senior to decide where to meet, and then everything would be fine.","But before the message could be sent, an unexpected person popped up first.","Zhou Wen: [Sister-in-law, did you and Big Brother really get a divorce?]","She paused.","It's been three or four days, and she's only finding out now?","An Ling: [Yeah, yeah.]","Zhou Wen: [I'm sorry, Sister-in-law, but you shouldn't have said those things at the gathering that day. You know perfectly well that there is nothing going on between Big Brother and me.]","Seeing this, An Ling was instantly amused.","[I didn't say there was anything going on between you two. Wasn't it Lu Jingshen who got triggered and lost his temper first?]","She didn't mind adding fuel to the fire: [Zhou Wen, Lu Jingshen loses his temper so easily, you really can put up with it.]","The other side was silent for a moment, seemingly not knowing how to retort.","After a good while, she replied: [He only acts like this when he encounters this kind of situation.]","An Ling raised an eyebrow. She suddenly realized that this female lead was also hopelessly love-struck.","That makes sense, otherwise how could she stay with an irritable man like Lu Jingshen all this time.","She typed a reply: [Anyway, I'm already divorced. To tell you the truth, that old thing in the Shen family is not a good person. The incident between me and Lu Jingshen from before getting leaked out was actually done by her on purpose. You tell me, the Shen family is so powerful, why couldn't they even suppress a scandal? Also! Your good husband is a mama's boy!]","She didn't understand before, but now she did. Mother Shen simply wanted to ruin her reputation and then drag Shen Linyan down with her.","The novel wrote that Lu Jingshen was playing the pig to eat the tiger.","In An Ling's words, he was just a pig.","He would only listen to Mother Shen, and didn't even dare to speak up when facing Shen Linyan.","She was kindly reminding Zhou Wen. How great would it be to take the money and run away as soon as possible. That old woman Mother Shen only agreed to let Lu Jingshen marry her purely because Lu Jingshen loved her too deeply.","An Ling held up her phone screen, silently hiding her upturned lips.","So hurry up and break up.","It would be best if they divorced, then the male lead would be heartbroken, turn dark and chase his wife, and even have no mind to attend to business.","Then Shen Linyan could take over the entire Shen Corporation at this time! Let that old woman die of anger!","Ha! Just thinking about it feels great!","But the next second, the message Zhou Wen sent made her smile freeze.","[Sister-in-law, it's a bit too much for you to say that.]","An Ling expressionlessly blocked Zhou Wen.","Forget it.","Out of sight, out of mind.","An Ling scheduled all the times, planning to go to Shen Fuyuan's house tomorrow afternoon to set up the camera positions and do a test shoot, and confirmed the precautions once more.","Busy and bustling, the time reached past seven o'clock. The sky gradually darkened, and she was finally able to get off work and go home.","Before getting off work, An Ling specifically searched for news about the Shen Corporation and found that the news of the Shen heir's divorce had not yet been released.","How long are they going to delay announcing it?","An Ling frowned. Dragging it on like this always gave her the feeling that that old woman was up to something.","Walking to her car, just as she opened the door, a middle-aged man suddenly called out to her from behind.","\"Miss An.\"","An Ling turned her head and glanced, but didn't speak.","The middle-aged man was the first to state his identity, \"You may not have seen me before. I am Shen Linyan's uncle, Shen Jiandong.\"","An Ling nodded as a greeting: \"Is there something you need?\"","\"I know you and Shen Linyan are divorced.\"","Shen Jiandong's tone was confident, \"I was also present at the gathering that day. My nephew indeed didn't do a good job. I heard that Miss An has never liked Shen Linyan. Now that you are divorced, doesn't Miss An want to take revenge?\"","An Ling: \"...\"","Was the clarification she posted before really that unbelievable? It seemed like everyone didn't believe she and Shen Linyan had a good relationship.","Speaking of which, since they were already divorced, why was there still a plotline for her as the vicious female supporting character.","An Ling coldly let go of the hand closing the car door and walked to the front of the car.","\"Right, our relationship is bad. Let's hear it, how do you want to take revenge.\"","Her poor ex-husband was really being targeted everywhere.","First his own mother, then his own uncle.","A hint of secret joy flashed across Shen Jiandong's face, but his expression remained amiable: \"The gathering that night was suppressed by Shen Linyan's mother. She was afraid it would affect her younger son, so she plans to announce to the public that the divorce is because of your incompatibility.\"","He held up the USB drive in his hand.","\"Here is the video of the gathering that night. As long as on the day the divorce is announced, Miss An steps forward to confirm that it was because of the issues with the two Shen brothers, then public opinion will lean towards Miss An, and the An family will also profit from it.\"","An Ling understood.","This person didn't want to target Shen Linyan.","But planned to suppress both Shen Linyan and Lu Jingshen.","Too classic.","In novels, there are always sinister relatives fighting with the male lead for the company.","But she had to admit, Shen Jiandong's method was very tempting. Although a peaceful divorce wouldn't hurt her, if she could expose what happened at the gathering that day, the An family could indeed profit from it.","The older brother and younger brother had been entangled with the same woman, argued fiercely at the gathering, the older brother's wife questioned them on the spot, and it ended in a mess.","Look, wouldn't public opinion rise just like that?","The two sons of the Shen family would fall into a scandal, and by then no one in the Shen Corporation would be able to take charge alone, so naturally the biological uncle would benefit.","An Ling didn't speak, just raised her hand and took the USB drive.","The smile on Shen Jiandong's face was expectant and shrewd, \"Miss An, happy cooperation.\"","An Ling gave a fake smile.","Happy my foot.","Could this be the buff of a vicious female supporting character? Why did these people always think she would do bad things.","After getting in the car, An Ling looked at the USB drive in her hand, stayed silent for a moment, and opened her chat window.","[Is it convenient to call now?]","A reply came from the other side half a minute later.","[Convenient.]","After hesitating for a while, she pressed the dial button.","\"Beep... beep...\"","The moment it connected, An Ling's heart inexplicably tightened, and she gripped her phone tightly.","She tentatively spoke: \"Shen Linyan?\"","The other side was silent for a few seconds, and then came the man's familiar, gentle voice, \"It's me.\"","\"Ah... I don't have much going on, it's just that a person claiming to be your uncle just gave me a USB drive containing what happened at the gathering that day, and he wants me to release it.\"","An Ling toyed with the USB drive in her hand, her gaze slowly landing on the dashcam.","\"I'll give you the video of him coming to find me and the video in the USB drive, and you can show it to that old woman.\"","Shen Linyan wouldn't lay a hand on Shen Jiandong, so let Mother Shen deal with this threat.","If someone laid a hand on her second son, there was no way that old woman would just let it go.","This strategy would not only eliminate the potential threats to Shen Linyan, but also ignite hostility between Lu Jingshen and the other supporting characters."]},{"number":53,"title":"Chapter 53: Is Anyone Better Than Her","paragraphs":["An Ling felt she was truly a perfect, twenty-four-karat good wife. Was there anyone better than her?","Just look, even after divorcing, she was still worrying about her ex-husband's company.","The man on the other end of the line also replied softly, \"Okay.\"","The car interior returned to silence.","Since the day they got their divorce certificates, they hadn't seen each other for days, nor had they spoken a single word.","Their life trajectories didn't overlap to begin with; once divorced, there was really no chance for them to meet.","The words reached the tip of An Ling's tongue, but she silently swallowed them back.","She lowered her head and let out a helpless laugh.","Fine, she had thought too simply of it. It seemed that divorced couples trying to be friends was still a bit awkward.","\"Well, there's nothing else then. I'm going to drive now. I'll export the video and send it to you when I get home.\"","The man agreed in a gentle voice, \"Alright, drive safely.\"","Hanging up the phone, An Ling buckled her seatbelt, muttering with her head down, \"Why didn't he even say a word of thanks.\"","In the past, he would still say 'thank you, Madam.' Now that they were divorced, were his boundaries this strong?","Pausing her movements, she sighed with a smile.","\"Forget it, this is a good thing too.\"","Both Shen Linyan and she had to enter their new lives.","She also sincerely hoped that Shen Linyan would meet someone he would treat specially.","Meanwhile, on the other side, in a dimly lit living room.","The man slowly put down his phone.","The night seeped through the window. Wearing his pajamas, he sat quietly on the sofa, his profile buried in the shadows. His eyelashes trembled slightly as he stared blankly at the night view outside without blinking.","Who knows how long had passed when the phone suddenly let out a ding, and several consecutive messages popped up.","An Ling: [(Video) (Video) You absolutely, absolutely, absolutely must show this to that old woman!]","Looking down and seeing the familiar profile picture, his gaze lingered for a moment, and the straight corners of his lips curved upward in an imperceptible arc.","His fingertips tapped on the screen.","[Thank you, Mad...]","His movements paused. He deleted it.","[Thank you.]","Send.","She didn't know if it was because she had talked on the phone with Shen Linyan, or for some other reason.","That night, An Ling didn't dream of Shen Linyan again.","In the afternoon, she met up with Nan Zhechuan downstairs at the company. While greeting him with a smile, her gaze circled over his face.","The man had a lean figure, a head taller than her. His face was very clear and handsome, with a tall nose bridge, monolids, and he wore glasses. His hair was slightly curly, and he had a black stud earring on his ear.","\"Should I call you Ah Leng or An Ling? Just call me Brother Nan.\" He smiled, revealing a dimple on his cheek.","An Ling answered with a smile, \"Alright Brother Nan, you can just call me Ah Leng. Everyone is probably more used to that name.\"","Very good, memorized it. Next time, she would be able to recognize him.","Every time she memorized these features, An Ling couldn't help but sigh inwardly.","If everyone in the world was as handsome as Shen Linyan, wouldn't her face blindness be cured? After all, she would only need to take a few extra glances to know who it was.","The two of them took the filming crew to Shen Fuyuan's house.","Seeing her arrive, Shen Fuyuan's eyes lit up slightly: \"You're here!\"","She couldn't wait to lean in, \"Let me tell you, you and my oldest... mmm mmm!!\"","Startled, An Ling quickly hooked her arm around her neck and covered her mouth, lowering her voice, \"Don't talk about this kind of thing here.\"","Then, she turned her head and introduced with a smile.","\"Miss Shen, this is Nan Zhechuan. He is also an executive producer. We came over today to help you test the camera angles. If you have any requests, you can bring them up anytime.\"","\"Mmm mmm mmm!\" Shen Fuyuan nodded with wide eyes.","Nan Zhechuan watched their interaction with some surprise. He blinked, paused for a moment, and then smiled, \"Ah Leng, you and Miss Shen get along quite well.\"","Everyone in the industry was well aware of Shen Fuyuan's temper.","He originally thought this shoot would involve a difficult client, but he didn't expect An Ling to step in and handle it right away. Now the two of them even had such a harmonious relationship.","Ms. Chen's worries were completely unnecessary.","An Ling let go of her hand, smiling modestly, \"No, no, it's mainly because Miss Shen actually has a good personality. We just hit it off.\"","Shen Fuyuan touched her own mouth, narrowed her eyes, and shifted her gaze back and forth between the two of them, especially staring at Nan Zhechuan's face for a long time.","Being stared at by her made a chill run down Nan Zhechuan's spine. He pointed at the other staff members and laughed awkwardly, \"Then... Ah Leng, I'll go check how the camera setup is going first. You can communicate a bit more with Miss Shen.\"","\"Okay, Brother Nan, go ahead.\"","After Nan Zhechuan left, An Ling turned to look at Shen Fuyuan.","Only to be met with the girl's suspicious, scrutinizing gaze.","\"Sorry.\" An Ling apologized gently, taking out a tissue to wipe the residual lipstick off her palm. \"They don't know my identity, and since it's working hours, it's not good to talk about these things.\"","Shen Fuyuan leaned her head over and asked hesitantly, \"Who is that?\"","\"Didn't I just introduce him? The executive producer.\"","\"Aren't you my executive producer? Why did you bring someone else? And why did he call you Ah Leng?\" Usually, only one executive producer was needed on set.","An Ling gave her a strange look. \"Why are you focusing on this?\"","Shen Fuyuan had a thoughtful expression. \"Could it be... you divorced my oldest brother because of him? But he's not even as good-looking as my brother.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","She explained patiently, \"Don't talk nonsense. He is my senior. He was afraid I might make mistakes, so he specially came over to help. Ah Leng is my pseudonym in the industry.\"","Shen Fuyuan curled her lips.","\"Fine, then why did you and my oldest brother get divorced?\"","She had almost accepted An Ling's identity, but who would have thought this would suddenly happen.","\"Do you know how happy my mom has been these past few days? Moreover, since my oldest brother publicly admitted to receiving the gift that day, our parents have been calling to scold him every single day.\"","An Ling's gaze paused slightly, but she pretended not to hear and stepped forward.","\"I'll go check on their work progress. Miss Shen, you go ahead and do your thing.\"","\"Hey, you...\"","Shen Fuyuan hesitated to speak.","Standing in place, she watched An Ling and Nan Zhechuan chatting in the living room. Her eyes rolled around, and the corners of her mouth suddenly curled up.","Fine, fine.","Who told her to be beautiful, kind-hearted, and a lover of drama.","Shen Fuyuan unhurriedly took her phone out of her pocket, opened the camera, and secretly snapped a photo of the scene in front of her.","She raised her eyebrows, happily opened a certain someone's chat box, and clicked send on the photo she just took.","\"I really don't want to get an even more ridiculous sister-in-law.\"","Inside the office at Shen Corporation.","The phone to the side vibrated slightly. The man paused his movements and glanced at it casually.","Shen Fuyuan: [Photo.jpg]","Just as he was about to withdraw his gaze, the other party sent another message the next second.","Shen Fuyuan: [Oldest brother, An Ling came to my house.]","Shen Linyan paused. In that moment of hesitation, ink blurred on the paper.","A few seconds later, he still put down his fountain pen and picked up his phone.","The moment the screen unlocked, a photo caught his eye.","When he saw the contents of the picture clearly, his eyes slightly froze."]},{"number":54,"title":"Chapter 54: Damn, how did this woman find out","paragraphs":["The progress of installing the cameras was faster than An Ling had expected.","After confirming the shooting range, An Ling turned her head and met Shen Fuyuan's exceptionally bright smile.","?","She frowned, looking down at her clothes today, not quite sure what the other woman was smiling at.","Beside her, Nan Zhechuan lowered his voice, \"What's wrong with Miss Shen? Her smile is a bit...\"","A bit too eerie.","\"I don't know, just ignore her.\"","An Ling walked over. \"Miss Shen, we will be doing some test shoots over the next few days. Just act as you normally would.\"","Shen Fuyuan sat on the sofa and made an 'OK' gesture.","Seeing her unusually obedient, An Ling picked up her bag. \"Then we won't disturb you any longer. We should be heading back.\"","\"Hey, wait,\" Shen Fuyuan suddenly spoke up. \"Aren't you going to tell me about the things I need to pay attention to?\"","An Ling replied, \"I already sent you the document with the precautions.\"","Shen Fuyuan lowered her head, pinched the bridge of her nose in frustration, and waved her hand impatiently. Her tone sounded a bit angry.","\"No, do you know how many words are in that document you sent? It gives me a headache just looking at it. This is my first time on a variety show, and I don't understand these cameras. What's wrong with paying a little more attention to me? Can't you just tell me verbally? What if something goes wrong? I won't take responsibility for you guys.\"","In that instant, the Shen family's little princess, the most difficult person to deal with in the circle, made her reappearance.","An Ling's temples throbbed faintly, her smile twitching. \"...\"","This girl is the real vicious supporting actress, right?","Nan Zhechuan walked over and patted her shoulder, afraid she would get into trouble, and whispered, \"It's fine, we'll just briefly explain it. I'm quite familiar with this. I'll explain it for you, it'll be faster.\"","Taking advantage of the gap, Shen Fuyuan secretly glanced at them.","She waved her hand dismissively, looking impatient. \"Ugh, fine, fine. I know it's almost time to get off work. I won't treat you badly. You explain the precautions to me, and I'll treat you to dinner. How about that?\"","An Ling and Nan Zhechuan were both stunned upon hearing this.","Nan Zhechuan quickly raised his hand. \"Um, Miss Shen, you don't need to treat us to dinner. We just need to talk about this...\"","Before he could finish his sentence, Shen Fuyuan had already quickly gotten up, put on her coat, and walked to the door to change her shoes.","Finally, she turned around and urged them, \"Hurry up! What are you still standing there like idiots for? I'm starving.\"","The two people in the living room: \"...\"","Nan Zhechuan forcefully swallowed the second half of his sentence back down.","Wait...","Is Shen Fuyuan really this enthusiastic about treating people to dinner?","He looked hesitantly at An Ling. \"What should we do?\"","Seeing Shen Fuyuan like this, An Ling already had a good idea of what was going on. Her expression remained unchanged as she put her hands in her pockets.","\"If she wants to treat us, let's go eat. Brother Nan, go pack up the equipment first. I'll take her to the car.\"","\"Okay.\"","Shen Fuyuan was already in the elevator.","Seeing An Ling enter, she quickly held up her phone. \"I plan to go here. I heard it's really delicious. What do you think?\"","An Ling didn't answer, just raised her hand and pressed the button for the first basement floor.","After the elevator doors closed, she spoke slowly:","\"Shen Fuyuan.\"","\"Hmm? What?\"","\"Have you chosen the restaurant?\"","\"The one I just asked you about. If you don't refuse, I'll take it as a yes.\"","An Ling nodded, her tone natural.","\"Then what time is Shen Linyan arriving?\"","\"Big brother will be early...\"","Halfway through her sentence, Shen Fuyuan's voice abruptly stopped.","She stiffened her neck and slowly raised her head, instantly meeting An Ling's calm, unwavering gaze.","The woman tilted her head slightly, her hair falling softly against her cheeks. Her skin was fair and delicate, and her beautiful face carried a hint of nonchalance as she lazily looked down at her.","Shen Fuyuan's expression stiffened, and she silently stuffed her phone back into her pocket. \"What are you talking about... How would I know when big brother... Ah, bah! I don't know if big brother is going or not!\"","Damn it, how did this woman find out?!","She hadn't even given the excuse she had prepared!","Seeing her guilty expression, An Ling knew she had guessed correctly and couldn't help but sigh. \"I knew you were going to call Shen Linyan over.\"","Shen Fuyuan was stunned for a moment, but just as she was about to speak, she was interrupted by An Ling.","\"Shen Linyan and I had an amicable divorce. We have no disagreements and no misunderstandings. When we meet, we're just ordinary friends. You don't need to go out of your way to bring us together like this, and besides, he doesn't know about my job.\"","Having to introduce her identity again when the time came would be far too awkward.","An Ling turned to look at the dumbfounded girl.","\"Were you planning to find an excuse about a 'coincidental encounter' when we got to the restaurant, just to make us eat together?\"","\"...\"","Shen Fuyuan opened her mouth, feeling entirely unable to defend herself.","But...","It took her a while to recover before she hesitantly asked, \"Then... should I tell big brother to go back? Tell him we're not eating with him anymore?\"","An Ling's movements paused imperceptibly. She withdrew her gaze and didn't speak.","When the elevator reached the first basement floor, the woman finally spoke slowly, \"Let him come. Just tell him in advance that I'm here too, and make my identity clear.\"","Shen Fuyuan thought to herself, Do I even need to say it? He knew on the first day.","But she still took out her phone again. \"Okay.\"","The restaurant was about a twenty-minute drive from Shen Fuyuan's house. On the way there, An Ling told Nan Zhechuan that Shen Fuyuan's older brother would also be joining them.","Hearing this, the expression on Nan Zhechuan's face in the driver's seat immediately froze.","He glanced at the rearview mirror and lowered his voice, \"Should we tell Teacher Chen? This is a bit beyond what we planned.\"","That was the head of the Shen Corporation.","Such an important figure—if they didn't perform well and upset this big shot, what if the show couldn't even be produced?","In the backseat, Shen Fuyuan heard his words and looked up from her phone.","\"Hey, what's there to worry about? It's just having a meal with my big brother. He won't do anything to you, unless...\"","At this point, she raised an eyebrow and made a meaningful expression, \"Hehehe...\"","Nan Zhechuan: \"...\"","That's even more terrifying, okay?","An Ling also smiled at him. \"Don't worry, she's joking. It's just a meal, there's no special meaning behind it. After explaining the precautions, we'll leave.\"","Nan Zhechuan could only feel slightly relieved.","After parking the car, the three of them entered the restaurant together.","Shen Fuyuan walked in front. \"My big brother has already arrived and is in the private room right now. I've already told him who you are, so you don't need to introduce yourselves again.\"","Nan Zhechuan nodded. \"Okay.\"","An Ling followed at the very back and didn't say anything upon hearing this.","Arriving in front of the private room, Shen Fuyuan turned to look at An Ling behind her, then pushed the door open.","The warm yellow light from the private room spilled out. After seeing the person inside clearly, she opened her mouth and called out:","\"Big brother.\"","Inside the private room, the man on the seat was looking down at his phone. His suit jacket was draped over the back of the chair, and his inner dress shirt was crisp with sharp shoulder lines. His sleeves were casually rolled up, and the luxury watch on his wrist further accentuated his cool, pale skin.","Hearing the voice, he slightly lifted his eyelids. Loose hair fell over his forehead, and his features were refined and gentle.","An Ling stood at the very back, yet she locked eyes with the man the very first second.","As their eyes met, the surrounding scene seemed to shift back and forth.","An Ling felt as if she had returned to the day she first met Shen Linyan.","That day, when the car door opened, the sunlight from outside streamed in, and the smell of leather in the air mingled with a faint scent of cedar.","The man had also looked up at her just like this, appearing noble and aloof.","In the days that followed, this face was the only one she could instantly recognize."]},{"number":55,"title":"Chapter 55: Hello, Miss An","paragraphs":["Nan Zhechuan saw this Shen family heir for the first time.","He was even younger than he had imagined.","After a flash of amazement crossed his eyes, he quickly stepped forward, smiling and extending his hand. Hello, Chairman Shen, I am Nan Zhechuan.","The man gave a soft Mm and politely shook his hand.","An Ling also extended her hand, lowering her eyes and saying softly, Hello, Chairman Shen, I am An Ling.","The man's distinctively knuckled hand grasped hers, his gaze sweeping lightly across her face.","Hello, Miss An.","A familiar voice, an unfamiliar title.","An Ling's expression froze slightly.","She subconsciously looked at the man's left hand, only to see that his long, pale fingers were strikingly bare.","She blinked, then gently curved her eyes into a smile and withdrew her hand.","After taking their seats, An Ling sat next to Nan Zhechuan, while Shen Linyan sat with Shen Fuyuan.","Shen Linyan picked up his chopsticks and said warmly, Please, everyone, let's eat. I haven't eaten here before, so I ordered their signature dishes. I hope they suit your tastes.","Shen Fuyuan couldn't wait to start. I'm starving. Let's eat first and talk later. My eldest brother is treating us today, so please don't be polite.","Nan Zhechuan nodded quickly. Okay, okay.","But a strange atmosphere still permeated the private room.","In the air, only the crisp sound of bowls and chopsticks clinking remained.","Noticing from the corner of his eye the woman opposite him eating in silence with her head down, Shen Linyan's movements paused slightly.","He lowered his eyes and suddenly asked gently, Shen Fuyuan, when does that show of yours start filming?","Shen Fuyuan's movements halted. She almost thought there was something wrong with her ears. She swallowed the food in her mouth and replied, Next week. This week is just test shooting.","The man still kept his eyes lowered gently. ...Will you find it tiring?","?","Clatter—","The food on Shen Fuyuan's chopsticks dropped into her bowl. She looked up in disbelief, a hint of panic flashing in her eyes.","This was the first time her eldest brother had ever shown concern for her.","Could it be because of the photo??","She opened her mouth hesitantly. Uh... well, probably not?","The sound of conversation broke the silence in the private room, slightly easing the atmosphere.","Taking advantage of a break in eating, Nan Zhechuan lowered his head slightly.","He used his chopsticks to cover his mouth and spoke in a low voice to An Ling beside him.","Scared me to death. I originally thought this Chairman Shen would be super strict, like threatening us that if we dared to bring bad publicity to his sister, he'd bankrupt our company.","Cough, cough—","An Ling almost choked, quickly turning to the side to cough twice. Unable to hold back, she covered her mouth and laughed out loud. Brother Nan, you have too much imagination. You should be a screenwriter.","She couldn't even imagine Shen Linyan saying such things.","Seeing her so calm, Nan Zhechuan said in surprise, Ah Leng, you're incredibly steady.","In contrast, he was scared to death.","Hearing this, An Ling raised an eyebrow and proudly pressed her hand down. Of course. Small scene, I can handle it.","Even she, the ex-wife, was sitting here without saying anything.","Nan Zhechuan looked enlightened. Wow... amazing. Seeing you like this, I'm not scared anymore.","An Ling smiled and looked up, subconsciously glancing toward Shen Linyan, only to unexpectedly meet a pair of pitch-black eyes.","Under the soft lighting of the private room, the man had stopped talking at some point.","His eyes were dark, hiding a faint stillness, quietly looking at her without a word.","The smile on An Ling's lips faltered slightly.","A few seconds later, she sat up straight, leaned back against her chair, picked up her water glass, and took a slow sip.","While drinking, the woman suddenly gave him a subtle, playful raise of her eyebrows, her eyes holding a smile.","Shen Linyan was stunned.","A few seconds later, a faint smile crossed his eyes. His expression relaxed, the corners of his mouth turned up, and his Adam's apple bobbed as he was about to speak.","Nan Zhechuan beside her spoke up: Ah Leng, do you want some more water?","The man's expression suddenly froze.","Hearing the voice, An Ling quickly turned her head and looked away, smiling as she pushed her glass over. Yes, thank you, Brother Nan.","No problem.","Nan Zhechuan took the glass, but when he handed it back, the water accidentally spilled over the rim, some of it splashing onto the back of An Ling's phone.","He instantly gasped, his eyes widening, and quickly pulled out a tissue to wipe it. Sorry about that, Ah Leng.","An Ling smiled and waved her hand. It's fine, it's fine. No harm done.","After wiping it clean, Nan Zhechuan hurriedly returned the phone to her, looking nervous. Check if it still works. I hope the water didn't ruin it.","An Ling took the phone and looked down to unlock it. It's okay, it doesn't break that easily.","Nan Zhechuan leaned over to take a peek, and breathed a sigh of relief when he saw it was fine.","Shen Fuyuan was still wondering why it had suddenly gone quiet.","As soon as she turned her head, she saw her eldest brother staring blankly in a certain direction.","She was about to speak when she suddenly caught sight of the man's tightly clenched, white-knuckled fingers under the table. She instantly swallowed her words.","She glanced at the two people opposite her who were getting along so well, then looked at her quiet eldest brother beside her, and silently lowered her head to eat.","Isn't this just asking for suffering...","Later on, there was only the sound of Nan Zhechuan and Shen Fuyuan chatting. An Ling and Shen Linyan remained silent.","After the meal, Shen Linyan suddenly went out to take a phone call.","Nan Zhechuan and An Ling stood at the restaurant entrance. Nan Zhechuan smiled and thanked her: Miss Shen, I hope the filming goes smoothly this time. We'll head back now. Please let Chairman Shen know.","Chewing gum, Shen Fuyuan waved at them. Got it, got it. See you.","An Ling glanced inside the restaurant, didn't say much, and also turned to leave.","The figures of the two retreated further and further into the night, until they could no longer be seen.","As soon as Shen Fuyuan turned around, she saw the man standing quietly at the doorway.","Eldest brother, I took the blame for you this time.","An Ling had blamed her, saying she deliberately invited her eldest brother out.","Goodness! She was so wronged; it was her eldest brother who told her to do it!","The man didn't speak. His suit jacket was draped over his arm, and the top button of his shirt was undone, faintly revealing a silver chain inside. With an air of noble elegance and long, straight legs, he looked down and pulled a cigarette from his pocket.","With a click, a flame flickered in the night breeze. His long fingers held the lighter as he lowered his eyes to light the cigarette between his fingers, his tone flat.","Tell Secretary Chen whatever you want.","Then OK!","Shen Fuyuan put her hands in her pockets. After a long silence, she couldn't help but ask, Eldest brother, if you wanted to invite sister-in-law to dinner, why did you have me bring that guy along too?","When she sent the photo earlier, her eldest brother hadn't said anything else, just replying: Bring them to dinner tonight.","Fine to bring them, but Shen Fuyuan didn't understand why that Nan Zhechuan guy had to come along too, only for her eldest brother to watch them chat and torture himself?","Hearing this, the man lowered his head, biting his cigarette, and said nothing.","The night was heavy, and the swirling smoke blurred his handsome profile. Shadows fell beneath his eyes, masking his emotions, leaving only an indifferent aloofness.","The temperature at night was a bit low. Shen Fuyuan rubbed her hands together. Eldest brother, I'm going home. You should go home too.","The man's movements paused, his eyelashes fluttering slightly.","Just as Shen Fuyuan lifted her leg to leave, the man's voice suddenly rang out behind her.","Shen Fuyuan.","Hmm?","She turned her head in confusion, only to see the man slowly lifting his head, his voice very soft.","After a divorce, how long does it take to get used to being alone?","An Ling said it was normal to feel sad.","But right now, he still missed An Ling so much."]},{"number":56,"title":"Chapter 56: I Will Not Get Married Again","paragraphs":["The night was misty, and the door lock let out a soft beep.","The warm light from the corridor gently refracted into the pitch-black living room as the man stepped inside.","As the front door closed, the room plunged into darkness once more.","Shen Linyan put down his suit jacket, placed his phone on the table, sat on the sofa, and then slowly lay down.","He stared silently at the ceiling before closing his eyes and resting a hand lightly over them.","The surroundings were completely silent. The boundless darkness was like a net, silently enveloping him, oppressive and quiet.","In the past, Shen Linyan really liked moments like this.","Escaping the noisy crowds, breaking free from troublesome interpersonal relationships.","He no longer needed to deliberately maintain a hypocritical facade, nor did he need to say another word. He could just lie here quietly and catch a brief moment of respite.","The solitary space that used to relax him had now become a suffocating, dense net.","The woman's fragrance in the air had long dissipated, leaving only a depressing chill.","Shen Linyan lifted his hand and opened his eyes.","Like...","What exactly is love?","Giving the best is not love, and treating her well is not love either.","Ring, ring...","The phone rang, and Shen Linyan turned his head to look at the table.","The caller ID on the screen read: Mother","He pressed answer and put it on speaker.","Instantly, Mother Shen's suppressed angry voice echoed in the living room.","Shen Linyan, what is the meaning of those videos you sent me?","He kept his eyes closed. Haven't you already seen them, Mother? Why are you still asking me?","Did that woman An Ling send them to you?! That damn woman, what does she mean by this?! Is she threatening me? You tell her, if she dares to publish them, the An family can forget about surviving!","Shen Linyan opened his eyes, his tone flat and emotionless. I will handle it. Mother, you should deal with Uncle first. He seems to be getting restless.","That dog Shen Jiandong! How dare he play two-faced with me! Did he think I wouldn't know!","Mother Shen's voice was filled with suppressed rage; it seemed she was quite infuriated by this matter.","Shen Jiandong had been a dog by her side for so many years, always fawning over her. How could she tolerate her own dog biting back?","Before marrying into the Shen family, Mother Shen was the eldest daughter of the Lu family, with two older brothers above her.","The Lu family was a prominent and top-ranking wealthy family in their circle, so marrying into the Shen family was considered a well-matched alliance.","Later, the two Lu brothers accidentally died in a car crash, and all the Lu family shares were transferred to her name. Her status was at least equal to Shen Zhong's.","The fact that Lu Jingshen took her surname was the most powerful proof.","After speaking of this, Mother Shen suddenly changed the subject.","Right, also get that divorce announcement out as soon as possible. I've found a few marriage prospects for you; you can pick one from them and remarry.","Going around in circles, it still came back to this.","What was the point? The prospects she found were all carefully selected by her, obedient, easy to manipulate, and most importantly, able to bring her benefits.","Just like An Ling before.","Until later, his wife suddenly realized one day that she no longer wanted to hurt him, nor did she want to stay in this suffocating and oppressive Shen family, so this marriage came to an end.","She said he should go find a new wife.","Find a better wife.","Then he would continue to fulfill his duties as a husband, this house would welcome its new mistress, and every memory would be overwritten.","An Ling would also return to her own life; she had her own colleagues and friends.","Leaving the Shen family and these people, her optimistic and bright nature would make her loved wherever she went.","She would also meet a better husband, and her husband would do those things for her.","Lowering his head to whisper to her with a smile, thoughtfully pouring water for her, in an intimately close manner.","And the person doing all this would never be him.","Because he was the eldest son of the Shen family, the person in charge of the Shen Corporation.","He could only be an outsider, just like today, quietly watching all this happen.","The corners of his eyes gradually turned red. Scalding tears rolled down from the corners of his eyes, quietly disappearing into his hair, but Shen Linyan remained completely unaware, just staring blankly at the ceiling.","His Adam's apple bobbed with difficulty, and his hoarse voice was very light.","Mother, I will not marry again.","He could not accept it.","Nor could he try.","The man sat up. Because his movement was too large, the necklace inside his shirt slipped out with a clack. Below his cool, pale collarbone, a delicate silver ring swayed gently, reflecting a brilliant luster in the night.","He raised his hand to brush away the tears at the corners of his eyes, lowered his gaze to stare for a moment, and gently pulled a tissue to wipe them away.","Mother Shen's agitated scolding could still be heard over the phone.","You won't marry?! Shen Linyan, let me tell you, you must marry?!","Who do you think gave you the life you have now!? Without us, could you have such a privileged life?? Marriage is to consolidate the Shen family's cooperation with other companies! Don't you even understand that? You are not young anymore; do you still think you can do whatever you want?","Seeming to sense the man's silence, Mother Shen took a breath to calm down.","Her tone softened slightly, and she spoke earnestly, Shen Linyan, Mom knows that An Ling was really too much before. It was Mom's fault for finding you such a troublesome wife.","Mom also wants you to be happy. Look, your younger brother has found a wife, so you should also find someone to accompany you, right? Isn't that what you've always wanted too? This time, Mom will definitely choose carefully for you. The ones you marry will all be daughters of wealthy families; they won't be bad.","Your brother married an ordinary person, and you get to marry a wealthy lady. What else are you dissatisfied with? Mom has been good enough to you, hasn't she? So Mom will pay a bit more attention to your brother; after all, he's the one losing out.","Ultimately, Mother Shen still felt that Shen Linyan's refusal to marry was just him blaming her for making him marry that troublesome woman, An Ling.","She sighed softly. Alright, I will throw you the best and most expensive wedding. Stop being dissatisfied. This matter will be handled as I say.","Shen Linyan lowered his head and said nothing. A moment later, he raised his hand to slowly cover his face and let out a low laugh. The best...","Mother Shen thought he had agreed, and a hint of arrogance already crept into her voice.","Yes, Shen Linyan, tell me, from childhood to adulthood, when have I not given you the most expensive things? You need to know how to be grateful, understand? Don't be ungrateful. The knowledge taught to you wasn't to make you forget your roots...","Mother.","The man abruptly interrupted her. Father has already agreed. Go talk to Father.","After saying that, regardless of what Mother Shen's reaction might be, he hung up the phone straight away.","He sat in the darkness for a long time. It was unknown whether it was the biting chill of the night wind, or noticing the phone screen going dark, that finally brought the man back to his senses.","He pursed his lips, looked down and unlocked his phone again, dialed a number, and then slowly placed the phone to his ear.","The call connected.","In the pitch-black living room, a familiar, slightly surprised female voice came from the other end of the line.","Shen Linyan?"]},{"number":57,"title":"Chapter 57: But He Was Never a Kind Person","paragraphs":["After returning from dinner that evening, An Ling planned to double-check the shooting schedule for next week.","She had been too busy finalizing the test shoot details these past few days, leaving her with no choice but to review things after work.","Just as she sat on her bed and opened her laptop after a shower, she received a call from Shen Linyan.","To be honest, she was a bit surprised, but on second thought, it was probably about the video from last time, so she answered without overthinking it.","She turned on the speakerphone and casually placed the phone on the blanket beside her.","\"Are you calling about the video? How did it go? Did you show it to that old woman?\"","The person on the other end was silent for a moment before giving a soft \"Mm.\"","\"I showed it to her. She'll handle it.\"","\"That's good.\"","An Ling opened a file, teasing as she skimmed through it, \"Did she curse me out? I could guess it with my eyes closed! But whatever, it's not like I can hear her anyway.\"","The moment she sent the video, she already knew exactly what that woman would say about her.","A very faint laugh came from the man on the other end. It was low, and if one listened closely, it carried an almost imperceptible huskiness.","An Ling paused, turned to pick up her phone, and placed it against her ear. \"She didn't scold you, did she? If she tells you to take all the blame and let Lu Jingshen play the victim, you absolutely cannot agree to it!\"","After all, it wouldn't be the first time Mother Shen did something like that.","\"No.\" Shen Linyan lowered his eyes. \"She didn't say that.\"","An Ling opened her mouth, unsure of what else to say. Holding the phone, she chuckled, \"Alright then, just take care of yourself and get some rest early.\"","After she spoke, she remembered something else. \"Oh, right! The food tonight was delicious!\"","She didn't mention why she had become an executive producer, nor did she explain why she had hidden it before.","There was no need to say anything when they were in a marriage of convenience, and now that they were divorced, these things mattered even less.","Sensing the silence on his end, An Ling stared at the document on her laptop and blinked. \"If there's nothing else... I'll hang up now?\"","Just as she was about to end the call, the man's gentle voice suddenly rang out.","\"An Ling.\"","She paused her movements. \"Hmm? What's wrong?\"","Shen Linyan's gaze fell on his empty finger. His dark eyes were unreadable as he said softly, \"...If Shen Fuyuan gives you any trouble, just tell me. She has a terrible temper, so you don't need to be polite to her.\"","As soon as he said that, there seemed to be a few seconds of stunned silence on the other end.","Immediately after, the girl's bright, cheerful laughter carried over.","\"Hahahaha, okay! I'll definitely look to Chairman Shen to back me up then. Isn't this what they call a fox exploiting the tiger's might? Don't worry, I even taught you how to be the bad guy before. My temper might just be worse than hers.\"","Her laughter broke the dead silence of his living room, tearing away the dense cobwebs in the house and letting the bright light shine in from outside.","Shen Linyan thought back to that night again.","The girl had sat on the sofa, holding up her phone for him to see with a serious expression, saying she wanted to teach him how to be a bad guy.","She said that if he developed feelings for someone else, this relationship of mutual benefit would end.","But they clearly hadn't developed feelings, yet their beneficial relationship had ended prematurely.","She also said that because he was so kind-hearted, she needed to teach him how to be bad.","Listening to the laughter through the phone, he numbly reached up to touch his face, only to feel a patch of wetness. Tears had fallen again without him realizing.","But he was never a kind-hearted person.","He wanted his wife to come back.","He had been constantly regretting letting his wife leave.","He couldn't forget her, no matter what.","He tried not to think about it, tried forcing himself not to see An Ling for days. But the moment he saw her, the longing he had desperately suppressed all these days burst forth, drowning him like a tidal wave.","He had even deliberately let Shen Fuyuan bring the two of them over, masochistically watching An Ling interact with others with his own eyes.","That scene didn't bring him any relief; instead, it drove him mad with jealousy. His heart felt like it was being torn in two, and the fire of jealousy burned relentlessly within him.","If he had known... he wouldn't have hypocritically agreed back then.","His wife was someone who easily softened her heart. If he had just pretended to be a bit more pitiful, she would have stayed.","She said he was kind.","In reality, she was the one who was so good that he couldn't bear to deceive her.","That was why he had confessed everything about his act of pretending to be a lover, unable to bring himself to deceive her with fake affection anymore.","After An Ling finished laughing, she chatted with Shen Linyan a bit more about things that had happened in the past.","She even brought up the incident of buying a bag with Shen Fuyuan at the mall, and Ms. Chen's misunderstanding when she gifted the fountain pen.","These trivial matters that she wouldn't have mentioned while they were married were instead spoken of after their divorce.","\"And my parents too. They were so surprised when I came back that day. Especially my brother—when he found out you gave me two hundred million, I really regretted not taking a picture of the expression on his face...\"","When she accidentally glanced at the time, her voice suddenly paused. She realized it was getting late.","She hadn't read much of the document she originally planned to review; she had spent all her time chatting.","Well then. She had previously rejected Jiang Mai's call to chat, yet here she was talking to Shen Linyan until this late hour. If Jiang Mai found out, she would definitely get an earful again.","\"It's really late, and we both have work tomorrow. You should go to sleep early.\"","An Ling smiled and shut her laptop, just about to hang up the phone.","Suddenly, the man's voice came through the receiver.","\"An Ling, can you have dinner with me tomorrow night?\"","She was slightly taken aback, not expecting him to bring this up out of the blue.","\"Dinner?\"","Didn't they just eat together tonight?","Seeming to guess what she was thinking, the man on the other end gave a soft \"Mm.\" His gentle tone was slow and light.","\"On the night of our divorce, I originally wanted to have one last meal with you before we parted ways, but I didn't expect you to move out early.\"","An Ling, feeling a sharp prick to her conscience: \"...\"","Since Shen Linyan hadn't brought it up, she had deliberately ignored it and avoided explaining herself. She even pretended not to see the messages Auntie Cheng sent her, offering no reply whatsoever.","Just the day before the divorce, she had said they should be friends, but immediately after the divorce, she left without a word, not even sending a single message.","Mainly, she was afraid that she might accidentally soften her heart and go back to offer Shen Linyan comfort.","She had just told Jiang Mai during the day that she absolutely wouldn't try to save Shen Linyan, so she needed to follow through with concrete actions.","Well, now look. He had brought the matter up himself.","She rubbed her nose. \"Dinner... Sure, no problem. Tomorrow night, right? Should we invite Shen Fuyuan along?\"","Shen Linyan really was different from her. He was such a decent and proper person.","He even needed a sense of ceremony for a divorce. Was this the \"breakup meal\" people talked about online?","Hearing the girl's voice, Shen Linyan lowered his eyes, his voice very soft. \"Just the two of us, is that okay?\"","Before An Ling could answer, he let out a soft chuckle, his voice remaining gentle.","\"If you feel it's inappropriate for the two of us to eat together now that we're divorced, that's fine too. I'm okay with whatever you decide.\"","\"...\"","An Ling gave a guilty, dry laugh. \"You're joking! What's wrong with it!? It's completely fine! I really was in the wrong that day, and I wanted to ask you out for a meal too. You can set the time and place.\"","She would keep it a secret from Jiang Mai. Just this one meal."]},{"number":58,"title":"Chapter 58: Shen Linyan, You Have a Fever","paragraphs":["To be reasonable, An Ling actually didn't think having a meal with Shen Linyan was a difficult thing.","It was just eating with her ex-husband, what was the big deal!","It was all Jiang Mai's fault for always talking about \"salvation\" every day. She was practically triggered by the word now, terrified that everything she did would be seen as some sort of salvation.","As long as they interacted like normal friends, it would be fine.","An Ling sat at her workstation, propping up her chin and staring at the video on her screen, but in reality, she was secretly glancing at the time in the bottom right corner out of the corner of her eye.","4:56.","There was still more than an hour until she got off work.","Shen Linyan said he would come pick her up after work.","Thinking of this, An Ling's gaze shifted to the small mirror on her desk, and she examined herself carefully for a moment.","She felt like her makeup was a bit smudged.","Why did it seem like her dark circles were a bit heavy too? If she had known, she wouldn't have stayed up late reading documents last night.","She took out her compact powder and lipstick from her bag, quietly opened the compact, leaned closer to the mirror, and pressed it onto the areas of her face where the makeup was fading.","Suddenly, a woman's slow, teasing voice came from beside her:","\"Oh my, it looks like our Ah Leng has a date after work. You usually don't pay this much attention to your pretty face.\"","\"...\"","An Ling subconsciously looked up, her gaze falling on the other party's pearl earrings and glasses. She curved her eyes and whispered, \"No, no, Sister Lin Ya, I'm just slacking off a bit.\"","\"Is that so...\"","Lin Ya nodded in sudden realization. \"Then do you want to grab dinner together tonight? Teacher Chen and a few other teachers will be there too. Teacher Chen said he wants to introduce you to them.\"","\"?\"","An Ling looked confused. \"Really?\"","So suddenly?","She hesitantly glanced at her phone nearby. \"...Are we going right after work today?\"","Maybe she should tell Shen Linyan and reschedule their dinner.","Seeing her troubled expression, Lin Ya couldn't help but burst out laughing. \"Alright, alright, I'm just kidding. Usually, when it comes to introductions, Ah Leng, you don't have this hesitant look on your face.\"","\"...\"","Seeing the girl's straight face, Lin Ya quickly smiled apologetically. While handing over a document, she also placed a piece of candy on the desk. \"My apologies, my apologies. Actually, there's a document I need you to sign.\"","After An Ling finished signing the document, Lin Ya picked it up. As she left, she winked secretly.","\"You go back to slacking off, I won't tell Teacher Chen. Though Teacher Chen would probably understand a precious date between a young couple.\"","An Ling's face flushed slightly as she accepted the candy. \"Apology accepted!\"","After getting off work, she sent a message to Shen Linyan.","An Ling: [Chairman Shen, off work! ^^]","Shen Linyan: [Already waiting outside ^^]","Walking out the main gate, sure enough, she saw the familiar black Bentley parked by the road.","She walked over and opened the back door. The man in the seat was dressed in a sharp suit, clearly having just gotten off work from his company as well.","Hearing the sound, the man looked up, his eyes curving into a smile. \"Good evening, An Ling.\"","An Ling had actually imagined it would be awkward, but in reality, the moment she got into the car and saw the man's usual gentle smile, all her nervousness quietly vanished into thin air.","She got in the car and smiled back. \"Good evening.\"","Just as she was about to say something, her phone suddenly buzzed.","The video she had sent to Shen Fuyuan in the afternoon finally received a reply.","Shen Fuyuan: [No problem, let's shoot it like this.]","An Ling: [Okay.]","Shen Fuyuan: [But there's one thing. My schedule for next week's shoot might change. My mom is acting crazy again recently; knowing I'm shooting a variety show, she insists I move back home and shoot it there, so the camera positions might need to be reinstalled.]","Seeing this message, An Ling's gaze paused slightly, a look of contemplation appearing in her eyes.","Mother Shen doing this was very likely an attempt to whitewash Lu Jingshen in front of the public.","An Ling just felt like a pig was about to be let out of its pen.","[Okay, I will have my colleagues go to the Shen family home for a site visit and figure it out before reinstalling the cameras.]","Reinstalling at this point was indeed quite troublesome, but the Shen family was wealthy and powerful; what ordinary person would dare to easily offend them?","Seeing her strictly professional response, Shen Fuyuan was clearly a bit dissatisfied, hinting at something overtly and covertly in her words.","[I didn't tell my mom that the executive producer of this show is you, humph humph humph.]","The corners of An Ling's mouth curled up slightly.","[Then let's give her a surprise later, humph humph humph.]","She had to let Mother Shen know what editing effects were all about.","After replying to the message, she put her phone back in her bag.","Just as she wanted to speak, she realized that the car had become quiet at some point, leaving only the sound of shallow breathing in the air.","An Ling's body stiffened, her expression turning somewhat subtle.","Oh no, she accidentally chatted too much with Shen Fuyuan and completely forgot that Shen Linyan was right next to her.","A few seconds later, she quietly turned her head to take a peek.","When she saw the scene beside her, her eyes widened slightly in surprise.","On the seat, the handsome man was leaning against the backrest with his head tilted, his eyes closed. Stray hair fell across his forehead, his long and thick eyelashes drooped quietly, and his breathing was steady. He had already fallen fast asleep.","An Ling blinked, unable to stop the corners of her mouth from turning up slightly.","Just as she was about to look away, her movements suddenly paused.","Hmm?","Her gaze stopped, and her brows slowly knitted together.","Why did it seem like Shen Linyan's face was a bit red?","Realizing something, An Ling narrowed her eyes and stared for a moment. Then, she quietly leaned closer and gently raised her hand to place it on the man's forehead.","The moment she touched his burning hot skin, her expression instantly froze.","Shen Linyan didn't know when he had fallen asleep.","After An Ling got into the car, he had originally planned to wait until she was done with her business to discuss where to eat, but his eyelids grew heavier and heavier until his consciousness gradually blurred.","In his sleep, a familiar citrus scent lingered at the tip of his nose. The hair on his forehead was gently brushed aside, and a soft palm pressed against his skin.","A trace of coolness dispelled the overly hot temperature on his face. His eyelids fluttered, and he slowly opened his eyes.","The first thing he saw was the girl's frowning, worried gaze.","\"Shen Linyan, you have a fever.\"","It wasn't a question, but a statement of fact.","An Ling felt something was wrong the moment she touched him. The temperature of the man's forehead was so hot that it warmed her palm; it was definitely not a simple low-grade fever.","His fever was this high? Did Shen Linyan not feel it himself?","She turned to look at the driver in the front and ordered directly, \"Go to the hospital.\"","Hearing this, the driver looked hesitant.","He looked at the man in the back seat through the rearview mirror, his eyes seemingly asking for his opinion.","But in the dim car, the man let out a low chuckle.","He tilted his head against the backrest, an abnormal flush on his face. The cold nobility he usually possessed had completely faded away, leaving only a touch of vulnerability and sluggish lethargy.","He lowered his eyes and smiled, grasping her wrist. His long, slender fingertips were scorching hot. His eyes curved as he whispered in a hoarse voice, \"It's alright, Madam. I'll go home and take medicine after we eat. Let's go eat first.\"","An Ling: \"...\" He was still thinking about eating.","\"No,\" An Ling frowned and rejected the idea. \"Shen Linyan, you must go to the hospital right now.\"","He was burning up so much he couldn't even think straight.","She wiped away the fine beads of sweat from the man's forehead and gently covered his eyes. \"Alright, alright, stop talking. Go to sleep for a bit.\"","After saying that, she turned her head again and stared expressionlessly at the driver, her tone icy cold.","\"Listen to me and go to the hospital. If you dare to listen to your boss, get out of the car right now and let me drive.\"","As soon as the words left her mouth, the man's hoarse laughter instantly came from the back seat.","\"Madam didn't bring her driver's license.\"","\"Don't worry about it. If we get a ticket, it's on you.\" An Ling covered his mouth.","Hearing their conversation, the driver's smile froze.","\"...Yes, ma'am. I will head to the hospital right away.\""]},{"number":59,"title":"Chapter 59: Ms. An's Legal Husband","paragraphs":["The hospital they went to was the same one where An Ling had stayed last time.","Holding Shen Linyan's hand, An Ling first went to register for a consultation. A nurse took Shen Linyan's temperature.","It was a good thing they checked, because his temperature was a staggering forty degrees Celsius.","Hearing the doctor announce this number, An Ling's brow twitched. Forty degrees?","What was this man doing? Did he really not feel unwell after a whole day? And he had even foolishly gone out to eat with her.","The doctor put away the thermometer. He is also a bit dehydrated. He might have been experiencing some emotional fluctuations recently. Take this slip and follow the nurse to get an IV drip later, and you'll need to take some medicine back home.","Okay, An Ling nodded hastily.","After giving these instructions, the doctor suddenly took another look at her.","He lowered his head to write on the medical record, his tone casual.","How have you been recently, Miss An?","?","An Ling's expression froze in bewilderment. Me?","Did this doctor know her?","The doctor handed over the medical record. Miss An, you should also drink less. You came here several times before complaining of severe headaches, but every examination showed no problems. Then, last time, you fainted after drinking. We guessed you probably drank too much, but you never came when we called you in for a follow-up.","An Ling: ...","Wasn't that the system's tactic to attract Lu Jingshen?","How could it be the same doctor?","A very faint chuckle came from the side.","She turned to look at the man on the chair, her face flushing red. You're still laughing at me! You didn't even know you had a fever! What if the fever makes you stupid!","She was starting to suspect if the plot was doing this on purpose. Realizing that Lu Jingshen wasn't as formidable as Shen Linyan, it was using underhanded methods to make Shen Linyan stupid.","The man sat obediently on the chair with a cooling patch stuck to his forehead, his eyes curving into a smile. I'm sorry.","I don't forgive you!","An Ling took the medical record, pulled Shen Linyan up by his hand, and muttered softly, Forget it, forget it, I won't argue with a patient. I'll forgive you after your IV drip is done, understand?","The man let her lead him out, answering with a smile, Understood.","Watching their retreating figures, the young nurse nearby quietly leaned in.","Dr. Liang, do you feel that this Madam Shen is a bit different from before?","Liang Chen took off his glasses, smiling as he looked down and organized the medical records. Her temper got better?","He picked up the phone next to him, unable to stop himself from clicking his tongue inwardly.","Gu Xiaochi and Wang Yihong really should have come to see how a certain someone looked just now. He was too good at pretending.","He didn't believe for a second that the man felt nothing with a forty-degree fever. He was definitely just dragging it out on purpose.","The young nurse didn't notice her doctor's meaningful expression. Recalling her encounter with the woman when she opened the door last time, she said, She really is. Could it be because of love? Is the man next to her Second Young Master Shen?","After all, every time she came over, this Madam Shen would call Second Young Master Shen.","Liang Chen raised his eyebrows and laughed out loud.","Of course not. That is the eldest young master of the Shen family, Miss An's legal husband.","Of course, he wasn't anymore.","When the nurse inserted the IV needle for Shen Linyan, An Ling watched from the side.","She glanced at the several bottles nearby. Does he have to finish all of these? About how long will it take?","Yes. The nurse thought for a moment. About five hours.","An Ling checked the time. It was seven o'clock now; five hours would take them to midnight.","Shen Linyan looked at her. Before he could speak, the nurse's voice rang out first.","Alright, don't move around. Call me to change the bottle when your husband finishes this one.","Hearing this, both of them were stunned.","An Ling's eyes flickered. She pursed her lips and turned her head away without saying a word.","Right at that moment, her phone chimed. She looked down at it.","Secretary Chen has arrived at the hospital. He brought some things over.","Shen Linyan stared at her. Sitting in the chair, he lowered his head and smiled gently, saying, Okay, you should head back first. I'm sorry to have troubled you tonight. Secretary Chen can take over from here.","An Ling pondered for a moment before silently nodding. It's okay, it's no trouble. Take care of yourself.","Just as she turned to leave, the man's soft and slow voice sounded behind her.","Can I treat you to dinner again next time?","She paused her steps. A few seconds later, she turned her head, blinked, and smiled. Of course you can. Once you recover, I can come anytime.","Shen Linyan's eyes curved as he nodded. Okay.","When she reached the hospital entrance, Secretary Chen was holding a bag containing a blanket and some food.","Miss An.","Seeing An Ling come out, his first instinct was to hand the bag over to her. The next second, hearing An Ling's words, he instantly stopped his movement.","Please take these up to him. I'm leaving.","Secretary Chen's eyes widened, unable to process it for a moment. He instinctively wanted to say, Aren't you staying?","The words reached his lips, but he silently swallowed them back and nodded. Understood, Miss An. Be careful on your way back.","Mhm. Remember to call the nurse to change the bottle when the IV finishes.","An Ling thought about it; there shouldn't be anything else.","Her gaze inadvertently fell on the lunchbox in his hand, and she frowned.","You only bought plain congee? You should have gotten some protein or something, right?","He hadn't eaten anything all evening; this was way too plain.","Why was Secretary Chen so unprofessional?","Thinking this, An Ling's eyes filled with suspicion.","Being stared at by her, a cold sweat broke out on Secretary Chen's back. He gave an awkward smile. You're right, it was my oversight.","Miss An looked so worried, so why didn't she just stay?","Alright.","An Ling waved her hand and stepped aside. Hurry up and go in. The infusion room is on the second floor.","Secretary Chen was just about to lift his leg when the woman's slightly frustrated and irresistible complaints rang in his ears again. Hey... Secretary Chen, as his personal secretary, your boss had a fever all day and you didn't notice? Isn't there a lifestyle assistant secretary? Where are they?","...","Secretary Chen stopped in his tracks, turned his head to look at her, and sighed helplessly a few seconds later.","Miss An, to tell you the truth, for Chairman Shen, a secretary's only use is for work reports and schedule arrangements. He doesn't like others interfering in his personal space. Just like when Zhou Wen was Chairman Shen's lifestyle assistant, her job was actually very simple—just making coffee.","Even if I noticed and pointed it out, Chairman Shen would just say it doesn't matter. This has happened before, and Chairman Shen just took some medicine himself and got over it.","If Miss An hadn't sent him a message, he wouldn't even have come to the hospital tonight.","Hearing this, An Ling stood frozen in place, speechless.","A moment later, her eyes curved as she nodded gently. Okay, go on inside.","Seeing Secretary Chen go inside, the woman's smile vanished instantly, and she silently curled her lips.","She turned around, pulled her phone out of her bag, and muttered quietly, You still have to say something. How is a boss supposed to pay salaries if his fever makes him stupid?","Secretary Chen was unreliable; she needed to find someone who was.","[Auntie Cheng, Shen Linyan has a fever. Could you make the dinners a bit lighter for the next few nights?]","Before she could tuck her phone back into her bag, a reply came through.","Auntie Cheng: [Um... Miss An, actually, the night you left, sir told me I didn't need to cook anymore.]","An Ling's movements paused. She stood in place for several minutes before typing: [Not cooking at all??]","Then what did Shen Linyan eat? He couldn't possibly have social engagements every night, right? Was he cooking for himself?","Auntie Cheng sent a reply: [Yes, sir actually doesn't have the habit of eating dinner.]","... So in the past, he was just eating to keep her company?","An Ling pursed her lips lightly, staring at the screen for a long moment before slowly tucking her phone back into her bag and slipping her hands into her pockets.","She turned her head, casting a glance toward the second floor of the hospital.","Her soft hair fluttered gently in the evening breeze, and the bright streetlights reflected in her almond eyes. It was impossible to tell what was going on behind that pretty face.","A moment later, she raised a hand to fix her hair and muttered softly, \"No wonder he got sick.\"","Skipping meals while working around the clock, not to mention eating dinner without a jacket last night and rolling up his sleeves. It would be a miracle if he didn't catch a cold.","Just as she was about to look away, she caught a glimpse of a familiar figure at the hospital entrance out of the corner of her eye. Her gaze paused, and she strode over, her face completely expressionless.","Secretary Chen was just heading toward the parking lot when a woman's flat, emotionless voice suddenly rang out behind him.","\"Wow, what a coincidence, Secretary Chen. Are you leaving already?\"","Secretary Chen: \"...\""]},{"number":60,"title":"Chapter 60: I Want Anling... by My Side","paragraphs":["The second floor of the hospital was filled with the smell of disinfectant.","In the IV drip room, a man sat alone in his seat. Dressed in a sharp suit, with handsome and refined features, his innate sense of nobility seemed completely out of place here.","His long legs were bent, and his eyes were cast down at the floor. The blue cooling patch on his forehead was conspicuous, making his solitary figure look somewhat pitiful.","Suddenly, the sound of footsteps approached.","A patch of white fabric appeared in his line of sight, and a familiar male voice came from above.","\"Why is our Chairman Shen sitting here all alone getting an IV? You look so pitiful.\"","Shen Linyan snapped out of his daze. He lazily lifted his eyelids for a glance, casually peeled the cooling patch off his forehead with his slender fingers, and indifferently lowered his gaze. His hoarse voice carried little emotion. \"What do you want?\"","\"What kind of question is that? As a doctor, isn't checking on a patient standard procedure?\"","Liang Chen sat down next to him, hands in his pockets and legs crossed. \"An Ling left?\"","\"Yeah.\" The man closed his eyes and lowered his head, pinching the bridge of his nose.","Liang Chen turned to look at him.","\"You're really weird. Since you've already gone this far, why didn't you ask her to stay? Wasn't deliberately skipping your medicine just for this?\"","But in the end, he only had An Ling accompany him to the doctor and then quickly let her go.","Shen Linyan was silent for a moment before speaking softly, \"There was no need. She has to work tomorrow.\"","He just wanted to spend a little time with An Ling today.","Stealing a brief moment of her care by playing the pity card was enough to satisfy him.","Liang Chen knew they were divorced, though he wasn't entirely sure why. But looking at the situation, it definitely wasn't because they hated each other.","More importantly, there was one thing he couldn't understand at all.","\"What do you want? From the looks of it, you clearly can't forget her. Is there no chance of remarrying?\"","What did he want?","Shen Linyan opened his eyes and quietly stared at the IV bottle on the stand. His feverish, muddled head was terrifyingly clear at this moment.","His eyelashes fluttered slightly as he opened his mouth to answer softly:","\"I want... An Ling's companionship.\"","Not fondness, nor love.","He went to such great lengths just to have the simplest form of companionship, the kind even a friend could have.","And he would only accept An Ling's companionship.","If so, perhaps one day, these illusions of dependency would unconsciously transform into genuine love.","He wanted to fall in love with An Ling.","If he could only love one person in his lifetime, he hoped that person would be An Ling, and it could only be An Ling.","When that day truly arrived, he could pursue An Ling and propose remarrying.","It was a very foolish, even extreme method. Who would force their own body and mind to love someone?","But this was the best method Shen Linyan could think of.","He could only use this way to learn how to love someone.","Hearing this, Liang Chen felt a complex mix of emotions.","He glanced at the nearly empty IV bottle, sighed, and stood up, patting his white coat.","\"Alright, I'll go call the nurse to change your IV bottle. I still have patients, so I can't stay long. Make sure you rest.\"","Catching a glimpse of the untouched dinner on the floor out of the corner of his eye, he pointed at it. \"Secretary Chen bought it for you, so just eat a little. You're not studying abroad anymore. Working at such high intensity every day without eating... your health really isn't great right now. And you even sent Secretary Chen back. Now look at you, without a single person to take care of you.\"","Shen Linyan's habit of skipping dinner started when he was abroad. At the time, his family didn't give him any money, so he worked four jobs a day. Half of what he earned went to his studies and daily living expenses, while the other half was entirely invested in the stock market.","The man didn't reply, simply leaning back against the chair with his eyes closed.","Liang Chen knew he wouldn't listen, so he just put his hands in his pockets and turned to find the nurse.","A few minutes later, footsteps approached.","The nurse's voice sounded by his ear.","\"Mr. Shen, I'm here to change your IV bottle.\"","Shen Linyan opened his eyes, turned to check the time on the wall, and suddenly spoke up to stop her. \"Can you just take it out? I won't do the rest. I feel pretty much fine now, and I have things to do later. I'm in a hurry.\"","It was taking too long, and he still had documents to review at home.","The nurse didn't pause her movements.","\"I'm afraid not. Dr. Liang just told me that if you made this request, I shouldn't agree to it. He also said that if you're bored, I should put the TV on for you. Do you want to watch?\"","\"...\"","He had a feeling Liang Chen was doing this on purpose. Taking some pills would have been perfectly fine.","Shen Linyan pressed his temples with a headache. \"No need, thank you.\"","The nurse withdrew her hands. \"Alright then, Mr. Shen, please rest well. I'll come back later to change the next bottle.\"","There weren't many people in the IV room; only three patients were getting fluids.","One of them was a little boy sitting diagonally behind Shen Linyan.","He had been watching cartoons, but after hearing the conversation between Shen Linyan and the nurse, he looked up. His big, round eyes blinked, and then he turned to his parent beside him.","\"Mommy, does that uncle not want his injection because he doesn't have a TV to watch?\"","Shen Linyan froze, turning his head slightly with a complicated expression.","...Uncle?","He was only twenty-seven and already being called an uncle?","The boy's mother had noticed this man of extraordinary temperament much earlier and quickly offered him an apologetic smile.","She lowered her head and said gently, \"The uncle isn't doing it because he has no TV. He's just very busy.\"","\"But you still have to get your injection even if you're busy, otherwise you won't get better.\" The little boy swung his legs. \"I'm very busy too. I have to go to kindergarten, but I still came to get my injection.\"","\"That doesn't count as busy.\"","The boy's mother wiped his nose and took away the phone. \"The uncle is different from you. Alright, stop playing on the phone. Ten minutes are up. Are you sleepy? How about Mommy holds you while you sleep?\"","The little boy nodded and sat on his mother's lap.","A moment later, he suddenly spoke up slowly again:","\"Mommy, I know why.\"","\"Why what?\"","\"The uncle doesn't want his injection because he has no one to keep him company. Look, we all have someone with us, and the other adults have people with them too. The pretty sister who came with the uncle earlier left. I even wanted to say hi to the pretty sister.\"","The crisp, childish voice was exceptionally clear in the IV room, and the space instantly fell completely silent.","A young couple nearby, where the boyfriend was keeping his girlfriend company during her IV, also looked over.","Shen Linyan: \"...\"","The boy's mother covered his mouth with a stiff expression. \"Go to sleep. Stop talking.\"","She then gave Shen Linyan an apologetic smile. \"I'm so sorry, kids just say whatever...\"","Shen Linyan shook his head. \"It's fine.\"","He checked the time, confirmed it would still be a long while, and closed his eyes, leaning gently against the chair back to rest.","He didn't know how much time had passed when the sound of footsteps reached his ears.","Shen Linyan assumed it was the nurse coming to change the IV bottle and didn't open his eyes.","But right after, a blanket was gently draped over him, and a familiar fragrance drifted to his nose.","Someone sat down softly in the chair next to him, making a faint sound.","Shen Linyan's eyelids fluttered, and he slowly opened his eyes to look over.","In the next second, the familiar side profile of a woman instantly filled his vision.","His pupils shrank slightly. He stared blankly at the scene before him, thinking he was dreaming, not even noticing the blanket slipping off his body.","Sensing the movement, the woman paused her action of untying her scarf. She turned her head and smiled, her eyes curving into crescents.","\"Did I wake you?\""]},{"number":61,"title":"Chapter 61: So Handsome","paragraphs":["Seeing the man staring at her continuously, An Ling felt a little embarrassed and looked away.","Suddenly turning back and returning, it was indeed a bit strange.","Fortunately, she had already thought of an excuse.","\"I came to bring you dinner. Auntie Cheng cooked some fresh millet porridge for you. The one Secretary Chen brought was too bland. I also cut up some fruit.\"","After speaking, she lifted the insulated food jar beside her to show him.","The man didn't speak, still staring at her blankly. A few seconds later, he blinked abruptly, then flusteredly lowered his eyes, his thin lips pressed together.","An Ling blinked at his reaction.","She couldn't help but curl her lips into a smile. Glancing at the untouched white porridge on the floor, she tilted her head and leaned in, \"Do you want to eat? I haven't eaten either, shall we eat together?\"","Shen Linyan looked up, meeting the laughter in the woman's eyes. His gaze flickered slightly, and he slowly nodded, his voice a bit hoarse: \"Okay.\"","An Ling took out the porridge. In fact, she had already eaten at home, but eating together would make things less awkward.","After portioning a little out for herself, she gave the rest to Shen Linyan.","Watching him lower his head and eat quietly, she stared for a while and suddenly spoke up, \"Has your fever gone down a bit now?\"","As she spoke, she naturally reached out to feel the man's forehead, then pulled the blanket up a bit higher, chattering away.","\"It doesn't seem as hot as it was at first. Are you still dizzy? I heard that when you have a fever, you feel cold, so I specifically asked Secretary Chen to bring a blanket over. You need to stay covered. Speaking of which, why did you let Secretary Chen leave? Such a grand chairman, sick here with no one to look after you, so pitiful.\"","When she ran into Secretary Chen downstairs at the hospital earlier, she still held onto a sliver of hope, guessing that he might just be going home to fetch something.","But Secretary Chen said Chairman Shen told him to just go back.","Hearing those words at the time, An Ling felt a sense of \"I knew it\" in her heart.","Shen Linyan didn't like to trouble others, so he would definitely send Secretary Chen away.","The moment the woman's palm pressed against his forehead, Shen Linyan's movements froze. He turned his head to watch her speak.","A few seconds later, he put down the food jar, lowered his eyes, and said softly, \"Thank you...\"","An Ling paused for a moment, then her eyes curved into a smile.","Propping up her chin, she seriously raised her index finger and wagged it. \"What are you thanking me for? When you recover, remember to transfer me a nursing fee. I'm not free, you know. Hmm... I'll give Chairman Shen a discount. How about a hundred bucks? I'll just charge you for the cab fare.\"","Under the light, the woman's long, dark hair was casually tied up, with a few strands falling by her ears. Her beautiful eyes looked at him with a smile, and her long, curled eyelashes were like little fans, gently sweeping across his heart.","Noticing his gaze, she blinked blankly and touched her own face.","\"Why are you looking at me? Is a hundred bucks too much? Then fifty?\"","The man lowered his head and chuckled softly, his voice very light: \"Okay.\"","An Ling hummed a laugh. \"Then it's a deal. Remember to transfer it to me. You rest now, I'll keep an eye on your IV drip for you.\"","She packed away the food jar and took out her earphones from her bag, intending to watch some shows.","With so much time to kill, she had to find something to do.","Just as she was about to put them on, she glanced at the man beside her, hesitated for a moment, and offered one earphone. \"Do you want to watch?\"","The man nodded, shifting the blanket a little more toward her side.","An Ling didn't refuse, moving the phone to the middle.","These past few days, for the sake of studying, An Ling had been watching other variety shows of the same genre.","She slightly raised her head, lowered her voice, and said with a smile, \"The variety show Shen Fuyuan is going to film is also this kind.\"","It was Shen Linyan's first time watching something like this. Hearing her words, his eyes curved.","\"With her temper, it seems it will be very hard to edit.\"","\"Exactly.\" An Ling laughed out loud.","Even her own brother agreed; if Shen Fuyuan knew, she would probably get mad again.","Recalling Nan Zhechuan's words from that day, she also grew somewhat interested. She leaned close to the man's ear and whispered, \"If we end up bringing hate to Chairman Shen's sister, will Chairman Shen make our show get taken down?\"","The warm breath exhaled by the woman brushed against his ear, enveloped in a unique fragrance. Her smiling voice carried a hint of teasing, like a tiny hook.","Shen Linyan's body stiffened slightly, but he quickly recovered. Curving his lips, he said gently, \"Having public discussion and heat is a good thing for your show. Sacrificing Shen Fuyuan alone isn't a loss.\"","An Ling held the phone and froze for a moment. After snapping back to reality, she raised an eyebrow at him.","\"You said it yourself, no taking it back! If the show gets popular, you can't take our show down.\"","Shen Linyan nodded lightly. \"Mm, I said it. I won't take it back.\"","An Ling smiled and shifted her gaze back to the phone screen, saying meaningfully, \"Then I've just obtained a get-out-of-jail-free card.\"","The two watched for a while longer, occasionally chatting about the content of the variety show.","An Ling completely forgot she was there to study, getting caught up in discussing the content with Shen Linyan.","Looking at the scenes on the phone, she couldn't help but chuckle softly. Just as she was about to turn her head and share it with Shen Linyan, her shoulder suddenly felt heavy.","Turning her head to look, she saw that Shen Linyan had fallen asleep with his eyes closed at some point.","The man's brows and eyes carried traces of exhaustion, and there were faint dark circles under his eyes. It seemed he hadn't slept well these past few days.","His soft hair gently brushed against the side of her neck. His breathing was steady, the hot breath spilling onto her skin.","An Ling silently muted her phone.","A nurse came over right on time to change the IV bottle. Seeing An Ling sitting there, she couldn't help but be slightly taken aback.","Noticing that Shen Linyan was asleep, she didn't speak either, quietly replacing the IV bottle.","After the nurse left, An Ling watched the variety show for a little while longer, but found she couldn't really get into it. Finally, she turned off her phone.","She leaned against the back of the chair, staring at the clock on the wall. The longer she stared, the sleepier she got. She yawned out of boredom and twirled her phone in her hands.","Having stayed up too late last night, not resting all day, and repeatedly watching videos at work, she was actually getting a bit sleepy now too.","To distract herself, An Ling lowered her head, her gaze circling the man's face before she nodded in approval.","She had to admit, no matter how many times she looked at Shen Linyan's face, she would never get tired of it.","So handsome.","While marveling at this, she tilted her head back, squinting at the IV bottle above.","This bottle is so big, it feels like it'll be dripping for a long time. The nurse should be keeping an eye on it too, right?","Earlier, she hadn't even called for the nurse, and the nurse had come over on her own.","Just in case, she yawned and set a vibrating alarm for twenty minutes later. Then, she leaned back against the chair and gently closed her eyes.","Not long after closing her eyes and falling asleep, she suddenly felt the weight on her shoulder lift. She groggily opened her eyes, \"Hmm?\"","The next second, someone gently covered her eyes.","The man's gentle, deep voice sounded by her ear.","\"It's okay, go to sleep. I'll watch the IV drip.\"","Catching the keyword \"IV drip,\" the man's warm palm and familiar cedar scent made An Ling instantly drop her guard. She nodded sleepily, closed her eyes, and went back to sleep.","Shen Linyan lowered his eyes, gently rested her head on his shoulder, and picked up the blanket to cover her.","He lowered his head, his gaze soft. His nose gently brushed against the hair on top of the woman's head, the corners of his lips curling up in an imperceptible arc.","His gaze slowly fell on the woman's hand resting on her lap. After a moment of silence, he slowly reached out his hand.","His movements were gentle yet restrained. His fingertips brushed against hers first, and only after making sure she didn't react did he softly hook his fingers around hers.","Just like that night in the garage, it was his way of coaxing his angry wife.","But this gesture, once so incredibly ordinary, would no longer belong to him."]},{"number":62,"title":"Chapter 62: An Uncle Who Doesn't Want to Get a Shot","paragraphs":["\"Mr. Shen, it's done. I'll take the needle out for you.\"","\"Mm.\"","\"You can just take this slip to the window to pick up your medicine later.\"","The faint sound of voices drifted into her ears. An Ling frowned and slowly opened her eyes, met with an unfamiliar scene.","Remembering where she was, her eyes suddenly widened. The confusion on her face vanished in an instant as she bolted upright, causing the blanket to slip off her body.","She instinctively looked up at the IV bottle above, but saw nothing.","A man's chuckle sounded by her ear.","\"Don't worry, the nurse just took the needle out.\"","\"It's already out?\"","An Ling looked down at her phone and realized it was already past midnight. \"Why didn't my phone vibrate?\"","She remembered setting a vibrating alarm.","\"I saw it and turned it off,\" Shen Linyan said. He bent down to pick up the blanket, folded it, and put it back in the bag. His voice was gentle. \"You're already so tired from coming to accompany me. I wanted to let you sleep a little longer.\"","An Ling nodded absentmindedly, her head full of thoughts about Shen Linyan's condition. She didn't even realize how ambiguous his words sounded.","She reached up to touch his forehead. \"Did your temperature go down? How do you feel?\"","The man lowered his head to make it easier for her. \"The nurse came over to check just now. It's gone down, but I still have a slight low-grade fever.\"","An Ling's heart finally settled.","Thank goodness Shen Linyan hadn't burned his brain out.","She picked up her bag and stood up. \"Are you going to get the medicine then? Let's go home after you get it.\"","Shen Linyan paused slightly, his lips curving into a gentle smile. \"Alright. I'll go get the medicine. Wait for me here, and I'll take you back in a bit.\"","An Ling yawned and nodded in agreement. \"Go ahead.\"","She let out a long breath and sat back down, rubbing her sore neck. \"Sleeping with my head tilted really...\"","As soon as the words left her mouth, her voice came to a sudden halt, and her expression froze.","Wait... head tilted?","Had she been sleeping on Shen Linyan's shoulder the whole time?","When did that happen? Wasn't Shen Linyan asleep too?","An Ling couldn't really remember what she did after falling asleep.","She leaned back against the chair, closed her eyes, and speechlessly massaged her temples.","\"I was supposed to be taking care of him, but I ended up falling asleep right on the patient's shoulder.\"","Earlier she had said Secretary Chen was unreliable, but it turned out she wasn't any better.","Shen Linyan wouldn't laugh at her, would he?","Crap, she was absolutely never going to see Shen Linyan again. This was too embarrassing.","An Ling awkwardly covered her face, sighed, and then opened her eyes.","Only to meet a pair of round, curious eyes.","A chubby little boy had appeared right in front of her at some point. He looked exceptionally adorable. Holding a toy, he blinked and stared at her. On the back of his hand was an IV bandage from where a needle had been removed.","An Ling paused and looked around the IV room. At this hour, she was the only one left in the room.","Certain that the little boy was looking at her, she bent down and smiled, her eyes curving.","\"Little friend, are you alone? Where are your parents?\"","The little boy blinked, his voice crisp. \"Mommy went to the bathroom. I have to wait for her here.\"","The bathroom was just next door, not too far away.","An Ling nodded, her voice gentle. \"Then don't run around, okay? Otherwise, Mommy will be worried if she can't find you.\"","The little boy nodded, but continued to stare intently at An Ling.","An Ling felt a bit self-conscious under his gaze. She awkwardly shifted her eyes away and touched her own face.","Did she have sleep marks on her face? Why was this kid staring at her the whole time?","Just as she was about to use her camera to check, she saw the little boy suddenly patter over to her.","His eyes were sparkling, and his crisp voice lowered in feigned mystery. \"Big sister, I'll tell you a secret. Can you be my friend?\"","Huh?","An Ling was a little surprised, but she still smiled and nodded, mimicking his hushed tone. \"Sure, what's the secret?\"","The little boy put his hand by his mouth, his expression mysterious, looking very much like he was whispering a secret.","\"Before you came, that uncle told the nurse sister he didn't want his injection anymore. He's not a good boy.\"","Uncle?","...Shen Linyan??","An Ling was stunned at first, and then burst out laughing.","Realizing she was laughing a bit too much, she covered her mouth, but her eyes were still curved with amusement as she nodded repeatedly. \"Yes, yes, yes, he's not a good boy! I'll scold him later!\"","Hahaha, she was definitely going to tell Shen Linyan about this!","Seeing her pretty smile, the little boy's chubby cheeks flushed slightly. He giggled too, sheepishly scratching his forehead.","\"Big sister, you're really pretty.\"","\"You're such a sweet talker, little one.\"","An Ling looked left and right, feeling she didn't have anything suitable to give him. She had some candy in her bag that Sister Lin Ya had given her earlier, but since the kid was sick, giving him that was obviously inappropriate.","She could only take off the pendant from her bag. It was a yellow plush toy with big, round eyes, exceptionally cute.","\"Big sister will give you this. Do you like it? It's just as cute as you are.\"","The little boy's eyes lit up. \"I love it! Thank you, big sister!\"","Having received the gift, he couldn't put it down and played with it in his hands.","Thinking of something, the little boy looked up again and whispered, \"By the way, big sister, you need to be careful of that uncle.\"","She blinked in confusion. \"Why?\"","\"Because while you were sleeping, the uncle kept touching your hand. Mommy says boys shouldn't just touch girls!\" The expression on the little boy's chubby face was exceptionally serious and righteous.","An Ling was dumbfounded upon hearing this.","She instinctively looked down at her own hand. \"Touched my hand?\"","The little boy nodded frantically. \"I saw it!\"","Afraid that An Ling wouldn't believe him, he placed the toy on the chair, freed up one hand, and used his finger to gently hook hers, mimicking the action perfectly.","\"Just like this!\"","An Ling stared blankly at the little boy's action, unable to speak for a moment.","After a long while, her eyes curved gently, and she hooked the little boy's chubby little hand.","\"Big sister understands.\"","Just then, the boy's mother called out from the doorway, \"Xiaobao, let's go.\"","The little boy quickly grabbed the toy from the seat. \"Mommy is calling me. Goodbye, big sister!\"","\"Bye-bye.\"","After the boy left, An Ling stared at her fingers, resting her chin on her hand, deep in thought.","After pondering for a while, she shifted her posture, leaning back against the chair with her arms crossed, her brows furrowed slightly.","When Shen Linyan walked in, he saw the woman sitting in the chair, frowning.","His footsteps paused slightly before he walked closer and asked gently, \"What's wrong?\"","An Ling snapped back to reality, picked up her bag, and stood up. \"Nothing. I just met a little boy. He was super cute and wanted to be friends with me.\"","Her gaze couldn't help but secretly glance at the man's hand.","Was what the little kid said true or false?","Shen Linyan bent down to pick up the bag. \"Let's go.\"","An Ling nodded and walked with him.","After reaching the elevator, she glanced at the man beside her from the corner of her eye, the corners of her lips turning up slightly.","Inside the elevator, the woman suddenly spoke, her tone slow and deliberate.","\"Shen Linyan, I just heard some news.\"","\"What is it?\"","\"A little friend told me that before I got here, a certain uncle didn't want to get his injection.\"","\"...\"","Shen Linyan instantly thought of the brat who had called him uncle earlier."]},{"number":63,"title":"Chapter 63: If I don't get married, can we still be friends forever","paragraphs":["After a momentary daze, Shen Linyan turned his head, a helpless smile appearing on his face. \"That must be about me, then.\"","An Ling blinked in feigned surprise, but the smile in her eyes couldn't be hidden.","\"Our Chairman Shen actually has such a disobedient side? Refusing to get an injection when you're sick?\"","Hearing the teasing in the woman's words, the man chuckled. His hoarse voice carried a hint of doting. \"Alright, I'll reflect on my mistakes.\"","\"You have more than just that to reflect on, Mr. Shen.\"","An Ling stuffed her hands into her pockets. \"You didn't go to the hospital when you were sick, insisting on having a meal with me instead. Auntie Cheng told me you didn't eat dinner, either. I didn't expect to add 'dislikes injections' to the list. When we got divorced, didn't I say...\"","As she spoke, her voice suddenly stopped, and her expression stiffened slightly.","These words... didn't seem quite appropriate to say out loud.","As soon as the word \"divorce\" came out, it instantly exposed the relationship between them.","She had no standing to say such things now, nor should she. Her actions today were already a bit out of line.","The man didn't seem to notice her pause. His expression remained unchanged as he smiled softly. \"You're right.\"","An Ling, however, didn't dare to utter another word. She turned her face away to avoid his gaze, nervously touching the earring on her earlobe.","The elevator suddenly fell quiet.","After a moment of silence, the woman suddenly spoke up in a low voice, \"By the way, when will the divorce announcement be released?\"","Shen Linyan's eyes froze. He subconsciously tightened his grip on the bag in his hand until his fingertips turned white, and then abruptly released the tension.","He lowered his eyes to conceal his emotions, curling his lips into a gentle smile. \"It will be released in the next couple of days.\"","\"I see...\"","An Ling hesitated, wanting to say something more, but the elevator doors opened at that moment. In the end, she said nothing and followed the man out of the hospital.","After getting into the car, Mother An happened to send her a caring message.","[Lingling, are you working overtime this late today? Do you want your brother to pick you up?]","She hadn't told her mother that she was accompanying Shen Linyan tonight, simply using working overtime at the company as an excuse.","[Mom, go to sleep first. No need for my brother to pick me up. I'm on my way back and will be there in about ten minutes.]","[Okay, focus on driving. Mom won't bother you.]","After replying to the message, An Ling glanced at the man beside her from the corner of her eye, the little boy's words echoing in her mind again.","She stared at her own hands for a moment, then slowly shifted her erratic gaze away.","The car cabin was a bit too quiet. An Ling could only look down at her phone, pretending to be busy, not really daring to start a conversation.","If she wasn't careful, she might say too much, and the more she said, the more mistakes she'd make. It was better to just stay quiet.","Suddenly, the man's voice broke the silence in the car.","\"An Ling, when my mother called me that night, she actually talked about more than just the video.\"","Hearing this, she instinctively raised her head.","The thought of staying quiet from just a moment ago was instantly thrown to the back of her mind.","\"More than that? What else did she say? Did she really ask you to take the blame for Lu Jingshen?\"","Hah! She knew that old woman was wicked!","\"No matter what she said, it's a good thing you refused.\"","It definitely wasn't anything good, anyway.","The man didn't speak, lowering his eyes as if lost in thought.","A few seconds later, he slowly raised his eyes.","The night was dark and heavy. The car windows occasionally reflected the streetlights passing by. The dim light traced the man's handsome features, making them appear even more profound in the shadows.","His dark eyes looked at her quietly. His thin lips parted, and his voice was low and slow.","\"She said she wanted to introduce my next marriage alliance prospect to me.\"","An Ling's expression suddenly froze. The words on the tip of her tongue got stuck in her throat, unable to go up or down.","When she recovered, she blinked rapidly and opened her mouth, hesitating. \"Ah... so it was about that... Then this also needs to be...\"","Her voice gradually faded away. An Ling shifted her gaze out the window, rubbing her phone with her thumb thoughtfully.","A marriage alliance prospect...","It made sense. Once the divorce announcement was released, the news that the head of the Shen family was single again would definitely attract a large number of people throwing themselves at him.","Shen Linyan would also start looking for his own love.","After a few seconds of silence, she suddenly smiled and sighed. Turning her head, her tone was no different from usual.","\"It seems my guess back then was spot on. They really are arranging blind dates for you. Did you refuse?\"","The man nodded. \"I refused.\"","An Ling continued to smile. \"That's good. Like I said back then, you should choose one yourself...\"","\"I told her I wouldn't marry again.\"","\"...\"","Her smile instantly froze, thinking she had misheard.","The car was filled with a relaxing, soothing incense, and gentle music was playing. It should have been a relaxing atmosphere, but right now, it felt somewhat heavy.","The man in the seat lowered his eyes and softly repeated it, his deep voice exceptionally clear in the car.","\"An Ling, I won't marry again.\"","In that instant, An Ling's heart skipped a heavy beat.","She stared blankly at the person in front of her, unable to utter a single word.","Not getting married?","What did that mean?","After a long while, she finally opened her mouth and found her voice. \"Not getting married... what does that mean?\"","Could it be because his previous marriage left such a terrible impression on him that Shen Linyan didn't want to get married at all anymore?","So, was it because of her?","An Ling gripped her phone tightly, her brows furrowing.","\"Shen Linyan, if you don't want to get married because of your previous marriage with me, I can assure you that your future marriage will definitely not be like that. Although our marriage was indeed a bit unpleasant at the beginning, there was a reason for that. I told you before, you will meet someone...\"","Shen Linyan was taken aback, initially not realizing what the woman was saying.","Once he clearly heard her words, his eyes curved, and a helpless, light chuckle escaped his lips.","He leaned forward and raised a hand to gently cover her chattering mouth.","A crisp, cold woody scent wafted over her. The woman stopped talking, her watery almond eyes looking at him in confusion. \"Mmh?\"","Shen Linyan released his hand. His long fingers helped tuck a stray lock of hair behind her ear. His movements were natural, his voice gentle.","\"An Ling, the reason I don't want to get married is indeed because of you, but not for that reason.\"","His fingertips inadvertently brushed against her earring, his warm finger gently touching the woman's soft earlobe before naturally withdrawing his hand.","The man lowered his eyes and rubbed his fingertips together.","He slowly raised his eyes, gazing at her gently.","\"I know that if I get married, you will keep your distance to avoid suspicion and stop contacting me. We would gradually become strangers.\"","\"If I don't get married, can we be friends forever?\"","An Ling stared blankly with her dark, clear eyes. Her beautiful face was filled with complete bewilderment. Her rosy lips were slightly parted, and her mind had already gone completely blank.","She forgot how she even got out of the car in the end.","By the time she came to her senses, she was already standing at her front door.","...What just happened?","She took a long time to process it before absentmindedly touching her forehead.","Was she running a fever too? Was this actually a dream?","Otherwise, why did it feel just like a dream?"]},{"number":64,"title":"Chapter 64: Tell Him That Reuniting in Marriage Is Impossible, and Stop Giving Him Hope","paragraphs":["\"Beep—\"","\"Click—\"","The door opened, and the warm yellow light from the entrance spilled into the room.","An Ling closed the front door, changed her shoes, and walked into the living room.","Just as she was about to head upstairs, a faint male voice suddenly came from the sofa.","\"Working late?\"","Caught off guard, she shuddered and turned her head in astonishment. \"Brother? You're not asleep yet?\"","An Zhou, dressed in pajamas, sat lazily on the sofa propping up his head and yawned.","\"Mom said you were working overtime and asked me to wait for you.\"","An Ling nodded, unwrapping her scarf as she walked up the stairs. \"Well, I'm back now, so hurry up and go to sleep.\"","But An Zhou didn't move.","He stared at the woman's back as she went upstairs and suddenly spoke, \"Was the colleague you were working overtime with Shen Linyan?\"","\"...\"","An Ling stopped in her tracks, turning her head in shock with wide eyes. \"How did you know?\"","Did An Zhou follow her?","Seeing right through her thoughts, An Zhou scoffed. \"I didn't follow you.\"","Working overtime? Only Mom would believe that.","\"Shen Linyan missed an investment conference today. The organizer told me it was a pity they didn't get to see him.\"","This had never happened before.","He stood up. \"So you were really with Shen Linyan tonight?\"","Why did that sound so strange?","An Ling corrected him, \"He had a fever, so I took him to the hospital.\"","\"Same thing.\"","An Zhou's gaze grew heavy. \"He's the chairman of the Shen Corporation. Does he not have a secretary? No family? Why does he need his ex-wife to accompany him? An Ling, you're divorced. You shouldn't have any more contact with him.\"","The people in the Shen family were all scheming. Only his sister would still think Shen Linyan was a good person.","Little did she know, the most calculating one of them all was Shen Linyan.","After taking control of the Shen Corporation, how many of An Zhou's projects had he swallowed up? Now, several major companies didn't dare cross the Shen Corporation.","He didn't know what that man's intentions were in approaching his sister after their divorce, but it was highly likely he was playing the long game to eventually swallow the An family whole.","An Zhou furrowed his brows, his tone turning serious.","\"An Ling, you're the one who brought up the divorce, so make a clean break from Shen Linyan. You know what the Shen family is like, especially Mother Shen. She hates you, which is why you divorced him in the first place. You keep meeting and spending time with Shen Linyan like this—don't tell me you're planning to marry back into that family.\"","The woman on the stairs remained silent. Pursing her lips, she turned her head slightly. Her soft, long hair fell, revealing a patch of snow-white neck.","After a long moment, she let out a heavy breath and looked down to meet An Zhou's eyes.","\"I know what you mean, Brother. I won't marry back into the Shen family.\"","Jiang Mai was right; her soft-heartedness was indeed a problem.","She lowered her eyes and folded her scarf, her tone calm. \"I just took him to the hospital and watched over him for a bit. Nothing happened. You should get to bed early.\"","Just as she was about to continue upstairs, An Zhou's voice rang out behind her.","\"An Ling, you said your body was taken over by a system for the past two years. I believe you now. My real sister wouldn't be so hopelessly love-struck.\"","An Ling turned to look at him.","After a silent exchange of glances, she waved her hand casually.","\"I'm not, I'm not. Don't worry, you're just overthinking.\"","-","Returning to her room, she closed the door.","An Ling flopped onto her bed and covered her face in frustration.","\"If I had known, I wouldn't have gone to the hospital...\"","Now look what happened. Shen Linyan suddenly said he wasn't going to get married. She had dragged him down after all.","According to the normal progression of things, Shen Linyan should have forgotten her by now and started a new relationship.","She had only gone to the hospital because she saw he wasn't wearing a ring, and during their last dinner, he seemed to have moved on.","But she didn't even do anything! She had even fallen asleep while taking care of him!","An Ling opened her eyes, remembering what the man had said today, and touched her burning ears.","\"This is killing me.\"","Saying he didn't want to get married because he didn't want to drift apart from her—that was way too ambiguous.","But what could she do if he couldn't let go? She couldn't possibly remarry him. She had planned to cut ties with him completely.","An Ling silently took out her phone and sent a message to Jiang Mai.","[(T▽T) I think I messed up, Jiang Mai.]","Jiang Mai: [?]","-","The next day at noon, in a coffee shop.","After hearing the whole story, Jiang Mai put down her teacup and nodded in agreement.","\"Ah... I get it. So you're saying you accompanied someone who needed saving to the hospital, and he accidentally fell in love with you?\"","\"...\"","An Ling silently hid her face behind her coffee cup and muttered, \"You make me sound so narcissistic. It might not even be love.\"","\"What else could it be? Shen Linyan has already gone this far with his words. You know what he means, right?\"","Refusing to get married because of An Ling—it was just too obvious.","She couldn't tell if Shen Linyan had said it on purpose or if he truly didn't realize the implications of his words.","Jiang Mai leaned back, her expression complex. \"An Ling, you really have the potential to be a heartbreaker.\"","Saying you're not playing games, but actually flirting everywhere.","An Ling let out a frustrated sigh. \"I am not! When I saw him sick yesterday, my mind was entirely focused on his illness. I completely forgot about any saving nonsense. Plus, I really feel like I didn't do anything.\"","\"People are at their most vulnerable when they are sick. You really took advantage of the situation,\" Jiang Mai said, nodding meaningfully.","\"...\"","An Ling slumped over the table and waved her hand weakly. \"Alright, alright. Just tell me what I am supposed to do now.\"","\"What do you mean, what to do?\" Jiang Mai took a calm sip of her coffee. \"Since Shen Linyan is so fixated on you, just bag him. Go all out and claim him.\"","An Ling looked completely dead inside. \"...Are you serious?\"","What the heck did she mean by bagging him?","Jiang Mai raised an eyebrow at her. \"Dare you tell me you weren't even a little bit thrilled when Shen Linyan said that yesterday?\"","An Ling had absolutely zero resistance to Shen Linyan's face. There was no way this girl could hold her ground after hearing him say something like that.","Besides, from the looks of it, Shen Linyan had feelings for An Ling long before the hospital incident. It had nothing to do with what happened there.","\"...\"","An Ling quietly turned her head away, her face flushing as she muttered, \"I was completely stunned at the time. I don't even remember how I felt.\"","Her mind had been completely consumed by the thought that it was all over, and that she was going to drag Shen Linyan down with her.","Jiang Mai stared at her, picking up her teacup thoughtfully.","\"An Ling, I know you think Shen Linyan is a good guy and you don't want to hurt him. But if you don't want him pining after you, you need to be decisive. Tell him that getting remarried is out of the question. Don't give him any more hope, and stop trying to be friends. Your idea of an amicable divorce is useless now. Cut ties early while his feelings aren't too deep. Don't go near him again, and ignore him if he asks you out.\"","An Ling froze.","She lowered her head and took a sip of her drink, her eyelashes casting small, fan-like shadows under her eyes. After a long moment, she gave a soft murmur of agreement.","Jiang Mai then slowly added another thought.","\"Of course, if you feel too sad and can't bear to let him go, you could always just play around. You like his face and his personality anyway, so not getting married isn't a dealbreaker. Just be a total heartbreaker. Shen Linyan wouldn't blame you anyway.\"","\"...\"","An Ling was slightly taken aback. \"I can do that?\"","Jiang Mai blinked and flashed a wide grin.","\"Bring it up with Shen Linyan. He might just say yes.\"","\"Don't be ridiculous.\"","An Ling didn't believe it for a second.","Even when they had kissed before, Shen Linyan had been incredibly restrained and never crossed the line. How could he possibly agree to something so outrageous?","He barely even dared to interlock fingers when holding her hand, let alone agree to something like that."]},{"number":65,"title":"Chapter 65: The Name of Shen Linyan's Ex-Wife Is Actually the Same as Yours","paragraphs":["After meeting with Jiang Mai during her lunch break, An Ling returned to the company in the afternoon.","She had originally planned to tell Shen Linyan about the matter, but her colleagues brought over the revised scripts and schedules for her to sign.","Then an emergency meeting was held. It wasn't just Shen Fuyuan's schedule that had changed; other guests also had various adjustments. Some schedules clashed, and there were also conflicts with sponsors.","An Ling was so busy she didn't even have a chance to look at her phone.","\"Ah Leng, aren't we going to the Shen family's house to set up the cameras today?\" Nan Zhechuan called out to her from the door.","The shooting date was getting closer, and it was best to finish these test shoots in the next few days.","\"Coming, coming.\"","An Ling picked up her bag and put on a hat and a mask.","\"Why are you wearing a mask?\" Nan Zhechuan looked at her.","\"I've caught a bit of a cold recently.\"","Nan Zhechuan didn't think much of it and turned toward the elevator. \"The Shen family's situation is a bit special. Ms. Chen told me to assist you in being responsible for Shen Fuyuan.\"","The news of Shen Linyan's divorce had been released this morning.","Ms. Chen was the only person who knew about her relationship with the Shen family. She had originally planned to assign An Ling to another celebrity, but An Ling said it was fine and that nothing would go wrong.","This was the show Shen Fuyuan was participating in, and she was eager for An Ling to be the executive producer, just waiting to see Mother Shen's reaction. If An Ling were reassigned, Shen Fuyuan would actually throw a tantrum.","An Ling got into the passenger seat.","Just as she buckled her seatbelt, she heard Nan Zhechuan speak from beside her.","\"I saw the news today. It seems the heir to the Shen family got divorced.\"","Her movements instantly froze.","Hearing this, the other filming colleagues in the backseat also looked up, and a discussion immediately broke out.","\"Ah, I saw that too.\"","\"The news just came out this morning, right?\"","\"With this news out, the show's popularity is guaranteed.\"","\"Wasn't today's meeting exactly because of this? As soon as the news came out, Ms. Chen said several sponsors came to her, anticipating that the show would blow up. I feel like our bonuses are looking promising this time.\"","Everyone discussed it animatedly, while An Ling silently looked out the window, barely daring to join the conversation.","Nan Zhechuan didn't notice her strange behavior. He glanced at the rearview mirror to reverse the car, still sighing with emotion.","\"The announcement said it was an amicable divorce. An Ling and I met Shen Fuyuan's older brother last time, and he seemed like a pretty nice guy. In the past, whenever I met those big bosses and investors, they all had beer bellies and spoke with an air of superiority. It's truly bizarre that even someone as rich and handsome as Shen Linyan would get divorced. Is it because you can know a person's face but not their heart?\"","The announcement didn't include An Ling's name. She wondered if Shen Linyan had deliberately hidden her name to make her work easier, only writing Miss An.","An Ling gave a few dry laughs without responding, her gaze fixed out the window.","...Should she tell the truth?","She hadn't revealed her identity before because she felt it was unnecessary, and it might even affect her work. Everyone was filming Shen Fuyuan; it had nothing to do with her.","But now the filming location was at the Shen family's house, and the news of Shen Linyan's divorce had just been released. Her name wouldn't be a secret for long.","Hearing Nan Zhechuan say this, the others immediately became curious. \"Brother Nan, you and Ah Leng have met Shen Linyan? When was this? What does he look like?\"","\"It was the last time we went to Shen Fuyuan's house to set up the equipment. You guys went back to the company, and Ah Leng and I stayed behind to wrap things up. It just so happened that Shen Fuyuan was hungry, so she said she'd treat us to a meal. As for what he looks like... you'll know if you search him online. He's exactly as handsome as he is on the internet.\"","At the end, he turned his head and asked An Ling, \"What do you think, An Ling?\"","\"...\"","An Ling nodded stiffly. \"Yes.\"","Hearing both of them say this, someone instantly picked up their phone to search.","A few minutes later, an exclamation came from the backseat: \"Holy crap, he's really handsome.\"","\"Let me see, let me see... Oh my god, is he really not a celebrity?\"","\"The Shen family's genetics are too good. Shen Fuyuan is a star, and her brother looks even more incredible, plus he's a chairman at such a young age.\"","After a while, someone suddenly shouted excitedly.","\"Hey, hey!! An Ling, Shen Linyan's ex-wife actually has the exact same name as you.\"","The announcement could hide her name, but search engines wouldn't.","As soon as these words were spoken, the other colleagues were instantly thrilled.","\"Really? Let me see.\"","\"Wow, it's actually true. Our Ah Leng actually shares a name with her, hahaha.\"","\"It just looks like something happened to this ex-wife; searching the name still brings up headlines.\"","It was also Nan Zhechuan's first time hearing this news.","Because of the nature of their work, they usually needed to pay close attention to the entertainment industry and rarely followed this kind of financial news.","Driving the car, he recalled their last meeting and casually mentioned it.","\"Is that so? To think such things happen in this world. No wonder during our meal last time, I felt Chairman Shen looking over at us several times. It turns out you have the same name as his ex-wife.\"","Feeling the topic drifting further and further off course amidst the lively atmosphere, An Ling pulled her mask up, closed her eyes in despair, and silently swallowed the words she was about to say.","Could she still admit it now? She felt that if she admitted it, everyone would die of awkwardness.","For the first time, she felt that it was the right choice not to post photos online previously due to her prosopagnosia.","Arriving at the Shen residence, the car drove into the courtyard.","Shen Fuyuan came out to receive them. The other colleagues unloaded the equipment from the car. An Ling didn't want to meet Mother Shen, so she chose to organize the equipment over here, while Nan Zhechuan, as the senior, took charge of negotiating.","They had brought quite a bit of equipment, and a few colleagues were still chatting nearby.","\"This villa is so big, it's going to take forever to set up the camera positions.\"","\"Rich families are truly magnificent. I wonder when I'll ever be able to live in a grand villa like this.\"","One of the colleagues stopped what he was doing, thought for a moment, and said, \"Based on our current salaries, we'd probably have to start working from the Qing Dynasty to be able to afford one.\"","The group instantly burst into laughter.","An Ling casually picked up a camera. She hadn't used this type before and was looking down, tinkering with the machine.","Her colleague's hushed voice sounded in her ear.","\"Hey, hey, is that Shen Linyan getting out of the car over there?\"","Her movements paused, and she subconsciously looked up.","A black Rolls-Royce drove into the courtyard. The driver opened the back door, and a man in a suit stepped out.","An Ling took a second to identify him, then lowered her head. Her voice, muffled by the mask, sounded a bit dull, and her tone was calm.","\"It's not Shen Linyan.\"","Although she didn't fully recognize him, this person had to be Lu Jingshen. He gave off an aura that was just begging for a beating; just looking at him was annoying.","By the time all the preparations were done, the sky had already grown dark. An Ling waited outside for them to wrap up their work.","She received a message from Jiang Mai on her phone.","[Did you tell him?]","An Ling's movements paused, and she replied: [No, I've been too busy. I didn't see Shen Linyan today.]","Jiang Mai: [? Couldn't you just say this kind of thing over the phone? Do you really have to say it in person?]","\"...\"","That seemed to make sense.","She paused, pursed her lips, and didn't reply again. She lowered her head, took off her mask, unwrapped a piece of candy and popped it into her mouth. Stuffing her hands into her pockets, she muttered to herself.","\"How could I explain it clearly over the phone...\"","She kicked a stone on the ground over and over, her mind a complete mess.","Actually, rejecting Shen Linyan would be very simple.","Before any deeper feelings could develop, she just needed to cut it off completely, just as decisively as when they had divorced.","She didn't want to hurt Shen Linyan, but her momentary soft-heartedness had ended up hurting him anyway.","Jiang Mai was right. In truth, the moment Shen Linyan said those words, she really was happy.","But that fleeting joy instantly dissolved into guilt.","Because she couldn't give Shen Linyan the love he desired, yet she secretly took pleasure in the fact that he had feelings for her.","Damn it! She really was a terrible woman!","Frustrated with herself, An Ling kicked a stone away, only to hear a familiar, gentle voice.","\"An Ling?\"","Turning around, she saw the very man she had just been thinking about standing right there in the courtyard. He wore a perfectly tailored suit that accentuated his tall, straight posture. His features were striking, and under the glow of the lights, his expression looked even more gentle and noble.","An Ling: \"...\"","Was even God pushing her to reject him?"]},{"number":66,"title":"Chapter 66: Shen Linyan's Ex-Wife Is Me","paragraphs":["The moment she saw Shen Linyan, An Ling quickly pulled back the foot she was using to kick stones.","She stood in place, uncomfortably putting her face mask back on.","\"Did you come here to eat?\"","Shen Linyan looked at her for a moment, then walked over and asked softly, \"Do you have a cold? Why the sudden mask? Did you catch it from me?\"","\"No, no!\" An Ling quickly waved her hands.","She turned to look around, raising her hand to whisper, \"It's because I don't want your mother to recognize me. That old woman is too annoying!\"","If she were recognized now, it would definitely cause a ton of trouble.","Hearing this, Shen Linyan chuckled softly and handed over the bag in his hand. \"Do you want to eat this?\"","\"What?\" An Ling looked down and saw various kinds of bread in the bag.","Butter and Sugar.","A very popular bakery brand, famous for being expensive and hard to buy, but the taste was absolutely superb. It was often the afternoon tea choice for wealthy young ladies.","An Ling used to love their pistachio chocolate scones, but because they were too hard to get and too expensive, she couldn't be bothered to find a scalper to buy them for her, so she hadn't eaten them in a long time.","She hadn't had dinner yet and her stomach was starving. Seeing this, her eyes instantly lit up. \"Can I take one?!\"","Shen Linyan opened the bag. \"You can take as many as you want. Choose some you like.\"","An Ling looked down and picked out that familiar scone from the bag. \"This one is fine.\"","\"Do you like eating this?\" The man glanced at the pastry in her hand.","An Ling nodded. \"I used to like it, but I haven't had it in a long time.\"","You can't bite the hand that feeds you. It seemed today was still not a good time to reject him.","Her mood instantly relaxed. She waved the pastry in her hand, her eyes curving into a smile under the brim of her hat. \"Thank you, Chairman Shen!\"","Shen Linyan smiled, closed the bag, and handed it to her.","\"Then share the rest of these with your colleagues.\"","\"?\"","She took the bag in confusion. \"Aren't you going to take it inside for Shen Fuyuan to eat?\"","\"No need.\" Shen Linyan's eyes curved in a smile. \"They don't know I came. I have work later, so I'll be leaving first.\"","As soon as he said this, An Ling's expression froze.","Did Shen Linyan come here specifically for her?","Was the bread also bought specifically for her?","The questions were on the tip of her tongue, but it seemed unnecessary to ask them out loud.","Noticing the familiar tie on the man's clothes, An Ling's gaze paused. She gripped the bag in her hand tightly and turned to look at the villa.","Her colleagues should be coming out soon...","A few seconds later, she let out a helpless sigh, looking up to meet the man's slightly stunned eyes.","\"Shen Linyan, are you free tonight? Let's talk.\"","It's better to end this as soon as possible.","-","Returning to the car and seeing the pastries, the colleagues were all very excited.","\"Where did this come from? An Ling, did you go buy it?\"","\"Oh my god, I'm starving to death. I wish I could go eat some street-side fried noodles right now, the kind with wok hei, sizzling with oil and steaming hot.\"","\"I give up. Chen Hang, don't say that, I'm already hungry as it is.\"","However, when they saw the logo on the bag, everyone's excited chatter suddenly stopped, and they looked at An Ling hesitantly.","\"This... can we really eat this?\"","Isn't it too expensive? Just one small piece of bread is almost a few hundred yuan.","An Ling smiled and opened the bag wide. \"Eat up, don't worry. I didn't buy this. Shen Linyan just brought it over for you guys to eat. He said you've worked hard.\"","\"Really? Chairman Shen came over?\"","Everyone instantly felt relieved and took them.","Nan Zhechuan walked over last. \"What are you guys looking at?\"","A colleague turned around. \"Chairman Shen came over to deliver food.\"","Another colleague opened the bag, moved. \"Brother Nan, I now support what you said before about Chairman Shen being a good guy.\"","Nan Zhechuan smiled at them and casually grabbed a piece of bread to eat.","An Ling quietly pulled him aside and spoke in a low voice, \"Brother Nan, I have something to do, so I won't be going back to the company with you all.\"","Nan Zhechuan nodded. It was already time to get off work anyway; they were just going back to the company to grab some things.","He bit into his bread and looked down to take out his phone. \"Alright, are you leaving right now? It doesn't look very easy to catch a cab around here.\"","An Ling thought for a moment before speaking up, \"Brother Nan, I have to tell you something.\"","Nan Zhechuan looked up at her. \"What is it?\"","\"Shen Linyan's ex-wife is me.\"","\"...\"","\"Smack—\" The bread fell to the ground.","Nan Zhechuan's expression went blank. He opened his mouth and closed it again, wanting to speak but stopping. \"It really is you...\"","It wasn't just a coincidence with the name??","He had been wondering why Shen Linyan kept looking over at their side during dinner last time. It turned out the man's ex-wife was sitting right next to him.","\"It's me,\" An Ling nodded. \"My role as executive producer won't be a secret for long, but please don't tell them for now. I'll take on some of the logistics work, so it might be tough on you to handle the communications with the Shen family.\"","\"That's not a problem, I was doing that anyway.\" Nan Zhechuan bent down to pick up the bread. As if suddenly realizing something, his face stiffened.","Good lord, that group of people was still eating it.","This was bought by Chairman Shen for his ex-wife.","He tore off the dirty part on top, looked down, and took a bite. \"So are you leaving with Shen Linyan later?\"","Weren't these two divorced?","\"No, he had something to do and left first. I'll go find him later.\"","An Ling glanced at the time on her wristwatch. \"I'll be going then. If there's any work, just send me a WeChat message.\"","\"Alright, go ahead.\"","After seeing An Ling off, Nan Zhechuan returned to the front of the car.","He looked at his colleagues who were still eating, looked up, and clicked his tongue in amazement:","\"Life really is full of surprises everywhere.\"","Other colleagues: ?","Did this guy go crazy from hunger?","Leaving the Shen family's place, An Ling got into the black sedan parked by the road.","Secretary Chen in the front seat greeted her.","\"Good evening, Miss An. Chairman Shen is still in a meeting. There was a temporary meeting tonight, so I will take you back first.\"","\"Okay.\"","Returning to that apartment after a long time, An Ling walked to the door.","Just as she raised her hand, she hesitated and stopped.","The passcode hasn't changed, right?","She hesitantly entered it once. Accompanied by a familiar \"beep\", the door opened.","The dim yellow light from the hallway shone into the house. The living room remained just as it used to be. The pitch-black interior was cold and desolate, and the moment the door opened, a wisp of cold air drifted out.","It was as if no one had lived there for a long time, completely devoid of human presence, as if returning to the very first day she had come to this house.","Turning on the lights and stepping inside, she noticed a hospital bag on the dining table. An Ling picked it up to take a look and found that the medicines inside were all still new and hadn't been opened or taken at all.","She smiled helplessly, put the medicine back down, placed her bag on the sofa, and turned to look at the bedroom.","After hesitating for a moment, she still walked to the bedroom door and pressed down on the door handle.","\"Creak—\"","The inside of the room was exactly as it had been when she just moved out.","The skincare products she hadn't taken with her were left on the dressing table, scattered messily. There were still a few pieces of clothing on the bed that she had casually tossed there while packing, and even the wardrobe was still open.","Anyone who didn't know better would think she had just left yesterday.","An Ling was stunned for a moment.","Didn't Auntie Cheng clean up?","She had originally thought this room would be completely emptied out.","An Ling looked for a while, then closed the door again.","Just as she sat back down on the sofa, a sound came from the front door.","\"Beep—\"","She turned her head and met the gaze of the man walking in."]},{"number":67,"title":"Chapter 67: If Madam Wishes, I Can Do That Too","paragraphs":["For a brief moment their eyes met. Shen Linyan's eyes curved into a slight smile before he walked in and lowered his head to change his shoes.","\"Would you like something to drink? Sorry I'm a bit late, there was a meeting at the company.\"","An Ling's mind was in a bit of a mess. She replied dryly, \"It's fine, I just arrived too. Plain water is fine.\"","Placing the glass of water on the table, the man sat down on the sofa next to her. \"What did you want to talk to me about?\"","A crisp, woody scent lingered at the tip of her nose for a moment. An Ling tightened her grip and hurriedly picked up the glass to take a sip, suppressing the inexplicable uneasiness in her heart.","She understood this uneasiness as guilt toward Shen Linyan.","An Ling gripped the cup tightly and pursed her lips.","\"Shen Linyan... about last night, I want to make things clear with you.\"","The woman's familiar tone was exactly like the night she brought up their divorce.","Shen Linyan's heart skipped a beat. His eyelashes trembled slightly, and his body stiffened for a second before he sat on the sofa and gave a soft \"Mm.\"","He subconsciously tried to twist the ring on his finger, only to touch empty air.","An Ling didn't notice his movement as she organized her words. \"Mainly, it's about you...\"","Her voice suddenly caught, and she slowly frowned.","These words were simply too difficult to say.","She didn't even know from which angle to completely nip Shen Linyan's thoughts in the bud. Suddenly telling him to stop liking her felt too baffling and out of nowhere.","After a moment of silence, the woman's long eyelashes slowly lowered, and her red lips parted slightly.","\"Shen Linyan, what did you mean yesterday when you said you wouldn't get married because of me?\"","The man on the sofa paused his movements.","His back was straight, his pitch-black eyes quietly watching her. The surging obscurity in his eyes was hidden by the night, his fingertips unconsciously rubbing against each other.","\"I don't quite understand... did I say something wrong?\"","He wanted to be friends with An Ling, wanted to try falling in love with her, so naturally he wouldn't take a wife.","He also couldn't fulfill his obligations to his next wife, so he wouldn't marry anyone else.","Was An Ling looking so troubled because those words made her feel morally burdened?","Shen Linyan's eyes darkened slightly, and he spoke exceptionally slowly and gently.","\"If I get married, I won't be able to contact you, and you won't have any contact with me either. So to avoid this situation, I won't get married. But An Ling, I won't mind if you get married. You don't need to feel burdened.\"","\"?\"","Hearing this answer, An Ling looked dumbfounded.","She looked up and met the man's gaze. Seeing that his expression didn't seem fake, her face went blank.","For the first time, An Ling felt her brain short-circuit, just like when Shen Linyan suddenly kissed her in her room back then.","To this day, she still didn't know why he had kissed her.","She used to think it was because Shen Linyan had too strong a sense of responsibility, but now that they were divorced, what did he mean by saying those words?","Sounded like, if her husband allowed it, Shen Linyan would still continue being friends with her?","After a brief silence, An Ling suddenly lowered her head, covered her face, and laughed out loud. Her tone sounded relieved.","\"You... if you want to be friends, just be friends. Don't say things like that, you made me think you liked me.\"","Hearing this, Shen Linyan's breathing slowed by half a beat, and his nails subconsciously dug into his palms.","He slowly lowered his eyes, his dark gaze fixed on the spot on his ring finger. His long fingertips gently rubbed it, who knew what he was thinking.","With the misunderstanding cleared up, An Ling stood up with a blushing face, wishing she could run downstairs immediately.","\"Alright, alright, it's nothing. I have nothing else to say.\"","She was dying of embarrassment. She had almost blurted out telling him to stop liking her.","It turned out he didn't like her romantically at all; he just thought she was a good person and wanted to be friends. There wasn't just love in this world, there was friendship too.","Rest assured, she would definitely cut off contact with Shen Linyan this time!","Just as she was about to walk out, her wrist was grabbed.","She subconsciously looked down, only to crash straight into the man's pitch-black eyes. There was none of his usual gentleness in them, only an indescribable darkness.","\"What if I do like you? An Ling.\"","His hoarse voice carried a trace of imperceptible tension.","Hearing this, An Ling stared at him, her gaze freezing.","A moment later, she spoke softly and slowly:","\"Shen Linyan, don't make such assumptions.\"","She looked up to avoid his gaze, her heart beating a little fast for some unknown reason. \"I don't want you to like me, so let's just part on good terms and not even be friends, okay? Don't come looking for me anymore. I'm also afraid of falling for you, because it's impossible for us to remarry.\"","As she said these words, An Ling's own voice was trembling.","She didn't even dare to look into Shen Linyan's eyes.","What if he cried again?","Anyway, everything had been said. Maybe she should just dash out now and play the part of...","Just as she was thinking this, her fingertip was suddenly gently hooked by a warm finger.","The man's voice was very light, as if it would dissipate in the wind at any moment.","\"An Ling, if I destroy the Shen family, will you remarry me?\"","\"...\"","An Ling's entire body stiffened, and she slowly lowered her head in a daze.","\"...What? Destroy?\"","Was that the word Shen Linyan just used?","The man paused, his eyes flickering. He looked up and said gently, \"I mean... if I acquire all the shares of the Shen family, including my mother's portion, become the true person in power, and give half of the shares to you, would you be willing to remarry me?\"","An Ling's eyes widened slightly.","What did he mean by true person in power?","Her voice caught, and she became a bit incoherent. \"But aren't you already the person in power...\"","\"I'm not. I'm just a proxy for my father.\"","Shen Linyan's tone was mild. The most crucial secret of the Shen family was easily spilled by him in this moment, spoken of as if it were a trivial matter.","\"I signed a contract with my father that even my mother doesn't know about. Once the contract expires, all the shares I currently hold must be given to him.\"","The bright and noble eldest son of the Shen family, the Shen heir admired by thousands, was actually nothing more than a pawn for his father.","An Ling had not expected to hear this truth at all. Her beautiful face was full of confusion, unable to process it, and her mind was buzzing.","How did a contract suddenly pop up...","What kind of development was this... Could it be that he went bankrupt because of this?","Jiang Mai never told her what to do in this kind of situation...","Under the man's gaze, An Ling's eyes darted around in panic. She opened her mouth, trying to find her voice. \"This... remarrying...\"","After a long time, she lowered her head, pursed her lips, and whispered, \"...Shen Linyan, I don't know why you want to remarry me. I told you to find someone you like and marry them...\"","Shen Linyan: \"You also said I could find a very good person to marry.\"","\"...\"","The boomerang hit right back, and An Ling's face instantly turned red.","She was actually being given the good person card!?","Her face was flushed crimson, unable to tell if it was from anger or embarrassment. She gritted her teeth and retorted, \"Then I want someone I like, okay?! This isn't a marriage of convenience, of course I have to pick someone I like! Besides, who said I'm good? I'm terrible! Fine, wait until you remarry me, I'll scam you out of all your money and use it to keep male models!\"","Shen Linyan was taken aback. \"Keep male models? Why would you keep them?\"","\"Why else?\"","Without a second thought, An Ling blurted it all out in one breath, \"Since we don't have any feelings for each other anyway, and we don't need to fulfill our marital duties, can't I just keep a boy toy to take care of my own needs?\"","The moment the words left her mouth, she realized what a scandalous thing she had just said. Her eyes widened in panic. Looking down at the man's stunned expression, she stammered an explanation:","\"Um... I didn't mean it like that... I was just, I was just making an analogy, you know... right?\"","It was all Jiang Mai's fault for having no filter; her bad habits were completely rubbing off on her!","Shen Linyan looked up and stared at her in silence. His dark eyes gave away no emotion. After a moment, he slowly stood up.","Feeling guilty, An Ling took a step back. But in the next second, the man grabbed her wrist and pinched her chin, forcing her to look up at him.","Her eyes widened in shock. Before she could utter a single word, the man leaned down and pressed against her lips, his warm kiss swallowing all her protests.","\"If my wife has needs, I can take care of them too.\""]},{"number":68,"title":"Chapter 68: But I Wish My Wife Were You","paragraphs":["The moment the man's lips pressed against hers, An Ling's mind went completely blank.","Clatter—the bag in her hand dropped to the floor.","It wasn't until her lips were gently suckled that she instinctively raised her hand to push him away. Her eyelashes fluttered as she looked up, only to meet the man's dark, unreadable gaze.","Sensing her resistance, Shen Linyan stiffened. He immediately let go and took a step back.","He gently turned his head away, a hint of panic breaking through his usually cold and handsome features. His lips were flushed under the light, and the corners of his eyes drooped slightly, giving him a desolate look. His voice was a bit hoarse: \"I'm sorry.\"","The woman was still in a daze, a blush tinting her delicate, porcelain-white face, her full lips looking incredibly alluring.","She lowered her head and blankly touched her lips.","Had she actually just been forcibly kissed by Shen Linyan?","Her shock over this fact far outweighed any anger.","\"You...\" An Ling had absolutely no idea what to say in that moment.","Shen Linyan bent down to pick up the bag from the floor, his Adam's apple bobbing. \"An Ling, if you have needs, you don't have to spend money to find those... male models. What I mean is, I can help you too.\"","An Ling's face turned another shade redder. \"I... I haven't said I'm going to remarry you.\"","Shen Linyan: \"That doesn't matter. I can still help you.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","She paused. \"Are you doing all this... just to get me to agree to remarry you?\"","The man placed the bag in her hands. \"If doing this will make you remarry me, then I will do it.\"","\"...\"","An Ling's expression was complicated.","She felt that Shen Linyan's feelings were very strange. It was as if he liked her, but at the same time, it seemed like he didn't—he just had a desperate urge to be close to her.","He was like the gentle second male lead in a novel, always silently watching over the female lead, yet perfectly capable of watching her marry the main character without any desire to fight for her.","He would say some incredibly ambiguous things without even realizing it himself.","Jiang Mai had even called her a scumbag, but the real scumbag was right here.","But the only thing she could be sure of was that, at least for now, Shen Linyan only had this special dependency on her.","Thinking of that contract that had suddenly appeared, An Ling looked thoughtfully at the man in front of her.","She wasn't sure if that contract was the key to Shen Linyan's ultimate bankruptcy.","But if it weren't for the remarriage, given Shen Linyan's kind, non-competitive nature, he definitely wouldn't fight for the shares.","Once the contract expired, he would be left with nothing, which would essentially count as bankruptcy.","The Shen parents were truly bizarre in their own unique ways.","One was biased, and the other didn't trust their own eldest son, leading to the signing of such a ridiculous contract.","An Ling placed her bag on the table and slowly sat back down on the sofa. \"Shen Linyan, I hope you can get the shares back, but as for remarrying... I can't give you an answer right now.\"","Setting aside whether Shen Linyan could successfully take back the shares from the male and female leads, An Ling didn't want to bear the guilt of causing his bankruptcy.","Furthermore, although she was quite fond of Shen Linyan's face and sympathized with him, she didn't love him deeply enough to stake the rest of her life on him.","She wasn't joking with Shen Linyan. If she were to truly get married, she would choose someone she loved, and who loved her back.","As her words fell, the living room descended into silence.","The man suddenly walked over and softly said:","\"An Ling, I won't deny that what I did for you in the past was out of a husband's duty. Even now, I don't know exactly what my feelings for you are.\"","\"You once asked me, if my wife wasn't you, would I still do those things? My answer is still yes.\"","He knelt on one knee, gently taking the woman's hand. Lowering his eyes, he whispered, \"But I want my wife to be you.\"","Whether it was desiring An Ling's companionship or being reluctant to let her go.","These were emotions he was experiencing for the very first time.","\"An Ling, although I don't know how to love someone, I will learn, okay?\"","The man's voice was low and gentle. His large palm enveloped hers, making her hand feel hot. An Ling's eyelashes fluttered; she pursed her lips and said nothing.","After a moment of silence, she quietly turned her face away, a barely noticeable blush spreading across her cheeks. She mumbled:","\"I said I can't give you an answer right now...\"","Shen Linyan froze for a second, then his eyes gently curved into a smile.","\"Then, can my wife also promise not to look for male models in the future?\"","\"...\"","An Ling, her face red, pulled her hand back. She crossed her arms, leaned back, and stubbornly said, \"That's hard to say... Maybe the moment I step out this door, I'll go to a club to find one.\"","Besides, they hadn't even remarried yet. Why was Shen Linyan already calling her his wife?","Just as she finished speaking, a shadow suddenly fell over her.","An Ling's voice hitched. She looked up stiffly, locking eyes with Shen Linyan.","The man braced his arms against the sofa, his long legs slightly bent. His deep eyes gazed down at her quietly. His straight nose was so close it was almost touching hers, and his hot breath gently brushed against her face, carrying the familiar, warm scent of cedarwood.","His long eyelashes lowered as he leaned in, testing the waters.","An Ling instinctively shrank back.","When they looked up at each other again, the air grew increasingly heated in the silent eye contact.","This time, it was unclear who leaned in first, but their lips slowly met.","The man cradled the back of the woman's head, her soft hair tangling around his watch strap. The faint blue veins on his cold, pale skin bulged slightly, exuding a palpable sexual tension under the light.","An Ling wrapped her arms around his neck. Blushing, she closed her eyes as her body was pressed back against the sofa.","A shower of delicate kisses fell on the corners of her mouth. Then, her lips were captured, gently savored along the edges with a tender, restrained force.","A damp heat permeated the narrow space. With their lips and teeth entangled, the kissing man and woman on the sofa didn't even notice the passage of time.","Suddenly, a ringtone pierced the air.","\"Ring, ring—\"","The unexpected sound shattered the intimate atmosphere.","The man pulled back slightly, their lips still brushing. He lowered his head to kiss away the moisture at the corner of her mouth, his nose gently nuzzling hers, his warm breath fanning her lips.","\"I think that's your phone.\"","Of course she knew that.","\"I need to take this.\" An Ling's fair face was flushed crimson, her beautiful eyes shimmering with moisture. She pushed the man away, pursed her tingling lips, and got up to grab her bag from the coffee table.","When she saw the caller ID and the current time, her eyelid twitched violently.","[Brother.]","Crap.","Crap, crap, crap.","The heat drained from her face instantly, and the rationality she had lost quietly returned.","She covered her face in regret. Feeling guilty, she silenced the call, glanced out of the corner of her eye at the man who had gone to pour another glass of water, and stiffly picked up her bag and phone to leave.","\"Um... you don't need to pour water for me. I'm leaving.\"","Hearing this, Shen Linyan turned from the dining table. \"Do you need me to walk you home?\"","\"No, no, no!\" An Ling frantically waved her hands and rushed to the door to change her shoes. \"I can just take a cab back. Get some rest.\"","If she let Shen Linyan take her home, her brother would absolutely explode if he saw them.","Beep—","The front door closed and locked automatically. The man standing by the dining table slowly put down his water glass. The lighting outlined his tall, slender figure, highlighting his sharp jawline and elegant profile.","After a moment of silence, he lowered his head and touched his lips. His eyelashes cast a shadow, his dark fringe falling over his eyes as the corners of his mouth slowly curled upward.","\"As expected... I still have to exploit my wife's soft spot.\""]},{"number":69,"title":"Chapter 69: Lip Friendship","paragraphs":["Leaving Shen Linyan's house, An Ling hurried to call An Zhou back while walking into the elevator.","He picked up almost instantly; he was probably waiting for her call.","\"Why did you hang up on me just now?\"","\"I was busy. I'm calling you back now, aren't I?\" An Ling replied, feeling a bit guilty.","She turned to look at her reflection in the elevator doors, leaning in close to inspect her lips.","They seemed a little swollen...","And they hadn't even been kissing for that long.","An Zhou's suspicious voice came through the phone. \"Are you working overtime again today?\"","\"...\"","She kept her tone steady. \"...What do you mean by that? I really am working overtime today. What's wrong?\"","\"Why didn't you tell anyone at home? You didn't even reply to my messages.\"","\"Because I was too busy. So busy I didn't even have time to check my phone.\" An Ling spoke with conviction. Afraid that An Zhou would ask more questions, she quickly changed the subject. \"Have Mom and Dad eaten yet?\"","She felt like a young girl terrified of being caught by her older brother for dating too early.","\"They've eaten. When I saw you didn't reply, I told Mom and Dad you were probably working overtime.\" An Zhou sounded like he actually believed her.","But before An Ling could breathe a sigh of relief, he spoke up again in a leisurely tone:","\"So, are you off work now?\"","An Ling grew alert. \"Why?\"","An Zhou's tone was casual. \"I'm coming to pick you up. I'm downstairs at your company right now. You didn't drive today, did you?\"","\"...\"","An Ling's eye twitched. \"That's not necessary... I'm with my colleagues setting up camera positions at the shooting location. We're almost done now and I'm just about to take a cab back.\"","\"It's fine. I'm already out anyway. Just send me the address.\"","\"...\"","It seemed he still didn't believe her.","The elevator reached the first floor, and she stepped out. \"Alright, I'll send you the address.\"","She was indeed working out of the office today anyway, so she wasn't lying.","She sent Shen Fuyuan's address to An Zhou. Since it was quite far from her company, An Ling hailed a cab to rush over there.","It wasn't until she sat in the car that An Ling's chaotic mind finally calmed down.","Thinking about what had just happened in the living room, her face flushed red, and she patted her cheeks.","\"This is getting messier and messier...\"","Great. Now she didn't even know what kind of development this was.","Wasn't she supposed to go there to reject him? How did rejecting him suddenly turn into her losing her mind?","At which step did things go wrong?","And what exactly was her relationship with Shen Linyan right now? What do you call a relationship where you aren't husband and wife, nor boyfriend and girlfriend, but you can still kiss?","An Ling leaned back against the seat, opened a search engine, and looked it up.","A few seconds later, she turned off her screen with a complicated expression, silently using the back of her hand to cool her face down.","What the heck is a \"lip friendship\"...","There were even people saying \"friends with benefits\"...","People online really just say whatever.","Forget it, forget it. I won't think about it anymore.","She took out her powder compact and lightly dabbed a layer on her face, then took out her lipstick to touch up a bit.","She couldn't let An Zhou notice anything amiss later.","Upon arriving at the location, An Zhou unsurprisingly wasn't there yet when she got out of the car.","An Ling stood by the side of the road. Just as she was about to send him a message complaining about how slow he was, a notification suddenly popped up on her phone.","Shen Linyan: [Can I call you?]","An Ling paused, then took her Bluetooth earphones out of her bag.","[You can.]","Not long after the message was sent, the man called.","As soon as An Ling answered, the man's deep voice traveled into her ears through the faint static of the connection.","\"Are you not home yet?\"","Speaking of this, she immediately started complaining to Shen Linyan. \"I should have been home by now, but my brother insisted on picking me up, and now I have to wait for him.\"","There was a hint of a smile in the man's voice. \"It's a bit cold tonight. I should have driven you back.\"","\"It's fine. I can't feel the cold wind standing here.\"","An Ling stuffed her hands into her pockets, unable to hold back a smile. \"Chairman Shen should pay more attention to himself. A certain someone hasn't even taken the medicine on his table. Is your cold cured? If you get a fever again later, I won't accompany you to the hospital this time.\"","Shen Linyan froze for a moment, instinctively glancing at the bag of medicine on the dining table, and stood up with a smile.","\"Then I'll go take it now.\"","Hearing the sound of plastic packaging being opened on the other end, An Ling stared at the streetlights by the road, suddenly remembering the question she had searched in the car earlier.","She lowered her eyes, her smiling tone sounding like a tease. \"Shen Linyan, do you know what the internet calls this kind of relationship we have? They call it a 'lip friendship', as in the lips on your mouth.\"","The rustling sounds on the other end suddenly stopped, as if he hadn't processed it right away.","An Ling thought he didn't understand.","After all, this was a man who didn't even know what keeping a male model meant.","Just as she was about to explain, a low chuckle suddenly sounded from the other end.","The man's magnetic voice spilled through the earphones. His pitch was very low, trailing off with an extremely faint, soft laugh.","\"Actually, it would be more accurate to understand it as me pursuing my wife.\"","An Ling froze on the spot.","The chilly night breeze blew against her face, but it couldn't take away the heat on her cheeks. Her heart inexplicably started beating a little faster.","Strands of hair fluttered against her cheeks. She raised a hand to tuck them away, spotted An Zhou's car driving toward her, and raised her hand to wave.","She spoke to the man in her earphones, \"My brother is here. I'm hanging up now.\"","\"Okay.\"","Just as she raised her hand to press the end call button, she suddenly smiled and whispered, \"Then you have to remember to pursue me secretly. Don't let my brother find out. My brother really doesn't want me to be with you.\"","The man paused upon hearing this, then let out a soft laugh.","\"Okay.\"","By the time An Zhou pulled the car over, An Ling had already put her earphones away. She got in and looked down to buckle her seatbelt.","An Zhou's voice suddenly came from beside her. \"You look like you're in a pretty good mood.\"","She paused her movements, instantly dropped her smile, and turned to look at him expressionlessly. \"You must be seeing things. Do you know how long I waited for you? I told you I didn't need you to pick me up. With all this time, I could have already been home.\"","An Zhou shrugged helplessly. \"There were a lot of red lights on the way. Hey, your big brother drove all the way to pick you up and you're still not happy? You should be grateful, why are you complaining?\"","An Ling couldn't be bothered with him. She yawned and leaned back against the seat.","\"Give me a break. Aren't you just picking me up because you suspect I went to see Shen Linyan?\"","Otherwise, why would he be so kind as to pick her up?","Hearing this, An Zhou choked up in the driver's seat and guiltily looked away.","After a few minutes of silence, he suddenly spoke up slowly, \"Actually, it's not because of that...\"","\"Then why?\"","An Zhou let out a few dry laughs. \"...Mom is trying to set me up on blind dates again.\"","An Zhou and Shen Linyan were about the same age, which meant he was indeed at the age for marriage. An Ling had heard their mom mention this before.","But An Zhou didn't want to go on blind dates and had dodged them several times. Their mom had even asked her to persuade him before, so she was probably starting to forcefully apply pressure now.","She raised an eyebrow and teased, \"Oh, so you came out to hide. Brother, you really should listen to Mom and bring a sister-in-law back for me.\"","Taking advantage of a red light, the man suddenly turned to smile at her.","Seeing his smile, the amusement on An Ling's lips faltered, and she suddenly had a bad premonition.","\"What are you doing?\"","An Zhou coughed a few times. \"I said I'd go on blind dates, but only if you join me. If you're willing to go on blind dates, then I'll go too.\"","An Ling: \"???\""]},{"number":70,"title":"Chapter 70: Does Aleng have a boyfriend","paragraphs":["Early in the morning.","An Ling sat at the dining table, biting into the corn in her hand with a look of deep resentment.","\"Mom, can you please not listen to my brother's nonsense? What does his blind date have to do with me? You should just press his head down and drag him to the cafe for his blind date.\"","Saying this, she even made a gesture of pressing a head down.","If An Zhou hadn't been driving last night, she really would have smacked him on the back of the head.","How could someone drag their own sister down just to get out of a blind date?","Opposite her, An Zhou was chewing on a piece of bread. The expensive suit he wore seemed a bit more laid-back on him, not looking like a CEO at all.","\"I don't care. Anyway, An Ling is divorced now. If she doesn't go on blind dates, neither will I. Why does she get to stay unmarried while I have to get married?\"","An Ling: \"Have some shame. I'm younger than you, and I just got divorced.\"","An Zhou: \"Don't bring age into this. Even if you're younger, you still have to get married. Besides, isn't your brother just trying to help you walk out of the pain of divorce?\"","She didn't need that at all, okay?","An Ling shrugged. \"I'm not like you. If I wanted to get married, there are plenty of people I could marry. I don't need to rely on blind dates at all.\"","\"Like who?\" An Zhou pressed for an answer.","\"...\"","An Ling paused, tilted her head to drink her milk, and pretended not to hear him.","An Zhou just assumed she was feeling guilty. He slowly spread butter on his bread. \"If there's no one, there's no one. It's not like I don't know you. You used to stay at home every day; where would you even get the chance to meet anyone?\"","An Ling: \"Even so, I don't need blind dates. Go on them yourself.\"","An Zhou: \"No, if I go, you go.\"","An Ling: \"I'm not going.\"","An Zhou: \"Then I'm not going either.\"","Father An and Mother An were eating their breakfast on the side, minding their own business.","It wasn't until she finished the food on her plate that Mother An interrupted the siblings' bickering.","\"If either of you brings a partner home, I won't force you anymore.\"","\"...\"","The two of them instantly shut their mouths.","Mother An sighed heavily, sadly wiping away non-existent tears from the corners of her eyes. \"When I go play mahjong now, Mrs. Lin and Mrs. Wen both have grandsons and granddaughters. They tell me every day how cute their little granddaughters are. I don't know when I'll be able to hold one.\"","Beside her, Father An pulled out a tissue and handed it to her, patting her back and sighing softly.","\"Mother of my children, the kids are grown up and have their own thoughts. If there's really no other way, the worst comes to worst, we can adopt an orphan and just say it's An Zhou's illegitimate child from outside.\"","An Zhou: ?","An Ling wiped her mouth and hurriedly stood up, afraid that it would be her turn next.","\"It's getting late, I'm heading to the company first. I have to work overtime today, so I won't be back for dinner. Mom, Dad, don't wait for me.\"","An Ling really wasn't lying to them this time.","Filming was about to start soon. Tonight, she and her colleagues had to watch all the videos and go through the procedures again. There could be no mistakes, so it would probably be very late again.","An Zhou quickly stood up as well, picking up his suit jacket from the back of his chair.","\"You're working overtime again tonight? Then I'll drop you off at the company and pick you up tonight. Mom, I'm going to drop An Ling off, so I'll leave first.\"","Watching the siblings leave together, Mother An instantly dropped the sad expression from her face.","Father An also withdrew his hand and took a sip of soy milk. \"Are we really going to arrange blind dates for them? Lingling just got divorced. It might not be appropriate for her to go on blind dates at this time, right? What if something like what happened before happens again?\"","The events of those two years had cast a significant shadow over the An family.","Mother An naturally knew this too, and calmly wiped her mouth.","\"It's exactly because of this that we must find someone good for Lingling in this regard. That girl is easily deceived by acquaintances. Staying away from the Shen family is good for her too. As for An Zhou, let's just trick that boy into going first.\"","Arriving at the company in An Zhou's car, An Ling put on her employee badge as she stepped out of the elevator.","She turned on her computer first and, taking advantage of the startup time, got up to make coffee in the pantry.","A few colleagues were standing in the pantry, huddled together talking about something.","An Ling didn't pay much attention. She put the coffee pod into the machine and pressed the button.","An uproar suddenly came from their direction.","\"Really?\"","\"Oh my god, and then what?\"","\"I can't, I couldn't stand that.\"","She glanced over curiously.","However, because she had face blindness and didn't really recognize people well, she didn't rashly interrupt, just silently watching them from the side.","But someone recognized her and waved their hand. \"Ah Leng, Ah Leng.\"","An Ling picked up her coffee and walked over. \"What are you talking about?\"","\"Listening to Little Yang talk about her blind date.\"","Little Yang was a year younger than An Ling. She had a baby face and looked very young. An Ling had some impression of her when she heard the name.","She felt a chill in her heart whenever she heard about blind dates now. \"Going on blind dates already?\"","Her brother was 27 and still fighting against blind dates every day.","Little Yang sighed helplessly. \"I have no choice. If I don't go, they nag me every day. I'm used to it. Anyway, I just treat it as going through the motions.\"","She met another one last weekend. His family conditions were good, he had a stable job with a high salary of over 500,000 a year, and he had his own house and car. He was six years older than her and would be 31 after the New Year.","\"When I heard these conditions, I thought it wasn't bad. But when I went, wow, his hair was completely greasy, he had dandruff on his shoulders, and his clothes were all wrinkled. He looked like he hadn't showered in weeks.\"","Little Yang remembered the scene again, and her face instantly twisted. \"When I shook his hand, his hand was oily. I immediately went to the bathroom to wash my hands. I added his contact info and ran away. These past few days, he's still asking me out.\"","\"...\"","Although An Ling hadn't seen it, she could imagine it. She picked up her coffee with a complicated expression.","Was the intensity of blind dates really this high?","A colleague next to them suddenly asked, \"Does Ah Leng have a boyfriend?\"","As soon as the words came out, several pairs of eyes instantly looked over.","After all, when they first saw Ah Leng, they were indeed stunned by this student of Teacher Chen. They hadn't expected the Ah Leng who disliked showing her face to look like this.","Being stared at, An Ling's hand holding the cup paused. \"...No.\"","The colleague was a bit surprised but also felt it was expected.","\"No? Ah Leng is so pretty, wouldn't your requirements for a boyfriend be higher? Like someone tall, rich, and handsome, hahahaha.\"","An Ling was stumped by this question. She lowered her eyes, smiled, and took a sip of coffee.","\"I don't really have any requirements... as long as they are pleasing to the eye.\"","The morning passed quickly, and in the blink of an eye, it was time for lunch.","An Ling went to the cafeteria with a few colleagues. Just as they reached the elevator, her phone lit up.","Shen Linyan: What is Madam eating for lunch?","She glanced at her colleagues and stood at the very back of the elevator before replying.","If someone accidentally caught a glimpse of the word Madam, she really wouldn't be able to explain it.","An Ling: I'm planning to go to the cafeteria with my colleagues. What are you eating?","Shen Linyan: Eating out. Can you eat with me tonight?","An Ling raised an eyebrow and replied, holding back a smile.","Is someone going to have a fever again?","Shen Linyan: Not this time.","An Ling: That still won't work. I have to work overtime tonight, so you eat by yourself. My brother is picking me up tonight.","Shen Linyan: Okay, then can we talk on the phone when you get home tonight?","Seeing this sentence, An Ling blinked.","Why did this feel so much like how a couple interacts?","Okay.","In a private room at the clubhouse.","The corners of the mouth of the man on the sofa turned up slightly. He turned off his phone and placed it face down on the table.","He looked up, only to meet the synchronized stares of the three people sitting across from him.","He gave them a faint glance before lowering his head to unhurriedly adjust his cuffs. \"Aren't we here to discuss business?\" he asked, his voice aloof. \"Why are you looking at me?\"","The other three: \"...\"","Oh, so you actually know we're here to discuss business?","Who was the one staring at his phone from the second he walked in?"]},{"number":71,"title":"Chapter 71: Have you forgotten what kind of person Shen Linyan is","paragraphs":["It was no exaggeration to say that from the moment he walked in, Shen Linyan had his head down, looking at his phone.","At first, he was just checking the time, seeming a bit absent-minded when he spoke.","But once a certain time hit, the man immediately opened his phone, completely ignoring them.","Right after his divorce, Shen Linyan had indeed gone through a phase like this.","But back then, it was completely different from now; every time he came out, he would just drink in silence.","The group instantly guessed who this was definitely about.","Liang Chen remembered hearing a little nurse say that An Ling had come back later that day, and his gaze instantly grew meaningful.","He stayed quiet, waiting for the other two to lose their patience first.","Sure enough, Wang Yihong was the first who couldn't hold back.","\"Did you and An Ling... make up?\"","The man shot him an indifferent sidelong glance. \"We never fought.\"","\"Alright, alright.\"","Those two had an amicable divorce.","Wang Yihong rephrased his question. \"Then did you guys remarry?\"","They hadn't heard anything about it; otherwise, Shen Linyan definitely would have told them.","Hearing this, the man paused. The slight upward curve of his lips flattened, and he picked up his wine glass, saying faintly, \"No.\"","Seeing this, Gu Xiaochi crossed his legs, rested his elbow on the back of his chair, covered his mouth with his hand, and whispered to Liang Chen beside him.","\"What's the situation?\"","Looking at Shen Linyan's demeanor, one would think An Ling had actually remarried him.","But previously, Shen Fuyuan had told him that when those two ate together, they pretended to be strangers, and after the meal, Shen Linyan even deliberately used a phone call as an excuse to go out and hide.","Liang Chen guessed roughly what was going on. After thinking for a moment, he asked Shen Linyan, \"Did you and An Ling successfully become friends?\"","During their chat at the hospital last time, wasn't this exactly what Shen Linyan wanted? To use the guise of a friend to gradually occupy An Ling's life and gain her companionship.","Hearing this, the man opposite him stopped his movements and slowly lowered the wine glass from his lips.","He slowly lowered his eyes, his long legs crossed, exuding a pampered and noble aura in his every gesture. His pitch-black eyes quietly stared at the red wine in his glass, his fingertips rubbing against the crystal, and his thin lips parted slightly.","\"There's no time for me to be her friend. She doesn't want to have any contact with me anymore.\"","If he tried to be just friends, An Ling would reject him.","He could tell.","When An Ling came to find him yesterday, it was to completely end their relationship.","This was out of Liang Chen's expectations, and he blurted out subconsciously, \"Then how are you actually still in touch with An Ling now?\"","Shen Linyan still didn't even know how to love someone; he himself had said he was learning how to love.","An Ling wanted to end it all, and he could still salvage this?","The man didn't answer. He just unhurriedly lifted his eyelids and cast a glance at them, his eyes as calm as an ancient well.","\"Did we come here today just to talk about this?\"","His tone betrayed no emotion, but it clearly carried a hint of impatience.","\"...\"","He really had absolutely zero patience!","The other three instantly changed the subject.","\"Alright, where were we?\"","\"I think it was about Damian wanting to expand into the domestic market.\"","\"Oh, right, right, right.\"","Gu Xiaochi stroked his chin and looked at Shen Linyan. \"You should know about this too, right? I heard he's also coming to the country to hold a bidding conference. With him coming, a lot of investors are keeping a close eye on it.\"","Shen Linyan put down his wine glass and gave a soft \"Mm.\" \"I know, but the Shen Group won't be participating.\"","Liang Chen was a bit surprised. \"You're not letting the Shen Group participate?\"","As a medical family, it was really difficult for his family to win the bid, but his dad still wanted to go, hoping to get a piece of the pie just in case. It showed just how important this bidding conference was.","Liang Chen thought about it for a moment, and then instantly understood. \"Oh, that younger brother of yours is going to participate, right?\"","Generally speaking, as a well-known corporation, if the Shen Group participated in this bidding conference, they would inevitably win.","This was a massive project. Mother Shen naturally couldn't let Shen Linyan handle it; she had to pave the way for her precious youngest son no matter what.","He raised an eyebrow at the man opposite him. \"Then this bidding conference looks like it'll be very interesting.\"","After all, since Shen Linyan said the Shen Group couldn't participate, Lu Jingshen's hopes of winning the bid looked slim.","Shen Linyan didn't deny it. He looked down at the time.","He stood up, his long fingers unhurriedly buttoning his suit jacket, and said in a faint voice, \"I have a meeting later. I'm leaving.\"","After the man left, Wang Yihong quickly leaned over.","\"Liang Chen, Liang Chen, what did you mean by that 'friends' thing you just mentioned to Shen Linyan? Why didn't I understand his answer?\"","Hearing this, Liang Chen slowly leaned back.","\"Someone's true nature is exposed, that's all. Did you forget what kind of person Shen Linyan is?\"","He had said back at the hospital that Shen Linyan went through so much trouble just to have An Ling accompany him to see a doctor, claiming he only wanted her companionship.","This obviously didn't really fit the man's style.","Looking at it now, mere companionship was clearly no longer enough to satisfy him.","If he could put in the effort to get An Ling to stay by his side, putting in a little effort to make her stay wouldn't be hard for Shen Linyan either.","-","It was already nine o'clock at night by the time she finished working overtime with her colleagues. An Ling's eyes were sore from staring, and she subsequently took An Zhou's car back.","After going upstairs, she was so tired she flopped straight onto the bed with a thud.","\"I'm exhausted.\"","Why was going to work so tiring? Why did she choose to work in the first place?","Was it too late to regret it now?","The soft blanket was too comfortable. An Ling yawned, but just as she closed her eyes, something flashed through her mind, and her drowsiness suddenly vanished.","Wait...","She had promised Shen Linyan they would have a phone call tonight!","An Ling immediately opened her eyes, rubbed them, rolled over, pulled her phone out of her bag, and checked the time.","9:30 PM.","Should she still call at this hour? It was already so late.","She lay on her stomach on the bed, her soft hair scattered across the covers. Tilting her head to look at the screen, her fair fingertips tapped lightly as she sent the man a message.","[I just got home, do you still want to call? 。◕‿◕。]","A reply came quickly from the other side.","Shen Linyan: [Can we call? 。◕‿◕。]","An Ling burst into a giggle, her eyes curving into crescents as she changed her posture to reply.","[Sure, wait for me to put my earphones on.]","She put on her earphones and dialed the call, but before the other side could pick up, there was a sudden knock on her bedroom door.","Knock, knock, knock—","Mother An's voice rang out from outside the door.","\"Lingling, are you asleep?\"","Her movements paused, and she got up to open the door.","\"Mom? You're not asleep yet?\"","Outside the door, Mother An was in her pajamas, looking at her with a smile.","\"Mom wants to talk to you about something, will it disturb your rest?\"","An Ling hesitated and stepped aside. \"No, Mom, come in first.\"","She walked behind her mother, glancing down to see that the call had already connected.","Just as she was about to hang up and explain to Shen Linyan later, she heard Mother An suddenly speak up from in front of her:","\"Mom mainly wanted to talk about the blind date arrangements for you and your brother.\""]},{"number":72,"title":"Chapter 72: Madam, This Feels Very Much Like an Affair","paragraphs":["Hearing clearly what her mom was saying, An Ling's eyelids twitched, and she quickly pressed the hang-up button.","Noticing her action, Mother An subconsciously looked over. Were you just on a call?","...No, I was listening to an audio recording. Mom, go sit on the bed first.","Feeling guilty, An Ling placed her phone face down on the desk.","She wasn't sure if Shen Linyan had heard, but she would deal with that later.","Putting away her earphones, she sat down opposite her mother.","Mom, you aren't really listening to my brother and making me go on a blind date too, are you?","Mother An smiled and said, Mom knows you don't want to go on a blind date, but can you do me a favor?","A favor??","An Ling didn't react for a moment. What do you mean? How can I help?","Mother An sighed. Mom just wants your brother to go on a blind date, but he insists on dragging you into it, so... could you pretend to agree to a blind date to trick your brother into going on his?","...Pretend to agree?","An Ling paused, then immediately shook her head. Impossible, Mom. He will definitely be suspicious and make me go on mine first.","Knowing how sneaky that guy was, he might even spy on her during the date.","Mother An, however, kept looking at her with a smile.","Then just go.","?","Mother An looked down and held her hand. Mom will find someone suitable for you. Trust my judgment. Just treat it as making a new friend, not a blind date.","The light spilled down, blending into the fine lines at the corners of Mother An's eyes. Her face showed both heartache and affection as she spoke softly:","Ling Ling, you don't like making friends. Mom knows you're afraid people will discover your face blindness and mock the An family, which is why you've only had Jiang Mai as a good friend all these years. But Mom hopes you can make more friends. It doesn't matter if there's no romance; finding happiness in friendship is still happiness.","Looking at her mother in front of her, faced with such warm, maternal affection, An Ling couldn't bring herself to say the words of refusal that were on the tip of her tongue.","Over the past two years, her parents had worried about her a lot, gaining many new wrinkles. Her brother had also been busy at the company all day because of her, and it was true he hadn't had time to meet other women.","After a moment of silence, she lowered her head and sighed, her tone helpless:","I just need to fake it and go through the motions, right?","Mother An's eyes lit up slightly. She looked up and nodded. Yes, just treat it as having a meal and making a friend.","An Ling made an OK gesture and nodded with a bit of compromise. Alright, alright. But you have to make it clear to the other party so there are no misunderstandings.","Mom will explain it clearly. Besides, you know the person, and you two even used to play together, so you don't need to worry about any surprises.","She already found someone??","And I know him? And we played together?","An Ling was confused. Who is it?","How could she have no idea who this person was?","Wen Yuche, your Auntie Wen's youngest son. He's about your age and recently returned from abroad. Didn't you two play together a lot when you were little?","Mother An seemed fully prepared. She immediately took out her phone, pulled up a photo, and showed it to An Ling.","Hearing this name, An Ling had a faint impression.","Auntie Wen was her mom's mahjong buddy, and the two families used to visit each other often. She had indeed met Wen Yuche when she was little, but that was a very long time ago, and she had long since forgotten.","The man in the photo had handsome, refined features, single eyelids, and gentle eyes. He wore glasses and had a bit of a scholarly aura. Mild and gentle, he indeed looked easy to talk to.","Although this guy also belonged to the gentle category, he was different from Shen Linyan.","Shen Linyan had an exceptionally striking face—a high nose bridge and deep, expressive eyes. When he wasn't speaking and merely cast a faint glance, he even carried a striking, aggressive edge. With broad shoulders and a narrow waist, just standing there gave him a noble air of a pampered, high-born gentleman.","Elegant in speech, his gentle and refined nature was another feeling he gave off when his eyes curved into a smile as he spoke.","An Ling's mind once again pictured that man's face.","She glanced at the time on Mother An's phone.","Almost twenty minutes had passed.","She wondered what message Shen Linyan had sent her.","She glanced at her phone on the nearby desk and nodded absentmindedly. Okay... I see the photo. I'll contact him later and arrange a place to eat. It's getting late, Mom, you should hurry back and rest.","Alright. You have work tomorrow, so rest early too. Mother An stood up.","As soon as the door closed, An Ling hurriedly picked up the phone from the desk.","Lighting up the screen, she saw that twenty minutes ago, right after the call was disconnected, Shen Linyan had sent her a message.","[When Madam finishes chatting with Mom, could you call me back?]","She didn't put on her earphones this time, but dialed directly.","Beep... beep...","The phone rang only a few times before it was answered.","She placed the phone to her ear and lay back on the bed. My mom suddenly came in just now, so I didn't have time to tell you.","It's alright, I heard.","...","He heard?","Did he hear about the blind date too?","An Ling blinked. She wanted to explain, but then felt it was unnecessary.","Leaving aside the fact that it was a fake blind date, Shen Linyan hadn't even asked.","Just as she was thinking this, a voice suddenly sounded in her ear again.","Madam, we seem a lot like we're having an illicit affair.","The man's voice was magnetic and deep. The words illicit affair rolled slowly and softly from his lips, the trailing notes carrying a lingering ambiguity.","An Ling inexplicably felt like she was hiding a secret husband on the outside who she couldn't bring home.","Her face flushed slightly. No we don't... Stop talking nonsense, what illicit affair? And why do you keep calling me Madam? We haven't even remarried.","So, is Madam going on a blind date?","...","He really had heard it.","An Ling pondered for a moment, then deliberately teased him. What if I really go on a blind date? I'm single right now anyway.","As her words fell, silence descended on the other end of the line.","An Ling glanced at the screen, which showed the call hadn't been disconnected.","Before she could open her mouth to explain, a man's low chuckle came through.","Then I'll just have to bankrupt the other guy.","An Ling didn't react right away.","Remembering what was said in the hospital before, she couldn't hold back a snort of laughter.","To think Shen Linyan would actually play along with these overbearing CEO tropes with her.","She smiled and played along. Then, for the sake of the other party's company, shouldn't I refuse the blind date?","Of course, An Ling didn't take Shen Linyan's words seriously, purely treating it as him joking around with her.","In his room, the man sat on his bed in his pajamas, his long, slender fingers playing with a ring. His voice remained gentle. Madam doesn't need to consider anyone else.","An Ling's laughter came through the phone.","Alright, alright. I'm not the one going on a blind date, it's my brother. He doesn't want to go, and insisted he'd only go if I went too. So my mom asked me to pretend to go on one.","Shen Linyan's movements paused. He enclosed the ring in his palm and slowly raised his eyes.","Pretend?","Yeah.","The girl seemed a bit tired, her voice soft and carrying a sticky, lingering weariness. Mom said she found someone we know, and told me to just go through the motions and treat it as making a friend.","Shen Linyan didn't ask any further questions, merely softening his voice. Are you sleepy? Rest early.","An Ling gave a soft Mm, keeping the phone by her ear.","She closed her eyes and suddenly asked:","Shen Linyan, would you mind if I went on a blind date?","She had now practically agreed to let Shen Linyan pursue her. To put it nicely, the two of them were in an ambiguous phase, so going on a blind date really wasn't very appropriate.","But An Ling could already guess the answer.","After all, Shen Linyan had said before that even if she got married, he wouldn't mind continuing to be her friend.","An Ling couldn't help but marvel at how incredibly magnanimous this gentle second male lead was.","Sure enough, after a brief moment of silence, the man's gentle voice came through the phone.","\"I don't mind. It is completely understandable why you did this, Madam, and besides, it is only a fake blind date.\"","Shen Linyan slowly tightened his grip around the ring in his hand. His eyelashes lowered gently, casting faint shadows beneath his eyes. The corners of his mouth curved up into their habitual smile, yet there was not a single trace of warmth in the depths of his pitch-black eyes.","\"It is just a pity... that I could not be your blind date, Madam.\""]},{"number":73,"title":"Chapter 73: Childhood Sweethearts","paragraphs":["In the early morning, while eating breakfast, Mother An announced the news.","\"An Zhou, Lingling said she has agreed to go on a blind date.\"","\"Clang—\"","The fork in An Zhou's hand instantly dropped onto his plate.","Dumbfounded, he looked up at An Ling sitting across from him.","\"Are you serious? You agreed?\"","How did this girl give in??","An Ling leaned back in her chair, drinking her soy milk without changing her expression. \"Yeah, is there a problem?\"","\"...Impossible.\" An Zhou's suspicious gaze swept back and forth between them. \"You guys aren't tricking me, are you? I don't believe it.\"","An Ling shot Mother An a look.","See, she told her that her brother was very cunning.","Mother An put down her spoon and wiped her mouth. \"I'm not tricking you. Lingling will go meet her blind date. An Zhou, if you dare to make up another excuse, you are also going on a blind date this weekend.\"","An Zhou: \"...\"","An Zhou held his tongue, speechless. He looked again at An Ling opposite him, who was so calm it seemed she had fully accepted it.","It was too fake.","\"Then who is An Ling's blind date?\"","Mother An replied, \"Wen Yuche.\"","An Zhou knew this person; his mother had mentioned him before.","He didn't expect it to actually be a real blind date.","An Zhou felt like he couldn't eat his breakfast anymore. He leaned back in his chair, looking like he had nothing left to live for, and lifted his chin. \"Hey, when are you meeting? Why didn't you hold out a bit longer?\"","\"We haven't set a specific time yet. I just added him, but it'll probably be this weekend.\"","An Ling wiped her mouth, giving a fake smile. \"Isn't this all for the sake of my brother's major life event?\"","She stood up and grabbed her coat and bag from the sofa. \"I'm leaving. Since it's raining today, I'll drive myself to the office. There's a company dinner tonight, so I won't be back to eat.\"","Driving to the company, An Ling had just parked her car when her phone suddenly lit up. Someone had sent a message.","Wen Yuche: [Hello, An Ling.]","She stuffed her car keys back into her bag and typed a reply.","[Hello, hello.]","Wen Yuche: [My mom told me about the blind date. Could we set a time to meet this Saturday? I have work scheduled for Sunday.]","Looking at this message, An Ling muttered softly, \"Feels like he was forced into it too.\"","Having work on the weekend but still having to make time to meet her.","An Ling: [Sure, then I will decide the time and place.]","Wen Yuche: [Okay.]","After chatting, An Ling put her phone back into her bag and pressed the elevator floor button.","Just as she sat down at her cubicle, Brother Nan placed a document on her desk and frowned.","\"Things are mostly settled with Shen Fuyuan's side, but there is one problem. Mother Shen requested that during editing, Shen Fuyuan's second brother should also be included, to the point where his screen time would exceed Shen Fuyuan's.\"","They were filming Shen Fuyuan. If they used too much footage to depict an irrelevant person, it would likely deviate from the show's positioning. Wasn't this just building up Lu Jingshen's reputation?","An Ling took off her coat, removed her scarf, and took the document, looking down to flip through it. \"Have you communicated with Shihe Media? Shen Fuyuan is the person they pushed in; we definitely have to prioritize her.\"","\"I did. Their reply was for us to resolve it.\"","It seemed they didn't want to offend Mother Shen, pushing all the pressure onto them.","An Ling could see what Brother Nan was worried about.","Even Shihe Media didn't want to get involved. As mere low-level employees, they were even more afraid of offending these people, terrified of losing their jobs.","She accepted the document. \"Brother Nan, you refuse first. If she has any objections, I will go talk to her.\"","Ms. Chen had given her this task, so this program had to proceed normally. She didn't care what that old woman wanted to do.","Hearing this, Brother Nan visibly sighed in relief and smiled. \"An Ling, it's a good thing we have you this time. Otherwise, it would be really hard for the rest of us to say anything. But will this cause trouble for you?\"","An Ling smiled at him. \"It's fine, it's no big deal.\"","They were divorced anyway. In the past, she hadn't wanted to argue with that old woman because she was afraid of causing trouble for Shen Linyan; after all, no matter what, she was Shen Linyan's mother.","But now, she wouldn't cater to that old woman anymore.","Originally, there was a company dinner planned for the evening, intended for everyone to share a meal before filming started.","Seeing that they had been too tired these past few days, Ms. Chen considerately said, \"Let's save the dinner for next time. Tomorrow is the weekend, so everyone go home and get some rest.\"","The other colleagues instantly breathed a sigh of relief upon hearing this. Compared to dining out, it was still more comfortable at home.","Seeing that it was still early, An Ling planned to go to Jiang Mai's cafe. Just as she arrived at the parking garage, she received a message from An Zhou.","[Did you set a time for your blind date?]","With this attitude, he was probably still suspecting that she and their mom were tricking him together.","Even though she was indeed tricking him.","An Ling sent him a screenshot of the chat.","[You should believe me now, right?]","An Zhou: [...Damn, weren't you on a united front with me?]","An Ling: [Sorry, never was. Have you set a time for your blind date? I'm going to tattle to Mom later.]","An Zhou: [...]","In the bar club, An Zhou leaned against the sofa, speechless.","He opened another chat window, which still only showed the greeting message he had sent out during the day.","\"How am I supposed to set this up? I send a message and the other party doesn't reply at all.\"","A friend next to him heard him talking and turned to look. \"There's actually someone who doesn't reply to our President An's messages? Who is it?\"","An Zhou locked his phone screen, picked up his wine glass, and casually replied, \"My blind date.\"","That daughter of the Qin family. He heard she was naturally introverted and didn't like to talk. He didn't even know what to say when they met.","Hearing this, his friend teased, \"Oho, An Zhou, you've reached the age of going on blind dates too? No wonder you asked us out for drinks today.\"","\"...Get lost.\" An Zhou took a sip of his drink in annoyance.","Another friend spoke up, \"Your sister got divorced a while ago, so is that why your mom just started rushing you to get married?\"","Speaking of that girl made it even more annoying.","The private room was too stuffy. An Zhou put down his glass. \"I'm going out to use the restroom and grab a smoke.\"","He stood up, pushed open the door of the private room, and walked out. Passing a corner, his footsteps instantly halted when he saw the person walking toward him.","The other party also stopped, curved his lips, and spoke in a gentle voice: \"President An, what a coincidence.\"","An Zhou's face gradually grew cold. He looked expressionlessly at the noble-looking man in front of him.","\"Not a coincidence at all. I couldn't tell that Chairman Shen would also come to a bar.\"","Regarding his cold attitude, Shen Linyan chuckled a few times. His tone remained as usual, and his demeanor was absolutely flawless. \"President An must be joking. Socializing doesn't discriminate by location. I still have matters to attend to, so I'll take my leave first.\"","As the man brushed past him, An Zhou suddenly spoke up.","\"Shen Linyan.\"","He didn't turn his head. He pulled a cigarette from his pocket, placed it by his lips, and said indifferently, \"I know my sister took you to the hospital a while ago.\"","The footsteps behind him instantly stopped.","The hallway lights outlined the man's sharp silhouette, his suit further highlighting his superior bodily proportions. He slightly turned his head, a polite smile still resting on his lips, yet there wasn't a trace of emotion in the depths of his eyes. His tone, however, remained gentle. \"Is that so?\"","An Zhou lit his cigarette and turned his head to meet those dark, heavy eyes.","He took a drag, blew out a smoke ring, and sneered, \"I don't know what you're trying to do by approaching An Ling like this. Since you're divorced, then make a clean break. Our An family doesn't want to get close to your Shen family anymore either.\"","The corridor fell silent for a moment, followed by the man's nonchalant, low chuckle.","With his hands stuffed in his pockets, Shen Linyan spoke at a leisurely pace, \"President An seems to be overstepping a bit. How I get along with An Ling doesn't seem to be any of President An's business.\"","Tch.","So he was finally dropping the act, huh.","An Zhou poked the inside of his cheek with his tongue and let out a smirk. \"Oh? None of my business? My sister is going on a blind date soon. She is about to embark on a new romance, so as her older brother, I naturally have to help her clear away any irrelevant nuisances.\"","Shen Linyan let out a laugh. Just as he was about to speak, An Zhou's voice rang out again.","\"Besides, her blind date is a childhood sweetheart she grew up playing with. That is definitely much better than some arranged marriage.\"","In an instant, the smile on the man's lips vanished, a dark storm surging in the depths of his pitch-black eyes.","...Childhood sweetheart?"]},{"number":74,"title":"Chapter 74: Having a Gentle, Wealthy, Devoted, and Considerate Husband Is Not a Bad Thing","paragraphs":["When An Ling went to the cafe, the shop was busy.","She ordered a drink and sat by the window, planning to wait for Jiang Mai to finish her work.","She picked a restaurant online and sent the address and time to Wen Yuche.","An Ling: [I think this restaurant looks pretty good. Does 7 PM work for you?]","Wen Yuche: [That works. Thank you for the trouble, Miss An.]","An Ling: [No problem.]","Just as she finished replying, Jiang Mai's voice sounded beside her ear.","\"Who are you chatting with? Shen Linyan?\"","An Ling put her phone away. \"No, someone else.\"","Jiang Mai didn't mind. She sat opposite her, pounding her waist and shoulders. \"I'm exhausted. It's so crowded today, and two staff members happened to ask for leave.\"","An Ling had ordered a cold peach oolong tea. She pushed the cup toward her. \"Drink some water and rest a bit.\"","Jiang Mai didn't stand on ceremony. She picked up the cup, took a few sips, and asked casually.","\"Right, did you reject Shen Linyan? I've been so busy these past few days that I forgot to ask.\"","\"...\"","An Ling silently looked away, scratched her cheek, and whispered, \"Well... the situation has changed.\"","Seeing her expression, Jiang Mai instantly understood.","She definitely failed to reject him. That's not how someone looks when they successfully reject someone.","\"Spit it out. What's the situation now?\"","An Ling pursed her lips and spoke slowly, \"Shen Linyan asked me... if he gets back all the shares of the Shen family, could he remarry me...\"","She paused, her gaze falling on the phone on the table.","\"And... he also said he wants to court me.\"","\"Cough, cough, cough!!\"","Caught off guard, Jiang Mai choked. She looked astonished. \"He said he wants to court you? Does he like you?\"","That was way too fast.","An Ling hesitated, nodding and then shaking her head.","Seeing Jiang Mai's shock, she chuckled. \"It's not that he likes me. He's learning to like me.\"","Jiang Mai looked confused. \"What does that mean?\"","An Ling propped up her chin, thinking about how to describe it. \"You can understand it as... the effort Shen Linyan is making to remarry me?\"","To remarry her, he is trying hard to like her.","To remarry her, he is trying hard to express his affection when they chat.","It was Jiang Mai's first time encountering such a thing, her face full of novelty. \"Did you agree?\"","An Ling blinked, then lowered her eyes and smiled, her fingertips tracing the edge of her phone.","\"Yes. Didn't you say it? If I can't bear to let go, then I should just play along.\"","\"That's true...\" Jiang Mai hesitated.","But playing like this could easily lead to trouble.","An Ling could tell what Jiang Mai was thinking.","She sighed. \"Didn't you just ask who I was chatting with? I was chatting with my blind date. My mom made me pretend to go on a blind date so my brother would go on one too, because my brother said he wouldn't go unless I went.\"","Jiang Mai had also heard about An Zhou being pressured to go on blind dates.","She couldn't hold back a laugh. \"Wait, you have to pretend? Your brother really never forgets to drag his sister down with him in whatever he does.\"","An Ling was speechless. \"Yeah, even you think it's ridiculous, right? I'm so annoyed with him. Now I have to go out to eat with someone this week.\"","\"Did you tell Shen Linyan?\"","Hearing this, An Ling's movements paused slightly.","She lowered her eyes and smiled as she spoke softly, \"I did. I even asked him if he minded. He said... he didn't mind.\"","After a moment of silence in the air, she looked up at Jiang Mai.","\"So, Jiang Mai, if you like someone, would you not mind them going on a blind date?\"","When she heard those words that night, she completely woke up to the reality.","It was also at that moment that she suddenly realized the effort Shen Linyan was making.","He was learning what behaviors meant he liked her.","Calling her his wife, kissing her, saying he wanted to court her, asking if he could call her, and even frequently inviting her to dinner.","In Shen Linyan's eyes, he believed these were the ways to express liking someone.","So he did them.","But he didn't know that the feelings produced in the heart when truly liking someone couldn't be faked. So with just a slight test, the man immediately exposed himself.","Hearing this, Jiang Mai didn't say much and just nodded gently.","\"That's true. Then, when he gets all those shares and the bankruptcy crisis is gone, will you agree to remarry him?\"","An Ling was about to answer when she saw the phone on the table light up.","It was a message from Shen Linyan.","She reached out, turned off the screen, and stayed silent for a moment before saying softly:","\"If, when that day comes, he still only has this kind of feeling for me, and I happen to not have fallen for anyone else, I might agree to remarry him.\"","Seeing Shen Linyan like this, she still felt soft-hearted.","Just as Jiang Mai said, she approached Shen Linyan first, became his reliance, and accepted the uniqueness he gave only to her.","So during this period, if she didn't fall for anyone else and the plot ran its course, she might really agree to remarry Shen Linyan in the end.","An Ling wasn't sure if this counted as salvation, but it didn't matter.","She was simply very satisfied with everything Shen Linyan gave her, so she also wanted to give him what he wanted.","Thinking about it carefully, having a gentle, wealthy, devoted, and considerate husband wasn't a bad thing.","During her time with Shen Linyan, she wouldn't feel wronged. Shen Linyan would notice all her emotions, just like the reporting incident that night.","It was better than some men who loved you at first but changed their minds later.","Shen Linyan's reputation as the gentle second male lead made her feel especially at ease.","Jiang Mai looked at her in silence and suddenly blurted out faintly:","\"An Ling, I told you not to set up a flag back then... See, you've fallen for him after all.\"","\"...\"","An Ling felt a bit guilty and argued weakly, \"...I just think it's pretty good that Shen Linyan treats me like this. Besides, he said he'd give me shares if we remarried...\"","Who could refuse sudden shares in the Shen Corporation?","Jiang Mai thought to herself that this development was really quite exciting.","She thought for a moment and teased jokingly, \"An Ling, I'm starting to suspect that Shen Linyan saw how soft-hearted you are and said all those things on purpose to make you stay.\"","He really pinched An Ling's soft spot accurately.","\"Don't talk nonsense.\"","An Ling leaned back in her chair helplessly. \"You know I hide every day when I'm with Shen Linyan now. My brother really hates Shen Linyan and tells me every day that Shen Linyan is very scheming.\"","Jiang Mai chuckled.","\"By the way, who is the person you're going on a blind date with tomorrow?\"","\"Wen Yuche, the youngest son of my mom's mahjong friend.\"","\"Oh ho, what does he look like?\"","An Ling's expression was complicated. \"Are you sure you want to ask me, someone who's face-blind?\"","She remembered he seemed pretty handsome.","Jiang Mai winked playfully. \"Can I go? Just to take a peek from a distance.\"","\"Sure, but I'm just going through the motions. You won't see much even if you go.\"","An Ling didn't have any expectations for tomorrow's blind date. It even felt like she was just going to a dinner gathering with a colleague.","Seeing that the shop was getting crowded again, Jiang Mai stood up. \"I need to get busy. Are you heading back soon too?\"","An Ling nodded, picked up her bag, and stood up as well. \"Just about. I originally planned to treat you to a meal, but seeing how busy you are, let's do it next time.\"","\"Then next time I'll have to see where the expensive restaurants are.\" Jiang Mai smiled and waved at her. \"Drive carefully in the rain.\"","\"Got it, got it.\"","An Ling waved goodbye as well, pulling out her phone to check her messages as she walked.","The moment she read the text from the man, her hand froze mid-push against the door."]},{"number":75,"title":"Chapter 75: This was the first time Shen Linyan had ever lied to her.","paragraphs":["The sky grew dark, and the rain fell heavier.","The curtain of rain blended into the night, blurring the neon lights on the streets, while the noisy patter of raindrops splashed against the glass.","An Ling sent a message to Shen Linyan saying she had arrived, then turned and leaned over to grab the umbrella from the floor of the passenger seat.","Just as she picked it up, someone gently knocked on her car window.","Knock, knock—","An Ling thought she wasn't allowed to park there, but when she turned her head, she met the man's smiling eyes.","Slightly surprised, a smile bloomed on her face as she hurried to open the door and step out. Why did you come out?","The man held a black umbrella, his knuckles distinct and strong. A luxury watch peeked out from his wrist. Water droplets rolled off the umbrella's edge, leaving dark, damp patches on the shoulders of his navy blue suit.","His eyes crinkled slightly as he tilted the umbrella toward her. He took her hand, wrapping it in his palm, and spoke in a gentle voice.","Are you cold?","No.","An Ling shook her head, then mysteriously stuffed his hand into her overcoat pocket.","Shen Linyan paused for a moment before his fingertips brushed against something warm.","The woman's proud and playful voice rang in his ears.","I have a secret weapon.","He bent down, smiling, and felt it again to figure out what it was. A heat pack?","Yeah.","When she left the house this morning, she specifically checked the weather forecast. Seeing that it would rain and get colder today, she packed a few heat packs in her bag.","An Ling raised an eyebrow at him triumphantly. If your hands are cold, I can share one with you.","The smile on Shen Linyan's lips deepened. He looked down and took her hand again. Your hand seems to be warmer than the heat pack.","An Ling's face flushed slightly. She held his hand and walked toward the pet store. Didn't you say you picked up a cat? Let's hurry up and go see it.","Shen Linyan had previously sent her a photo of a kitten getting checked out, saying he had found it.","Inside the pet store, a gray-and-white kitten was kept in a warm incubator basket. Its fur was still a bit wet. It rested its chin on the edge of the basket, its left leg wrapped in a white bandage, and its ears drooped.","An Ling squatted beside it and gently touched its little paw with her finger. Without even opening its eyes, it whimpered and meowed softly.","There are no major issues. After the checkup, we found a small wound on its leg, probably from an accidental scratch. It's a little girl, about three months old, a mix between a Ragdoll and a Silver Shaded British Shorthair. She has very good features, the shop assistant explained from the side.","An Ling nodded in agreement.","Even though she didn't know much about cat breeds, she still thought it looked incredibly cute.","She touched the kitten's ears again, listening to its comfortable purring, and looked up at the man. Are you going to take it home and keep it?","Shen Linyan's gaze swept over the kitten in the cage.","Yes. You can give it a name.","Me? An Ling pointed at herself, pursing her lips in slight embarrassment. But I'm terrible at naming things.","It doesn't matter. The man squatted down beside her and said gently, It likes you very much, so it will like the name you give it.","Since Shen Linyan put it that way, An Ling didn't refuse.","Looking at its gray fur, she thought for a moment, then turned her head with a smile and blinked at him. Let's call it Huihui. Do you think that's okay?","The woman's fair, beautiful face held a look of anticipation. Her eyes were clean and clear, incredibly captivating when they curved into a smile.","Staring at this smile, Shen Linyan recalled An Zhou's words again.","Childhood sweethearts.","Why would a blind date be a childhood sweetheart? Aren't they usually arranged with strangers?","His wife hadn't told him that she was going on a blind date tomorrow either.","He lowered his eyes to hide his emotions, curled his lips, and said gently, Yes, it sounds very nice.","After paying the bill, An Ling and Shen Linyan didn't linger and left the pet store.","Watching the couple leave, the shop assistant lowered her head to sort out the bills.","Another assistant walked over, holding a freshly bathed cat.","Hey, didn't a college student bring in that sick cat? How did it suddenly become that handsome guy's?","Without looking up, the first assistant replied, The college student didn't have the money to pay for the treatment. That handsome guy happened to be in the store picking out a pet at the time.","When the college student was begging her to help treat the cat, the man had glanced at the sickly kitten and suddenly spoken up: I can pay for it.","As for his only request...","The man took out his phone and added indifferently, Just say I brought it in.","Having organized the bills, the assistant looked up again.","She had a puzzled expression on her face.","It's a bit strange, though. It looked like he wanted to give it to his girlfriend.","He came all the way to the pet store to pick a pet for his girlfriend, but ended up choosing a stray cat.","Truly strange.","Outside the pet store, An Ling looked down at her phone.","7:23.","Even if they went back now, they wouldn't make it in time for dinner.","Before she could speak, the man suddenly asked, Has my wife had dinner yet? Do you want to go eat together?","Sure. An Ling had been just about to bring that up.","Shen Linyan had asked her out many times before, but she had been quite busy lately. Their schedules always clashed, so they hadn't actually managed to go on a proper date yet.","She looked down and opened an app to search. Where should we go eat? I'll set up the navigation.","Let's go home.","The man opened the umbrella and turned to look at her, his appearance gentle and noble. Smiling, he said softly, Shall we eat at home? I've already had Auntie Cheng prepare dinner.","An Ling blinked, smiled, and put her phone away. Okay.","...","After walking through the door, An Ling placed her bag on the sofa.","She took off her coat and instinctively turned to look at the dining table. When she saw that the table was completely empty, her expression froze in surprise.","Huh?","Didn't he say dinner was already prepared?","Seeing the man walk over, An Ling pointed in confusion. Did Auntie Cheng put the food in the fridge? Let's heat it up first then.","Saying that, An Ling stepped toward the kitchen to open the refrigerator.","As she walked past him, the man grabbed her wrist.","No.","A deep voice sounded above her head. There's no need to look, my wife. There's no food in there.","She was stunned for a moment, not quite processing it yet. Ah? Then where is it?","The man looked down at her dazed little expression and sighed with a helpless smile. Feeling a tickle in his heart, he gently pulled her into his arms, wrapping his arms around her soft, slender waist, and lowered his head to nuzzle the top of her hair.","My wife, I didn't ask Auntie Cheng to cook.","An Ling blinked, her face pressed against his chest. Feeling a bit of novelty in the moment, she tilted her head up and looked at him eagerly. So you lied to me?","This was the very first time Shen Linyan had lied to her.","Yes, the man admitted softly.","He reached out and cupped her face, his palms warm. He rubbed his nose against her cheek and lowered his head to kiss the corner of her lips.","He lifted his gaze, his pitch-black eyes staring straight into hers.","Because I missed my wife very much. Did you not miss me?"]},{"number":76,"title":"Chapter 76: Pleasing you is also what I want to do.","paragraphs":["In the living room, the man's deep voice sounded in her ear.","An Ling's face flushed slightly. She was about to speak, but suddenly remembered what she had discussed with Jiang Mai. She pursed her lips, wrapped her arms around his neck, and couldn't help but ask softly, \"Do you really miss me?\"","The man chuckled, supported her by the buttocks, and lifted her up. He sat down on the sofa, and An Ling straddled his lap, obediently clinging to his shoulders.","Shen Linyan kissed her cheek. \"I really do miss my wife. Why do you ask?\"","An Ling blinked at him. \"Because aren't you courting me? Maybe you're just saying things to coax me so you can win me over.\"","She hugged Shen Linyan's neck, resting her chin on his shoulder. After a moment of silence, she slowly said, \"Shen Linyan, I know you are learning to like me, but I don't need you to do it deliberately. Just follow your heart. Do what you want to do, and don't do things just to please me.\"","The man's movements paused slightly.","After a moment of silence, he raised his hand and gently rubbed her earlobe, asking with a warm smile, \"What behaviors does my wife think I'm doing deliberately?\"","\"Like calling me 'my wife'!\" An Ling's body trembled, her waist going soft as she slumped into his arms. \"And kissing me and stuff, saying you want to court me. You're just saying that because you want me to remarry you.\"","Hearing this, Shen Linyan turned to look at her.","\"What if I say I'm not?\"","\"What?\" The woman tilted her head, her clear eyes filled with a misty haze.","Shen Linyan lowered his gaze to look into her eyes. He bowed his head and kissed the corner of her eye, his Adam's apple bobbing as he whispered softly,","\"An Ling, I admit that when we were married, I did these things deliberately because I was your husband. But now, I do them because I want to.\"","Gentle, fragmented kisses fell on her cheeks, the tip of her nose, the corners of her mouth, and her chin, before he turned his head to lightly kiss her earlobe.","\"I call you my wife because I want to, I kiss you because I want to, and I am courting you because I want to.\"","\"Even pleasing you is something I want to do.\"","His thin lips trailed down little by little. The skin on the woman's neck was fair, carrying a rich, sweet fragrance. Shen Linyan's movements paused slightly, a hint of darkness flashing in his eyes as he slowly lowered his head to kiss her.","He slowly lifted his head, his eyes curving into a smile as he said softly, \"If I want to do these things from the bottom of my heart, does that mean I've fallen for my wife?\"","An Ling's expression froze slightly.","She was dazed for a moment, then raised her blushing face.","\"Really?\"","Shen Linyan's eyes curved. He reached out to hold her chin, lowered his head for a kiss, and gently rubbed her skin with his thumb. \"Really. So, is this what it means to like someone, my wife?\"","Then why wasn't he angry when he heard about the blind date?","Could it really be because Shen Linyan was too nice, so he truly didn't mind?","Anyway, if she heard that Shen Linyan was going on a blind date, she would definitely be furious.","It made her seem a bit petty.","An Ling felt a tickle in her heart. She blinked her eyelashes and gave a slight nod. \"Well... that remains to be seen, but you are allowed to keep doing it.\"","\"Okay,\" Shen Linyan let out a low chuckle. He reached out to cup the back of her head, lowering his face until his lips touched hers, his hot breath brushing against her mouth. \"What do you want to eat tonight? Shall we order takeout? Hmm?\"","\"I want to eat braised prawns,\" An Ling said, hugging his neck.","\"Alright.\" Shen Linyan grabbed the phone from the side and handed it to her.","An Ling ordered takeout on his phone. After finishing, she remembered the cat he had picked up. \"Are you going to buy cat food and a cat bed? And cat litter? I can help you buy them together. I just searched on the way here, and there are so many different brands with varying reviews.\"","It was probably Shen Linyan's first time raising a cat too, so she didn't mind helping him.","She turned around to grab her own phone.","\"There are also some nice little beds. I've saved a lot of them. I'll show you. They are very cute, and I feel like they would suit Huihui perfectly.\"","The woman's hair slipped from her shoulder, revealing her fair, beautifully contoured neck. The moment she turned her head, a faint kiss mark on the side of her tender white neck came clearly into view.","The man's gaze lingered for a long time before slowly shifting away. He curled his lips and said softly, \"Okay.\"","...","An Ling didn't find out about An Zhou's blind date schedule until the following afternoon.","She was sitting on the sofa, taking out a hair tie to casually pull her hair up, leaving a few loose strands around her neck. She was picking out a cat bed on her phone and casually chimed in upon hearing his words, \"Yours is tomorrow?\"","\"Yeah,\" An Zhou sat on the other sofa, opening the bag of potato chips in his lap.","Last night in the middle of the night, that Miss Qin finally replied to him.","Concise and straight to the point, with absolutely no nonsense, she just threw a single sentence at him:","[Sunday at twelve noon, lunch at the Fuli Hotel.]","He had been sending greetings earlier, but the other party clearly had no intention of exchanging pleasantries.","Great, it looked like this blind date was doomed to fail.","Thinking of this, An Zhou couldn't help but laugh out loud. \"I'm about to be liberated.\"","Seeing that An Ling kept her head down, he frowned, stood up, and walked over. \"What are you playing with so intently? You don't even look up when your brother is talking to you.\"","An Ling instantly pressed her phone against her chest and looked up at him. \"It's a secret. I'm not showing you.\"","An Zhou scoffed, \"I don't care anyway.\"","He offered the potato chips. \"Want some?\"","\"No, I'm on a diet.\"","An Zhou retracted his hand and glanced at the clock on the wall. \"It's already four o'clock. Aren't you going out for dinner at seven? Why haven't you changed your clothes yet? Don't you girls need to dress up and stuff before going out to eat?\"","\"No need, I'll be quick.\"","An Ling casually brushed An Zhou off. After browsing back and forth, she sent the chosen cat bed to Shen Linyan.","[I like this one! It's shaped like a little persimmon, all round and chubby. Do you think it looks nice?]","Shen Linyan: [It looks great. I like it too. Let's buy it.]","An Ling: [Okay!]","Shen Linyan: [Does my wife want to come out and have dinner with me tonight? We can go to the pet store together ^^]","An Ling paused.","She had forgotten to tell Shen Linyan yesterday that she was going out for dinner with her blind date today.","[I have to eat with my blind date tonight.]","The other side was quiet for a while before a message came through.","Shen Linyan: [Where are you eating?]","An Ling sent him the address.","Shen Linyan: [Okay.]","After buying the cat bed, An Ling stretched lazily and got up, planning to go upstairs to change clothes.","An Zhou looked up from his phone. \"Finally done? Let me tell you something, do you know who I bumped into at the bar?\"","Yesterday was the first time Shen Linyan had been rendered speechless by him. After hearing about the childhood sweetheart, he probably couldn't even force a smile anymore!","Thinking of this, a smug smile tugged at the corners of An Zhou's mouth. He turned his head to glance at An Ling: \"I saw your ex...\"","But the very next second, his expression suddenly froze, the words catching in his throat. Instead, his eyes widened and he exclaimed:","\"An Ling! What is on your neck??\"","An Ling stopped in her tracks and turned her head in confusion. \"What?\"","An Zhou stood up and took large strides over, his tone filled with shock as he pointed a finger. \"There's a red spot on the back of your neck. Holy crap! Is that a hickey??\"","An Ling: \"...\"","No way, right? Did Shen Linyan kiss her neck yesterday?","An Ling covered the back of her neck without changing her expression, her tone calm.","\"You saw it wrong. How could it be a hickey? I don't even have a boyfriend. It was probably a bug bite. The environment at the dinner place yesterday wasn't very good.\"","Anyway, her brother had never dated. How could a single eligible bachelor like him recognize a hickey?"]},{"number":77,"title":"Chapter 77: Would you like to go shopping at the mall with me","paragraphs":["7:00 PM, Jinshan Dragon Restaurant.","Seeing the woman approach, the waiter bowed respectfully and gestured with his hand.","\"Miss An, right this way, please.\"","\"Okay.\"","An Ling sent a message to Jiang Mai and put her phone back into her bag.","Following the waiter to the table, she saw a man already sitting opposite her seat.","Seeing her arrive, he stood up, smiled, and politely extended his hand. \"Hello, Miss An.\"","The man was dressed in a gray suit, his hair styled meticulously. With a flawless smile and a lean face, he wore silver-rimmed glasses resting on his nose bridge, giving off a gentle and refined aura.","An Ling smiled and shook his hand. \"Hello, Mr. Wen. I apologize for being late.\"","Wen Yuche's gaze fell upon the woman in front of him.","She was wearing a long white silk dress with a grayish-white fur coat draped over her shoulders. Her long black hair was pinned up, and the diamond necklace around her neck refracted a dazzling light, making her fair, beautiful face look even more exquisite. Her eyes curved when she smiled, and her aura was gentle, carrying a pure innocence.","Wen Yuche was momentarily stunned, a trace of surprise flashing through his eyes.","It seemed his mother really hadn't lied to him.","His smile deepened as he gestured with his hand. \"Not at all, I just arrived early. Please, have a seat.\"","An Ling sat down and placed her bag aside.","Wen Yuche handed the menu to her. \"I don't know what you like to eat, Miss An, and I haven't eaten here before either, so I went ahead and ordered some of their signature dishes. See if there's anything else you'd like to add.\"","\"It's fine, I eat anything...\" An Ling took the menu, but then her movements paused.","She looked up with a helpless smile. \"You ordered so much; I don't think the two of us can finish it all.\"","\"Is that so?\"","\"Yes.\" An Ling looked up and pointed it out to the waiter. \"Please cancel this fish and the soup. We already have similar dishes.\"","After saying that, she turned to ask for Wen Yuche's opinion. \"Is that alright?\"","The man smiled and nodded. \"That's fine.\"","\"Certainly.\" The waiter took back the menu.","The moment An Ling turned her head, she caught Wen Yuche looking at her.","She blinked. \"What's wrong?\"","Wen Yuche smiled and leaned back in his chair. \"I just feel that you're quite different from the Miss An I knew before.\"","\"From when we were kids?\" An Ling's eyes curved in a smile. \"My mom said we used to play together when we were little, but I don't really remember.\"","Wen Yuche smiled but didn't answer directly. He simply raised his hand to pour her some red wine. \"I don't really remember either. This wine is quite good, you should try it.\"","He had read the news about the An and Shen families, so his initial impression of An Ling wasn't very good.","When his mother first mentioned this blind date, he knew she had already made a promise to Auntie An.","He hadn't really wanted to agree, but he couldn't withstand his mother using excuses like \"you played together as kids\" and insisting that the news was all fake.","Playing together as kids didn't guarantee a person's character as an adult.","Looking at her now, however, there were indeed some discrepancies from the news.","An Ling took a sip of the red wine. Remembering her face blindness, she didn't dare to drink too much; if she got drunk, recognizing people would become very troublesome.","Holding her wine glass, she looked at the man across from her. After thinking for a moment, her long, curly eyelashes fluttered as she leaned in and asked in a low voice, \"Were you forced to come here too? Did my mom tell you this was just to make friends?\"","Wen Yuche was slightly taken aback, and then a laugh escaped his lips.","\"She did.\"","So they were in the same boat.","An Ling smiled at him, her eyes curving. \"No need to be so formal. You can just call me by my name.\"","\"Alright, An Ling.\" Wen Yuche turned and pulled out a gift box from beside him. \"For our first meeting, this is a gift for you.\"","An Ling took it and opened the box to find a Van Cleef & Arpels bracelet. She immediately pushed the box back. \"There's no need, this is too expensive, and I didn't prepare anything for you.\"","The main reason was that she already had several of these.","Among the luxury goods Shen Linyan had given her before, she had one in every color of this collection.","\"It's fine. If you don't accept it, my mom will scold me.\"","\"Alright then.\" An Ling held up the gift and smiled at him, raising an eyebrow. \"Then I'll owe you a gift in return for later.\"","Swallowing his words of refusal, Wen Yuche smiled and nodded. \"Okay.\"","When the waiter came over to serve the food, An Ling picked up her phone and glanced at it, seeing a message from Jiang Mai.","[I see him! He's quite good-looking. Are you guys going on a date after dinner? Hehe.]","Where did she see them?","Seeing that Wen Yuche was also looking down at his phone replying to messages, she typed quickly.","An Ling: [What date? I'm going straight home after dinner.]","She had deliberately cut down on the dishes just so she could go home early.","Just as she sent the message, the clattering sound of a glass tipping over suddenly rang in her ears, accompanied by the waiter's exclamation.","\"I'm sorry, sir! I'm so sorry!\"","She looked up to see a messy scene on the table. The man's glass had tipped over, and red wine was dripping down the edge of the table right onto his suit.","The waiter beside them bowed repeatedly, apologizing in a panicked tone. \"I'm so sorry, sir... I-I didn't mean to.\"","Wen Yuche quickly stood up and grabbed a napkin to wipe it. The smile on his face was a bit forced, but he tried his best to keep his tone gentle. \"It's fine...\"","Before An Ling could figure out what had happened, the lobby manager heard the commotion and hurried over, his face full of apology. \"I'm so sorry! Sir, this waiter is new and a bit clumsy! We will cover the cost of cleaning your suit and your meal tonight. We are truly sorry!\"","Wen Yuche looked at the red wine stain on his clothes and sighed. \"Forget it...\"","He looked at An Ling. \"An Ling, did you get splashed?\"","An Ling looked down. \"No.\"","Wen Yuche put his hands on his hips helplessly and chuckled. \"I'm really sorry. With this happening so suddenly, I'm afraid we can't continue our dinner.\"","An Ling quickly waved her hands and stood up. \"It's totally fine, it couldn't be helped. You should hurry back, Mr. Wen.\"","This was great! She could go home early!","Suppressing her joy, An Ling picked up her bag and the gift, smiling as she said, \"You don't need to see me off. Go home early and change your clothes so you don't catch a cold.\"","Just as she was about to turn around, the man's voice sounded from behind her.","\"If you have time, Miss An, would you like to go to the mall with me?\"","\"...\"","An Ling paused in her tracks and turned around to meet the man's gentle smile.","\"The main thing is, if I go back too early, my mom will definitely scold me, and she might just set up another date. It just so happens I need to buy a new suit for work tomorrow, but unfortunately, my fashion sense isn't the best. Isn't this perfect timing? You can return the favor for the gift now.\"","An Ling blinked, then smiled and gave him an \"OK\" gesture.","\"No problem, let's go.\"","After they left, the manager looked at the spilled red wine on the floor, patted the waiter on the shoulder, and lowered his voice.","\"Good acting. Thanks for your hard work.\"","He walked to the side, took out his phone, and dialed a number.","Out on the street, a Maybach was parked quietly by the curb.","A man in a sharp suit sat upright inside the car. His long, slender fingers pressed the button to hang up the phone. He slowly lifted his gaze, his dark eyes staring at the car driving away in front of him.","Secretary Chen sat in the front seat, bracing himself as he spoke respectfully:","\"I've looked into it, Chairman Shen. That is the youngest son of the Wen family, Wen Yuche. He studied abroad for several years and just recently returned from London.\"","He paused for a moment before adding:","\"Also, this Wen Yuche works together with Damian.\"","As the words faded, a heavy, frozen silence spread through the interior of the car.","The man lowered his gaze, nonchalantly tapping on his phone screen. His calm voice betrayed no trace of emotion.","\"Send a message to Damian and tell him I will be having dinner with him tomorrow.\""]},{"number":78,"title":"Chapter 78: What Do You Think You Are","paragraphs":["At night, the hotel was brilliantly illuminated. Its exterior was magnificent, with luxury cars constantly entering and exiting.","\"Damian, did you say someone was joining us for dinner today?\"","Wen Yuche held his phone in one hand while closing the car door with the other, handing the keys to the valet.","Damian's excited voice came through the phone.","\"Yes, Rowan. I told you he is incredibly formidable. I came here this time specifically to see him.\"","Damian was a renowned financial investment tycoon abroad. Wen Yuche had been studying and collaborating with him overseas, and had indeed heard him mention such a formidable figure—someone whose investments never lost money and whose methods were ruthless.","Damian said even he was wary of the man, but the person just didn't like making public appearances.","To think such a powerful person was also in Jing City?","Hanging up the phone, Wen Yuche followed a waiter to a private room.","As soon as he pushed the door open, Damian's less-than-fluent Chinese drifted from inside.","\"Svein, it's really hard to see you nowadays. I heard you got married earlier, is it true or false?\"","A man's faint \"Mm\" came from within.","Wen Yuche stepped inside, but when he saw the scene in the room, his expression slightly froze.","Seeing him arrive, Damian stood up with a smile. \"Rowan, you're here.\"","He turned to introduce him to the man in the seat of honor. \"Svein, this is the student I told you about, Rowan.\"","\"Rowan, this is Svein. You should know him, right? Svein is quite famous domestically too, hahaha.\"","The man had a straight posture and an outstandingly noble temperament. He leaned casually against the back of his chair, exuding the oppressive aura of someone in power, and lazily lifted his eyelids to look at him.","Wen Yuche thought to himself that he was indeed famous—so famous that he never expected it to be this person.","The heir of the Shen family, Shen Linyan.","He quickly recovered, a polite and customary smile appearing on his face. He stepped forward and offered his hand. \"Hello, President Shen. I am from the Wen family...\"","\"I know.\"","The man interrupted him with no intention of shaking his hand. He looked down and took out a cigarette, his tone calm. \"Wen Yuche, right?\"","With a click, a flame danced in the air, and smoke carrying the scent of cedar curled upward.","Biting the cigarette, the man raised his eyes, his careless gaze sweeping over the suit Wen Yuche was wearing before he let out a low chuckle.","\"This suit on President Wen looks quite nice.\"","Wen Yuche's face stiffened.","This suit was bought by An Ling.","He wasn't entirely sure if Shen Linyan was making a veiled reference to yesterday's blind date.","Weren't these two already divorced?","Damian wasn't quite sure what had happened, but seeing Shen Linyan's expression, he spoke up hesitantly, \"Svein, have you and Rowan met before?\"","Had Rowan offended him?","Shen Linyan flicked his cigarette ash and said lightly, \"Never met. Damian, the branch company you're setting up domestically—you want him to manage it?\"","Damian nodded. \"Yes... I invited you over, but you insisted on going to that Shen Corporation. Svein, I can offer you a much better opportunity than the Shen Corporation. That place restricts you too much.\"","Shen Linyan slowly raised his eyes and glanced at Wen Yuche.","\"I don't think he is capable.\"","As soon as the words fell, the other two were stunned.","Damian murmured in repetition, \"You don't think he's capable...\"","He signaled Wen Yuche, asking how he had provoked Shen Linyan.","Wen Yuche's expression was ugly.","He could tell that Shen Linyan was intentionally targeting him because of yesterday's blind date.","It seemed the previous news reports were true.","The marriage between An Ling and Shen Linyan had indeed been unhappy. Even now that they were divorced, Shen Linyan would deliberately target An Ling, and even the people around her.","Was it really necessary?","Those news reports claimed An Ling was the party at fault, but after spending time with her yesterday, he clearly felt she wasn't that kind of person. The problem must have been with Shen Linyan.","It was hard to imagine what kind of life An Ling lived during her marriage. No wonder his mother told him to just be friends with An Ling first and not to rush.","He gritted his teeth and clenched his fists. \"Is Chairman Shen acting like this because of what happened yesterday? If so, then I think I made the right choice by going to that date yesterday. Even if Chairman Shen speaks of me this way, I don't regret it. An Ling is a very good person. Can't Chairman Shen just let her go?\"","Shen Linyan's movements paused.","The private room fell quiet, the atmosphere heavy.","After an unknown amount of time, the man suddenly let out an ambiguous chuckle. He stood up and unhurriedly pressed his cigarette into Wen Yuche's suit.","\"Sizzle—\" The sound of burning fabric crackled right by his ear.","The man's thin lips curled up, his dark eyes bottomless. There was not a trace of a smile in his eyes, only a bone-chilling coldness.","\"What the hell do you think you are?\"","Seeing Shen Linyan get angry, Damian hurriedly rushed over and covered Wen Yuche's mouth, his Chinese stumbling in his anxiety. \"Svein, don't be angry, my student might... uh, be sick in the head!\"","Shen Linyan tossed away the cigarette in his hand, lowered his eyes, and took a wet wipe to clean his hands.","\"Damian, your student is very interesting.\"","He gave Wen Yuche an indifferent glance and strode out of the private room.","After Shen Linyan left, Damian let go of his hand. \"Why did you have to make Svein angry!\"","Wen Yuche frowned. \"He started it...\"","Damian looked at him with exasperation. \"Svein said 'he thinks'. He was warning you! If he truly didn't want you to manage it, he wouldn't even need to say it to your face. Great, now Svein is angry, and your family better watch out.\"","Wen Yuche's face was still a bit pale. After a moment of silence, he took out his phone and sent a message.","[An Ling, when will you be free? Can we meet?]","An Ling had just gotten out of the car when she saw the message.","\"An Ling, what are you doing?\"","An Zhou's urging voice came from ahead, so she had to put her phone away for now.","Taking a few quick steps to catch up, she shot a speechless glance at the man beside her. \"I should be asking you what you are doing. Why did you insist on dragging me along to your own blind date?\"","An Zhou was holding a bouquet of flowers. \"Didn't I tell you? If the situation gets too awkward, you call me and say something like the gas at home wasn't turned off, and I'll use that as an excuse to bail.\"","\"Is that necessary?\"","\"Of course it's necessary!\" An Zhou looked serious. \"You have no idea, my biggest fear is trying to chat with the opposite sex when they don't talk.\"","An Ling was truly defeated by him. She crossed her arms. \"Fine, fine. We have a deal. I'll help you this one time, but you are not allowed to bring up Shen Linyan ever again.\"","\"Deal.\" An Zhou raised his wrist to check his watch. \"I'll go in first. You sneak in a bit later. Remember to find a hidden spot where you can still see me, and don't get caught.\"","Quite cautious.","\"Just go in already.\" Seeing him enter the restaurant, An Ling stepped to the side so as not to block others.","She took out her phone again to reply to Wen Yuche.","[Work might be quite busy next week, so I'm not sure when I'll have time. Is there something you wanted to say?]","Before the other side could reply, a familiar voice sounded by her ear.","\"Madam.\""]},{"number":79,"title":"Chapter 79: Actually, I Was There Yesterday Too","paragraphs":["Hearing the familiar voice, An Ling turned her head in pleasant surprise.","\"Shen Linyan?! Why are you here?\"","\"I have a business engagement here.\"","The man walked over, took off his coat, and draped it over her shoulders. Catching a glimpse of the contact name on the woman's phone from the corner of his eye, his movements paused slightly.","He quietly withdrew his gaze, helped her tidy her hair, and touched the woman's cold little face. With smiling eyes, he asked gently, \"Why is my wife standing outside? Aren't you cold?\"","\"My brother is having a blind date here.\" An Ling pointed toward the restaurant. \"I'm going to go in later to cover for him.\"","She caught a very faint scent of tobacco and lowered her head to sniff. \"Did you smoke? Your clothes seem to smell like cigarettes.\"","\"It might have gotten on me by accident when someone else was smoking.\"","Shen Linyan's tone was natural. He turned to look at the restaurant. \"Do you really have to go in? The pet hospital just messaged me saying Huihui is doing quite well today and we can go see him. Do you want to go together?\"","An Ling blinked, feeling somewhat tempted.","Sitting there the whole time would be too boring; she might as well go see Huihui.","After thinking for a few seconds, she looked up, her eyes curving into a smile.","\"Let's go!\"","An Zhou had thrown her under the bus so many times, it was about time she returned the favor.","As they were leaving, a woman walked toward them from the opposite direction.","After passing them, the woman paused slightly, turned her head to cast a thoughtful glance, and then entered the restaurant.","An Zhou sat in the restaurant, head down, frantically sending messages.","[She isn't here yet, come in quickly!]","[Where are you?]","[An Ling??]","What was this girl doing? Why wasn't she replying to his messages??","Receiving no reply, An Zhou frowned. Just as he was about to go look for her, a cold, clear female voice sounded by his ear.","\"You must be Mr. An, right?\"","His movements froze. He looked up to see a woman looking down at him. Her eyes were light-colored, her features elegant, and she was wearing a simple white turtleneck sweater with an outer coat, exuding an aloof aura.","And at this very moment, he finally received An Ling's reply:","An Ling: [I'm leaving now~]","\"...\"","An Zhou turned off his phone screen, forced a smile, stood up, and extended his hand. \"Hello, hello, Miss Qin, I am An Zhou.\"","The woman lightly shook his hand. \"Just call me Qin You.\"","An Zhou nodded repeatedly. He bent down, picked up the flowers from the table, and offered them to her. Before he could even speak, the woman suddenly raised her hand and calmly declined, \"I'm sorry, could you put those away? I'm allergic to pollen.\"","\"...\"","An Zhou gave an awkward laugh, his arm stiffening as he put the flowers down. \"Sorry... I wasn't being considerate enough.\"","He really wanted to run away.","An Ling, you traitor!!","...","\"Achoo—\"","Sitting in the car, An Ling suddenly sneezed.","Seeing this, the man turned up the heater a bit. \"Catching a cold?\"","An Ling smiled and waved her hand. \"Probably not. I'm guessing my brother is cursing me.\"","An Zhou hadn't replied to her, which meant his blind date must have arrived.","Upon arriving at the pet store, An Ling and Shen Linyan got out of the car.","Compared to yesterday when it lay listlessly in the cage, Huihui had indeed recovered quite well today and was very eager to eat.","An Ling held out a cat treat, and the little creature let out a milky meow. It immediately got up and came over; when she rubbed its head, it obediently nuzzled against her palm.","But as soon as it finished eating, it instantly turned its back, acting as if it didn't know her, pointing its butt at them and swishing its fluffy tail back and forth.","The store clerk, squatting nearby, saw this and said with a smile, \"This little guy is very pragmatic. He's good when there's food, but ignores people completely when there isn't.\"","Normally, a stray wild kitten like this, especially one with injuries, would be somewhat wary of people and hesitate before accepting food.","But this one completely lit up at the sight of food.","An Ling smiled and tossed the wrapper into the trash can. \"Looks like he's quite the little foodie.\"","\"Thanks to his good appetite, his recovery speed is also fast. He's had his vaccines and deworming. At this rate, you can take him back next week.\" The clerk walked over to the front desk. \"It's just that you might need to spend more time with him when you take him back. Kittens don't adapt to new environments that quickly.\"","An Ling actually really wanted to help, but her workload was heavy next week, and shooting was about to start.","She looked at Shen Linyan. \"Are you busy with work next week? I'll be quite busy next week. Should we have Auntie Cheng take care of him during the day while we're at work?\"","The man glanced at the cat in the cage.","\"It's fine, someone will take care of him.\"","...","Leaving the pet store, An Ling looked down at the time.","A voice suddenly sounded beside her.","\"Wife, do you want to go home for dinner?\"","\"...\" What a familiar conversation.","An Ling didn't say anything, just tilted her head and narrowed her eyes at him.","Meeting the woman's suspicious little gaze, Shen Linyan smiled and held her hand.","\"I'm not lying to you this time. The food is actually ready.\"","After getting into the car, An Ling took out her phone. Just as she was about to turn it off and ask An Zhou how his blind date was going, Wen Yuche suddenly sent a reply.","He hadn't sent any messages since her previous reply, and An Ling had almost forgotten about him.","Wen Yuche: [Um, it's nothing major. We didn't really get to eat yesterday, so I'd like to invite you out for a meal again.]","An Ling: [It's okay, no need to invite me again.]","Wen Yuche: [Well, actually, my mother found out about what happened yesterday, and she asked me to invite you again. Miss An, could you help me out just this once?]","An Ling thought this was simple enough.","[Sure, just tell Auntie Wen that we are having dinner together tonight. It just so happens I'm not eating at home tonight anyway.]","When the time came, she could even use this excuse to fob off An Zhou.","It was killing two birds with one stone!","\"Are you chatting with President An?\"","Hearing Shen Linyan's sudden question, An Ling put down her phone. \"No, I'm chatting with the blind date I had dinner with yesterday.\"","The man's gaze paused slightly. His long, slender fingers tapped against the steering wheel as he stared at the road ahead. With his usual gentle smile at the corners of his mouth, his tone remained normal, \"Are you and that person already friends?\"","\"Not really, I guess?\"","Seeing that Wen Yuche had replied with an \"Okay, thank you,\" An Ling typed out \"no problem\" and sent it. She answered casually, \"It seems he was also forced into it by his family. Mainly because my mom and his mom are mahjong buddies, and our two families have a pretty good relationship...\"","As she spoke, An Ling's voice suddenly trailed off.","She hadn't told Shen Linyan about what happened during dinner yesterday. Mostly because there wasn't much to say, and besides, Shen Linyan hadn't asked.","She turned off her phone and was just about to close her eyes to rest for a bit.","In the quiet car cabin, the man's voice slowly rang out.","\"Wife.\"","\"Hmm?\"","\"Actually, I was there yesterday too.\"","\"...\"","After taking a few seconds to process this, An Ling snapped her eyes open and turned her head in shock. \"You were there too?\"","Where??","How come she hadn't seen him at all??","Shen Linyan fell silent for a moment before answering softly, \"Because I originally wanted to wait for you to finish eating and then pick you up to go to the mall together, but I ended up seeing you go with someone else.\"","The car parked in the garage. He turned to look at her. \"Wife, does just going through the motions require going to the mall?\"","\"No, it's not like that...\"","An Ling's eyes darted around, and she rubbed the tip of her nose. \"Because his clothes got splashed with red wine, and he had given me a gift, so I thought I'd buy him a piece of clothing in return...\"","Wait, it wasn't like she was having an affair. She had perfectly justifiable reasons for doing that.","Why should she feel guilty?","Thinking of this, An Ling grew a bit bolder. She frankly met the man's gaze.","\"Aren't blind dates all about courtesy and returning favors? Didn't I give you a tie before too?\"","As her voice faded, the inside of the car suddenly fell silent, an indescribable quietness filling the air.","The man's deep, dark eyes watched her quietly. His eyelids were slightly lowered, casting shadows beneath his eyes, and the light from the window failed to illuminate the heavy darkness in his gaze.","An Ling's expression froze slightly. She pursed her lips, just about to open her mouth and say something.","But the man suddenly lowered his head and let out a soft chuckle. His deep, hoarse voice was laced with an obscure emotion, \"So that's how it is...\"","\"I wouldn't know, because I've never been on a blind date. I've only ever been married to you, Madam.\"","Click—","The man unbuckled her seatbelt for her, lowered his gaze, and said softly:","\"Go on upstairs, Madam.\"","An Ling: \"...\"","It seemed she had said the wrong thing."]},{"number":80,"title":"Chapter 80: What about places that loved ones cannot see","paragraphs":["Everything was exactly the same as usual.","An Ling and Shen Linyan took the elevator upstairs together, opened the door, changed their shoes, and then naturally finished dinner.","During this time, they even discussed the future arrangement of the house after Huihui arrived, planning to place Huihui's little nest next to the floor-to-ceiling windows in the living room.","The atmosphere was as peaceful as before.","But An Ling was still certain of one thing.","She had said the wrong thing and made Shen Linyan upset.","Although the man didn't say anything and even acted just like before, An Ling just felt that something was off.","She leaned against the sofa, looking down and idly scrolling through videos, but in reality, she was secretly glancing at the man beside her from the corner of her eye.","The heating was on in the living room. The man sat on the sofa with his long legs crossed, his eyes lowered as he quietly read the documents on his tablet. His side profile was elegant and noble. The sleeves of his shirt were rolled up, revealing the faint, powerful lines of veins on his forearms. A few buttons at his collar were undone, faintly revealing a silver chain inside.","Shen Linyan wore a necklace?","This thought flashed through An Ling's mind.","Wait, that wasn't the most important thing right now.","She quietly shifted her body, tilting her head to rest it on the man's shoulder.","Shen Linyan's movements paused. He looked away from the documents, turned his head to glance at her, and then continued reading.","See!","It was exactly like this!","Although it felt similar to usual, it was actually vastly different!","An Ling paused, bit her lip, and continued to nuzzle against the man's shoulder before lifting her head.","As soon as Shen Linyan lowered his head, he met a pair of clear, clean eyes. The woman looked at him eagerly, her long and thick eyelashes making her look both well-behaved and alluring.","He lowered his eyes and looked at her for a moment, then set the tablet aside and reached out to wrap his arm around her waist. \"What's wrong, Madam?\"","An Ling hugged his neck and blinked.","\"Shen Linyan, are you mad at me?\" The woman's voice was clean, the ending notes lifting slightly with a soft tone, her hot breath dusting his chin.","Shen Linyan's movements paused slightly, the emotions in his eyes loosening. He smiled and sighed, \"No.\"","His eyes curved as he touched her face. \"I just didn't know that blind dates were like this. You did nothing wrong, Madam.\"","An Ling definitely didn't believe such words. She sat up and straddled his lap.","\"Shen Linyan, you don't have to unconditionally say I'm right just because I did it. Didn't I tell you to follow your own heart?\"","If that were the case, he would want Wen Yuche to disappear from this city tomorrow.","The very existence of this person already infuriated him.","What right did that person have to be her blind date, to openly walk side by side with An Ling, have An Ling pick out things for him, and even see another side of An Ling?","These things should have been his.","They should have belonged only to him.","Shen Linyan lifted his head, his pitch-black eyes staring at her. His breathing was a bit heavy, his voice husky:","\"I don't like you buying him a suit, Madam. I have only ever bought things for you.\"","Even if he hadn't liked An Ling before, he had still given her the best of everything, because An Ling was his only wife.","Even if this didn't truly represent love, and even if he knew there was nothing wrong with what An Ling did, he did not want to share this treatment with anyone else.","An Ling had guessed it was because of this.","She cupped the man's face and took the initiative to lean down and kiss him. \"Alright, alright, I know I said the wrong thing.\"","She leaned close to his ear and whispered, \"How could that suit compare to your tie? I just picked it out randomly, I didn't even really look at it. But your tie, I spent a long time picking it out specifically for you.\"","Seeing that the corners of the man's mouth were still tight, An Ling lowered her head again and kissed the corner of his lips, following his lead. \"Next time I won't... uh, no, I will only buy things for you from now on, okay?\"","Shen Linyan's gaze fell into her eyes. His Adam's apple bobbed, and he let out a soft \"Mhm,\" saying, \"Okay.\"","Her mind was entirely focused on coaxing her angry ex-husband, so much so that An Ling completely failed to realize that these possessive words did not fit the setting of a gentle second male lead at all.","She smiled in relief. Seeing the man leaning in for a kiss, she was about to close her eyes when she suddenly remembered something. She opened her eyes again, puffing her cheeks. \"Oh right, you're the one angry, but I haven't even gotten angry at you yet.\"","\"What?\"","An Ling looked at him, blushing as she muttered softly, \"Did you kiss my neck the night before last? There's a mark.\"","Shen Linyan paused slightly upon hearing this, his gaze falling on the woman's snow-white neck. \"Where?\"","\"Right here.\"","An Ling brushed her hair aside, voluntarily revealing the back of her neck to him.","The young woman was wearing a soft, pink V-neck sweater today, making her look entirely soft and clean. The moment she lowered her head, the necklace on her neck swayed gently, faintly revealing her delicate collarbones. That dazzling patch of fair skin glowed with a fine luster under the light, tempting one to pluck it.","Shen Linyan's pupils stiffened slightly. He forced himself to look away, the tips of his ears hidden in his hair flushing with an imperceptible redness.","The woman's confused voice came to his ears, \"Did you see it?\"","Seeing the band-aid on the woman's neck, his Adam's apple rolled up and down. He reached out, his fingertips gently stroking over it as he said softly, \"Sorry, I might have accidentally used a bit too much force.\"","\"My brother saw it yesterday, but thankfully I managed to fool him.\"","An Ling let her hair down again and spoke with a smile, completely oblivious to the dark undercurrents in the man's eyes.","She seriously emphasized, \"In the future, you can't leave marks when you kiss. It's a good thing my brother was the one who saw it. If my parents had seen it, I really wouldn't be able to explain it. They would definitely ask...\"","Before she could finish her sentence, she was suddenly interrupted by the man's soft voice.","\"Then what if I kiss places they can't see?\"","An Ling's expression instantly froze. She opened her mouth hesitantly, \"...What?\"","The next second, her waist was gently pulled in by a powerful arm.","Before An Ling could react, her eyes suddenly widened. A hand nimbly slipped in from the hem of her sweater. The man's scorching palm pressed against her slender waist, carrying a layer of rough, thin calluses.","The pads of his fingers rubbed against her delicate skin, sending a shudder through her entire body. A fine trembling spread from her waist and abdomen to every part of her limbs.","An Ling's face flushed bright red, and her breath caught. She hurriedly pressed down on his arm, stammering, \"You...\"","The man lifted his head, his hot, heavy breath dusting her neck. He kissed along her jawline bit by bit, his eyes dark and burning with desire as he hoarsely repeated.","\"If it's in places they can't see, can I leave marks?\""]},{"number":81,"title":"Chapter 81: Staying Here Tonight","paragraphs":["The light refracted by the crystal chandelier in the living room was soft.","On the soft leather sofa, a woman was kneeling on a man's lap. Her waist was slender and supple, so small it could be held in one hand.","The man's arm slipped beneath the hem of her clothes. With a slight press of his long, slender fingers, the woman instantly went limp in his arms.","An Ling's breath trembled as a strange sensation spread throughout her body, bringing a flush to the corners of her eyes. She pressed down on the man's arm. Her beautiful face looked even more stunning, and she gazed at him with tear-misted eyes. \"You can't.\"","An Ling had an inexplicable premonition that if she allowed Shen Linyan to continue this time, things would truly spiral out of control.","The scent of citrus in the air grew stronger, tightly intertwining with him.","Shen Linyan slowly withdrew his hand, lowered his head, and kissed the corner of her eye.","\"Alright, don't be afraid.\"","Lingling's lower back was very sensitive.","The man's voice was hoarse as he coaxed her in a low whisper, opening his mouth to gently take her lower lip. \"Lingling, I'll just kiss you.\"","An Ling looked at him, panting, her face flushed red. She suddenly bit him, the end of her sentence turning soft. \"If you're going to kiss me, then just kiss me. Why do you always just kiss the outside? I don't want to kiss anymore.\"","Even with the simplest pressing of lips against lips, Shen Linyan could kiss her endlessly.","It was like this every time, teasing her until she wanted to kiss him. An Ling had wanted to bring this up for a long time.","\"Shen Linyan, do you not know how to... mm!\"","Before she could finish her sentence, the back of her head was cupped, and the crisp scent of cedar enveloped her.","The tip of the man's tongue forcefully pried her teeth apart. His movements lacked their usual restrained gentleness, replaced instead by an almost ferocious plunder.","He nimbly hooked her tongue, their lips and teeth intertwining, their breaths scorching.","The saliva she didn't have time to swallow was swept away by the man. An Ling gripped his clothes tightly, forced to lower her head and open her mouth.","The night wind outside the window was freezing, while the indoor air was damp and hot. Fine beads of sweat broke out on her forehead.","When her lips were finally released, the man lowered his head and rubbed his nose against hers. His dark hair fell loosely over his forehead, and his eyes were deep. A trace of lust tainted his usually aloof and noble face. His voice was husky, carrying more sex appeal than usual. \"Do you like it like this?\"","An Ling's face was flushed. She pursed her numb lips and secretly glared at him. \"No, I don't!\"","She had thought Shen Linyan didn't know how to kiss, but how could this man be so good at it!?","Didn't they agree that it was the first time for both of them? Why was she the only one acting like a complete novice?","The man chuckled and leaned in to kiss the corner of her lips again.","An Ling looked up at the clock on the wall. The sticky sweat on her back made her very uncomfortable.","\"I need to go home. I'm all sweaty.\"","The man wrapped his arm around her lower back, his eyes curving into a smile as he spoke softly, \"Are you staying here tonight? I had Auntie Cheng tidy up the room.\"","\"?\"","An Ling blinked, wearing a little expression that plainly said, \"What are you talking about?\"","The man smiled and kissed her eyes. \"I'm joking. I just feel that it's tiring for my wife to travel back and forth like this.\"","\"Even so, I can't. I have to work tomorrow.\"","She removed his arm, stood up, and looked down to straighten her clothes. \"Besides, I told An Zhou that I was having dinner with Wen Yuche tonight. How could I possibly stay out all night?\"","Remembering that Shen Linyan didn't know who Wen Yuche was, she added an explanation, \"Wen Yuche is my blind date.\"","Shen Linyan's expression paused slightly.","His gaze fell on the woman's neck. After a moment of silence, he stood up to help her fix her hair. His long fingers reached around the side of her neck, his fingertips lingering on the bandage.","An Ling looked up in confusion. \"What's wrong?\"","\"You said before that you would only buy things for me...\"","The man spoke slowly, \"Can I interpret that as you agreeing to remarry me?\"","An Ling blinked, saying nothing.","A few seconds later, her eyes curved into a smile as she cupped his face. \"Now it is. I thought about it carefully. Our Chairman Shen is handsome and kind. Having a husband like this is pretty nice.\"","She stood on her tiptoes, kissed him on the cheek, and teased, \"So Chairman Shen needs to get those shares quickly. If you drag it out too long, I might just stop liking you.\"","Shen Linyan's eyes darkened slightly, and he lowered his gaze to hide his emotions. Smiling, he tucked a strand of hair behind her ear and leaned down to kiss her. \"Alright, I'll take my wife home.\"","...","Afraid of being seen by her family, An Ling asked Shen Linyan to just park the car by the side of the road. She unbuckled her seatbelt.","\"I'll get off here. It's only a short walk, I can go the rest of the way myself. You should head back soon.\"","\"Alright, goodbye, my wife.\"","\"Goodbye.\"","The car door closed. Shen Linyan sat in the car, quietly watching the woman's retreating back.","Halfway down the road, the woman suddenly stopped. She turned around and waved at him. Under the dim yellow streetlights, her hair was dyed gold, and the light and shadows outlined her smiling eyes.","Shen Linyan was momentarily stunned, and then the corners of his lips curled up. He was just about to raise his hand when, in the very next second, his movement abruptly stopped.","A black Mercedes pulled up next to the woman.","The window rolled down, and a man's hand reached out from inside, waving at An Ling with a natural and familiar gesture.","The smile in Shen Linyan's eyes slowly vanished, his lips pressing into a straight line. His pitch-black eyes stared at the distant sedan, a profound emotion swirling in their depths as his long fingertips lightly tapped the steering wheel.","...","\"An Ling!! Ha! So you're here, you brat!\"","Hearing An Zhou's shout, An Ling covered her ears. \"What do you want? This is the way home. If I'm not here, where else would I be?\"","An Zhou clamped down on his cigarette and laughed out of sheer frustration. \"Unbelievable. I asked you to help me, and you just ran off. Do you have any idea how I suffered through these past few hours?\"","\"I was just having dinner with someone,\" An Ling replied casually. \"How did your blind date go, anyway?\"","She brushed him off while catching a glimpse of Shen Linyan's direction from the corner of her eye. Seeing that his car was still parked there, she hid her hand behind her back and discreetly waved for him to leave.","An Zhou rested his arm on the car window. Noticing her thin clothes, he flicked his cigarette ash. \"Did Wen Yuche drop you off? Why are you walking around out here? Get in the car first, I'll tell you about it in a minute.\"","How could that guy be so clueless? Didn't he know he was supposed to drop her right at the door?","Once she saw Shen Linyan leave, An Ling walked over to the passenger side and got in. \"Alright, spill it. How was Miss Qin?\"","An Zhou deadpanned two words: \"An iceberg.\"","Who on earth described her as introverted? Was this what people called introverted??","His face was practically cramping from smiling so much, yet that spoiled heiress sitting across from him hadn't cracked a single smile the entire time.","If he weren't such a gentleman, he would have walked out ages ago.","In the end, just to complete his mission, they even went to see a movie. She didn't say a single word the whole time, and he didn't even dare to laugh at the funny parts.","Whatever. Now that this blind date was over, he was finally free.","An Ling caught sight of the bouquet in the backseat. \"You didn't give her the flowers?\"","\"She said she's allergic to pollen.\"","\"Oh.\" An Ling nodded in realization. \"Well, no wonder. You couldn't even get the gift right, how could you expect her to smile at you?\"","\"...\"","A trace of doubt crept into An Zhou's mind as he looked up at the rearview mirror. Was that really why?","He dropped the subject and asked instead, \"Anyway, I'm out of the running. But it seems you and that Wen Yuche guy are getting along pretty well? You actually went out for a second dinner with him today. See? I was right to drag you along with me back then.\"","\"...\"","An Ling coughed guiltily and stayed quiet.","She looked out the window and asked tentatively, \"Brother, let me ask you a question.\"","\"What is it?\"","\"Why are you so hostile towards Shen Linyan?\"","An Zhou slammed on the brakes and stared at her completely deadpan.","\"Do you have any idea how many projects that bastard has stolen from us?\"","The only reason Shen Linyan was able to firmly secure his position as the chairman of the Shen Group was because of the tens of millions in profits he had brought to the company.","And those profits didn't just come from snatching projects from other companies—even their own family, despite being in-laws, hadn't been spared from his ruthlessness."]},{"number":82,"title":"Chapter 82: To Marry","paragraphs":["An Ling had never heard of such a thing before, and hearing it now gave her a very strange feeling.","She naturally believed what An Zhou said; this was the family business, so he couldn't be joking about it. Yet, she also felt this was completely out of character for Shen Linyan.","But it made sense. Being kind-hearted didn't mean being stupid. Shen Linyan must have a good head for business, otherwise, Father Shen wouldn't have let him act as the acting chairman.","An Zhou parked the car and noticed her thoughtful expression.","\"That's why I told you long ago that the guy is no good. He didn't approach you with good intentions. If you remarry him, I might as well pack up the An Corporation and hand it right over to him, saving him the trouble of scheming to cheat you out of your feelings and money.\"","\"...\"","An Ling unbuckled her seatbelt and stammered, \"Then what if Shen Linyan said he would give me shares if I remarry him?\"","An Zhou chuckled and replied without hesitation, \"Don't even think about it. Impossible. He definitely planted a trap in the contract.\"","An Ling blinked.","Could that be? Shen Linyan had always been able to do everything he promised her.","Before, she had jokingly asked him for two hundred million, and when they divorced, he actually gave it to her.","Afraid that saying too much would give her away, An Ling could only nod, pretending to agree as she got out of the car.","After entering the house, Mother An and Father An were sitting on the sofa watching TV.","Seeing them return together, Mother An turned her head and asked, \"How come you two came back together? Did you siblings go on blind dates together today?\"","An Zhou unbuttoned his suit jacket, sat on the sofa, and couldn't wait to say, \"Not at all. Mom, let's get this straight first. I've already tried my best, but she completely ignored me. You can't arrange any more for me.\"","Mother An shot him a sideways glance. \"Looks like you blew it?\"","That was a given.","An Zhou held his forehead with a distressed look. \"Yeah, yeah. There's nothing I can do. You know you can't force feelings.\"","Father An was peeling an orange next to them. After peeling it, he handed it to Mother An. \"But Qin You said she is very satisfied with you.\"","\"??\"","An Zhou's expression froze. \"Huh?\"","How was that possible???","That iceberg of a young lady was satisfied with him?","An Ling sat on a small sofa to the side, also bent over to grab an orange, and smiled. \"Haha, congratulations, brother.\"","\"...\"","An Zhou frowned. \"That's impossible, right? Mom, Dad, don't lie to me. She didn't even speak to me.\"","\"It's true.\" Mother An took out her phone to show him. \"She even said she is open to getting married right away.\"","An Zhou's eyelid twitched. \"...Married?\"","Mother An turned to look at Father An. \"Looks like we can buy a marital home. Where should we buy it? We'll have to ask Youyou for her thoughts when the time comes.\"","She was already calling her Youyou???","What in the world was going on?","An Zhou's head spun. \"Wait a minute, you guys. Ask me! I'm the one getting married!\"","Mother An: \"You don't agree?\"","Father An: \"She didn't even despise you, and you still have something to complain about?\"","An Ling: \"Exactly, exactly.\"","An Zhou: \"...\"","An Ling, you're just gloating over there, aren't you?","He leaned back and decided to throw her under the bus too.","\"Mom, An Ling went out for a second dinner with her blind date today. I think they have a pretty good chance too.\"","Hearing this, Mother An turned to look at An Ling. \"Lingling, did you meet with Xiao Wen?\"","An Ling blinked. \"I did. As friends.\"","Mother An smiled and nodded. \"Good.\"","An Zhou: \"?\"","Seeing his bewildered face, An Ling stood up and smiled as she patted her clothes.","\"Oh, right, brother, I forgot to mention. I'm not quite like you. I went to make a friend, not for a blind date.\"","An Zhou was dumbfounded. \"???\"","He turned his head in shock. \"Mom, Dad, what does this mean?!\"","Mother An turned a deaf ear and casually stood up to head upstairs. \"I'm sleepy. Lao An, we should go to bed too.\"","Father An also stood up and followed. \"Alright.\"","Only An Zhou was left in the living room, sitting on the sofa in a daze.","Had he... been set up??","...","Qin You agreed to marry An Zhou, and the two families arranged to have dinner together next week.","As the future mother-in-law, Mother An naturally had to buy a gift for Qin You.","\"Mrs. An, we've recently stocked a lot of new jewelry. Would you like to see if anything catches your eye?\"","Mother An sat on the sofa and took the tablet handed to her by the salesperson.","She picked up the cup from the table and casually swiped on the screen.","Her gaze landed on a violet jadeite necklace priced at 6.8 million. The purple color would actually suit Qin You quite well—cool, elegant, and the price was reasonable enough.","She took a sip of tea and signaled to the salesperson beside her. \"Please wrap this one up for me, along with the earrings from the same collection.\"","\"Right away, Mrs. An.\"","The salesperson got up and left.","Mother An put down her teacup and picked up her phone to call Mrs. Wen.","When the call connected, she smiled and said, \"Mrs. Wen, would you like to come over to my house later to play mahjong? A few other ladies will be there too.\"","Mrs. Wen's voice came from the other end. \"Sure. By the way, Mingyue, after Lingling and Yuche went on their blind date last time, did Lingling say anything?\"","Mingyue was Mother An's name.","Mother An's tone was cheerful. \"Lingling said she and Yuche are going to be friends. It seems the two kids are getting along pretty well.\"","\"That boy Yuche didn't even want to go at first, but after he came back, he specifically asked me about Lingling,\" Mrs. Wen laughed.","As she spoke, she suddenly paused and lowered her voice. \"Um, Mingyue, about Lingling's ex-husband... Isn't that Shen Linyan? Did they really have an amicable divorce?\"","Mother An's expression tightened slightly, and she gave a soft \"Mm.\" \"It was an amicable divorce. Don't worry, it's all in the past. The two of them have nothing to do with each other now.\"","Mrs. Wen's tone noticeably relaxed. \"Hahaha, I was just asking. I said those past news stories were fake anyway. I watched Lingling grow up; how could something like that ever happen?\"","Seeing the salesperson walking over, Mother An found an excuse to hang up, her tone gentle. \"I still have some things to take care of while I'm out. I'll chat with you later when I get home.\"","She put down her phone and noticed the salesperson's hands were empty.","Before she could ask, the salesperson spoke up first, her expression showing difficulty and apology.","\"Um... I'm so sorry, Mrs. An. It was my oversight. The jewelry piece you wanted is no longer available, and neither is the rest of the collection.\"","Mother An was taken aback. She picked up the tablet and swiped left and right. \"Are these imperial green jadeite pieces gone too?\"","\"Yes.\"","What unfortunate timing.","Mother An waved her hand and sighed. \"Never mind, never mind. If they come back in stock, let me know. By the day after tomorrow at the latest.\"","If not, she would just have to find something else as a substitute.","She picked up her bag and walked toward the exit of the store, but then her footsteps suddenly halted, a trace of surprise flashing across her face.","A man in a sharp suit was standing at the entrance of the store. It was unclear when he had arrived. His posture was tall and straight, exuding a natural aura of noble elegance.","Seeing her there, the man showed no surprise on his face, as if he had anticipated it all along.","He curled his lips slightly, his expression gentle.","\"Auntie, is it convenient for you to have a chat with me right now?\"","Mother An's expression was somewhat subtle. After a moment of silence, she finally sighed and agreed.","\"Let's go, Chairman Shen.\""]},{"number":83,"title":"Chapter 83: I Want to Remarry An Ling","paragraphs":["In the quiet cafe, soothing music was playing.","\"Auntie, just calling me Linyan is fine.\"","Hearing the man's words, Mother An paused her movements.","She put down the cup in her hand and smiled, \"Let's not. After all, Chairman Shen is no longer my son-in-law, so it is better for me to address you respectfully.\"","She looked down at her phone to check the time. \"Is there something Chairman Shen wants to talk to me about? Just say it directly.\"","This behavior clearly showed she did not want to say much to the man.","Shen Linyan noticed her cold attitude, and his expression paused slightly.","He lowered his eyes and said gently, \"Auntie, I want to remarry An Ling.\"","As soon as these words came out, Mother An's gaze froze slightly.","For a moment, she didn't know whether to call Shen Linyan straightforward or just too foolish, not even knowing how to lay the groundwork.","\"I do not agree.\"","She didn't ask for reasons, didn't ask why, just refused without hesitation.","Shen Linyan's eyelashes trembled. He rubbed his ring finger without speaking, as if he had already guessed this answer.","Just as Mother An was about to get up and leave, the man's voice sounded, \"I can give the Shen Corporation's shares to An Ling.\"","Her movements stagnated slightly. After being silent for a long while, she sat back down.","Leaning against the back of the chair, she slowly said, \"Shen Linyan, An Zhou told me that you are quite ruthless in business.\"","The man's posture stiffened, his lack of response seemingly a tacit admission.","Mother An changed the subject, \"But I don't understand these things, and I didn't listen carefully when he talked about them. What I mean is, money is not the reason for my disagreement.\"","Looking at the man in front of her, Mother An's tone softened a bit, \"Shen Linyan, Lingling told me that she was the one who first brought up the divorce. She told you she didn't want to stay in the Shen family, and you agreed. Then don't bring her back to the Shen family again.\"","\"As a mother, I don't want to see my child return to the place that once dragged her deep into the mud.\"","Marrying into the Shen family only left An Ling with rumors and gossip.","Even now, those things still follow her.","The moment she saw Shen Linyan, Mother An had actually guessed it would be about this.","At that time in the living room, An Zhou and his father both thought Shen Linyan was lying when he said he liked An Ling.","But she could tell that Shen Linyan was not lying.","It just looked a bit fake because his expression was somewhat unfamiliar and awkward.","\"That girl is soft-hearted towards people close to her. Seeing you like this, she would definitely agree. But you also know that Lingling listens to me more, which is why you came to find me.\"","Mother An slowly stood up, her voice softening.","\"But, I'm sorry, Shen Linyan. Auntie is already traumatized by this, so I won't agree to your remarriage. I would rather she marry an ordinary person.\"","Marry without any conflicts of interest, without any gossip, and live happily like an ordinary person.","The air was quiet for a moment before the man raised his head.","\"I understand.\"","No joy or anger could be seen on his face. His eyes and brows were as gentle as ever. He curled his lips and said softly, \"I am very sorry to take up your time. Please do not tell An Ling about today's matter. As compensation, I will have someone deliver that set of jade to your home.\"","After watching the man leave in his car, Mother An took out her phone and texted An Ling.","[Lingling, are you coming home for dinner tonight?]","An Ling: [Probably, what's wrong, Mom?]","[Nothing, just asking. If you have to work overtime, remember to let me know.]","An Ling replied okay and put her phone back in her bag.","She put on her hat and got out of the car with Nan Zhechuan.","Nan Zhechuan seemed a little nervous. He turned his head and asked her, \"Is it really okay?\"","\"It's fine.\"","An Ling directly raised her hand and pressed the doorbell.","The auntie's voice came from the other side, \"Who is it?\"","\"Hello,\" Nan Zhechuan spoke. \"I am the producer of the show. I came here this time to talk to Mrs. Shen about what she mentioned last time.\"","\"Oh, it's the producer. Come in then.\"","The front door opened, and An Ling and Nan Zhechuan went in together.","In the living room, Mother Shen was sitting on the sofa sipping tea. Seeing two people come in, her expression showed a momentary stun.","\"And the person next to you is...?\"","Nan Zhechuan hurriedly introduced, \"This is also the producer in charge of Miss Shen. She had something to do and couldn't attend last time.\"","Mother Shen nodded and gestured to the auntie, \"Auntie, pour tea for the two producers.\"","Nan Zhechuan sat on the sofa and carefully handed over a document. \"Um, Madam Shen, our team thought about the proposal you mentioned last time, and I'm afraid it's still not quite suitable.\"","Hearing this, the gentleness on Mother Shen's face instantly faded a bit.","She didn't speak, just lowered her eyes and lightly picked up the teacup from the table to take a sip.","\"Not suitable?\"","She glanced over with condescending arrogance. \"The producer doesn't seem to understand what I meant. I didn't consider that a proposal.\"","Nan Zhechuan looked troubled. \"This... mainly...\"","\"My daughter didn't even refuse, so the producer doesn't need to be so dutiful, right?\"","Mother Shen interrupted him, put down her teacup, and said with a half-smile, \"It wasn't easy for the show to get to this point. I also invested in it, and I even recommended some of your sponsors. So let's not make things difficult for everyone.\"","Anyone could hear the explicit and implicit threats in these words.","Seeing the man's face stiffen, the smile on Mother Shen's lips turned mocking as she slowly lowered her eyes and took a sip of tea.","At this time, the woman wearing a hat next to him suddenly reached out and took the document back, her voice calm under the mask.","\"Since we can't come to an agreement, I will apply with Miss Shen to change the shooting location back to the original place.\"","As soon as she said this, Mother Shen's movements suddenly stopped.","After hearing the content clearly, she frowned, automatically ignoring the slightly familiar tone of the woman's voice, and slammed the cup onto the table with a bang.","\"Change locations!? I do not agree!\"","\"Mrs. Shen, your proposal will cause huge losses to the show, and it's not just a matter of money, so we cannot agree.\"","The woman raised her head, revealing clear and clean eyes under the brim of her hat, \"Moreover, no one wants to watch Lu Jingshen.\"","Mother Shen's eyelids twitched.","Was it an illusion? Why did this woman give her a familiar feeling?","\"A lowly producer like you dares to speak to me like this?? Believe it or not, I will withdraw my investment!\"","The woman's attitude remained unchanged, \"I have already said it, this is not a matter of money.\"","The reputation that Ms. Chen had built up over many years in the industry could not be ruined by this variety show.","Mother Shen's eyes turned cold and she said sternly, \"What is your name? From now on, you don't need to be in charge of this anymore.\"","When she was out and about, who dared not give her some face? Since when did a lowly employee dare to talk back to her?","Hearing this, the woman looked up at her, slowly took off her hat and mask, revealed that familiar and beautiful face, and smiled brightly with curved eyes.","\"Whether I am in charge or not, I'm afraid it has nothing to do with Mrs. Shen.\"","Mother Shen's pupils shrank, and then her face instantly darkened as she gritted her back teeth.","\"An Ling!? Why is it you?\""]},{"number":84,"title":"Chapter 84: Oh my god, it's so thrilling","paragraphs":["\"Why is it impossible?\"","An Ling smiled without her eyes reaching them. \"But I suppose Mrs. Shen wouldn't want to catch up with me anyway, so let's get down to business. This time, our shoot will solely focus on Shen Fuyuan.\"","Mother Shen spoke without a second thought, \"Shen Fuyuan is withdrawing from this shoot. She's not doing it.\"","What a joke. If she had known it was An Ling, she wouldn't have let Shen Fuyuan take this variety show no matter what.","That foolish girl wouldn't even realize it when An Ling schemed against her.","An Ling expected her to say this. \"Whether she withdraws or not is up to Shen Fuyuan and the company behind her. It's best if Mrs. Shen doesn't interfere.\"","Mother An's tone grew heavier. \"I am her mother! What right do you have to tell me not to interfere!? I will find her another variety show to shoot!\"","\"If Shen Fuyuan withdraws, then she will have to bear all the consequences.\"","An Ling said indifferently, \"The entire team has been preparing for months, and the guest list has already been announced. If Miss Shen unilaterally withdraws, leaving aside the financial losses, her reputation in the industry is already poor. Once this gets out, I can hardly guarantee what the internet will say about her.\"","At this point, An Ling raised her eyes to look at Mother Shen.","Her gaze was calm as she enunciated every word:","\"Or is it that Mrs. Shen doesn't care about her own daughter's reputation?\"","Just like how she hadn't cared about Shen Linyan's reputation back then. As long as it benefited Lu Jingshen, the reputations of her eldest son and youngest daughter could both be discarded.","Hearing this, Mother Shen's expression suddenly froze.","The atmosphere in the living room stiffened slightly. Beside them, Nan Zhechuan kept his head down, completely afraid to speak.","The expression on Mother Shen's face shifted constantly as she glared fixedly at An Ling in front of her.","After a long silence, she sneered and gritted her teeth to issue a harsh warning.","\"An Ling, I'm warning you. You'd better not play any little tricks during the shoot. If anything happens, I absolutely won't let you off.\"","Hearing this, An Ling's eyes paused in a daze.","After reacting for a few seconds, she suddenly turned her head away and let out an ambiguous laugh.","She lowered her eyes, picked up the documents, and spoke in a cold tone.","\"You should keep those words for yourself. You are the most annoying one.\"","Having said that, she stood up and walked toward the door.","Hearing this, anger instantly surged in Mother Shen's heart. \"What did you say?!\"","She conveniently grabbed the teacup on the table and threw it at the woman without hesitation.","Nan Zhechuan subconsciously cried out, \"Ah Leng!\"","An Ling had long guessed what she was going to do again. She leaned sideways and dodged it slightly. With a crash, the porcelain cup smashed to pieces on the floor.","She glanced at the shards on the floor, then raised her head expressionlessly. \"This trick again, is it interesting?\"","She could already predict it.","An Ling walked back to the sofa, bent down, and picked up a teacup from the table. Her voice was indifferent. \"The first time, for the sake of you being Shen Linyan's mother, I didn't bother to argue with you.\"","She slowly raised her eyes.","\"But now, I am not your daughter-in-law.\"","Mother Shen watched the woman walking toward her, her gaze falling on the teacup in her hand. Her eyes widened, her face filled with disbelief. \"What are you trying to do!?\"","She backed away and hurriedly turned her head, shouting loudly, \"Auntie! Auntie!\"","But as her voice fell, warm tea was instantly poured down from the top of her head. Her exquisitely styled hair was ruined, a few strands sticking to her forehead, leaving her face in a wretched state.","Mother Shen hurriedly raised her hand to wipe the tea off her face, her expression twisted.","\"An Ling!! You woman, you have such nerve!\"","Hearing the woman's furious roar, An Ling lazily held the teacup, pretending not to hear.","She tilted her head and glanced at the rushing Auntie. \"What? Do you want to be splashed too?\"","The Auntie instantly froze in place, not daring to step forward.","At this moment, footsteps came from the stairs.","She looked up casually and happened to meet Zhou Wen's shocked and astonished eyes. She was still wearing her pajamas.","It seemed she had run down after hearing the commotion.","An Ling put down the teacup. \"Alright, we're even.\"","She called out to Nan Zhechuan, who was completely dumbfounded. \"Let's go.\"","Nan Zhechuan snapped back to reality and hurriedly nodded. \"Okay.\"","Oh my god, that was too thrilling!","Zhou Wen hesitated for a moment but still ran down. She raised her hand to block the way, trapping An Ling between the coffee table and the sofa, and pursed her lips.","\"An Ling, what is the meaning of this? How could you raise your hand against Mom?\"","An Ling really didn't want to clash head-on with this female lead. She looked down at the time. \"It means exactly what it looks like. I'm very busy and really have to go. I have things to do later.\"","Zhou Wen glanced at Mother Shen behind her, clenched her palms tightly, frowned, and spoke in a somewhat preachy tone.","\"An Ling, when you were married to Big Brother before, you did so many bad things, and Mom handled them all for you. How can you treat Mom like this now? I didn't even tell Mom and Jingshen about how you tried to sow discord last time, just to save you some face. How could you be like this?\"","An Ling: ?","Sow discord?","An Ling was stunned for a moment, and when she suddenly realized what the other party was talking about, she couldn't help but laugh.","\"No, are you sick in the head?\"","Well then, she had kindly told Zhou Wen about Mother Shen's true colors, and it turned out the other person thought she was sowing discord.","Although she was indeed sowing discord, she didn't expect Zhou Wen to be so dead-set on Mother Shen, trusting her completely and unconditionally.","She turned her head to glance at Mother Shen, who was wiping her face with a towel, and then looked at Zhou Wen blocking the way here, lifting her chin.","\"Alright, hurry up and go comfort your mom. I really have to go.\"","But Zhou Wen was unusually stubborn, biting her lip. \"You must apologize to Mom before you can go! Otherwise, I won't let you leave! You've really gone too far this time.\"","\"...Are you going to move or not?\"","\"No! Apologize to Mom!\"","\"...\"","Toxic.","What a waste of time.","An Ling couldn't be bothered to say another word and pushed her away directly.","Even though she clearly didn't use much force, Zhou Wen staggered and fell to the ground.","Her hem caught Nan Zhechuan's teacup, causing the cup to roll off the table. Tea instantly splashed onto her pajamas, and the previously broken porcelain shards cut her palm. Zhou Wen instantly cried out, tears welling up in her eyes.","An Ling's movements paused, and she cast a confused glance.","She hadn't used much force, right?","And at this moment, the sound of the door opening came from the entrance.","As the footsteps approached, a man's tall and straight figure appeared in the living room.","The scene instantly quieted down.","An Ling met the man's gaze, then glanced at Zhou Wen on the floor, the expression on her face slowly fading.","Oh, it seemed that not only had she heard the commotion, but she had also tipped someone off.","With this scene, even she felt like a vicious supporting female character herself.","Seeing the man, the bottom of Zhou Wen's eyes lit up imperceptibly. She bit her lip, her fair face looking even more pitiful and delicate. With teary eyes, her voice carried a somewhat helpless sob.","\"Big Brother, An Ling poured water on Mom. I asked her to apologize, but she won't.\"","As she spoke, she struggled to stand up from the floor, pulled the glass shard out of her palm, and gasped in pain.","Blood flowed down, and the wound on Zhou Wen's palm was shocking to see. Her pajamas were wet, her hair slipped off her shoulders, and her lips were pursed. Her petite figure and pitiful appearance strongly evoked a desire to protect her.","Shen Linyan took a look at the wound on her palm. After lingering for a moment, his gaze slowly shifted to the woman in the center of the living room.","An Ling stood in place, her beautiful face devoid of expression, and calmly met his gaze.","\"Why are you looking at me?\"","\"Are you hurt?\"","Their voices rang out at almost the exact same moment."]},{"number":85,"title":"Chapter 85: Since when did you have the right to meddle in my affairs","paragraphs":["Hearing the man's words, let alone Mother Shen and Zhou Wen, even An Ling was stunned.","The words she had prepared couldn't be spoken.","Shouldn't they pretend not to know each other at a time like this?","Glancing at Mother Shen, who hadn't yet reacted, she found it hard to suppress the corners of her mouth. She turned her head and coughed to cover it up, \"No.\"","Since Shen Linyan was acting like this, she wouldn't care either.","As the two brushed past each other, An Ling suddenly stopped and turned her head:","\"Regarding today's matter, I hope Chairman Shen will separate public and private affairs. Personal grudges shouldn't involve work.\"","Her tone was polite and distant, but secretly, her fingers quietly hooked the man's hand.","The moment the soft, warm touch enveloped him, the man's figure paused.","His slender fingers quietly tightened around the woman's hand.","His expression was calm, his voice gentle: \"Rest assured, Miss An.\"","Seeing An Ling leave just like that, Mother Shen threw away the towel in her hand, her face gloomy. \"Shen Linyan! Target the An family right now. I want An Ling to pay the price!\"","What an arrogant thing, daring to treat her like this. Once the An family behind her falls, she would like to see who could still protect that wretched girl.","Zhou Wen kept her head down, not daring to make a sound, as blood dripped from her fingertips.","Footsteps approached from the front. Her expression shifted slightly, and she looked up, just about to say something.","However, the man took a long stride, passing right by her side. A cold sandalwood scent brushed past her nose.","A deep voice sounded from behind.","\"Mother, the An family cannot be touched right now.\"","Zhou Wen's face stiffened slightly.","After a moment, she pursed her lips, lowered her head, and quietly pulled out a tissue to wipe the blood from her palm herself.","Mother Shen was clearly dissatisfied with this answer. She frowned and was about to speak, but was interrupted by Shen Linyan's words.","\"The invitation for the Damian bidding conference has been delivered. It's scheduled for the day after tomorrow.\"","Her movements paused slightly, her gaze slowly landing on the man in front of her. Her tone brooked no argument, \"Seeing as you've been quite busy lately, let your younger brother go to this bidding conference. Your brother hasn't been in the company for long; we need to give him a chance to show himself.\"","Shen Linyan lowered his eyes and said mildly, \"I'll have Secretary Chen give it to him.\"","Mother Shen looked at her wet clothes and clicked her tongue.","Sure enough, nothing good ever happened when she ran into that girl.","While Mother Shen got up to go upstairs and change clothes, Zhou Wen saw the man was about to leave and hurriedly chased him into the courtyard to call out to him.","\"Big Brother.\"","Shen Linyan stopped his footsteps, turned his head, and stared at her with pitch-black eyes, as if asking what the matter was.","Zhou Wen looked hesitant: \"Big Brother... are you still in contact with Sister-in-law?\"","The man's tone was calm, one hand in his pocket. \"Why do you ask?\"","\"I...\" Zhou Wen clenched the tissue in her hand, her eyes darting away. \"I just feel like Big Brother has changed a lot. You weren't like this before.\"","The Shen Linyan of the past gave her a very gentle feeling, speaking with a smile. If he saw someone injured, he would absolutely not be this indifferent; at the very least, he would call the auntie to help bandage her up.","In the Shen family, apart from Lu Jingshen, Shen Linyan was the only person she could trust and rely on.","\"Big Brother used to say that Lu Jingshen's bad friends would lead him astray, and even advised me to get a divorce. Big Brother used to be such a good person. I don't know why you've become like this now. Is your current behavior... also influenced by someone?\"","Shen Linyan's tone was light: \"Are you implying that An Ling led me astray?\"","\"No, no! I, I just...\"","Zhou Wen hesitated, \"I just feel that since last time, Sister-in-law's behavior has become more and more... bold. I'm afraid that if you interact with her too much, Mom won't like it. I'm doing this for your own good. Aren't you and Sister-in-law divorced anyway?\"","If possible, she naturally hoped everything would return to normal.","She even felt that An Ling might as well revert to her old self, so that Big Brother wouldn't have this kind of change.","The living room was unusually quiet. Hearing this, the man said nothing, merely looking at her calmly. There was not a trace of emotion in those pitch-black eyes, like a dark, bottomless lake.","Zhou Wen inexplicably felt a chill down her spine and forced an awkward smile.","\"Big Brother, you...\"","\"Since when could you meddle in my affairs?\" the man suddenly interrupted her with a faint voice.","Zhou Wen's expression suddenly froze.","Immediately after, her face turned faintly pale, and she bit her lip in embarrassment, \"I just...\"","Shen Linyan looked down at his watch, his tone indifferent. \"What happens between An Ling and me is our business; it has nothing to do with you. Zhou Wen, you used to be my life assistant. You know what should and shouldn't be said. Fortunately, nothing happened today, so I'll let it slide, but there won't be a next time.\"","Watching the man leave, with her wet clothes clinging to her skin, Zhou Wen stood blankly in place. The night wind, wrapped in a biting chill, didn't clear her mind; instead, it made her head feel even more dizzy.","How did it turn out like this?","It was obviously never like this before.","...","In the car, on the way back to the company, Nan Zhechuan still hadn't recovered.","\"An Ling, you were way too brave just now. If it were me, losing eight hundred jobs wouldn't be enough.\"","But satisfaction aside, he was still a bit worried: \"However, Chairman Shen was also there. Won't you get in trouble for doing that?\"","Hearing this, An Ling snapped out of her daze, looked up, and smiled, \"It's fine.\"","Nan Zhechuan breathed a sigh of relief, \"That's good then.\"","He smiled and said with a sigh of emotion: \"Thanks to you, we were able to complete the task. But it seems Mrs. Shen still cares quite a bit about her daughter's reputation. Looking at her attitude, I originally thought she would refuse.\"","An Ling's expression paused slightly. She lowered her eyes and chuckled softly.","\"Yes, I didn't expect it either.\"","Faced with her daughter's reputation, Mother Shen ultimately chose to compromise, not wanting to blow things out of proportion.","But when it came to Shen Linyan, she could completely disregard him.","Nan Zhechuan held the steering wheel. \"Are you going back to the company? Or straight home? I was planning to take you home, but Sister Lin Ya is out having dinner with investors. Ms. Chen is a bit worried and asked me to go over later, so I might not have time to drive you back.\"","\"Having dinner with investors?\" An Ling looked up in surprise. \"Just Sister Lin Ya alone?\"","\"Originally Ms. Chen was supposed to go too, but Ms. Chen suddenly had something come up tonight and couldn't make it. The other colleagues have also gotten off work.\"","An Ling felt a bit of novelty. After all, she used to stay at home every day and only heard her brother and Shen Linyan talk about business dinners; she had never truly experienced one herself.","She hesitated for a moment, then turned her head and asked tentatively, \"Then can I go along? I can look out for her, and anyway, I don't have anything going on tonight.\"","Hearing this, Nan Zhechuan froze for a moment. He turned his head to meet the woman's expectant eyes, and the words on the tip of his tongue were forcefully swallowed back.","His expression was bizarre.","No way? How could someone actually look forward to going to a business dinner??"]},{"number":86,"title":"Chapter 86: I Saw An Ling","paragraphs":["The car stopped at the entrance of the Golden Palace. An Ling unbuckled her seatbelt and got out.","She looked up at the familiar clubhouse in front of her.","It was exactly as Shen Linyan had said; socializing was all about drinking.","Arriving at the door of the private room, Nan Zhechuan saw Lin Ya standing there and walked over. \"Sister Lin Ya.\"","An Ling also called out, \"Sister Lin Ya.\"","Lin Ya nodded, took An Ling's hand, and lowered her voice. \"Don't say anything when we go in later. Let me handle it. If they ask you to drink, just listen to me.\"","An Ling nodded in agreement.","Entering the private room, a middle-aged man sat on the sofa in the center. He was slightly plump, with his suit jacket draped over the sofa. His sleeves were rolled up as he poured wine, and a luxury watch rested on his wrist. He was dressed like a boss, but An Ling couldn't help but feel he looked like a nouveau riche.","Seeing Lin Ya enter, the middle-aged man smiled and waved. \"Director Lin is here! Come, come, have a seat.\"","Lin Ya walked over and politely shook his hand with a smile. \"President Song, Mr. Chen had something come up at the last minute and couldn't make it today. I hope you can understand.\"","\"I understand, I understand. Mr. Chen is a busy man,\" the middle-aged man laughed heartily.","His gaze fell on the two people behind her, pausing slightly as it lingered on An Ling's face.","\"And who might these two be?\"","Lin Ya turned to introduce them. \"These two are producers from our company.\"","\"Ah Leng, Nan Zhechuan, this is President Song.\"","The smile on the middle-aged man's face deepened. \"So they are producers. Director Lin's company is full of hidden talents; even the producers look like celebrities.\"","His smile seemed amiable, but his gaze unashamedly fixed on An Ling's face.","An Ling stood where she was, feeling that sticky gaze landing on her skin as if it had physical substance. The blatant appraisal gave her a sickening feeling of physiological discomfort.","Her expression remained unchanged as she stood there calmly.","Lin Ya discreetly blocked the man's line of sight, picking up a wine glass and smiling to change the subject. \"President Song flatters me. How has business been lately? Thankfully, we had your investment for the previous project. I really must toast you.\"","President Song took the glass. \"Not bad, not bad.\"","He looked at the two people by the door. \"You two producers, come and have a seat as well.\"","Lin Ya gestured for An Ling to sit next to her, then raised her glass and continued talking to the man about investments.","However, not long after they sat down, President Song's gaze suddenly landed on An Ling's face again.","He poured a glass of wine and proactively placed it in front of An Ling. \"Won't this producer have a drink?\"","The air in the private room went quiet for a moment.","Lin Ya quickly pulled the glass in front of herself and said with a smile, \"Ah Leng is still young and doesn't know how to drink. I'll drink it for her.\"","President Song's smile faded. He looked at Lin Ya, his tone ambiguous. \"What are you saying, Director Lin? If she doesn't know how to drink, she can just learn. What's the point of coming here if you don't drink? Isn't investing all about everyone being happy?\"","His words made it clear that he wanted An Ling to drink.","The atmosphere grew slightly stiff. The smile on Lin Ya's face became a bit forced, and her hand tightened slightly around her glass.","This bastard just loved to force people to drink.","Every time she went back from a social event, she had to throw up.","Just as she was about to say something, the glass in her hand was taken away, and a gentle female voice sounded in her ear. \"Give it to me, Sister Lin Ya.\"","An Ling gave her a reassuring look, sighed inwardly, tilted her head back, and downed the wine in one gulp.","No wonder Mr. Chen was worried. So this was the kind of investor they were dealing with.","How realistic.","Seeing this, the smile returned to President Song's face. \"Hey! That's more like it!\"","Seeing An Ling finish the wine, he poured her another glass, smiling so widely that the wrinkles at the corners of his eyes bunched up, revealing a shrewd glint. \"Director Lin, look at this. She clearly knows how to drink.\"","After a few glasses, An Ling felt a bit dizzy and put down her glass.","Ever since she came here to drink with Jiang Mai last time, she hadn't touched a drop of alcohol.","She gave President Song a faint smile and stood up. \"Excuse me, I need to use the restroom.\"","Nan Zhechuan, who was beside her, quickly stepped forward and took her place with a smile. \"President Song, I'll drink with you.\"","President Song frowned but still nodded reluctantly. \"Fine, fine.\"","An Ling walked out of the private room, shook her head, and went over to lean against the railing.","She glanced at the dancing crowd in the hall below, then her gaze slowly drifted to the edge of the bar. She propped her chin on her hand, a slight drunken flush on her face, and her eyes looking lazy. She mumbled, \"So this is what the angle looks like...\"","Was this where Shen Linyan stood when he watched her back then?","Her temples throbbed uncomfortably. An Ling frowned, massaged them, and took out her phone.","An Ling: Bro, are you free later? Come pick me up~","Before deciding to come here, she had let her family know.","An Zhou: Send the address. Why did you insist on going to a social event when you're perfectly fine? You're just asking for trouble.","An Ling: I was just curious. It turns out this investor likes to force people to drink. Is this what all your social events are like?","An Zhou: ?? What, An Ling, you have face blindness and you dare to drink outside?","After replying, An Zhou picked up his jacket and said to Mother An on the sofa, \"Mom, I'm going to pick up An Ling. The girl seems to have had a little to drink while out.\"","Mother An was about to nod when her gaze paused slightly on the jade jewelry box on the table.","The exquisite violet jade shone beautifully under the light, and the matching earrings were equally translucent.","This had been sent over by someone dispatched by Shen Linyan a few hours ago.","In addition to this, the other styles previously shown by the salesperson had also been sent over.","Tens of millions worth of items. The people dropped them off and left, giving her no chance to refuse.","Recalling what the man had said earlier, her expression grew serious. She suddenly stopped An Zhou, who was about to leave. \"An Zhou, wait a minute.\"","An Zhou turned around, puzzled. \"What's wrong?\"","Mother An remained silent for a few seconds, then let out a long sigh and spoke slowly.","\"Don't go. Give the address to Wen Yuche and let him go.\"","An Zhou froze for a moment.","Once he realized what she meant, his expression instantly became complicated. \"Mom, are you... deliberately trying to set them up? What about An Ling's face blindness?\"","Mother An didn't answer. She reached out to close the jade box and said gently, \"It doesn't matter. They are friends, and Xiao Wen isn't a bad person. Ling Ling can recognize him. Remember to make an excuse and tell Ling Ling you can't go.\"","An Zhou had no choice but to do as he was told.","As he sent the message, he couldn't help but click his tongue in amazement.","\"Looks like I'm not the only one being set up...\"","Meanwhile, on the other end, An Ling looked surprised when she read the name on the screen.","\"Wen Yuche is coming??\"","Why was her brother so unreliable? Always bothering other people.","She put away her phone and muttered softly, \"If I had known, I would have just asked Shen Linyan.\"","She had stayed out for a bit too long, so An Ling decided to head back to the private room.","Frowning and uncomfortably rubbing her temples, she turned around. After taking a few steps, she almost bumped into someone. She quickly looked up at the person. \"Sorry.\"","The other person seemed taken aback and replied hesitantly, \"Uh... it's okay.\"","An Ling nodded and continued walking forward.","Watching the woman's retreating back, Wang Yihong stood in place, a strange expression on his face.","\"Was that An Ling just now?\"","She looked like she had drunk quite a bit. Was she alone?","He thought for a moment, then turned around, pulled out his phone, and texted Shen Linyan.","[I saw An Ling. She's drinking at my bar.]"]},{"number":87,"title":"Chapter 87: Do you want to go home with me","paragraphs":["Returning to the private room, President Song had already collapsed on the sofa, sound asleep with his face flushed from the alcohol.","Beside him, Nan Zhechuan held a wine glass. Although his face was red, his eyes were exceptionally clear. He stood up and smugly gave President Song the middle finger.","\"Hahahaha, trying to outdrink me? Back in college, your Brother Nan could drink an entire club under the table.\"","Lin Ya hadn't drunk much this time. She helplessly massaged her temples and pressed Nan Zhechuan's arm down. \"Alright, you're going to wake him up in a minute. Hurry up and call a designated driver; we still need to get him back.\"","Noticing An Ling at the door, she quickly walked over. \"Ah Leng, are you alright?\"","An Ling smiled and waved her hand. \"I'm fine. I just feel a little dizzy, but I'm not drunk.\"","Lin Ya sighed in relief. \"The driver will be here soon. We'll drop you off first.\"","Hearing this, An Ling quickly took out her phone to show her. \"No need, no need. Someone is coming to pick me up. Sister Lin Ya, you guys can go ahead.\"","She glanced at President Song in the back. \"How did the partnership talks go?\"","\"Not bad.\" Lin Ya nodded, revealing a smile. \"At least we can report back to Ms. Chen.\"","\"Sister Lin Ya, the driver says he's downstairs.\" Nan Zhechuan's voice came from behind.","An Ling stepped aside to make room. \"You guys go first. My friend should be here soon too.\"","\"Then be careful by yourself, and remember to call me if anything happens,\" Lin Ya instructed uneasily. \"Don't just leave with anyone, and don't drink anymore.\"","\"Okay.\" An Ling smiled and nodded.","After they left, An Ling returned to the second-floor balcony where she was before. Taking out her phone, she saw the message Wen Yuche had sent her.","[I saw Brother An Zhou's address. I'll be there in about fifteen minutes.]","An Ling hesitated and tapped her phone. She sighed, a suspicion arising in her heart. \"Could An Zhou have done this on purpose?\"","Just to get back at her?","She muttered curses at An Zhou under her breath while replying to Wen Yuche.","[Okay, I'm so sorry to bother you. You really didn't have to come; I could have asked my colleagues to take me back.]","Wen Yuche: [It's no problem. I just happened to be at home with nothing to do.]","An Ling: [You really don't have to be so polite to my brother! If you have things to do, go ahead and do them!]","Wen Yuche's tone carried a hint of helplessness.","[I'm really free. Brother An Zhou probably asked me because he genuinely couldn't get away. As a friend, I'm more than happy to come pick you up.]","An Ling was out of options.","Just as she was about to turn off her phone, a new message popped up.","Shen Linyan: [Madam, want to call?]","An Ling: [But I'm outside.]","Shen Linyan: [That's okay, me too.]","But she was in a bar.","The music here was too loud; if they called, they probably wouldn't be able to hear each other anyway.","An Ling: [Let's call when I get home. I'm heading home right now ^^]","The alcohol hit her, and she yawned. Leaning against the railing, she looked at the crowd of unfamiliar faces below. To be honest, even if there was someone she knew here, she wouldn't be able to recognize them.","An Ling checked the time, already feeling a bit regretful.","If she had chosen to go home earlier, she could be on the phone with Shen Linyan right now.","She lowered her head and muttered softly, \"If I had known, I wouldn't have come to this social event. I should have just gone home.\"","Just as she finished speaking, her waist was gently wrapped by someone's arms, and the scent of cedarwood enveloped her along with a burning hot breath.","\"Then do you want to go home with me?\"","The man's deep voice carried a hint of a smile.","An Ling froze. A few seconds later, she turned around in pleasant surprise and threw her arms around the man's neck, her bright eyes blinking.","\"Why are you here?\"","The woman's cheeks were flushed pink, her eyelashes fluttering gently. Her lips were crimson, and her breath carried a faint, mellow scent of alcohol.","Shen Linyan smiled and held her waist. \"I came here to see a friend and saw my wife. Why are you here all alone?\"","An Ling felt a little embarrassed. \"You're not allowed to laugh at me. I was curious about what these social dinners were like, so I tagged along to see.\"","Speaking of the social event, she raised her head, leaned close to Shen Linyan's ear, and whispered, \"In the end, that investor even tried to force me to drink. It wasn't interesting at all.\"","Shen Linyan's movements paused slightly, though the curve of his lips remained unchanged. He lowered his head, his nose brushing past her hair, and asked in a gentle tone, \"Which company's investor?\"","\"His surname is President Song. I didn't ask much else, but anyway, Sister Lin Ya said the deal was sealed...\"","Remembering the message from just now, An Ling suddenly realized, \"So when you asked to call earlier, you did it on purpose!\"","She had wondered why Shen Linyan suddenly wanted to call, even when he was outside.","The man's eyes curved in a smile, not denying it. \"So, do you want to go home with me and call?\"","An Ling shook her head and sighed. \"No, I originally asked my brother to pick me up, but he sent Wen Yuche instead.\"","Shen Linyan held the person in his arms and glanced downstairs, his gaze landing on a certain someone. His arms tightened slightly, and his tone was soft. \"Doesn't Madam have trouble recognizing people after drinking?\"","As if sensing his gaze, that person looked up at the second floor. Upon meeting his eyes, the other man's expression abruptly froze.","Shen Linyan curled his lips and, right in front of that person, lowered his head to kiss the top of the woman's hair.","The man's face grew increasingly ugly as he took out his phone.","Completely oblivious to all this, An Ling took out her phone to check her messages. \"Yeah, so I'll ask him to wait for me outside later, that way I won't mistake him for someone else. He should be here by now.\"","Just as she finished speaking, a call came in.","The caller ID showed it was indeed Wen Yuche.","An Ling paused.","What a coincidence.","Just as she was about to answer, her chin was pinched. The man's presence pressed down, and their lips met. His breath was scorching and damp, the scent of alcohol intertwining between them.","Having drunk alcohol, An Ling's reactions were a bit sluggish. Blushing, she was pressed against the railing and kissed by the man. She whispered, \"I think he's here.\"","Shen Linyan lowered his eyes, gently kissed the corner of her mouth, and helped her hang up the phone.","\"It doesn't matter if he waits a bit, or you could tell him I'm taking you back.\"","An Ling was coaxed by the man to the point where she almost agreed.","\"No, my brother will find out.\"","The man's movements paused slightly. His dark eyes were deep in the dim light of the bar. He stared at her, his voice softening, \"Has Madam considered telling your family that we plan to remarry?\"","\"Hmm?\" An Ling blinked, smiling as she hugged his neck. \"Do you want me to tell them? My brother definitely won't agree.\"","She didn't know her parents' attitude, but she felt they probably wouldn't say much.","\"Plus, haven't you not finished sorting out the shares yet? I originally planned to wait until you were done before saying anything.\"","Shen Linyan merely lowered his head and kissed the corner of her lips. \"Whatever Madam wants is fine.\"","From the corner of his eye, he glanced downstairs at the man who was no longer visible. Retracting his gaze, he raised a hand to tidy the girl's hair. \"Alright, go home. Call me when you get there, okay?\"","An Ling nodded, \"Okay.\"","Shen Linyan watched the woman's retreating figure as she left the bar. Footsteps sounded behind him.","\"Shen Linyan, you should thank me.\"","Wang Yihong walked over nonchalantly, holding a wine glass.","The man glanced at him. \"Send me the information on that investor once you find it.\"","Wang Yihong gave an \"OK\" gesture.","He then lifted his chin. \"But who is this Wen Yuche guy? I haven't seen him before.\"","Shen Linyan lowered his head and took out a cigarette. Just as he was about to light it, he thought of something and paused his movements, saying flatly, \"He's a nobody.\"","Oh ho, looks like a love rival.","Wang Yihong was intensely intrigued; it had been a long time since he last heard Shen Linyan evaluate someone like that.","But he didn't dare fan the flames of that particular topic, so he simply changed the subject.","\"So, you're really not going to Damian's bidding conference? Lu Jingshen definitely won't win the bid anyway, so who is getting it this time?\"","Shen Linyan toyed with the cigarette in his hand.","\"The An Group.\"","\"Huh?\"","Wang Yihong whipped his head around in surprise. \"You suggested that to Damian? And he agreed? Is Damian really that comfortable handing it over to the An Group?\"","A smirk then spread across his face. \"Wow... that old hag is probably going to die of rage. Such a massive project, handed right to her former daughter-in-law.\"","The man said nothing, his silence serving as a tacit agreement.","He lowered his gaze to his empty ring finger and spoke in a quiet voice.","\"I've lost interest in playing games with them.\"","Wang Yihong froze at those words and turned to look at him.","But Shen Linyan had already turned away and was heading downstairs.","Watching the man's retreating figure, Wang Yihong took a sip of his wine and clicked his tongue.","\"The Shen Group's good days are officially over.\""]},{"number":88,"title":"Chapter 88: Shen Linyan, I can see you're genuinely looking to have an affair.","paragraphs":["Walking out of the bar, An Ling was just about to call Wen Yuche when she heard someone calling her name from ahead.","\"An Ling.\"","She looked at the man not far away and blinked.","It should be Wen Yuche.","She walked over and gave the man an apologetic smile.","\"Actually, I told you that you didn't have to come pick me up. It's too much trouble for you.\"","Whether it was an illusion or not, Wen Yuche's smile seemed a bit forced. He tightened his grip on his phone. \"It's fine. Let's get in the car first.\"","\"Okay.\"","After getting in the car, An Ling had just buckled her seatbelt when she looked up and met the man's gaze.","\"What's wrong? Is my face very red?\" She smiled and touched her own face. \"I had a few drinks.\"","The expression in Wen Yuche's eyes was complex. He looked as if he wanted to say something but hesitated, and ultimately said nothing.","Upon arriving home, An Ling was just about to get out of the car when the man's voice sounded behind her.","\"An Ling.\"","\"Hmm?\"","As soon as she turned her head, she heard Wen Yuche ask, \"How... how was your relationship with your ex-husband before?\"","Not expecting him to say this, An Ling froze. \"What's wrong?\"","Wen Yuche paused. \"Although it's a bit presumptuous to say this, I still want to tell you that Shen Linyan... is not a good person. It's best if you stay away from him.\"","An Ling stood there for a few seconds before smiling and saying, \"Thank you for bringing me back. Drive safe.\"","Without waiting for Wen Yuche to react, she closed the car door.","Standing at the door of her house, the smile on An Ling's face faded.","She turned her head to look in the direction Wen Yuche had left and frowned.","She opened the door, changed her shoes, and walked in.","In the living room, only Mother An was sitting alone on the sofa.","An Ling put down her bag and took off her coat. \"Mom, where are Dad and my brother?\"","She needed to settle a score with An Zhou.","Hearing the sound, Mother An looked away from the TV. \"They went out for a walk. Did Xiao Wen bring you back?\"","\"Yeah. If I had known my brother was busy, I wouldn't have called him. Why bother others?\"","Noticing the jade on the living room table, An Ling walked over, sat on the sofa, and picked it up curiously to look at it. \"Did you buy this for my future sister-in-law? It's very pretty. Did you buy one for yourself?\"","The young woman looked focused, her long eyelashes casting a shadow under her eyes, her aura clean and gentle.","Mother An looked at her, her eyes drifting into a daze.","It had been two years, and her daughter had finally returned to her old self.","She couldn't accept, nor could she just watch, An Ling revert to how she was before.","She withdrew her gaze and spoke softly while sitting on the sofa: \"I didn't buy this. Shen Linyan sent it.\"","An Ling's movements halted.","As if not seeing the young woman's stiff expression, Mother An reached out to turn off the TV and continued, \"Lingling, Shen Linyan came to see me. He told me he wants to remarry you.\"","The living room was exceptionally quiet for a moment, leaving only the simple sound of breathing.","An Ling looked up and was just about to open her mouth to say that she had already agreed, but Mother An spoke first:","\"I told him it's impossible.\"","\"...\"","An Ling instantly shut her mouth, blinked obediently, and pretended it was the first time she was hearing this news.","Mother An said softly, \"He also told me his conditions, but Mom isn't doing this for money. If it weren't for the fact that you insisted on marrying Shen Linyan for Lu Jingshen back then, Mom would never have agreed to that arranged marriage. Mom doesn't want you to have any more contact with the Shen family. Mom is truly scared. Just listen to Mom, okay?\"","The crystal chandelier overhead refracted a soft light, but the air carried the chill of the night, making the atmosphere in the living room slightly cold.","An Ling was just about to speak when she noticed the tears in her mother's eyes, and her gaze faltered slightly.","She put down the box in her hand, silently pulled out a tissue, and handed it over. \"Is this what Mom told Shen Linyan too?\"","Mother An took the tissue to wipe her tears. \"Yes.\"","An Ling pursed her lips.","After a few seconds of silence, she suddenly smiled and sighed. \"What's all this for? It's not a big deal. You scared me so much that I've sobered up. I promise you, aside from work, I won't have any contact with the Shen family. Alright, let's not talk about it anymore. I reek of alcohol, so I'm going upstairs first.\"","Just as she stood up, as if remembering something, she bent down and patted the box, blinking playfully. \"Oh right, since this was given by Shen Linyan, let's just keep it. It'd be a waste not to.\"","After closing her bedroom door, An Ling stood by the doorway, a thoughtful expression on her face.","A moment later, she picked up her phone, dialed a number, and walked over to sit on the soft sofa.","The call connected quickly, and the man's familiar voice came through the receiver.","\"Is Madam home?\"","An Ling picked up the diamond ring box on the table, opened it, and saw the diamond ring inside. She muttered, \"Why are you still calling me Madam? Do you think we can still remarry? Why didn't you tell me you went to see my mom?\"","She was wondering why Shen Linyan suddenly asked if they should tell her family. It turned out he was waiting for her here.","The man let out a low chuckle. \"Did Lingling ask Mom?\"","\"I didn't ask. Mom brought it up to me herself.\"","An Ling puffed out her cheeks. \"You're still laughing. Shen Linyan, I think you really just want to have a secret affair.\"","The man's tone still carried a smile. \"A secret affair is fine too. Does Madam want to sneak over to my place?\"","Why did this guy sound quite happy?","Wasn't he the one who said he wanted to remarry in the first place?","Hearing the man's laughter, An Ling didn't feel relieved inside. She hadn't expected things to turn out like this either.","Back then, she had chosen to divorce Shen Linyan because she was afraid of the plot's ending. Now that she wanted to remarry, her mom was worried she would repeat the same mistakes.","Somewhere in the unseen world, it felt as if she was deliberately being reminded of the unfortunate ending of this marriage.","After a moment of silence, An Ling lowered her eyes and pursed her lips. \"Shen Linyan, I promised Mom. Mom hasn't accepted what happened before yet. It might take some time.\"","Choosing between her family and her lover, An Ling had never thought she would fall into such a dilemma. She originally thought it would be a difficult choice for her.","But in fact, Shen Linyan had already told her the answer long ago.","The man's voice remained gentle, carrying a reassuring steadiness. \"I know. I said that whatever Madam wants is fine. I will solve this matter.\"","Her head feeling dizzy and heavy, An Ling lay on the sofa, placed the phone by her ear, closed her eyes, and suddenly said softly:","\"Shen Linyan.\"","\"Hmm?\"","\"I'm going to tell you a secret. Do you want to hear it? If you listen, you have to believe it, and you can't tell anyone else.\"","The man stood up and walked toward the kitchen, putting his phone on speaker and setting it on the table. Hearing this, he chuckled, his tone indulgent. \"Alright, I'll believe it, and I won't tell anyone else. Go ahead, Madam.\"","He picked up a cup and was just about to pour some water when An Ling's sleepy, slurred voice came through the phone.","\"Back when I divorced you, aside from not wanting to stay in the Shen family, there was actually another reason.\"","His movements abruptly froze.","But the voice on the other end of the phone continued.","\"I dreamed about our ending. In the end, you would go bankrupt and be kicked out of the Shen Group, and I would die. We were still married at the time, and I didn't want our ending to be like that.\"","\"Shen Linyan, this is the reason why I wanted you to get all the shares. I want you to be well.\"","\"Although you might think it was just a dream, I've experienced things stranger than dreams. I hope you can believe me.\"","In the silent living room, every word the woman said pierced clearly into his ears.","The man stood quietly in place, his eyes slightly downcast. The shadows cast by his prominent brow bone obscured the emotions in his eyes, and beneath his straight nose, his thin lips were pressed into a tight line.","His slender fingers set down the cup in his hand, letting out a crisp clink against the table.","The earlier amusement in his eyes had long since vanished, leaving behind only an endless, pitch-black abyss.","\"I believe you, Madam.\""]},{"number":89,"title":"Chapter 89: That's My Elder Brother's House","paragraphs":["Although she had promised her mother not to remarry Shen Linyan, perhaps because of the jade pieces Shen Linyan had sent over, An Ling could clearly feel her mother keeping a very close eye on her lately.","For the past few nights, An Zhou had been picking her up after her overtime shifts.","An Zhou didn't understand why, but he did as he was told. Every time he picked her up, he would raise his eyebrows smugly.","\"See that? Your brother treats you the best, right? That time at the bar was purely an accident, okay?\"","\"...\"","An Ling didn't say anything. She knew her mother was afraid she would run into Shen Linyan and end up agreeing to remarry him.","But honestly, it was completely unnecessary. Even if An Zhou didn't come to pick her up, she wouldn't have the time to meet with Shen Linyan anyway.","These past few days had been packed with meetings to confirm procedures and contracts. After Mother Shen withdrew her investment, they had to screen new sponsors. The shooting schedule was delayed, and combined with the itinerary changes of other guests, she was basically run off her feet.","An Ling could only call Shen Linyan after returning home at night. But because it was so late and she was physically exhausted, she wouldn't even realize when she fell asleep.","When she woke up the next morning, her earphones would be lost somewhere, and the call would have long been disconnected.","The only thing left on her phone was the last message Shen Linyan had sent.","[Goodnight, Madam.]","In the conference room.","An Ling was sitting in front of her computer when her phone suddenly lit up next to her. It was a video sent by Auntie Cheng.","The little bed and toys she had bought for Huihui had arrived, so Shen Linyan went to pick Huihui up this morning.","In the video, an orange plush cat bed was placed next to the floor-to-ceiling windows, a round rug sat in front of the litter box, and a cat tree took up more than half the space.","A little grayish-white kitten was eating cat food from its bowl, its fluffy head buried deep inside.","The minimalist and cold living room suddenly gained a lot of bright colors.","Resting her chin on her hand, she watched the scene in the video. Her eyes softened, and the corners of her lips curled up.","Just as she was about to forward the video to Shen Linyan, someone knocked on the conference room door.","Knock, knock—","\"Ah Leng, Miss Shen is here,\" a colleague's voice rang out from outside the door.","\"Come in.\" An Ling put down her phone.","As soon as she spoke, the door was pushed open.","Shen Fuyuan, sporting red hair and wearing a hat and sunglasses, walked in. She sat down on a chair and immediately took off her hat.","An Ling stood up to close the door, then sat back down and pushed a document toward Shen Fuyuan. \"I told you last time about changing the shooting location. We originally planned to shoot it the same way as before, but your manager said you wanted to change the content.\"","Hearing this, Shen Fuyuan's expression paused slightly. She stiffly raised a hand to smooth her hair, her expression under the sunglasses a bit unnatural. \"Ah... yes, changing the shooting location is fine, it's just that there might be a minor change in the itinerary. Will that be too much trouble?\"","At this point, she even held up her fingers to indicate a tiny amount. \"Really, just a tiny little change. I might need to go somewhere else during the shoot. I'll only change it this once.\"","\"Where?\" An Ling felt like laughing.","It was her first time seeing Shen Fuyuan asking for an opinion so cautiously. In the past, whenever there were changes, this eldest Miss Shen would always have a bossy 'I want it this way, change it for me immediately' attitude.","She looked at the computer next to her and opened a document. \"A minor change is fine. We happen to have some free time during this period. Just tell me the location.\"","Shen Fuyuan: \"You're familiar with this location. It's my eldest brother's house.\"","An Ling: ?","She turned her head in confusion. \"What are you going to Shen Linyan's house for?\"","Hearing this, Shen Fuyuan's eyes instantly lit up, her voice filled with excitement and thrill. \"To see the cat!! Did you know my brother got a cat? I begged... I mean, bah! I told my brother that I would help him take care of it while he's working!\"","Heaven knew how long she had begged her brother before he finally agreed, with only one condition—as long as An Ling approved.","An Ling: \"...\"","Now she finally understood what Shen Linyan meant when he previously said someone would take care of Huihui.","So it turned out that Shen Fuyuan liked cats.","She nodded. \"Did Shen Linyan agree to the shoot?\"","\"My brother said that if you agree, he agrees.\"","An Ling's typing paused.","Shen Fuyuan blinked sincerely. \"My brother also said you can decide the shooting areas. Is that okay? Please? If there are any extra costs, I'll pay for them.\"","An Ling closed her laptop and said with a straight face.","\"Understood. I will arrange it as soon as possible.\"","After finalizing the arrangements and seeing Shen Fuyuan out, An Ling sat back in her seat. Her hands had just touched the keyboard when she fell silent for a few seconds. She lowered her eyes, and the corners of her mouth couldn't help but curl up slightly.","Just as she was about to pick up her phone, someone called out to her from behind.","\"Ah Leng, time for the meeting.\"","An Ling stopped her movements, picked up her documents, turned around, and stood up.","\"Coming.\"","...","Inside a private club, Dahl Company's bidding conference was underway.","The branch company, established by the famous foreign investor Damian, had attracted the attention of domestic enterprises as soon as it was founded. Everyone was eager for the chance to cooperate with Damian.","Lu Jingshen stood at the back and took a look. Seeing the representative of the Shen Corporation sitting in their seat, he turned and walked toward the hall next door.","He took out an invitation letter from his suit.","Seeing this, the waiter at the door respectfully bowed and pushed the door open.","Unlike the solemn and serious bidding conference next door, inside the banquet hall, crystal chandeliers hung from the domed ceiling. The light cascaded down like a waterfall, reflecting off the marble floor and washing over the gilded carved pillars. An air of luxury rushed at the senses. The famous and powerful figures of the business world were all gathered here at this moment.","It was a gathering of the elite, accessible only by invitation. Their goal was not just a simple project; if they could build a connection with Damian, expanding overseas in the future would be much easier.","Wearing a silver suit, Damian stood among the crowd, holding a wine glass and talking cheerfully with a smile.","Lu Jingshen picked up a glass of champagne and walked over with a polite smile. \"Mr. Damian, hello. I am the CEO of the Shen Corporation, Lu Jingshen.\"","Hearing the voice, Damian turned to look, raising an eyebrow slightly. \"Shen Corporation? I know of it, but wasn't the person I invited Shen Linyan?\"","An Zhou, who was standing nearby, cast an extra glance upon hearing this.","Lu Jingshen paused and could only come up with a random excuse. \"Shen Linyan has some matters to attend to today, so I came to the party as the CEO of the Shen Corporation.\"","Damian held his glass, his expression showing undisguised disappointment. \"What a pity. I heard that heir also returned from London. I originally wanted to meet him; chatting with him would surely be very interesting.\"","The smile on Lu Jingshen's face was a bit forced.","Here it goes again. Even though he was also the CEO of the Shen Corporation, everyone only seemed to notice Shen Linyan.","Wasn't Shen Linyan just lucky? If he were to be the one at the helm of the Shen Corporation, he could achieve the same results, maybe even do it better.","\"Mr. Damian, I also brought along with me this time...\"","Before he could finish his sentence, Damian suddenly turned his head to look at An Zhou.","\"Eh, I remember you're from the An Group, right?\""]},{"number":90,"title":"Chapter 90: Madam, I Miss You So Much","paragraphs":["An Zhou didn't expect to be called out suddenly. After a momentary daze, he quickly smiled and agreed, \"Yes, Mr. Damian.\"","Damian looked very interested.","\"I know your family. Shen Linyan's wife is your younger sister, right? I'd really love to meet her if there's a chance. Didn't I send two invitation letters? Did your sister not come?\"","\"...\"","The other invitation was actually for An Ling. He had thought they just sent an extra one.","An Zhou's voice caught in his throat. He gave an awkward smile, not knowing how to reply. \"She hasn't attended this kind of event before, and she's quite busy with work today.\"","He inexplicably had the illusion that Damian's only purpose for this gathering was to meet Shen Linyan and An Ling; everyone else didn't matter.","Hearing this, Damian looked slightly disappointed. He casually handed his wine glass to a waiter and looked down at his watch. \"I have a video conference later, so I'll be leaving first. Please, enjoy yourselves.\"","Once Damian left, people from other companies immediately surrounded Lu Jingshen.","\"Mr. Lu, it seems Shen Corporation will be the winning bidder again this time.\"","\"I'm afraid we're just here to accompany you on the run again.\"","After all, aside from Damian, the Shen Corporation was also a major player in the business world present here.","If Damian were to choose a partner, it would inevitably be the Shen Corporation.","\"Shen Corporation's recent momentum is fierce, and it's all thanks to Mr. Lu.\"","\"If you ask me, even though Director Shen is the chairman, Mr. Lu is actually the one putting in the most effort.\"","\"I agree with that. I've tried to make appointments with Director Shen several times but never saw him. It's always Mr. Lu discussing things. It's much more comfortable talking about projects with Mr. Lu anyway. He might as well hand the chairmanship over to Mr. Lu, hahaha.\"","\"Director Shen just returned from abroad and doesn't understand the domestic market at all. Shen Zhong was too hasty in making him the heir.\"","Amidst the chatter, the flattering words came one after another. The smile on Lu Jingshen's face deepened, though his words remained polite. \"No, no, there are still many projects we'll need to collaborate on in the future.\"","That's right, this was the treatment he deserved to enjoy.","That guy Shen Linyan merely had the title of Shen Corporation's chairman; in reality, he was completely useless.","Listening from the side, An Zhou glanced at the people speaking, raising an eyebrow and curling his lips in a mocking sneer.","These old foxes were truly cunning.","If he remembered correctly, these people had all suffered losses at the hands of Shen Linyan.","Now they were directly sowing discord from within the Shen Corporation, driving a wedge between the two brothers.","Not long after, a woman in professional attire walked in through another door and stepped onto the high stage. She was a staff member coming to announce the bidding results.","Under the watchful eyes of the crowd, the woman picked up the microphone.","\"Distinguished guests, the bidding results are now out. Congratulations to the An Corporation for winning the bid. Mr. Damian is still in a meeting and cannot be here, but he asked me to thank everyone for your support of Dahl Company and hopes there will be opportunities to cooperate in the future.\"","As soon as the words were spoken, the entire banquet hall fell silent.","Everyone's faces were filled with shock and astonishment, their gazes constantly darting back and forth between Lu Jingshen and An Zhou.","Who didn't know the relationship between these two families? Previously, the Shen family had even snatched several projects from the An family.","This time, the An Corporation had snatched such a massive project from the Shen Corporation.","And at the moment he heard the An Corporation's name, An Zhou himself was stunned.","He looked at the large screen, and after confirming that the name on it was indeed the An Corporation, he finally reacted, unable to suppress the smile on his face.","Holy crap... hit the jackpot!","Was the An Corporation really about to rise?","In contrast, the expression of Lu Jingshen beside him was extremely ugly. Faced with the crowd's whispers, he shot An Zhou a dark, gloomy look, then turned and left the banquet hall without saying a word.","In a room, the large screen was broadcasting the situation in the banquet hall.","Damian sat on the sofa. Seeing Lu Jingshen's expression, he laughed so hard he slapped his thigh, nearly spilling the wine in his glass. \"Oh my god, you really should have seen it. The moment he heard the An Corporation's name, the smile on Lu Jingshen's face vanished instantly.\"","After laughing, Damian glanced at the man beside him again.","He took a sip of wine, pushed the documents on the table toward him, and spoke in a probing tone.","\"But, Svein, did you really agree to my request?\"","Shen Linyan took the documents and gave a faint \"Mm.\"","A smile immediately appeared on Damian's face. \"I told you, your choice is the right one! Now I can return to London with peace of mind. It's just a pity I didn't get to meet your wife.\"","He really wanted to see the woman who could change Svein; she must be quite extraordinary.","Thinking of this, Damian's tone grew excited. \"Next time you bring your wife to London, it's my treat!\"","Hearing this, the man's movements paused slightly.","He lowered his eyes. His originally cold and aloof features seemed to melt like spring snow as he curled his lips and said gently:","\"Alright.\"","...","Back in the car, Secretary Chen handed over a tablet.","\"Director Shen, the news that Dahl Company chose the An Corporation is already out. Your father and mother want you to return to the old residence right now, and many shareholders are also looking for you.\"","The Shen Corporation losing a major partner like Damian was bound to cause a massive uproar.","The man casually flipped through it, then took out his phone. Sure enough, there were already over a dozen missed calls and dozens of messages, all from his mother.","He frowned and pinched the bridge of his nose. Just as he was about to reply, he received another message on his phone. He originally thought it was his mother again.","But when he caught a glimpse of its contents, his gaze slightly froze.","\"Go back to the apartment first. Tell them I'll go back tonight.\"","\"Yes, sir.\"","After returning to the apartment, Shen Linyan entered the elevator and pressed the floor button.","Ding—","Before the elevator doors fully opened, the man had already stepped out toward the door. His pace was fast, even carrying a hint of urgency.","Beep—","The door opened, and the milky meow of a cat was the first thing to reach his ears.","Following closely behind was a woman's clean and clear voice.","\"Do you want some freeze-dried treats? Come over and let me pet you, and I'll give you some.\"","Seeming to hear the sound of the door opening, the woman sitting on the floor turned her head.","She was sitting by the windowsill, her dark, waterfall-like hair tied up. The sunlight from outside poured in, scattering golden rays on the loose strands by her ears.","The sunlight slid down the tips of her hair onto her eyelashes. She curved her eyes, gently tilted her head, and said, \"You're back, Director Shen.\"","The bright smile on the woman's beautiful face crashed straight into his heart, like a pebble thrown into a lake, creating ripples that expanded outward with a subtle tremble.","Shen Linyan stood rooted to the spot, his pupils shrinking. Even his breathing instinctively slowed down. An overwhelming, strange emotion rose within him, and his heart pounded violently.","Thump, thump... It beat against his eardrums one after another, deafeningly loud.","After a moment of silence, he finally lifted his legs and walked over.","An Ling didn't notice his strange behavior. Looking down at the freeze-dried treat in her hand, she continued, \"Huihui is definitely a foodie. It only pays attention to me when I feed it treats. If I don't feed it, it ignores me and won't even let me pet it.\"","It wasn't until the man silently dropped to one knee in front of her that she sensed something was off and looked up in confusion.","\"Why aren't you...\"","Before she could finish her sentence, in the next second, large, warm palms cupped her face.","The crisp scent of cedar washed over her as the man gently captured her lips. His warm breath brushed against her mouth, burning with fervent longing and deep affection.","\"My wife, I have missed you so much.\""]},{"number":91,"title":"Chapter 91: Hehe, She Picked Up a Good Husband","paragraphs":["Twenty minutes ago, Shen Linyan received a photo from An Ling.","In the photo, the woman's hand rested gently under a cat's chin, her slender fingers appearing almost porcelain-white in the sunlight.","Wife: [Isn't it cute (๑••๑)~]","At that moment, Shen Linyan completely froze.","Only one thought occupied his mind.","His wife was home.","In their home.","During the few days they hadn't seen each other, he never felt like he was missing An Ling.","Compared to his state right after their divorce, being able to talk on the phone every night had left him feeling quite satisfied.","That was all he needed.","But the moment he opened the door and saw the woman in the house, Shen Linyan knew he was wrong.","He missed An Ling so much.","He missed her so much that he couldn't sleep even after hanging up the phone every night.","He wanted to hold his wife, wanted to hear her voice with his own ears.","It had been so, so long since he last saw his wife at home.","So long that seeing this scene now almost brought him to tears.","His heart felt as if it were soaking in warm water, a bittersweet ache spreading through his entire body. Shen Linyan's breathing trembled, his legs feeling as heavy as lead.","He tried his best to suppress the urge to pull the woman into his arms. Kneeling on the floor, he reached out and gently cradled her face.","He lowered his head and kissed her.","\"I missed you...\"","His scalding breath wrapped around endless yearning. He kissed her over and over, his movements lacking any rhythm or technique, driven only by the most primal desire and love.","Suddenly kissed out of nowhere, An Ling looked up and blinked, seemingly failing to process the situation.","A moment later, she suddenly opened her mouth and lightly bit the man's lip, lowering her voice. \"Chairman Shen, the cameras are rolling.\"","Shen Linyan's body stiffened slightly. Realizing what she meant, he looked up.","In an instant, several cameras came into view.","An Ling had only come here to install the equipment.","He hurriedly let go and pulled away. With a somewhat flustered gaze, he kept his body rigid and asked softly, \"Sorry... I'm still not used to this. Will this cause you trouble?\"","But the next second, a soft chuckle rang in his ears.","The woman covered her mouth, her eyes curving into crescents in the sunlight, her beautiful brown eyes brimming with amusement.","\"I'm tricking you, they aren't turned on yet.\"","Shen Linyan paused. Once he realized he'd been had, he smiled helplessly and sat on the floor. \"Where are your colleagues?\"","Huihui had climbed onto the cat tree at some point. It lay there watching them, its tail swishing back and forth.","\"They went back first. I stayed behind to double-check things, and to see Huihui while I was at it.\"","As An Ling spoke, she raised her hand and shook the last bit of freeze-dried treats.","Huihui instantly jumped down, poked its little head over, and ate the snack from her hand. Then, without looking back, it jumped back onto the tree, leaving them with nothing but an aloof tail.","An Ling smiled and dusted off her hands.","\"I only have an hour... No.\"","She glanced at the wall clock.","\"To be precise, I only have half an hour of break time left. Waiting for a certain someone to come home has already used up half of my lunch break.\"","Saying this, she looked up at the man beside her.","Her eyes slowly curved into a smile as she reached out her hand.","\"So, do you want to kiss?\"","Shen Linyan looked stunned for a moment, then smiled and took the woman's hand. He gently pulled her into his arms, lowered his head, and kissed her.","\"Yes.\"","Under the sunlight, the man and woman embraced intimately, bathed in a pale golden halo. The air itself seemed to hold a warm hue.","Shen Linyan lowered his head and kissed the woman's face bit by bit. \"I'll take you back to the office later. Do you want to go to the bedroom and sleep for a while?\"","The man's scent was crisp and clean. An Ling tilted her head and rested on his shoulder, feeling warm and cozy under the sun.","She closed her eyes. \"I won't sleep. Resting like this for a bit is enough.\"","Remembering the cameras, she opened her eyes again and pointed toward the rooms.","\"Cameras are only installed in the living room and kitchen; there are none in the bedroom. But don't worry, I'll have the editor cut you out.\"","\"Okay.\" The man rubbed his tall nose against her cheek.","Tickled by his nuzzling, An Ling tried to dodge to the side.","But the man chased after her, his eyes curving as he kissed her eyes.","Seeing Shen Linyan like this, An Ling recalled what happened that night and suddenly found it a bit funny.","\"The last time Wen Yuche took me home, he told me you weren't a good person and told me to stay away from you.\"","An Ling hadn't believed Wen Yuche's words at all.","Did she really not know whether Shen Linyan was a good person or not?","How bad could a person who rescues small animals really be?","It would be one thing if An Zhou said that; after all, he had projects snatched away by Shen Linyan, so he had never found Shen Linyan pleasing to the eye.","But why was an outsider chiming in?","Thinking of this, she sat up straight and doubtfully touched the man's face.","\"Our Chairman Shen is so good-looking, but why does it feel like your popularity is so poor?\"","This world was too biased against Shen Linyan.","His parents at home played favorites, and he was ostracized outside for being too capable. Could it be that only the female lead could discover his good qualities?","Oh wait, now there was also her.","Hehe, she had picked up a good husband.","An Ling thought happily, completely oblivious to the subtle change in the man's eyes.","Shen Linyan lowered his gaze and chuckled, dropping a kiss on the corner of her lips.","\"Yes. So, could my wife dote on me a little more?\"","The man's gentle voice was very soft, its trailing notes carrying a faint, almost imperceptible sigh.","An Ling blinked and cupped his face.","\"Today I can. How do you want me to dote on you? I have to head back to the office soon.\"","The man lifted his thick, dense eyelashes. His handsome features carried a gentle nobility. His fingertips grasped the back of the woman's neck, slowly and quietly slipping into her collar, hooking the fabric and pulling it down.","His fingers were long and distinct, his movements unhurried, exuding a sense of ambiguous desire.","\"My wife wore a turtleneck sweater today...\"","His eyes were pitch-black, like the dark, deep sea—bottomless, yet enticing one to fall in.","Realizing what he was getting at, An Ling's face reddened slightly.","She lowered her head and mumbled softly, \"Be gentle. I can't wear a turtleneck every day.\"","\"Alright.\"","Smiling, the man kissed her neck.","As his scalding thin lips pressed against her skin, An Ling's face grew even redder than before.","The sensation of his light suction made her spine tingle. Feeling his wet tongue slowly lick across her neck, mist gathered in her eyes. Her lower back slumped slightly as she let out a trembling gasp, a strange, dense numbness sweeping over her entire body.","Her slender fingers gripped the man's shoulders tightly, wrinkling his expensive custom suit.","The man's powerful arm gently wrapped around her waist, the warmth of his broad palm transmitting through the fabric.","An Ling tilted her head, panting. She instinctively turned her head, only to meet the round eyes of the little cat.","\"!\"","Her eyes suddenly widened, her face flushing crimson. Even her ears were almost red enough to bleed. With a soft voice, she whispered, \"That's enough... Huihui is watching, and I need to get back to the office.\"","Shen Linyan lifted his eyelids, glanced at the cat on the cat tree, and kissed the mark on the woman's neck.","His eyes curved as he raised his hands to help her adjust her clothes.","\"I'll take you back to the office.\"","...","After returning to the office, An Ling put on her employee badge.","The heating in the office was ample. She took off her coat, feeling a bit hot, and subconsciously tugged at her collar.","Remembering something, her gaze instantly froze, and she unnaturally lowered her arm.","Sitting in silence for a moment, An Ling quietly picked up the small mirror nearby.","After confirming that no one was around, she slowly pulled open her collar and tilted her neck.","There, resting starkly upon her fair neck, was an ambiguous hickey.","Blushing, she let go and readjusted her collar, muttering under her breath, \"I'll have to wear clothes that cover my neck even at home.\"","How many days would it take for this to fade?","The very next second, a woman's voice unexpectedly rang out from behind her.","\"Ah Leng, do you have a fever? Why is your face so red?\""]},{"number":92,"title":"Chapter 92: I am stepping down as the chairman of Shen Group.","paragraphs":["Hearing the voice, An Ling's back stiffened, and she subconsciously sat up straight.","Turning her head to confirm it was Teacher Chen, An Ling blinked guiltily and waved her hand. \"No, no, I just ran back from outside, so I might be a little hot.\"","Seeing that she looked well and didn't seem sick, Teacher Chen breathed a sigh of relief.","\"It's good that you're not sick. The workload has been heavy these past few days, and with the sudden drop in temperature, several colleagues have fallen ill.\"","Saying this, Teacher Chen paused for a moment.","\"I heard from Nan Zhechuan that things on Shen Fuyuan's side are almost done, is that right?\"","\"Yes, basically everything is arranged.\" An Ling turned and opened a document. \"The venue and contracts are confirmed, and there's no problem with the pre-recording these past few days. We can basically start shooting.\"","She looked up and saw Teacher Chen's somewhat hesitant expression. \"Teacher Chen, did you need me for something?\"","After a moment of hesitation, Teacher Chen sighed.","\"Then I won't beat around the bush. Teacher Wang, who is in charge of another guest, has fallen ill and needs to go to the hospital for IV drips these next few days. But the tasks in his hands aren't finished yet, and shooting is about to start. We can't delay it any longer, so I wanted to ask if you and Nan Zhechuan could take over for a bit.\"","An Ling nodded without hesitation. \"Sure, have you told Brother Nan?\"","She and Nan Zhechuan were responsible for Shen Fuyuan, and their tasks were already lighter than the others. Since they were all colleagues, they should help out when they could.","\"I told him, and he agreed. I'll have Teacher Wang send the information to you guys later.\" Teacher Chen patted her shoulder. \"Thanks for your hard work. I'll give you some time off after this shoot is over.\"","An Ling smiled, her eyes curving, and gave her an OK gesture.","The information was quickly sent over, and Nan Zhechuan came to talk to her about it.","\"The guest Teacher Wang is responsible for is Guo Yu, a Best Actor winner who has won several awards. He's a senior in the entertainment industry.\"","He handed her the laptop to look at.","\"I took a look, and there's actually not much left to do. Teacher Wang has basically finished everything. Now we just need to confirm the venue and schedule with the guest again. If there are no problems, we can start shooting. We happen to be free today, and we've already made an appointment with Teacher Guo. We'll go to his place tonight and double-check the equipment while we're at it.\"","An Ling nodded. \"Okay.\"","Coincidentally, the place where Teacher Guo lived was in the same residential complex as Shen Linyan.","While taking the elevator upstairs, An Ling was still wondering if she should tell Shen Linyan after the confirmation; maybe they could even have dinner together.","Just as this thought emerged, she received a message from An Zhou on her phone.","My good sister~ When do you get off work tonight? I have good news today! Hurry back for a big meal! Hurry, hurry, hurry!","...","What was this guy going crazy about?","An Ling: What good news? I'm working outside today. You can come pick me up here later.","She then sent over the address of the residential complex.","An Zhou: Shen Linyan's house?","An Ling: You know it? Let me be clear, I'm here for work. It has nothing to do with Shen Linyan.","An Zhou: Of course. Oh, knowing you're not looking for Shen Linyan, whatever hahaha, just hurry back.","An Ling: ?","What on earth was the news? It felt like her brother was going crazy with joy.","The elevator arrived. An Ling put away her phone and walked out with Nan Zhechuan.","After ringing the doorbell, the door opened. Nan Zhechuan spoke politely, \"Teacher Guo, I'm Nan Zhechuan, the one who contacted you to confirm the equipment.\"","Teacher Guo smiled and stepped aside to welcome them. \"Come in.\"","There was another man sitting on the sofa in the living room.","The man was tall with sharp, handsome features. He had a messy yet stylish short haircut, wore a black leather jacket, and had a silver stud in his ear. His whole person exuded a rebellious and untamed aura.","Even hearing their voices, he still sat lazily on the sofa with his legs crossed, chewing gum and looking at his phone, not even lifting his head, as if he was used to it.","Nan Zhechuan looked at An Ling. \"Ah Leng, you go check the living room, and I'll check the bedroom.\"","\"Okay.\"","An Ling walked to the corner of the wall, confirmed the machine was running normally, and withdrew her hand.","Just as she looked up, she unexpectedly met the eyes of the man on the sofa.","She didn't know if it was her illusion, but she felt the expression on the man's face freeze for a moment.","She didn't show any expression, just calmly withdrew her gaze, and returned to her original spot after checking the other machines.","When Nan Zhechuan came out, he took out the documents and confirmed the schedule with Teacher Guo.","An Ling stood to the side, but she could clearly feel the man on the sofa quietly watching her. That gaze carried a bit of scrutiny and surprise.","She frowned, not really liking the other party's stare.","It wasn't until all the procedures were confirmed and they left Teacher Guo's house that the uncomfortable gaze disappeared.","\"Ah Leng, are you going home? Or back to the company? I'll drop you off.\"","Nan Zhechuan opened the car door and looked at her standing by the road.","An Ling had just finished sending a message to An Zhou with her head down. Hearing this, she looked up. \"No need, my family will come pick me up. Brother Nan, you can head back first.\"","\"Okay, then I'll leave first.\"","Seeing the car leave, An Ling reopened her phone, but a male voice sounded behind her.","\"...An Ling?\"","She paused, turned her head, and her gaze fell on the man's leather jacket.","The man who was just in Teacher Guo Yu's house was now standing behind her.","He was wearing a hat and a mask over his face.","He stared at her face for a long time, and the smile on his face widened. \"It really is you, An Ling.\"","An Ling couldn't recognize who this person was, guessing it might be a friend the system knew.","Despite her inner dislike, she maintained basic professional courtesy. \"Can I help you?\"","The man pulled down his mask and smilingly took out a cigarette.","\"Why the cold expression? Don't you recognize me? That really makes me sad...\"","He slowly lit the cigarette, caught a glimpse of the unfamiliarity in An Ling's eyes, and suddenly laughed out loud. \"Oh right, I remember now...\"","He took a drag of the cigarette, blew out a smoke ring, and smiled as he enunciated every word:","\"You can't recognize people.\"","As soon as these words came out, An Ling's eyes suddenly froze, and her face instantly turned cold.","The man smiled and continued, \"But that was my old way of putting it. Now I know, your condition... should be called prosopagnosia? Right?\"","Seeing An Ling's icy expression, he raised an eyebrow and took a step forward. \"You should remember who I am now, right? After all, I chased you for so long in middle school. Back then, I was just playing a joke to test if you really couldn't recognize people. I didn't expect you to get so angry and even transfer schools, not even listening to my apology. It made me sad for a long time.\"","His gaze fell on An Ling's beautiful face, the smile on the corners of his mouth growing brighter, and he tried to grab her hand.","\"You really grew up to be more and more beautiful. I didn't expect you to become a producer and even be in charge of the variety show my uncle is participating in. Doesn't this mean our destiny isn't over?\"","An Ling took a step back to avoid his touch and looked at him coldly.","\"Xu Huoqing, get the hell away from me.\"","\"You look exactly the same when you're angry as you did before.\"","Xu Huoqing said shamelessly, Aren't you just mad that I used to tease you on purpose? You know how teenage boys are, just a bit impulsive. I'm apologizing to you now, okay? So, An Ling, do you have a boyfriend?","Beep, beep—","A car horn sounded from behind, interrupting him, accompanied by An Zhou's voice.","An Ling.","An Ling immediately walked toward the car without looking back, but Xu Huoqing's lazy voice trailed after her.","Give me your contact info. We're definitely going to be seeing a lot of each other from now on.","The woman completely ignored him, got straight into the car, and left.","Xu Huoqing clamped his cigarette back between his teeth, narrowed his eyes, and clicked his tongue.","Even if you don't give it to me, I have other ways to get it.","...","At night, in the Shen family's old residence.","As soon as Shen Linyan walked through the door, Mother Shen's angry voice rang out from the living room.","Shen Linyan! What on earth is going on with the Damian project! Why couldn't the Shen Group beat the An family in the bidding!!","Looking up, he saw Father Shen and Mother Shen sitting on the sofa, with Lu Jingshen sitting on a smaller sofa to the side.","Holding a folder, he walked over with a calm expression.","Why are you asking me, Mother? Wasn't Lu Jingshen the one who went to the site?","Who else should I ask!? You are the chairman of the Shen Group. If the Shen Group can't even beat the An Group, isn't it because you haven't managed the company well? Did you think your brother could succeed just by talking!?","Mother Shen slammed her cup down heavily on the table, her face dark. Her voice echoed throughout the living room.","So the responsibility for this lies entirely with you!","Although she said that, the Shen Group losing the bid wasn't what truly angered her.","Lu Jingshen had attended the bidding conference today and ended up suffering so much humiliation. Naturally, she needed to find a scapegoat to vent her anger on her son's behalf.","Father Shen frowned beside her, his voice deep. Shen Linyan, what exactly is going on? I handed the Shen Group over to you, and you can't even beat the An Group? Didn't you reach out to Damian?","Shen Linyan sat down on the sofa and said indifferently, Mother said to let Lu Jingshen go. I assumed Lu Jingshen could handle it.","I said to let Lu Jingshen attend the bidding conference! Shouldn't meeting with Damian have been your job?","Mother Shen's face was ugly as she gritted her teeth. Shen Linyan, you've really grown arrogant. You've even learned how to shift the blame. You have no capability yourself, yet you blame your brother!","She turned to Father Shen. Shen Zhong, this is the heir you chose! Look at him now! Everyone online is saying that the Shen Group is inferior to the An Group!","Lu Jingshen chimed in, Dad, do you know how humiliating it was for me when they announced the results at the venue? They were all secretly laughing at the Shen Group.","Father Shen's furrowed brows never relaxed. Ever since Shen Linyan took office, he had never worried about the Shen Group's affairs. He never expected Shen Linyan to mess up at such a crucial moment.","Shen Linyan, you better handle this matter properly. Give me an explanation when the time comes, and give the other shareholders an explanation too.","The man calmly raised his eyes. Why should I handle it?","Father Shen slammed his hand on the table. Because you are the chairman of the Shen Group! If you don't handle it, who will!","Then I quit.","As soon as those words came out, the entire living room fell into a dead silence.","Father Shen's face stiffened.","A flash of pleasant surprise, however, crossed Mother Shen and Lu Jingshen's eyes.","After an unknown amount of time, Father Shen's cold voice cut through the air. What did you say?","Shen Linyan placed the folder in his hand on the table. His eyes were calm, and his tone was indifferent.","I said, I am no longer going to be the chairman of the Shen Group."]},{"number":93,"title":"Chapter 93: I Will Sever Ties with the Shen Family","paragraphs":["The entire living room was eerily quiet, the air thick with a palpable, hair-trigger tension.","Even Mother Shen sat to the side in silence, though she couldn't hide the secret delight in her eyes.","Father Shen's face was dark as thunder, shooting a sharp, warning glare across the room.","\"Shen Linyan, shut up! Is everything a joke to you?! I'll let the Damian incident slide this time, but you better focus on your work!\"","Mother Shen wanted to say something, but seeing Father Shen's fury, she merely gave Lu Jingshen a meaningful look.","Lu Jingshen nodded slightly and suddenly spoke up, \"Dad, if my brother doesn't want to do it, let it be. It just means he feels he's not suited for it. I can share his burden.\"","Hearing this, Shen Linyan cast a careless glance over, a barely detectable trace of mockery hidden in his eyes.","He chuckled softly. \"Yes, I really am not suited to be the chairman of the Shen Group. Besides, hasn't Mother always wanted Lu Jingshen to take the position?\"","Mother Shen paused, picking up her teacup without changing her expression. Her tone was uncharacteristically gentle. \"I just think that as the older brother, Linyan, you should give your younger brother room to grow. You too, Shen Zhong. If Jingshen has this ambition, you should support him. After all, Jingshen is your son too. You can't always play favorites with Linyan.\"","Lu Jingshen was dying to replace Shen Linyan and couldn't wait to prove himself. \"That's right, Dad. If you don't believe me, I can find a better investor than Damian. I promise I'll do a better job than my brother.\"","Listening to the three of them chime in one after another, Father Shen's face grew darker by the second. His brows gathered like storm clouds laced with ice, and his knuckles turned white as he clenched his fists, as if desperately suppressing something.","Bang!","Finally, the fuse was completely ignited. Father Shen raised his hand and smashed the ashtray fiercely onto the floor, roaring, \"In your dreams! You, someone with the surname Lu, dare to dream of inheriting the Shen Group! Lu Jincai, put away your petty schemes! Don't think I don't know what you're plotting!\"","At that moment, the hypocritical facade of peace in the Shen family was brutally torn away.","Shen Linyan lowered his eyes and sipped his tea, his expression indifferent.","Lu Jingshen stood frozen in shock, while Mother Shen completely exploded.","She slammed her hand on the table and stood up furiously, her voice piercing. \"Shen Zhong, explain yourself! Is Lu Jingshen not your son? What schemes am I hiding? Just because Lu Jingshen took my surname, that's your excuse to favor Shen Linyan?!\"","\"What else could it be?\" Father Shen sneered, pointing a finger at Lu Jingshen. \"If you're so capable, have Lu Jingshen take my surname. I will never hand the Shen Group over to someone with a different last name!\"","\"Why should I? We had an agreement back then. My son naturally takes my surname!\"","Mother Shen refused to back down, her face dark. \"Shen Zhong, even if Lu Jingshen has my surname, he's still your son. It's only right for him to inherit the Shen Group. Why won't you let him? If you're going to play it this way, then I won't hold back either. If the shareholders of the Shen Group find out you're letting an illegitimate son inherit the company, do you think they'll still agree to let Shen Linyan take charge?!\"","These words exploded like a clap of thunder in the living room.","The air suddenly became terrifyingly still. Lu Jingshen's mind went completely blank as he instinctively looked at Shen Linyan.","The man sat on the sofa with his long legs crossed, his eyes lowered as he unhurriedly adjusted the watch on his wrist. It was impossible to read the emotion in his eyes.","Mother Shen gritted her teeth, her gaze ruthless. \"I raised that dead woman's son for so long, helped you hide this secret for so long, and this is what I get? You stab me in the back! What? Are you waiting for your bastard son to secure his position so you can throw us outsiders out?!\"","Father Shen curled his lips into a sneer. \"Werent you the one who agreed to bring Shen Linyan back in the first place? If news of your miscarriage had gotten out, the Lu family's assets would have been divided up by your uncles long ago. Letting Lu Jingshen take your surname was already the biggest concession I could make. Even if Shen Linyan is illegitimate, he is still my son. If I want him to inherit, he will inherit!\"","Watching them argue endlessly, Lu Jingshen stood to the side and asked hesitantly, \"Mom... what are you and Dad talking about? What illegitimate son?\"","\"What else?\"","Mother Shen was full of rage. She put her hands on her hips, pointed at Shen Linyan, and said through gritted teeth, \"Shen Linyan isn't your brother at all. He's your father's bastard son from another woman! Your father would rather give the company to an illegitimate son than to you!\"","If that dead woman hadn't bribed the doctor to say she could never get pregnant again after her miscarriage back then, she would never have agreed to bring Shen Linyan home to raise.","Hearing this, Shen Linyan slowly lifted his gaze.","He suddenly let out a laugh, his voice mild.","\"It seems Mother still doesn't know. I am actually not the heir to the Shen Group. The shares are still in Father's hands. I am merely the acting chairman.\"","Mother Shen froze instantly at his words.","Then she burst into laughter. \"Hahaha! Shen Zhong, well done! It turns out you don't trust anyone! You really are a selfish man!\"","The living room descended into chaos, filled only with Mother Shen's sharp, mocking laughter.","Shen Linyan stood up, his expression indifferent. \"I will sever all ties with the Shen family. As for who the Shen Group ultimately belongs to, you two can handle it yourselves.\"","Father Shen, however, stood up with a dark expression and called out to stop him in a deep voice.","\"Shen Linyan! If you walk out that door, I'd like to see where else you can go! Everything you have right now was given to you by me. Without me, you would have been trapped in that rental house for the rest of your life! Do you really think you have a way out if you leave the Shen family now?! I let you be the acting chairman; you should feel honored!\"","The man, however, didn't stop walking.","His hand grasped the doorknob. As soon as he opened the door, he saw Zhou Wen standing outside.","The young woman wore exquisite makeup and carried several luxury shopping bags. It looked like she had just returned from an outing. Even though she tried to hide it well, the shock in her eyes betrayed her. There was no telling how much she had heard.","She hesitated to speak, opening her mouth to mumble, \"Big brother, you...\"","Shen Linyan's tone was completely detached: \"Move.\"","The man's eyes held zero warmth. A chill ran down Zhou Wen's spine, and she instinctively stepped aside to make way.","Watching the man's retreating back, Zhou Wen gripped her shopping bags tightly, the look in her eyes growing increasingly complex.","Shen Linyan was actually an illegitimate son of the Shen family.","She glanced into the living room, her gaze landing on Lu Jingshen.","So... the Shen Group would eventually belong to Lu Jingshen after all?","Meanwhile, An Ling was still unaware of everything that had happened tonight.","After returning with An Zhou, she found out that he had secured a major project today.","She heard that they had been competing with the Shen Group for this project and had ultimately beaten them.","No wonder he was acting as happy as an idiot.","In the past, she might have been interested enough to listen to a few details, but running into Xu Huoqing today had completely ruined her appetite.","After eating a few simple bites, she went upstairs, took out her phone, and called Jiang Mai.","Once the call connected, she frowned and said, \"Jiang Mai, I ran into Xu Huoqing today.\""]},{"number":94,"title":"Chapter 94: This time, Madam can rest assured and remarry me.","paragraphs":["Hearing that name on the other end of the phone, Jiang Mai instantly sat up in bed.","\"Are you serious?\"","An Ling rubbed her temples with a headache. \"I am. Aren't I in charge of a variety show? Guo Yu is a guest on the program, and it turns out he is Guo Yu's nephew. He recognized me first, but I didn't recognize him.\"","Jiang Mai let out an exclamation of surprise and disgust. \"Holy crap.\"","Naturally, she couldn't forget this person either. The trauma that made An Ling so reluctant to tell others about her face blindness was entirely his doing.","At the time, no one knew An Ling was the daughter of the An family. However, her beauty couldn't be hidden, and word quickly spread throughout the grade that there was a very pretty girl in Class Eleven.","Xu Huoqing and his friends were curious, so they went together to see if she was really that pretty.","As a result, Xu Huoqing fell in love with An Ling at first sight right then and there.","After that, Xu Huoqing began to pursue An Ling. He tried different tactics every day, asking around for her preferences, bringing her breakfast, and waiting for her after school to walk home together. He made such a scene that the entire grade knew someone was going after An Ling.","Jiang Mai had even been tormented by him back then; the guy was always coming to ask her what An Ling liked and begging her to create opportunities for them to spend time together.","Xu Huoqing was quite good-looking at the time. His features were maturing, he was tall, and he had the spirited energy of a young man, along with a rebellious, roguish charm that made him very popular with the girls.","Unfortunately, An Ling had face blindness. She had absolutely no impression of Xu Huoqing's face, nor did she have any feelings for him as a person.","She rejected Xu Huoqing, but the guy just used the excuse of being friends to keep following her around.","During middle school, An Ling wasn't as guarded around people. Although she was quiet, she was still happy to make friends and obediently nodded in agreement.","Later, after hanging around her so much, Xu Huoqing gradually realized that An Ling didn't seem to be able to recognize people.","To test his theory, he conspired with some of An Ling's classmates. They deliberately picked someone with a similar build to him, dressed him in Xu Huoqing's clothes, and sent him to talk to An Ling while the others watched from the sidelines.","When An Ling started chatting with the guy, confirming that she truly couldn't tell the difference, Xu Huoqing couldn't hold back his mocking laughter before the act was even over.","\"An Ling, you really can't recognize people, can you?\"","The scene was instantly filled with shock and curiosity. The surrounding crowd burst into laughter and quickly gathered around.","\"Are you serious?\"","\"Can you not recognize me either?\"","\"Is this a problem with her eyes? Or her brain?\"","\"Hahaha, she really can't recognize anyone! That's so funny. Does she not even recognize her own parents?\"","\"Look at her expression, it seems she really doesn't know, hahaha! Hey, An Ling, do you know who I am?\"","\"Wow, Xu Huoqing, when you finally win An Ling over and hold hands with her, she might not even know who her boyfriend is! Hahahaha.\"","Hearing this, Xu Huoqing scoffed.","\"No wonder she wouldn't say yes to me. It turns out she can't even recognize people. If I had known earlier, I would have just found someone else to pursue her in my place, save myself from wasting so much time.\"","Surrounded by them, An Ling backed away in a panic, step by step. Her eyes were dazed and frightened as she was forced to look at the crowd of unfamiliar faces before her.","The sounds of mockery flooded her ears. Stared at by countless pairs of amused eyes, the beautiful girl's face grew increasingly pale, and she could barely keep her footing.","By the time Jiang Mai realized what was happening and came looking for her, it was already too late.","After that day, the An family immediately arranged for An Ling to transfer schools.","Not wanting to cause trouble for her parents, An Ling took the initiative to suggest they just suppress the news.","She just hadn't expected to run into Xu Huoqing again after all these years.","Every time she thought of that scene, Jiang Mai would get so angry she could barely breathe.","\"Damn it, my only regret from back then is that I didn't punch that punk Xu Huoqing. Where is he now? I'm going to go punch him!\"","Little An Ling was so cute, and she even agreed to be his friend, only to be backstabbed like that.","\"So, will he tell people about your face blindness?\"","In the past, Xu Huoqing didn't know An Ling was the An family's daughter, but that might not be the case now.","Hearing this, An Ling clenched her fists. She was silent for a few seconds before she spoke. \"I don't know, but it doesn't matter anymore... The worst-case scenario is just a repeat of the past.\"","Her reluctance to reveal her face blindness was because she didn't want outsiders to know that the daughter of the An family had an illness.","But if she truly couldn't hide it anymore, then there was nothing to be done.","At worst, she would just have to go through those things all over again.","Hanging up the phone, An Ling let out a heavy breath. She was just about to take a shower and relax when she received a friend request on her phone.","Huo Yuan: [This is Xu Huoqing. Accept the request.]","Her gaze stalled for a moment. Then, expressionless, she replied with a \"Get lost,\" and blocked the account without hesitation.","So annoying.","...","After running into Xu Huoqing, An Ling didn't even sleep well, dreaming of past events for the first time in a long while.","She spent the entire morning in a state of drowsiness, sitting in front of her computer, propping up her chin and yawning repeatedly.","She got up and went to the pantry to make a cup of coffee. She picked it up and took a sip; the bitter taste instantly stimulated her taste buds, finally making her feel a bit more awake.","An Ling picked up her phone again, blinking thoughtfully.","She was so disgusted by Xu Huoqing yesterday that she completely forgot to call Shen Linyan, though it seemed Shen Linyan was quite busy anyway.","She subconsciously touched the silk scarf around her neck, her lips curling up into a smile, and her mood improved slightly.","Once the variety show started filming, she could go to Shen Linyan's house to see Huihui.","Just as she was about to get to work, she suddenly received a message from Shen Linyan on her phone.","She was just about to check the content when a voice sounded from behind her.","\"An Ling.\"","Turning her head to see who it was, she put down her phone. \"What's wrong, Brother Nan?\"","Nan Zhechuan walked over quickly. He couldn't hide the shock on his face as he lowered his voice, \"Have you seen the news?\"","\"What news?\"","Seeing the blank expression on the woman's face, Nan Zhechuan paused.","He silently handed over his own phone, his tone complicated. \"Um... just read it yourself.\"","An Ling looked down, and a line of large text instantly caught her eye.","[Shen Linyan, the heir to the Shen Corporation, is exposed as an illegitimate child. The Shen family announces severed ties with him. The former chairman of the Shen Corporation has now resumed his position.]","The moment she read the headline clearly, her pupils dilated sharply. A sudden feeling of weightlessness swept over her entire body, her heart pounded wildly, and a chill shot up from the soles of her feet.","She recognized every single word up there, but put together, they felt exceptionally unfamiliar.","Why?","How could things turn out like this?","As if realizing something, she hastily picked up her own phone and unlocked the screen.","She saw that Shen Linyan had sent her a message.","[Madam, if you have time, could you come home and meet with me?]","An Ling stood up abruptly, grabbed her jacket from the desk, and looked up at Nan Zhechuan. \"Brother Nan, I need to go out for a bit. If any work comes up suddenly, could you handle it first? Or leave it for me to do when I get back this afternoon.\"","Nan Zhechuan naturally knew where she was going and nodded. \"Don't worry, the work for the past few days is mostly done. Just go ahead.\"","An Ling hurriedly put on her jacket and went downstairs.","Standing in the elevator, she gripped her phone tightly. Her eyelashes trembled in panic, and every breath was accompanied by the trembling of her heart.","An Ling didn't even dare to send a message to Shen Linyan, terrified of receiving the news that she feared the most.","Why...","Even though she had already gotten a divorce, why did Shen Linyan still go bankrupt...","What did they mean by an illegitimate child? Why would Shen Linyan be an illegitimate child...","An Ling's eyes stung. Her mind was a terrifying mess, her thoughts tangled up like hemp rope, completely impossible to unravel.","But as if he knew exactly how she was feeling, the very next second, her phone received another message from the man.","[Don't be afraid, my wife ^^]","Her gaze instantly froze.","Her heart, which had just been in a state of sheer panic, miraculously settled down at this moment. Pursing her lips, she slowly typed out a reply to him.","[I am coming to see you right now.]","Arriving outside Shen Linyan's house, An Ling stood silently at the door with her head lowered for a long time.","She stood there for so long that her legs began to ache, before she finally and slowly reached her hand out.","Beep—","The moment she pushed the door open, warm air rushed out from inside the house.","Before she could even step through the doorway, in the very next second, her entire body was pulled into a warm embrace.","\"My wife.\" The man's deep, gentle voice sounded from above her head.","The familiar scent of cedar and sandalwood enveloped her. An Ling's nose stung, and she instantly burst into tears, her beautiful face filled with a helpless panic. \"Why... Shen Linyan, this is fake, right? How could this happen? I don't want this, sob... this has to be fake...\"","The man's warm palms cupped her freezing face. He lowered his head, kissing away her tears little by little, and coaxed her in a low voice, \"Don't cry, my wife. I didn't go bankrupt.\"","An Ling's eyes were red from crying. Hearing his words, she looked up at him with teary, bewildered eyes. \"Huh?\"","\"Do you remember the two hundred million I left for you, my wife?\"","The man bent down to look at her tenderly, his eyes slowly curving into a smile. In his usually deep, pitch-black eyes, a layer of soft, shattered light now rippled.","\"As long as my wife remarries me, our destined ending will be broken.\"","\"This time, you can remarry me with peace of mind.\""]},{"number":95,"title":"Chapter 95: The Mistress Keeps Me","paragraphs":["The freezing wind bit to the bone outside. An Ling was picked up by the man by her waist, and she instinctively wrapped her arms around his neck.","Beep—","The front door closed behind them.","The heating in the living room was ample. The curtains were slightly drawn, allowing only a few rays of light to slip through the gaps. Huihui was sleeping in its bed, curled up into a tiny ball, looking exceptionally peaceful.","Shen Linyan sat on the sofa with her in his arms, reaching out to gently stroke her face. Be good, don't cry.","An Ling lowered her head to wipe her tears. When did this happen? It was my colleague who told me the news.","She looked up, the corners of her eyes flushed red and teardrops clinging to her eyelashes. Her dark pupils looked as clear as if they had been washed in water. She spoke with a nasal voice, And how did you become an illegitimate son...","Seeing the woman's distressed, tearful little expression, Shen Linyan curled his lips into a smile and lowered his head to kiss her eyes.","It happened last night. I only found out yesterday that I am my father's illegitimate son. They want to sever ties with me. There was so much going on, so I forgot to tell you, my wife.","The man's voice was gentle. Even though such a thing had happened, there was no resentment in his tone; he simply accepted it all calmly.","An Ling, however, wanted to cry even more.","It was too unfair. Shen Linyan should have had a better future. He was supposed to be the heir to the Shen family, becoming the most powerful figure in the business world.","How could a scandal about him being an illegitimate son suddenly break out, resulting in him being disowned by the Shen family?","How was this any different from going bankrupt?","No wonder Shen Linyan didn't message her last night.","An Ling cupped his face, her voice hoarse. How could they do this? You helped the Shen family so much, how could they just use you and throw you away?","An Zhou was so happy last night. He drank too much and mentioned that after Shen Linyan returned, the quarterly revenue generated by the Shen family kept getting higher and higher.","It was a good thing Shen Linyan wasn't involved in this project, otherwise, it probably would have gone to the Shen family again.","The man, however, smiled and nuzzled her cheek. It's alright, my wife. This is good too. If I had gotten the Shen family shares, you would be on edge every day after we got married, terrified that I might go bankrupt. Now, you won't have to worry.","He raised his hand to untie the decorative silk scarf around the woman's neck, his thin lips gently kissing the hickey there.","Looking at her, his eyes curved as a low chuckle escaped his lips.","If you keep me as your sugar baby, my wife, then I won't be considered bankrupt.","An Ling was momentarily dazed and didn't react. But on second thought, it actually seemed to make some sense.","Oh right, she still had her little secret stash of money.","She blinked and wiped away her tears. Then I have money to support you. I'll go back and let Mom know.","The man held her hand. I'll go tell her. Just help me set up a meeting with Mom.","An Ling thought about it and agreed, whispering, That works too. It's okay if you don't have money, just play the victim. Mom is soft-hearted. My brother has been in a great mood lately, so he probably won't do anything to you.","Shen Linyan couldn't help but laugh.","His Adam's apple bobbed, and unable to resist, he kissed the corner of her mouth. Okay.","His wife was indeed easy to fool.","Do you need to go back to the company later? He stroked her hair.","An Ling took out her phone. About ten minutes ago, Nan Zhechuan had messaged her, saying that Ms. Chen was holding a meeting in the afternoon to discuss tomorrow's shoot.","The meeting is in the afternoon, so it's fine if I don't go back right now.","Shen Linyan's thumb brushed over her eyes. Did Lingling not sleep well last night?","Her complexion didn't look too good.","An Ling placed her phone on the table. Hearing this, she was reminded of that jinx Xu Huoqing, and nodded heavily. I had a very, very bad dream.","Then go rest in the room for a while. I'll take you back to the company later.","The man wrapped his arm around her waist, kissed her lips, and said with a smile in his voice, Do you want me to carry you back to the room, my wife?","As soon as he said that, An Ling remembered the time before they got divorced.","Her face flushed slightly. Hugging his neck, she whispered, Mr. Shen, you are about to be kept by me. You should have the proper awareness when doing these things.","The man's chest vibrated slightly as a low chuckle escaped his lips, indulgent and doting.","Yes, Miss An.","Just as he stood up with her in his arms, a sudden meow came from the cat bed.","They both looked over and saw Huihui crawling out of the bed. The little guy ran over on its short legs, continuously rubbing against Shen Linyan's pant leg and meowing non-stop.","Seeing this, An Ling smiled and said, Looks like it's hungry. You go get it some food first, I'll go back to the room by myself.","Shen Linyan glanced at it and stepped right past it. It's fine. I'll come out and pour it some cat food later.","Compared to last time, the room was very tidy.","An Ling lay on the bed and rolled over. Last time I came back to take a look, I found that the room hadn't been cleaned at all.","The man knelt on the bed with one knee, propped himself up, and leaned down to kiss her.","I forgot to tell Auntie Cheng.","He hadn't forgotten at all.","He had deliberately told Auntie Cheng not to clean that room.","An Ling would never know that for the first few nights after their divorce, whenever Shen Linyan couldn't sleep, he would stand at the door of her room.","Countless times standing in the pitch-black hallway, looking at the messy arrangement inside the room, he even developed an illusion in his heart.","His wife just hadn't come home yet.","An Ling would be back soon.","But Shen Linyan never dared to step inside. Once he did, the chilling air that rushed at his face would ruthlessly shatter his illusion.","These signs constantly reminded him that this home had long lost An Ling's presence.","The attachment An Ling spoke of was truly too hard to erase.","He couldn't forget An Ling, nor did he want to forget her.","Shen Linyan tightened his grip, the veins on the back of his hand bulging slightly.","His scalding lips gently pressed against the woman's, his voice softening. My wife, after we remarry this time, will you still teach me how to be a bad guy?","If he could keep An Ling for the rest of his life using this method, he didn't mind pretending forever.","Just being bound to him like this, whether out of heartache or pity.","These were all his.","Hearing this, An Ling blinked, her eyes curving into crescents as she took the initiative to kiss him. Of course I will.","Now that Shen Linyan had been kicked out of the Shen family, those people from before would definitely kick him while he was down. She, of course, had to watch over him carefully; her bankrupt husband couldn't be bullied by others.","Perhaps because she had just cried, coupled with not sleeping well last night, An Ling's eyes felt sore.","She yawned. Hurry up and go feed Huihui. I'm going to sleep for a bit.","Okay. Shen Linyan tucked her in, watched the woman lie on the bed and close her eyes, then lightened his footsteps and closed the door behind him as he left.","In the living room, Huihui was standing on the table, entertaining itself at some unknown point. It was looking down, messing with something with its little paws, having pushed all the books on the table onto the floor.","Seeing the man come out, it immediately sat properly, looking entirely innocent.","Shen Linyan bent down to pick up the books from the floor and said flatly, Get down, or you won't get any food.","Huihui immediately jumped down.","Shen Linyan placed the books on the table. His gaze caught the phone on the table; it was the one An Ling had casually left there earlier.","At this moment, the screen was lit up with an unfamiliar number.","It showed an ongoing call.","Shen Linyan's gaze paused slightly, and he turned his head to look at the cat bed.","The culprit, meanwhile, was nonchalantly licking its fur.","An Ling had just fallen asleep; going in right now would definitely wake her up.","Left with no choice, Shen Linyan picked up the phone and placed it to his ear while reaching for the cat food with his other hand. His voice was gentle. Hello, may I ask what you are looking for An Ling for?","There was a brief silence on the other end of the line, followed by a man's unfriendly and guarded voice.","\"Who are you? Where's An Ling?\""]},{"number":96,"title":"Chapter 96: I Am Anling's Husband","paragraphs":["Hearing the voice on the other end of the phone, Shen Linyan paused his movement of pouring cat food.","He closed the bag and glanced at a certain cat that was eating happily.","Holding the phone, he turned and sat back on the sofa. An Ling is not available to answer the phone right now. If you have something to say, I will pass it on to her later.","Who are you? This is An Ling's phone, right? Give the phone to her, I want to talk to her.","The person on the phone had an arrogant tone, clearly not the colleague An Ling often worked with.","Was it another colleague? Or a business partner?","His wife usually saved people's contacts with notes. A phone number without a saved name like this meant it probably wasn't someone important.","Shen Linyan said calmly, I'm sorry, but I've already said she is not available right now. Tell me your name, and I will let An Ling know you called.","Hearing this, the person on the other end became even more impatient.","No, who the hell are you? An Ling's colleague? Can't you understand human speech? I'm looking for An Ling! Give her the phone!","A condescendingly arrogant tone and a completely disrespectful attitude.","If it was a sponsor, why were the investors this company found all like this? The last one was like this too.","Shen Linyan's eyes darkened slightly, his cold voice carrying an invisible sense of oppression.","I am An Ling's husband. Is there a problem?","As soon as he said this, the other end instantly fell silent.","Shen Linyan hung up the phone directly and sent this number to Secretary Chen.","[Go investigate who is behind this phone number and what their relationship is with An Ling.]","Secretary Chen: [Yes, Young Master.]","Finding someone using a phone number was usually very quick. Shen Linyan got up to pour a glass of water, and by the time he picked up his phone again, Secretary Chen had already sent a reply.","[Young Master, I found it. The owner of this number is Xu Huoqing. His uncle is Guo Yu, who is also a guest on Miss An's show.]","A guest?","Although Shen Linyan didn't pay much attention to the entertainment industry, Gu Xiaochi had told him about Shen Fuyuan's situation. In this circle, phenomena like acting like a big shot were quite common.","Now, even a guest's nephew could speak to a staff member like this at will?","Shen Linyan frowned and set down his cup, tapping his fingertips against the tabletop.","[Send it to Gu Xiaochi. Let him handle it as he sees fit, and make sure this person doesn't delay An Ling's work.]","[Yes.]","Meanwhile, on the other side, Xu Huoqing looked at the hung-up phone, sat up from the sofa, and furrowed his brows deeply.","Husband? That's impossible.","He had checked last time, and An Ling didn't have a ring on her hand at all.","Xu Huoqing thought of his WeChat account, which had been blocked.","Could this be someone An Ling specially found to pretend?","It looked like that was mostly the case.","He clicked his tongue in annoyance and twitched his lips. Someone with face blindness actually has a husband? Can she even recognize him?","Who was she trying to fool?","...","After getting enough sleep and returning to the company, An Ling's complexion had improved a lot.","After the meeting, Nan Zhechuan saw that she was in a decent mood. He wanted to ask about that matter but didn't dare to.","An Ling also guessed what he wanted to say, so she smiled and lowered her voice, It's fine now.","Returning to her workstation, An Ling had just picked up her phone when she saw an unknown call coming in.","She answered it, and Xu Huoqing's voice instantly came from the other end.","An Ling, who was the man that answered the phone for you this morning?","Recognizing this voice, An Ling originally wanted to hang up directly, but after hearing the content of his words clearly, her movements paused slightly.","This morning?","Wasn't she at Shen Linyan's house this morning?","That must have been when she was sleeping, and Shen Linyan probably answered it for her, afraid it was work-related.","Seemingly sensing An Ling's pause, Xu Huoqing's voice on the other end darkened, That man even claimed to be your husband.","An Ling leaned back. He is my husband. But what does that have to do with you? Xu Huoqing, didn't I tell you to get lost? Why are you calling me?","Xu Huoqing, however, acted as if he hadn't heard the second half of her sentence. Stop joking around. How could you marry someone when you have face blindness?","An Ling, I know you have face blindness, and I don't even mind. Are you really not going to give us a try? I've already apologized to you for what happened in the past, and besides, I didn't say anything back then, it was all them talking.","These words instantly pulled An Ling back to those bad memories from the past.","Her expression turned cold, and she gripped her phone tightly. Xu Huoqing, I'm telling you for the last time. I'm already married, and even if I weren't, I have zero interest in you. If you harass me again, I won't be polite.","She then hung up and blocked the number.","After so many years, Xu Huoqing was still like a dog-skin plaster; once he stuck to you, you couldn't tear him off. He was purely disgusting.","Xu Huoqing tried calling back only to find out he had been blocked.","He twitched his lips. A lowly producer actually dares to act like this.","He had plenty of ways to deal with her.","He was just about to message his uncle when his uncle called him instead.","Delighted, Xu Huoqing immediately answered, Uncle, let me tell you something. That female producer I asked you to look into last time, can you make her come...","Xu Huoqing!","Before he could finish his sentence, he was coldly interrupted by his uncle. You are not allowed to go looking for that producer anymore! Do you even know who she is before you go provoking her?!","Xu Huoqing was stunned. Isn't she just a minor producer... Who else could she be?","His uncle said in a deep voice, I thought so too at first, but then President Gu of Shihe Media personally called me. Although he didn't say it explicitly, go search An Ling's name online yourself. She is the daughter of the An family!","As soon as these words came out, Xu Huoqing's expression froze.","The daughter of the An family??","After hanging up the phone, he immediately searched the name online.","Although there were no photos online, seeing the exact same name gave Xu Huoqing an inexplicable premonition that this was indeed An Ling.","At this moment, he didn't feel afraid. Instead, a strange, itching feeling arose in his heart. Squinting his eyes as he stared at the screen, Xu Huoqing poked the inside of his cheek with his tongue.","The internet didn't say that the An family's daughter had face blindness.","Didn't this mean that the An family didn't want to reveal this information?","His gaze lingered on the news of her divorce from the Shen family's heir, and he suddenly sneered.","Didn't she get a divorce...","As expected, she was lying to him.","...","In the evening, after dinner, An Ling sat on the sofa watching TV.","Eating some fruit, she quietly glanced at Mother An and Father An out of the corner of her eye.","While she was still hesitating about how to bring it up, An Zhou, who was sitting opposite her and looking down at his phone, suddenly asked, An Ling, did you see the news about the Shen Corporation today?","Her movements paused, and she gave a vague response, Yeah.","Beside them, Mother An and Father An asked curiously, What news?","An Zhou put down his phone and clicked his tongue twice. It was exposed that Shen Linyan is an illegitimate child, and he has left the Shen family. The news broke this morning. The original chairman of the Shen Corporation has returned to his post. A friend just sent me a message saying it's true, and the Shen Corporation has already issued an official announcement.","Hearing this, Mother An's expression froze. She turned to look at An Ling. Lingling, you knew about this too?","An Ling slowly nodded.","An Zhou leaned back on the sofa, crossed his legs, and stretched lazily.","Things are really exciting at the Shen Corporation right now. The announcement said that Shen Linyan left on his own initiative, and everyone is saying he doesn't know what's good for him.","They were blaming everything on Shen Linyan again.","An Ling curled her lip and, looking at the TV, subconsciously replied, That's nonsense. They drove Shen Linyan out first.","How do you know?","Shen Linyan told me.","As soon as those words left her mouth, a sudden silence fell over the living room.","An Ling realized what she had slipped up on, and her expression stiffened slightly.","Turning her head, she saw three pairs of eyes staring straight at her in unison.","An Zhou eyed her suspiciously. \"Did you talk to him today?\"","An Ling set down her fork and let out a soft, sheepish cough.","Pursing her lips and blinking innocently, she said in a sweet voice:","\"Oh, right, I suddenly remembered something. I'm planning to remarry Shen Linyan. Is that okay?\"","Her sincere and casual tone made it sound as if she were merely asking what they should have for breakfast tomorrow.","The three people in the living room: \"...\"","Are you sure you just suddenly remembered?"]},{"number":97,"title":"Chapter 97: Isn't it just that you want to humiliate Shen Linyan","paragraphs":["Feeling the silence in the living room, An Ling was fully prepared to act shamelessly.","An Zhou suddenly burst into laughter, I couldn't tell, An Ling, you have such a wicked heart. You're truly my sister.","An Ling: ?","What do you mean?","An Zhou raised an eyebrow at her with a look that said, I know.","Don't you just want to humiliate Shen Linyan? You're deliberately saying this while he's down and bankrupt, and once he agrees, you'll tell him he's dreaming and could never be good enough for you.","Brother, I'm serious.","Hearing this, An Zhou instantly fell silent, the smile slowly fading from his eyes.","After a moment, he suddenly clicked his tongue and turned his head away.","I gave you an out, and you wouldn't even take it.","Of course he knew An Ling was serious. The moment he saw Shen Linyan go bankrupt, he knew it was over.","Back when Shen Linyan was sick, this girl insisted on going to him; now that he was bankrupt, that guy Shen Linyan would only cling to her even more.","He shot her a sideways glance. He's bankrupt, and he still has the nerve to ask you to remarry him? He wants you to live a life of poverty with him?","An Ling defended herself in a small voice, What's wrong with keeping him as a sugar baby...","As her words fell, the living room grew even quieter.","An Zhou was silent for a long time before he spat out a single word in shock:","Badass.","Only his sister could suggest something as crazy as keeping her ex-husband as a sugar baby.","An Ling looked at her mother, who had remained silent the entire time.","Mom, actually, I agreed to remarry Shen Linyan a long time ago. Those shares were the condition I gave him...","Mother An just looked at her without saying a word.","An Ling spoke softly, Mom, I promised you back then because I couldn't even convince myself. I was worried about remarrying Shen Linyan at the time, but now, I'm not worried anymore...","Even if Shen Linyan had gotten the shares back then, she still would have been worried.","After all, the male and female leads were always there. What if he went bankrupt again after they married?","But now, with Shen Linyan by her side, it was as if he was telling her that she didn't need to be afraid of these things.","An Ling wanted to continue playing the pity card for Shen Linyan, but she suddenly heard Mother An speak:","Okay.","This unexpected agreement stunned both An Zhou and An Ling.","An Ling stood up, her eyes lighting up slightly. Really? Mom.","Mother An leaned back against her chair and nodded. Really. I agree to you remarrying him. Do it.","Watching An Ling happily head upstairs, An Zhou sat up straight, a look of shock on his face.","Why? Mom? How could you agree? Didn't you disagree before?","Had his mom been bought off too?","Mother An, however, simply replied calmly, Even if I don't agree, she will still remarry him. I refused her once before, but Lingling still brought it up today, which means she really wants to remarry Shen Linyan.","To be honest, even Mother An hadn't expected this situation.","An Ling had prosopagnosia. Logically speaking, as long as she had less contact with Shen Linyan, their feelings for each other would fade.","That was why she had always tried to keep Shen Linyan and An Ling apart, hoping their relationship would end naturally.","As if remembering something, she sighed again. Besides, Shen Linyan already contacted me this afternoon while I was playing mahjong.","When she answered the phone, the man's first sentence was:","Auntie, I am no longer a part of the Shen family. Can I remarry An Ling now?","The moment he said that, Mother An completely forgot what tile she was about to play.","She had originally wanted Lingling to have an ordinary marriage.","But she never expected Shen Linyan to actually do something like this.","Mother An was feeling a bit tired. She stood up. Forget it. If Lingling wants this, let her be. They aren't children anymore, and as parents, we can't control them anyway. Didn't you hear that they've been in touch ever since their divorce?","An Zhou looked astonished. No... but Shen Linyan is bankrupt. Mom, do you really want to watch An Ling suffer? What if Shen Linyan is just tricking her for her money?","Mother An chuckled twice, not even looking back as she waved her hand dismissively.","Didn't you hear your sister? She's going to keep Shen Linyan as her sugar baby.","An Zhou had a weird expression on his face.","Keep him as a sugar baby for real?","Father An, who was sitting nearby, slowly stood up. Lingling probably won't suffer. Shen Linyan did so well at the Shen Corporation before; it will be the same even after he leaves.","An Zhou clearly didn't believe it. He'll be targeted to death leaving the Shen family like this. What if remarrying An Ling ends up affecting the An family? Do you know how huge the public outcry on the internet is right now? Dad, you should be persuading Mom, not agreeing with her.","It won't.","Father An patted his shoulder and chuckled. An Zhou, don't worry too much.","An Zhou: ?","Seriously, why are you all so unbothered about this??","...","The moment the news that Shen Linyan was an illegitimate child broke, it instantly caused massive waves on the internet.","Especially when they saw that Shen Linyan had voluntarily cut ties with the Shen Corporation, even more people were in disbelief.","According to the announcement released by the Shen Corporation, it was because the mistress's child and Mother Shen's child were born on the exact same day.","Mother Shen's child tragically passed away at birth, so the mistress swapped her own son with Mother Shen's son. Mother Shen and Father Shen were completely unaware of this and only accidentally discovered the truth recently.","Seeing the former chosen one, the youngest powerful figure in the business world, fall from grace overnight, most people were more interested in gossiping and watching the drama unfold rather than feeling pity.","[Holy crap, is this real? This is way too dramatic.]","[Wealthy families are such a mess. The mistress's son took the heir's seat, while the biological son was reduced to a mere supporting role. It's really not easy being a wealthy wife.]","[Lu Jingshen probably never imagined in his wildest dreams that his older brother was an illegitimate child who stole the position that rightfully belonged to him.]","[Shen Linyan voluntarily severing ties shows he at least has some conscience left. Illegitimate children should just die out on the streets!]","[I agree. Lu Jingshen is the biological son of the Shen parents, yet he had to watch an illegitimate child be doted on and sent abroad to study. Who's going to make up for the differential treatment he suffered all these years?]","[The older brother was heavily groomed as the heir, while he was completely neglected. No wonder Lu Jingshen always acted like a rich playboy outside; it turns out he had lost his parents' attention.]","[Is no one going to say how irresponsible Shen Linyan is acting? Even if he's an illegitimate child, his parents groomed him for so many years, and he just leaves the moment he wants to. Returning the chairman's seat is fine, but shouldn't he at least continue working at the Shen Corporation?]","[Don't worry, he'll definitely get his karma. Just look and see which company would dare to hire Shen Linyan now. With no money and no power, the only thing left for him is a dead end.]","The internet was overwhelmingly filled with curses. Under deliberate guidance, no one blamed the cheating Father Shen. Instead, they deeply despised Shen Linyan's ungrateful behavior while pitying Lu Jingshen, who had suffered so many grievances over the years.","Watching the public opinion on the internet escalate, Lu Jingshen sat on the sofa, holding his phone, and let out a sneer.","Mom, did you read what they're saying online?","He had said it long ago: Shen Linyan only had so many people kissing up to him because of his position as the chairman of the Shen Corporation.","Look at him now. Having lost his status as the Shen family heir, who still takes Shen Linyan seriously?","Mother Shen sat nearby drinking tea. Hearing this, she said indifferently, Don't celebrate too early. Even with Shen Linyan gone, your dad still hasn't planned to give the heir position to you. But I will figure something out.","However, Shen Linyan leaving now was at least a huge weight off her mind.","Previously, they had been wary of his status as the heir and were fretting over how to drive him away. Unexpectedly, he was sensible enough to leave on his own accord.","Beside them, Zhou Wen paused her movements upon hearing this. She looked up at them, pursed her lips, and then silently lowered her head to continue scrolling through her phone.","But in the very next second, her pupils constricted. She snapped her head up and blurted out,","\"Mom, the news is reporting that Big Brother is going to remarry An Ling!\"","Hearing this, Mother Shen's gaze suddenly froze. \"What?\"","She snatched the phone from Zhou Wen, her face instantly darkening.","There, glaringly displayed on the trending search list, was a newly broken headline.","Shocking! The An family heiress announces her remarriage to the Shen family's illegitimate son, Shen Linyan!","Author's note: I really can't stay up any longer, babies. There is just too much going on. Tomorrow night, I will release three chapters together to make up for it. The juicy iconic scene from the synopsis is not far away~"]},{"number":98,"title":"Chapter 98: Don't Want Shen Linyan Anymore Then I'll Take Him [Word Count Fulfilled, Three-in-One]","paragraphs":["Clicking into it, she saw that just ten minutes ago, An Ling's personal account had posted a new update.","[You don't want Shen Linyan anymore? Then I'll take him~]","Attached below the update was a photo—it was a brand-new marriage certificate.","And the date on the marriage certificate was exactly today.","At this, the internet completely exploded.","[Good heavens, what does this mean? One second the illegitimate child scandal breaks out, and the next he remarries his ex-wife.]","[Wait, what kind of plot twist is this? I don't get it.]","[Looking at An Ling's words, why does it feel like the Shen family doesn't want Shen Linyan anymore?]","[What a plot twist, hahahaha.]","[Why does this give off the vibe of a domineering ex-wife loving fiercely?]","The comment section grew increasingly sidetracked, to the point where people even forgot to discuss Shen Linyan's status as an illegitimate child.","An Ling couldn't help but chuckle out loud.","It wasn't a waste of her effort dragging Shen Linyan to the Civil Affairs Bureau first thing in the morning.","It was just that since both she and Shen Linyan had things to do, they hurried back to their respective companies right after getting the certificate.","She put her phone back into her pocket and rested her chin on her hand while watching the monitor. Suddenly, the sound of her colleagues chatting rose behind her.","\"Did you guys see the news? The former chairman of the Shen Group was exposed as an illegitimate child, and he went bankrupt.\"","Her movements paused slightly, but the voices by her ear continued.","\"I saw it, it's all over the trending searches. Wasn't it just revealed that he remarried his ex-wife?\"","\"It's so shocking. This is my first time following gossip outside the entertainment circle, and it's super exciting.\"","\"I remember Shen Fuyuan is going to Shen Linyan's house for a shoot this afternoon, right? Do you think we'll see the people involved? And that An family heiress—if she makes an appearance, our show's ratings will definitely skyrocket once it airs.\"","\"We probably can't film them, right? I remember they said we were only allowed to film the house.\"","Hearing this, one of the colleagues suddenly took off his headphones. \"Chairman Shen went bankrupt? No way! He's a pretty nice guy. Last time we went to the Shen house to set up the cameras, we almost bumped into him, and he even gave us bread. How could this happen?\"","Saying that, he turned to look at An Ling.","\"An Ling seemed to have run into him, and you were the one who got the bread, right?\"","Caught off guard by her name being called, An Ling froze for a second. \"Yes.\"","That colleague laughed, \"We even said at the time that Ah Leng's name is the same as that ex-wife's name. If An Ling hadn't said last time that she didn't have a boyfriend yet, we would have guessed that An Ling was her.\"","An Ling, the ex-wife in question: \"...\"","She indeed didn't have a boyfriend at the time.","She just had an ex-husband.","Not knowing how to answer, she could only smile.","Then she quietly changed the subject. \"It's almost noon. I'll order the boxed lunches. Is the same place as last time okay?\"","Her colleagues' attention was instantly diverted.","\"Sure, sure. The stir-fried pork with garlic sprouts from last time was delicious.\"","\"Their beer-braised duck is also really good.\"","An Ling smiled and pulled her phone out of her pocket. \"I'll ask the boss for today's menu first.\"","Smack— A crisp sound came from the floor.","Just as she opened WeChat, a colleague's voice suddenly reached her ears.","\"An Ling, is this thing on the floor yours?\"","Thing?","She subconsciously looked down, and when she caught a glimpse of that familiar little red booklet, her eyelids twitched violently.","Damn it! She forgot this was still in her pocket!","After getting it in the morning, she was in such a hurry to rush back to the company that she had just casually stuffed it into her pocket.","Seeing her colleague about to help pick it up, her heart skipped a beat. She quickly bent down and snatched the booklet back before her colleague could reach it.","Looking up, she locked eyes with her colleague.","The other person stared at her blankly.","Fortunately, the marriage certificate had landed face down, and An Ling maintained a calm expression.","She let out a few dry laughs. Just as she was about to stuff the thing back into her pocket, she remembered something, and halfway there, she silently slipped it into her bag instead.","\"Thanks, it's a newly bought notebook. It was quite expensive.\"","Her colleague didn't seem to notice anything amiss and nodded.","\"Yeah, I really don't understand prices nowadays. I was scrolling through videos before, and some journaling notebooks are really expensive. One can sell for thousands of yuan.\"","\"...Yeah.\"","For the first time, An Ling wished the filming would end quickly so everyone would stop discussing Shen Linyan.","During the lunch break, An Ling found a moment to check her phone.","She didn't know if the Shen family had bought internet trolls, but a lot of different voices started appearing in the comment section.","[Remarrying at a time like this, is the An family even trying to piggyback off this kind of heat?]","[It was previously exposed that An Ling was chasing Lu Jingshen, and now she's remarrying Shen Linyan. Are we sure this isn't just to grab attention?]","[Remarrying Shen Linyan at this time, it's hard to say if she isn't trying to get some blackmail material on the Shen Group out of Shen Linyan's mouth.]","[According to insider leaks, An Ling and Shen Linyan's relationship was very average before. It was just an arranged marriage, not the kind of relationship where they would remarry just to help each other out. There's most likely another motive. Shen Linyan is pretty miserable too; getting kicked out and then being used by his ex-wife to gain traffic. How do you know Shen Linyan wasn't forced?]","Insider?","Was there anyone who understood her and Shen Linyan's relationship better than they did?","An Ling clicked open this comment and found it was just a burner account.","These words sounded so real that some people had already believed them, though others didn't.","[For those of you doubting their relationship, didn't you see the photo of Mr. and Mrs. Shen holding hands back then?]","[Thanks for the reminder. I found it online, it's true love. An Ling's account has only made three posts: one was an identity verification when she first registered, and the other two are both related to her husband.]","An Ling didn't take these words to heart. Anyway, she had long discovered that some people's mindsets were just hard to change.","Even when she posted that photo of them holding hands before, some people still didn't believe in the feelings between her and Shen Linyan.","Just like how her brother didn't believe Shen Linyan was a good person.","...","After returning home that evening, An Ling was just about to open the door and go in.","Suddenly, a man's voice sounded behind her.","\"An Ling, I've realized you really are the speedy type. Fast to divorce, and fast to remarry.\"","Having this happen suddenly in the middle of the night scared An Ling so much she almost screamed. \"Brother, why don't you make any sound when you walk! You scared me to death! Are Mom and Dad asleep?\"","An Zhou, wearing pajamas and leaning against the wall, wagged his index finger. \"Don't change the subject. We're talking about serious matters. You just agreed yesterday and went to remarry today? I thought a certain someone wouldn't be coming back today and would be going home with her husband instead.\"","An Ling ignored his teasing. \"Shen Linyan has cameras in his house, so I won't move in for the time being.\"","She had already told Shen Linyan that she planned to move back after the show ended.","Hearing this, An Zhou frowned. \"Then why did you remarry so quickly? What's the difference between this and not being remarried?\"","\"Didn't you see what they're saying online? Remarrying is obviously to shut their mouths and suppress the illegitimate child scandal.\"","An Ling was so tired she didn't even have the energy to chat. She opened her bedroom door. \"Alright, I'm exhausted. Brother, you should go back to your room too.\"","Closing the bedroom door, An Ling lay down on her bed.","She thought for a moment, then got up and took her phone out of her bag.","She hadn't chatted much with Shen Linyan today. She had originally planned to chat with him after coming back at night, but she didn't expect to be busy until so late.","A dozen minutes ago, the man had sent her a message.","[Are you home yet?]","An Ling: [I'm here. I'll take a shower in a bit.]","Shen Linyan: [Okay, rest early, Madam.]","Looking at the screen, An Ling blinked.","\"It seems like there really is no difference...\"","Was it because this was how they interacted before?","Getting the marriage certificate was a rushed affair, and they immediately threw themselves back into work right after.","She originally wanted to have lunch with Shen Linyan, but her colleagues were all there, so she couldn't easily slip away.","It wasn't quite like the remarriage she had imagined.","Yet she couldn't quite put her finger on how it was different.","After a few seconds of silence, An Ling sighed. Just as she was about to turn off her screen, a message suddenly popped up from him.","Shen Linyan: [I have to go abroad tomorrow.]","Seeing this message, she paused.","She immediately sat up in bed.","An Ling: [For how many days?]","Shen Linyan: [I'm not exactly sure, probably four days.]","She typed and deleted words in the chat box. In the end, she didn't ask for the reason. Her eyes lowered, and she pursed her lips tightly.","Who said there was no difference? On the first day of their remarriage, her husband was going on a business trip.","An Ling: [Okay.]","Shen Linyan: [Can I see you, my wife?]","An Ling was stunned for a moment and checked the time.","It was already eleven o'clock.","[Now? Are you coming to find me? Or should I go find you?]","Immediately after, the man's message popped up again.","Shen Linyan: [I'm at your door.]","Her eyes widened, and she immediately opened her door and went downstairs.","Pushing open the main gate, the porch light was on. The night air carried a chill, and she saw a tall, straight figure standing in front of the door.","The man was wearing a black cashmere coat, boasting long legs and broad shoulders, exuding a noble aura. Underneath was a perfectly ironed suit. The shadows from the streetlamp outlined his deep-set features. His clear, dark eyes looked at her, as if his gentleness was melting into the deep night.","An Ling stood frozen, watching him walk toward her step by step.","The man took off his coat and draped it over her shoulders. He pulled her into his embrace, cradling the back of her head with his palm, and lowered his head to gently kiss the top of her hair.","\"Don't be mad at me, okay?\"","His warm breath brushed against her ear. His voice was magnetic, like vibrating strings. The coat still held his lingering body heat, enveloping her in a reassuring scent that drove away the cold night wind.","Yet, An Ling didn't know what emotions she was feeling.","In truth, even if Shen Linyan didn't go abroad, she had to keep an eye on the program's progress these next few days and wouldn't have time to accompany him anyway.","But this feeling was different.","It was a bit like what An Zhou had said: whether they remarried or not, it seemed about the same.","She pursed her lips and gripped the man's clothes tightly. \"Shen Linyan, but today is the first day of our remarriage...\"","\"I know, baby.\"","Shen Linyan cupped her face, lowering his head to kiss her again and again. \"I'll handle everything and come back soon. I'll tell you everything when I return, okay?\"","An Ling looked at him and slowly nodded.","\"Okay.\"","After a moment of silence, she suddenly looked up. \"Do you have money to spend abroad?\"","The man was taken aback. His chest vibrated slightly as he let out a low chuckle, his thumb gently rubbing her earlobe.","\"No. Is my wife going to give me some?\"","An Ling answered without hesitation, \"Yes.\"","Expenses abroad were high, and she couldn't let Shen Linyan go hungry.","Seeing her serious expression, Shen Linyan smiled and kissed her eyes. \"Alright, then I'll make sure to bring a gift back for my wife.\"","\"Are you going to buy me a gift with my own money?\"","\"Do you not like that?\"","\"I like it, but please be frugal. Our quality of life isn't what it used to be, Mr. Shen,\" An Ling said dryly.","Laughter spilled from the man's lips. He wrapped his arms around her waist and lowered his voice near her ear, \"Then can I buy something cheap, Madam?\"","An Ling nodded in approval. \"You can.\"","Under the silent night sky, the figures of the man and woman were stretched long by the streetlamp.","Darkness enveloped their surroundings, but a warm, dim halo of light lingered around them.","...","After Shen Linyan went abroad, An Ling basically left early and returned late.","She spent her days at the company and her nights at home, constantly keeping an eye on the monitors and other matters. She was so busy her feet barely touched the ground.","Furthermore, due to the time difference, it was hard for her and Shen Linyan to speak much during the day.","It wasn't until the final recording ended that the entire studio finally relaxed.","Nan Zhechuan leaned back in his chair and turned to look at her. \"An Ling, are you going to the dinner party tonight? After copying the footage, Mr. Chen said we should all grab a meal together to celebrate the end of the recording.\"","An Ling was packing up her things and shook her head upon hearing this.","\"No, I have family matters to attend to tonight. I've already told Mr. Chen.\"","Tonight was a dinner with the Qin family. She had to go to the restaurant, and An Zhou would be coming to pick her up shortly.","Since it was a dinner between the two families, An Zhou had dressed up meticulously today. He wore a crisp dark blue suit, and his hair was slicked back, revealing a smooth forehead. It gave him an elite vibe, and when he wasn't speaking, he actually exuded a somewhat mature and steady aura.","As soon as An Ling got into the car, he couldn't wait to show off his outfit.","\"How is it? Your brother looks handsome today, right?\"","\"You look like a human.\"","\"Say something nice.\"","\"That'll cost extra.\"","\"...\"","An Ling's ears finally got a moment of peace. Just as she was about to take out her phone to see what message Shen Linyan had left her,","An Zhou's voice sounded from beside her again.","\"By the way, there's been quite a lot of turmoil in the Shen Corporation these past few days.\"","She paused her movements and looked up, only to see An Zhou smiling happily. \"Shen Linyan was in charge of several projects before. After he left, all those projects fell through. Who knows how much money they've lost.\"","Everyone online was saying that Shen Linyan would face retribution for abandoning the Shen Corporation.","But in reality, it was the Shen Corporation that was in danger without Shen Linyan.","She didn't know what Shen Linyan had been busy with lately. Could his trip abroad be related to the Shen Corporation's affairs?","The car stopped at a red light.","An Zhou glanced at her and suddenly asked, \"An Ling, did Shen Linyan tell you about that matter?\"","An Ling was taken aback. \"What matter?\"","\"I knew it. You've been so busy lately, it seems you don't know. I'll tell you, but you can't reveal that I was the one who said it.\"","An Zhou tapped the steering wheel and said slowly, \"Dad secretly told me yesterday. They added a condition for Shen Linyan's remarriage to you: he has to have his own company.\"","But under the current circumstances, this was practically a fantasy.","Shen Linyan had just resigned from the Shen Corporation. Even if he started a company, who would dare to collaborate with him? They would definitely be targeted by the Shen Corporation.","Even when he heard this condition at the time, he felt it was making things way too difficult for him.","But Dad said Shen Linyan had agreed to it.","No wonder they were so relieved. So there was such a condition. If he really managed to pull it off, who wouldn't feel reassured?","An Ling had never heard of this. She sat blankly in her seat, seemingly unable to process it.","\"...A company?\"","An Zhou shrugged. \"But you've already remarried Shen Linyan. That guy must be thrilled. This condition will probably just be fulfilled slowly over time.\"","An Ling didn't say anything, just looked thoughtfully at her phone.","After getting out of the car and arriving at the restaurant, they met up with the Qin family.","An Ling finally met the legendary Miss Qin. The woman was beautiful, carrying a uniquely aloof and elegant aura.","Seeing her, the woman's eyes showed a hint of surprise before her lips curved into a gentle smile. \"Hello, I'm Qin You.\"","An Ling also smiled, her eyes curving as she shook her hand. \"Hello, I'm An Ling.\"","Halfway through the meal, An Ling went out to use the restroom. Just as she walked around the corner, she heard a man's voice.","\"Why did you decide to get married? During our blind date, Miss Qin didn't seem too satisfied with me, did she?\"","This familiar voice clearly belonged to An Zhou.","An Ling paused her steps. She struggled between listening to gossip and moral condemnation for a mere 0.01 seconds before standing behind the wall and quietly pricking up her ears.","Qin You's voice followed: \"I'm quite satisfied. President An and I are both just lacking a marriage partner. There's nothing wrong with this.\"","An Zhou's expression was strange. \"No, but... I have no feelings for you. Can you really stand that?\"","Qin You stared at him, frowned, and suddenly grabbed his collar. Tilting her head up, she kissed him, her tone already carrying a hint of impatience.","\"It's just a marriage of convenience. I'm fine with it. How can a grown man like you be even more coy than a woman?\"","An Zhou, who was caught off guard by the kiss: ???","An Ling, who witnessed all of this: !˶╹ꇴ╹˶!!","Even after the three of them returned to the private room, An Ling caught a glimpse of An Zhou's dumbfounded expression out of the corner of her eye and pursed her lips, trying hard to hold back her laughter.","After dinner, the two families finally decided to let the two youngsters interact for a period of time first. There was no rush for the wedding.","To give them a chance to be alone, Mother An asked An Zhou to take Qin You home.","Seeing the car leave, Mother An turned to look at An Ling. \"Lingling, you can ride back with your dad and me.\"","An Ling had her hand on the car door handle. Just as she was about to open it, she paused.","She pulled her hand back. \"Mom, you guys go back first. I have some things to handle at the company, so I won't go back with you.\"","Perhaps because An Ling had indeed been very busy these past few days, Mother An didn't ask further upon hearing this. She simply nodded and got into the car.","Watching the car drive out of sight, An Ling took out her phone to call a ride-hailing car.","...","\"Beep—\"","The front door was pushed open from the outside.","The light from the hallway outside shone into the living room as An Ling walked in and closed the door behind her.","The living room curtains were drawn open, letting the moonlight shine through the floor-to-ceiling windows. A dim yellow floor lamp was lit next to the sofa, and the hallway lights were also on. It was probably Aunt Cheng who was afraid that Huihui would be scared staying here alone.","Her colleagues had already dismantled the equipment in the living room, and Aunt Cheng had cleaned it again, restoring everything to its original state.","Suddenly, a milky \"meow\" echoed in the air.","She put her bag on the sofa, walked over, and opened a cat treat. Squatting in front of the cat bed, she rubbed its head and softened her voice.","\"Did you miss Mommy after not seeing her for a few days?\"","Shen Fuyuan really had a knack for raising cats. After just a few days of not seeing it, Huihui had noticeably gotten a bit chubbier.","Huihui ate the cat treat, rubbing its little head against her palm and purring in its throat, seemingly responding to her.","After feeding the cat treat, she rubbed its head again and then stood up to walk toward her room. Just as she was about to open the door, her gaze caught the room next door, and she blinked.","She had never been to Shen Linyan's room. Every time, it was Shen Linyan who came to her room.","It should be fine to go in and take a look, right?","Shen Linyan wouldn't be angry, would he?","But Shen Linyan had gone to her room.","Besides, they were husband and wife now. Looking at his room was no big deal.","While brainwashing herself, An Ling shuffled over to his bedroom door with small steps, her hand hesitantly resting on the doorknob.","\"Creak—\"","The door opened a crack. Through the light from the hallway, the furnishings in the room came into view. It had the same layout as her room.","The color scheme of the man's room was mainly light luxury gray and white. It was spotlessly clean, with a dark gray carpet on the floor. A computer and books were placed on the table in front of the sofa, and a pair of glasses lay beside them.","Shen Linyan actually wore glasses!?","After a few seconds of internal struggle, An Ling stepped into the room, picked up the glasses, and examined them.","They were probably anti-blue light. Her eyes had been sore from looking at materials these past few days, so she had also bought a pair of these anti-blue light glasses.","An Ling originally just intended to take a look, but as she looked, she ended up lying on the bed. The quilt carried a faint, clean cedar scent, exactly like the smell on Shen Linyan.","Lying on the edge of the bed, she swung her legs and took out her phone.","She wondered when Shen Linyan would be back. They had agreed on four days, so he should be back soon.","It was noon in London right now, so Shen Linyan shouldn't be busy.","She thought for a moment and sent a message.","[When are you coming back? The show finished filming today, and the cameras at home have been taken down.]","Just as An Ling sat up, her phone suddenly buzzed.","Shen Linyan: [Is my wife working overtime today?]","An Ling: [No need. I'm eating out with my family tonight, and taking the chance to meet my brother's future marriage partner.]","Thinking of what she had seen, she couldn't help but let out a laugh.","It was too amazing. Her brother was actually forcefully kissed by someone else one day.","Shen Linyan: [Have you finished eating and gone home now?]","An Ling: [No, I'm outside. Do you want to guess where? ^^]","Hehe, Shen Linyan would definitely never guess that she was in his bedroom.","However, before she could even type out the message, she saw a sentence from the other side.","Shen Linyan: [Are you hanging out with friends? I'll come pick you up later.]","Pick her up?","An Ling typed in confusion: [Aren't you abroad?]","Shen Linyan: [I'm back. Giving my wife a surprise ^^]","The moment she received the message, An Ling heard a familiar \"Beep—\" from the front door.","Immediately following was the sound of suitcase wheels rolling.","The man's familiar deep voice rang out.","\"Huihui, get down from the sofa.\"","An Ling's eyes widened: ????","She stood up in a daze, looking down at the message, and then at the bed she had messed up by lying on it.","\"...\"","Was this a surprise?","Then she had also prepared a surprise for Shen Linyan.","An Ling's face stiffened slightly. She silently reached out to smooth out the wrinkled quilt and put the glasses back in their original place.","What do I do, what do I do!","Casually entering someone else's room was one thing, but randomly lying on their bed! Previously, Shen Linyan would always ask her before entering her room.","Hearing the sound of the suitcase outside the door getting closer and closer, An Ling's expression became even more rigid. Her eyes darted around in panic, inexplicably feeling a guilty conscience like a thief.","The sound of the door opening rang out, and she subconsciously hid in the adjacent bathroom.","\"Click—\"","Seeing the lights turn on in the room, An Ling's expression froze.","Wait? Why did she seem so much like she was having an illicit affair?","Forget it, whatever.","It was only getting more and more awkward now.","Once Shen Linyan left, she would immediately leave too, pretending nothing had ever happened.","An Ling squatted on the ground and sent a message to Shen Linyan.","[Then come pick me up right away (⑉••⑉) I'm at the mall.]","Unexpectedly, a message suddenly came from the other side.","[Wife, want to have a phone call?]","An Ling: ? Right now??"]},{"number":99,"title":"Chapter 99: Couples Should Naturally Share a Room [Word Count Fulfilled]","paragraphs":["Of all times to call, he had to call right now.","Thanks to the man's reminder, An Ling hurriedly muted her phone.","[Not calling, I'm outside.]","Shen Linyan: [I want to show my wife her present.]","An Ling: [Wait until I get back.]","After sending this message, the man's laughter seemed to echo outside the bathroom.","Soon after, footsteps sounded. An Ling could clearly feel them getting closer and closer, heading straight for the bathroom.","She was so scared she didn't even dare to breathe.","The footsteps drew nearer. The man's silhouette was cast against the frosted glass door, his hand resting on the doorknob.","Just as he was about to come in, it was as if he suddenly thought of something. He turned around and walked back to sit on the sofa.","Shen Linyan: [Send me your location.]","An Ling randomly picked a nearby shopping mall and sent the location.","Shen Linyan: [Can you wait for me to take a shower and change clothes?]","An Ling thought to herself, if I wait for you to shower, I'm doomed.","[Why do you need to shower? Just come directly.]","Shen Linyan: [Because I'm going to see you.]","An Ling: [No need. Right now, just come over.]","Shen Linyan: [Okay (⑉••⑉)]","The man got up from the sofa, followed by the sound of the door closing.","He was finally gone. Her legs were almost numb from crouching.","An Ling supported herself against the wall and stood up, patting her legs as she muttered softly,","\"If I had known, I wouldn't have come in here.\"","Now she still had to rush to the mall.","She opened the bathroom door and stepped out. As soon as she looked up, she froze in place.","The man who was supposed to have left was currently standing right at the doorway.","He was wearing a black shirt with a few buttons undone at the collar, revealing the smooth lines of his collarbones. Black trousers further accentuated his excellent proportions. His features were sharp and clear, with dark hair falling over his forehead.","He leaned his head against the door frame, his dark eyes rippling with a hint of a smile.","\"Can my wife teleport?\"","\"...\"","She had been played again.","Sure enough, there was something off about that phone call.","Under the man's gaze, An Ling silently walked over to the bed, lay down, and buried her face in the quilt.","She put on a posture of, \"This is how I am, what are you going to do about it?\"","Shen Linyan laughed, walked over, and lay down beside her, reaching out to pull her into his arms.","But the woman twisted her waist and dodged to the side, turning her head away to avoid looking at him, clearly sulking.","\"When did you find out?\"","If she had known, she wouldn't have bothered hiding.","\"Your shoes and bag were out there. I saw them as soon as I came in.\"","Shen Linyan hadn't noticed the shoes at first; it was seeing the bag on the sofa that made him realize his wife was home.","He knew she was in the room.","But he didn't expect An Ling to actually hide.","\"Don't be mad, okay?\"","He smiled and chased after her, pulling his angry little wife into his arms again. This time, he managed to hold her tight. \"Why did you hide?\"","An Ling slowly turned her head. Her pupils were clear, her eyelashes fluttering, and a layer of blush dyed her cheeks. \"Because this is your room. I was just taking a look around, I didn't touch anything.\"","The man's long, slender fingers gently brushed the hair away from her ear.","\"Darling, we are husband and wife now,\" he reminded her.","An Ling nodded. \"I know. We slept in separate rooms before, didn't we?\"","Hearing this, Shen Linyan's expression slightly froze.","His eyes darkened, and his knuckles curled unconsciously.","After recovering, the corners of his mouth habitually curved upward, and his voice softened. \"Do you mean that after moving back in, we should interact like we used to?\"","This \"used to,\" naturally, referred to how they interacted after she returned.","An Ling blinked hesitantly. \"Shouldn't we...?\"","Getting along like before was pretty good...","Just as she was thinking this, a voice came by her ear.","\"It seems my wife hasn't understood my words.\"","Shen Linyan got up and hovered over her, his arms propped on either side of her. He lowered his eyes to gaze at her and parted his lips to say, \"Lingling, we are a real married couple, not a marriage of convenience.\"","An Ling's eyes widened slightly in a daze.","Her lips were captured. The man's tall nose brushed against her cheek, and his scorching breath fell upon her lips. \"Therefore, my room is also your room. Husband and wife are supposed to share a room. Live in here with me, okay?\"","The man's deep, magnetic voice sounded by her ear, laced with a bewitching charm, gently striking her eardrums, making it utterly impossible to refuse.","An Ling's ears inexplicably felt a little itchy, and a crimson hue climbed up her cheeks. But she still resisted the temptation, raising her hands to push against the man's chest, just about to say something.","Suddenly, a cold metallic sensation brushed across the back of her hand, making her shiver.","An Ling subconsciously looked over.","In the deep night, a silver chain had slipped out from the man's clothes at some point.","A familiar ring hung quietly on it, rippling with a faint glow under the dim light.","Her gaze froze, and she instinctively reached out to touch the ring. \"This is...\"","A scalding palm wrapped around the back of her hand. The man smiled and lowered his head to kiss her eyes. \"The wedding ring you gave me.\"","An Ling naturally recognized it.","Back then, to resolve a news scandal, they had decided to put on a show of affection.","She sat up, stared at the ring for a while, blinked, and then looked up at him. \"When did you start wearing this? I thought you...\"","She had thought Shen Linyan had put the ring away in storage.","\"The day after our divorce.\" The man took off the chain and removed the ring.","Shen Linyan had once thought about throwing the ring away, as if doing so would throw away all the memories and attachments along with it.","But it was always just a thought; he never actually did it.","Because this was the only thing An Ling had left him.","And the only thing he could hold onto.","Shen Linyan took the woman's left hand and gently slid the ring onto her ring finger.","The woman's fingers were slender and fair. The silver men's wedding ring was far too big for her hand, reflecting a brilliant luster, looking both beautiful and delicate.","He curved his lips into a smile, his eyelashes drooping as his thumb brushed over the wedding ring on her finger. He spoke softly, \"I thought I would never have the chance to put a ring on my wife again. Sometimes, I even regretted refusing to let you put the ring on me that afternoon.\"","An Ling looked down at the ring on her finger.","After a moment of silence, her eyes suddenly curved into a smile. She looked up and said, \"Shen Linyan, let's go buy a new pair of wedding rings, alright? And then I'll put yours on for you.\"","Shen Linyan wrapped his arm around her waist, pulling her into his embrace. He smiled and lowered his head to kiss the top of her hair. \"Okay.\"","An Ling was still thinking about when they would have free time to go pick out rings when the man's voice sounded by her ear again.","\"So, does my wife agree to sleep in the same room as me?\"","\"...\"","He was still hung up on that.","An Ling turned her head. The man's elegant and handsome face was incredibly striking, his dark eyes staring straight at her.","After their eyes met, his eyes curved as he leaned in to kiss her lips. \"Hmm?\"","After a brief moment of silence, An Ling smiled helplessly and wrapped her arms around his neck. \"Alright.\"","The man chuckled, cupped her chin, and lowered his head to kiss her.","The temperature in the air gradually rose, the narrow space between them enveloped in a scorching, cool fragrance.","The woman hugged the man's neck. Under the light, the silver men's wedding ring dangled from her fingertip, on the verge of falling.","Finally, the moment the woman was lifted and turned around, the ring slipped from her finger, falling to the floor with a soft clack.","Feeling her hand empty, An Ling lay on the bed, panting slightly. \"The ring dropped...\"","Before she could finish her sentence, the rest of her words were entirely swallowed between their lips and teeth, leaving only the man's heavy breathing in their passionate entanglement.","\"It's fine, if it dropped, it dropped...\"","The consequence of messing around with Shen Linyan was losing track of time.","Kissed into a daze, An Ling accidentally opened her eyes and caught a glimpse of her phone vibrating on the side.","The caller ID read: Mom.","Reason suddenly returning, she blushed and gently pushed the man on top of her. Her voice was soft at the end, \"My mom is calling. I originally told her I was working overtime at the company.\"","It was truly a coincidence. Last time they were interrupted by An Zhou, and this time it was her mother.","Shen Linyan saw the phone, straightened up slightly, lowered his head to kiss her eyes, and after a moment of silence suddenly asked, \"Is Madam staying here tonight?\"","An Ling had just grabbed her phone. Hearing this, she turned her head to look at him.","She looked at him, blinked, and didn't say anything.","Seeing this, Shen Linyan chuckled, reached out to tidy her hair, and his voice remained gentle, \"Alright, I won't tease you anymore. Answer the phone, I'll go check on Huihui.\"","He got out of bed and bent down to pick up the dropped ring from the floor.","Just as he placed the ring on the nightstand, his arm was suddenly tugged gently.","The woman held his hand, tilted her head up, her pretty face flushed with a layer of pink, and her eyes held a smile. \"I'll move back in tomorrow.\"","Shen Linyan looked slightly stunned, then his lips curved into a smile as he held her hand. \"Okay.\"","Before leaving the house, the man suddenly called out to her, \"Madam, you haven't looked at the gift I gave you.\"","An Ling's face showed a moment of surprise. She originally thought he was just joking before, and didn't expect there to really be a gift, so she sat back down on the sofa. \"What gift?\"","She saw the man bring out a document from the room. An Ling had signed too many contracts recently, and she recognized at a glance that this was a contract.","The man spoke, \"Madam, I opened a new company.\"","An Ling instantly recalled what An Zhou had said. \"I heard from An Zhou before that you agreed to a condition from my mother, and it was this...\"","\"Yes, I asked a friend abroad to speed things up. Although the company is very small, it can operate normally.\"","He pushed the contract over. \"And this is the gift I'm giving to you, Madam.\"","\"What? You're giving the company to me?\" An Ling smiled and picked up the contract.","She just didn't know if this was really worth any money.","Before she could clearly read the contents, Shen Linyan's gentle voice sounded by her ear.","\"This is the kind of agency agreement I signed with my father before.\"","Her movements suddenly paused. She looked up in astonishment, only to meet his warm eyes. The man's eyes curved in a smile as he spoke softly:","\"Signing this means that I will manage this company on your behalf. Any issues that arise will be my responsibility, while all the shares and profits will belong entirely to you, Madam.\"","An Ling stared at him blankly, opened her mouth, but didn't know what to say.","After a moment of silence, she pursed her lips, picked up a pen, and signed her name on it.","After signing, she looked up and shifted to the side, quietly patting the spot next to her, signaling the man to come sit down.","As soon as Shen Linyan sat down, the woman cupped his face, and her soft lips unexpectedly pressed against his.","He looked up in a daze, unexpectedly meeting a pair of clean and bright almond-shaped eyes.","The woman's eyes curved into crescents, the end of her sentence rising like a little hook. Her voice was sweet and soft, \"Do your best, Hubby. Once we make money, we'll go buy rings. I don't want a huge diamond like the previous one, it's expensive and impractical. This time we'll just buy ordinary ones, and I'll wear it every day.\"","A trace of surprise flashed in Shen Linyan's eyes for a second.","His Adam's apple bobbed, the corners of his mouth rising uncontrollably. He lowered his head, smiling as he gently rested his forehead against hers.","\"Wifey, we have to buy the big one too. We will have the money.\"","After the last shoot, An Ling's workload lightened a bit, and she didn't have as many things to do.","She had just returned from the pantry when she received a message on her phone.","It was a message from an unknown, strange number.","[What a surprise, the An family's young lady actually has face blindness.]","Her gaze paused slightly. Seeing that she had read it, the other party became even more arrogant.","[Why aren't you replying after seeing it? Your colleagues at the company probably don't know that Producer An is the An family's young lady, right? And they definitely don't know that Producer An has face blindness.]","An Ling placed her cup on the table and, without changing her expression, blocked the number.","Just after blocking it, she received a message from Shen Linyan.","[Madam, I have nothing to do at noon. Would you like to have lunch together?]","An Ling: [Sure, are we going home?]","Shen Linyan: [No, we're eating out. I'll come pick you up during your lunch break.]","When the lunch break arrived, An Ling left the company and got into the car.","Ever since Shen Linyan left the Shen family, his cars had been taken away, and he had switched to a new car.","An Ling had previously worried if his house would also be taken away, but Shen Linyan said the house wouldn't be, as he had bought it with his own money.","She suddenly asked curiously, \"Is Secretary Chen still staying at the Shen Corporation?\"","Shen Linyan's tone was natural. \"No, the Shen Corporation fired him too. He will probably work with me later.\"","Halfway through the meal, An Ling went to the restroom. She pulled out a paper towel to wipe the water off her hands and casually looked up. Through the mirror, she saw a man wearing a hat leaning against the wall behind her, not knowing when he had arrived.","The man casually leaned against the wall smoking. The brim of his hat hid his eyes, revealing only the sharp, chiseled lower half of his face.","She threw the paper towel into the trash can. Just as she turned around to leave, the man suddenly let out a scoff, his tone carrying a familiar casualness.","\"An Ling, was that your bankrupt husband just now?\"","Her footsteps paused slightly, and she turned her head to glare at him coldly.","The man lowered his cigarette and lifted his head, revealing his full face. That rebellious and untamed face carried a roguish air, and the smile on his lips was unbridled. \"Sorry, I forgot that our Miss An is face-blind. But our An Ling should know who I am, right?\"","An Ling glanced at him and wanted to turn around and leave.","Xu Huoqing raised a hand to adjust his hat and spoke slowly:","\"An Ling, you really make me sad. Didn't you see my messages? If you just walk away like this, I'm going to tell everyone about the An family's young lady having face blindness.\"","\"...\"","She knew it was this guy.","An Ling stopped in her tracks, turned her head, and said indifferently, \"Xu Huoqing, do you think you can threaten me like this?\"","The woman was wearing a black V-neck knit sweater dress. Her jet-black long hair was pinned up, revealing the graceful lines of her neck, adorned with a silver necklace that accentuated her fair and delicate skin. Her exquisite and beautiful face held no expression as she looked at him coldly.","Yet, it only made one feel an unbearable itch in their heart.","Xu Huoqing's Adam's apple bobbed. His gaze was firmly fixed on her face as he took a few steps forward.","\"Don't worry, I won't say anything. After all, this is a secret only I know. Who told you to always ignore me and block several of my numbers? I had no choice but to do this.\"","As he spoke, he wore an expression of feigned sadness on his face.","But when his gaze landed on a glaring red mark on the side of the woman's neck, Xu Huoqing's expression suddenly froze, a fleeting look of hostility flashing in his eyes.","Fuck, someone else beat him to it.","His mood instantly soured. With a gloomy face, he strode forward, wanting to grab the woman's hand, and sneered sarcastically:","\"An Ling, even knowing you have face blindness, I didn't despise you, and my family background isn't bad either. Why don't you divorce that whoever and be with me? That way, I'll help you keep this secret.\"","An Ling frowned deeply, took a big step back, and slapped the man's hand away. \"Get lost! Xu Huoqing, stop being an eyesore! I don't care what you want to do.\"","She really could not be bothered to waste her breath on someone like him, so she simply turned and walked away.","A sharp pain flared on the back of his hand. Already provoked by the sight of her kiss marks, Xu Huoqing's eyes grew increasingly vicious.","Was he actually losing out to a bankrupt illegitimate son?","Staring at the woman's retreating back, his expression turned dark and sinister as he ground his teeth.","\"An Ling, you brought this upon yourself.\"","Then she could not blame him for going after Shen Linyan."]},{"number":100,"title":"Chapter 100: An Ling's Secret [Word Count Restored]","paragraphs":["An Ling never expected to run into Xu Huoqing at the restaurant.","He had found out the truth earlier than she anticipated, and, unsurprisingly, was using it to blackmail her.","Sitting in the passenger seat, she looked down and gripped her phone, until suddenly, someone cupped her cheeks.","\"What is on your mind, darling?\"","An Ling paused slightly, turning her head to meet the man's gentle eyes.","Without her noticing, the car had already parked downstairs outside her office building.","Shen Linyan unbuckled his seatbelt and reached over to adjust her scarf. \"Is something at work bothering you? You didn't seem to have much of an appetite during the meal either.\"","Seeing Xu Huoqing had disgusted An Ling so much that she truly had lost her appetite.","After a brief silence, she looked up and smiled. \"I just ran into a really annoying person at the restaurant earlier. But it's no big deal, I gave him a piece of my mind.\"","\"I'll head up now. Drive safe,\" An Ling said, opening the car door.","\"I'll pick you up after work.\"","\"Okay.\"","Watching her figure disappear into the building, Shen Linyan sat in the car and pulled out his phone to make a call.","Secretary Chen's voice came through the line: \"Chairman Shen, what are your orders?\"","Shen Linyan lowered his eyes and said, \"Pull up some security footage for me. Find out who An Ling interacted with. The address is...\"","Knock, knock, knock.","Before he could finish, someone tapped on the car window.","He paused and lifted his eyelids for a quick glance.","Outside the window stood an unfamiliar young man wearing a black baseball cap.","When Shen Linyan rolled down the window, the man casually leaned against the frame.","\"You're Shen Linyan, right?\"","\"Can I help you?\"","Noticing the man's cold gaze, Xu Huoqing let out a chuckle.","His smile seemed friendly, but a subtle contempt was hidden in his eyes. \"You might not know me, but I know An Ling. And I have some secrets about her that you'll definitely find interesting.\"","Hearing this familiar arrogant tone, Shen Linyan paused slightly, his dark eyes slowly sweeping over the other man's face.","His long fingers tapped lightly on the steering wheel, his thoughts unreadable.","\"...Chairman Shen?\" Secretary Chen's hesitant voice came from the phone.","He withdrew his gaze, his voice indifferent. \"I'll send you the address in a moment.\"","Seeing him hang up, Xu Huoqing was about to speak, but the man in the car slowly raised his eyes.","\"You mentioned An Ling's secrets just now?\"","The man in the driver's seat wore a sharp suit, boasting deep, handsome features and an innate aristocratic aura. He didn't look the least bit like someone who had gone bankrupt.","A hint of gloom flashed through Xu Huoqing's eyes, and he silently clicked his tongue.","Just a bastard who happened to look decent. Could that face-blind woman An Ling even recognize him?","\"Yeah,\" Xu Huoqing smirked. \"Secrets you absolutely don't know.\"","He was completely confident that An Ling would never tell Shen Linyan about these things.","The An family didn't even dare to let the internet know about their daughter's face blindness; why would she tell a loveless marriage-of-convenience partner?","Weren't the two of them just together for clout and money?","Thinking of this, Xu Huoqing's gaze became meaningful. He deliberately lowered his voice, \"You probably don't know this, but An Ling actually has face blindness.\"","As soon as the words fell, the man's fingers stopped tapping the steering wheel. His cold, heavy gaze swept over Xu Huoqing outside the car. Though devoid of emotion, the look was suffocating.","A sudden chill ran down Xu Huoqing's spine.","What the hell, why did he feel a bit scared?","What was there to fear from a bankrupt illegitimate son?","But the oppressive feeling vanished in an instant. The man's expression returned to its usual refined elegance as he asked calmly, \"Who told you that?\"","Xu Huoqing forced down his fear and twitched his lips. \"I found out myself. If you don't believe me, go test her. An Ling can't actually tell anyone apart.\"","Once he knew about An Ling's face blindness, he didn't believe this man would remain indifferent.","He had given An Ling a chance, so she couldn't blame him for resorting to this method.","Not forgetting his objective, he took out a business card and handed it over. \"Once you confirm that I'm telling the truth, you can contact me.\"","Glancing at the name on it, Shen Linyan suddenly chuckled, the sound carrying an ambiguous meaning.","After Xu Huoqing left, Secretary Chen sent a message.","[Chairman Shen, as instructed, we found the person. The Madam chatted with a man in the restaurant corridor. It was Xu Huoqing, the one you investigated last time.]","Shen Linyan cast a sidelong glance at the business card in his hand and slowly tore it into pieces.","[Dig up all the information on this person.]","[Yes, sir.]","Shen Linyan dialed a number.","On the other end, Gu Xiaochi looked at the caller ID on his phone with a surprised expression.","Shen Linyan was actually calling him on his own initiative?","He answered the call, put the phone to his ear, and leaned back comfortably, slouching lazily in his chair.","\"How rare. Our busy Chairman Shen actually has time for me. Listen...\"","Before he could finish, the man's icy voice abruptly cut him off.","\"Gu Xiaochi, I asked you to deal with Xu Huoqing. How exactly did you deal with him? Bring that Guo Yu, or whatever his name is, and meet me at the club tomorrow night.\"","Gu Xiaochi's face instantly stiffened.","Wait, what?","He really had dealt with him!","After work, An Ling looked down as she packed her things and stood up.","Tonight she was going back to the An family home for dinner with Shen Linyan, and after dinner, she could move back.","She thought happily. She pressed the elevator button, and while waiting, she heard a colleague's voice beside her.","\"Ah Leng, are you getting off work too?\"","She paused and turned to look, finding a few colleagues there. Her gaze fell on their faces, but she could only vaguely recognize Sister Lin Ya among the group.","Her face blindness was acting up again. She clenched her palms and could only curl her eyes into a smile. \"Yes.\"","One of the colleagues linked arms with her. \"Sister Lin Ya is treating us to karaoke today. Do you want to come?\"","An Ling blinked, smiling as she waved her hand to politely decline. \"No, no, I'm a terrible singer. Plus, I have plans tonight, so I can't go.\"","\"Plans again?\" the colleague asked in surprise. \"You didn't come to the dinner party yesterday either.\"","Saying that, another colleague made a teasing sound.","\"Ooh~ Could it be a date? Does our Ah Leng have a boyfriend?\"","She continued, looking at Xiao Yang next to them, \"Just like Xiao Yang. Didn't we talk about Xiao Yang's blind date last time? She finally started dating him last week.\"","Before An Ling could say anything, Sister Lin Ya beside them suddenly spoke up in a surprised tone.","\"Boyfriend? Ah Leng is already married.\"","As soon as the words came out, the other colleagues were slightly stunned and instinctively retorted, \"No way, right? An Ling said she didn't have a boyfriend. We even asked her about her requirements for finding one last time.\"","Sister Lin Ya looked confused. \"Huh? The first time we had dinner together, An Ling said she was married. Her husband even came to pick her up. What are you guys talking about?\"","As her words fell, the scene instantly went quiet.","Several pairs of eyes turned to look at An Ling in unison.","An Ling's face stiffened slightly. \"......\"","Oh no... I forgot to synchronize the information.","Back when she told Sister Lin Ya, she and Shen Linyan hadn't divorced yet.","Under everyone's gaze, An Ling let out a few awkward laughs, her scalp tingling. \"Um... I am indeed married. When you guys asked, I...\"","I was divorced then, but now we've remarried.","If I told anyone about how things developed, it would be no different from writing 'My husband is Shen Linyan' right on my forehead.","An Ling's eye twitched, her tone strained.","\"I... my husband and I had a conflict before, pretty much like a divorce, and we just recently made up.\"","...","Even after leaving the company, An Ling couldn't forget the complicated and meaningful expressions of her colleagues.","She got into the car, leaned back weakly in her seat, and sighed.","\"I feel like my colleagues have figured out that I'm An Ling.\"","Hearing this, the man driving next to her smiled and held her hand. \"What's wrong?\"","\"They know I'm married, and they probably guessed I'm divorced too.\"","Initially, she didn't think anyone would discover her identity at all. After all, there are many people with the same name in the world, and what normal person cares about the name of a corporate group's daughter.","But the identity of Shen Linyan's ex-wife had just been popping up way too frequently.","Taking advantage of the red light, Shen Linyan turned to look at her, his voice gentle and slow. \"Does my wife not want them to know because of me? Or... is there another reason?\"","\"No, it has nothing to do with you.\"","An Ling lowered her head and played with his fingers. \"I didn't want to hide it at first, but they have discussed me right in front of my face. I feel like it would be really awkward if they found out.\"","Anyway, once the variety show finishes filming, no one will discuss this matter anymore.","She let go of the man's hand, her eyes curving into a smile. \"Forget it, if they find out like this, that's fine too. You won't have to hide when you come to pick me up in the future.\"","Shen Linyan paused for a moment, then curled his lips. \"Okay.\"","...","After arriving home.","An Ling held Shen Linyan's hand and smiled as she greeted Father An and Mother An on the sofa.","\"Mom, Dad, we're back.\"","Beside her, Shen Linyan paused and also called out warmly, \"Dad, Mom.\"","Father and Mother An stiffened slightly, exchanged a glance, and then smiled and nodded.","\"You're back.\"","An Ling looked around. \"Where's my brother?\"","Mother An pointed. \"He just got back not long ago too. He should be upstairs in his room.\"","Hearing this, An Ling turned to Shen Linyan and blinked. \"You chat with my parents for a bit. I'm going to find my brother.\"","Shen Linyan smiled and gently squeezed her hand. \"Go ahead.\"","Watching the man sit on the sofa and chat with her parents, An Ling turned and went upstairs.","Reaching the upper floor, An Ling knocked on the door.","\"Brother?\"","The door opened. An Zhou must have just been changing clothes; his hair was a bit messy, and he was adjusting his loungewear. \"What is it?\"","An Ling blinked. \"I need you for something. Can I come in to talk?\"","An Zhou lowered his hands, his eyes suspicious. \"Need me? You didn't cause some kind of trouble again, did you?\"","Despite his words, he stepped aside to let her in.","An Ling went in and sat on the sofa. Without waiting for An Zhou to ask, she said, \"Can you help me deal with someone?\"","Huh?","An Zhou looked surprised. \"Deal with someone?\"","Oh wow, this was the first time An Ling had ever used such a phrase.","He grew somewhat interested. \"Who? And you need them dealt with...\"","\"Xu Huoqing.\"","His voice stopped abruptly, and An Zhou's smile instantly faded.","His expression froze. He thought for a moment, then frowned deeply. \"Is it that kid from back then who knows you have face blindness?\"","An Ling nodded gently. \"Yes.\"","She sighed and pinched the bridge of her nose. \"He's been looking for me these past few days, and now he knows I'm the daughter of the An family. He's using my face blindness to threaten me. I'm really getting annoyed by him. Just find someone to intimidate him.\"","Without a substantial lesson, this kind of person wouldn't give up.","\"It's just that when the time comes, he might expose the fact that I have face blindness...\"","Thinking of that scenario, An Ling paused. Countless faces flashed before her eyes in an instant, and mocking laughter seemed to echo in her ears.","Her heart tightened slightly, and she unconsciously clenched her hands. Her eyelashes fluttered twice as she pursed her lips and whispered, \"Brother, suppress it if you can. If you can't... then there's nothing we can do...\"","Seeing the woman's tightly clenched palms, An Zhou's gaze paused.","He watched for a moment, then walked over and patted her shoulder, his tone relaxed. \"It's a small matter. Your brother will help you teach him a lesson. I wanted to teach him a lesson back then, and now he still dares to jump out.\"","As he spoke, his movements suddenly stopped, his tone a bit strange. \"By the way... does Shen Linyan know you have face blindness?\"","Hearing this, An Ling looked up and blinked. \"He... kind of half-knows?\"","\"Half-knows?\"","An Zhou looked confused. What did half-know mean?","Thinking of what she had done before, An Ling rubbed the tip of her nose in embarrassment. \"I lied to him before, saying that I only get face blindness when I drink.\"","\"...\"","Meeting An Zhou's speechless expression, An Ling laughed awkwardly. Her face reddened slightly as she muttered, \"I was just a bit embarrassed about how to bring it up. I have to apologize first before saying it, right? After all, I lied to him before.\"","It had been so long, and she didn't know how to tell Shen Linyan.","She needed to build up to it; just suddenly blurting out her face blindness dryly would be a bit awkward.","An Zhou was already used to his sister's god-like maneuvers.","But it made sense. For so many years, An Ling had hidden it so well. Her daily life looked no different from an ordinary person's. Sometimes, even he would forget that his sister had face blindness.","It was quite normal that Shen Linyan hadn't noticed.","But An Zhou still felt a bit regretful, clicking his tongue. \"If Shen Linyan knew you were face-blind, you should tell him about Xu Huoqing.\"","\"Why?\"","An Zhou: \"I just feel like he's better at handling this kind of thing. And it would also let you see that Shen Linyan really isn't some kind, good person.\"","Her brother was at it again.","An Ling stood up speechlessly. \"What nonsense are you spouting? Besides, Shen Linyan has been busy with company matters lately. He's very busy.\"","An Zhou's expression was odd. \"What do you mean? Is your brother not busy? Do I look like I have a lot of free time?\"","The woman didn't answer. She just smiled, opened the door, and walked out.","\"So hungry, so hungry. I'm going downstairs to eat. Brother, hurry down too.\"","An Zhou: \"...\"","After dinner, An Ling simply packed up her things and planned to go home with Shen Linyan.","While taking the elevator, the man carried the suitcase, and An Ling stood beside him, looking down at her phone to buy cat toys.","\"Ding—\"","Just as they stepped out of the elevator, they saw a middle-aged woman standing at the door of their home.","The woman was wearing a coat and a hat on her head, with jade earrings dangling from her ears. Dressed wealthily, with her hands in her pockets, she was frowning and silently watching them.","An Ling stopped in her tracks, her gaze falling on the other person's face, and she froze for a moment.","Who was this? The neighbor from downstairs?","The next second, her hand was gently held, enveloped by a warm palm.","An Ling put away her phone, but when she looked up, she met the man's quiet gaze.","Seeing that he wasn't speaking, she blinked, as if asking what was wrong.","Looking at the woman's puzzled expression, Shen Linyan lowered his eyes, curled his lips, and gently touched her face. However, his eyes were pitch black, with dark tides surging silently within.","An Ling held his hand. Just as she was about to speak, she heard the woman's cold sneer from beside them. \"Shen Linyan, you've grown bold now. You actually dared to block me.\"","The familiar tone made An Ling's face instantly stiffen.","She turned her head to look again, her brow furrowing.","Wait a minute...","Is that the old hag?"]}]);
